{Opponent info: Age 15 ; Bd 39 for Middlesex Juniors} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4
cxd4 4. Nxd4 g6 {Allowing a Maroczy bind.} 5. c4 Bg7 6. Be3 Nf6 7. Nc3 O-O 8.
f4 Ng4 9. Qd2 Nc6 {Threat of NxB} 10. Nf3 Nxe3 11. Qxe3 f5 $2 12. Bd3 fxe4 13.
Bxe4 Nb4 14. a3 Nc6 15. O-O Bf5 16. Rac1 $1 Na5 (16... Bxe4 17. Qxe4 Bxc3 18.
bxc3 {doubles the cPs} (18. Rxc3)) 17. Nd4 Nxc4 $4 18. Bd5+ Kh8 19. Bxc4 Rc8 $4
(19... Qb6 $1) 20. Nxf5 $1 Rxf5 $4 21. Be6 $1 Rxc3 22. bxc3 Rc5 23. Rfd1 Qa5
24. Rb1 Rxc3 25. Qd2 Qc5+ 26. Kh1 b6 27. Rbc1 Rxc1 28. Rxc1 Qxa3 $4 29. Rc8+
Bf8 30. Qd4# {Black gave up, more or less, near the end and didn't concentrate.
} 1-0

