{HCGS Hayes County Grammar School. I think this is a team tournament. see scan
of score.} 1. Nf3 d5 2. e3 Nf6 3. Nc3 Bf5 4. Ne5 Nc6 5. d4 Ne4 6. Qf3 e6 7. g4
Bb4 $1 8. gxf5 Nxe5 $1 9. Rg1 Qf6 10. Bd3 Nxc3 11. dxe5 Qxe5 12. Rg4 c5 13. e4
$2 {Useless} Nxe4+ 14. c3 {Even worse} Nxc3+ 15. Be3 Ne4+ 16. Kf1 {About time
too} exf5 17. Rf4 Bd2 $1 18. Rxf5 Qe6 19. Bxd2 $4 {As good as resignation}
Nxd2+ $1 20. Kg2 Nxf3 21. Rxf3 Qg4+ 22. Rg3 Qb4 23. Re3+ Kd7 {Many mistakes by
White} 0-1

