1. c4 c5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Nf3 d5 4. cxd5 Nxd5 5. g3 Nxc3 6. bxc3 {Black has lost
a centre Pawn whereas White has lost a b-Pawn} Bg4 7. Bg2 {This places the
b-Pawn under attack.} Bxf3 8. Bxf3 Qd7 9. O-O e5 10. Ba3 {Threatening to
prevent Black castling} f6 {Why?} 11. Rb1 Nc6 12. Qb3 b6 13. Qb5 Rc8 14. Rbd1
Bd6 15. e3 O-O {At last!} 16. d4 exd4 17. exd4 cxd4 $2 18. Rxd4 $1 Qc7 $2 (
18... Nxd4 {Gains some compensation.}) 19. Bxd6 Qd7 20. Bxf8 Nxd4 21. Qxd7 {
A game in the school team play-off.} 1-0

