O-O-O O-O 8. Kb1 Nc6 9. Bd3 $2 Qe7 $2 (9... Nxd4 $1) 10. a3 $2 Rac8 $2 (10...
Nxd4 $1) 11. h4 $2 e5 $2 (11... Nxd4 $1) 12. d5 Na5 $4 13. b4 Nb3 14. cxb3 c5
15. bxc5 bxc5 16. Rh3 ({Aiming at} 16. Rh3 Z0 17. Rg3 Z0 18. Qxh6) 16... Rfd8
17. Rg3 Kf8 18. Rh1 $2 c4 $2 {Why?} 19. Bxc4 d6 20. Rc1 f5 21. exf5 e4 22. Nd4
Bxd4 23. Qxd4 Qxh4 $4 24. Qh8+ Ke7 25. Rg7+ ({Black could have recoverd by Kf6
} 25. Rg7+ Kf6 26. Rg6+ Ke7 {These notes are taken from Dick's score books.
(Sean Parker)}) 1-0

