1. c4 c5 2. g3 e5 3. Bg2 d6 {Development of the KBishop will be hard.} 4. Nc3
Be6 $2 5. Bxb7 Nd7 6. Bxa8 Qxa8 7. f3 Bxc4 8. d3 Bd5 9. e4 Bb7 10. Nge2 d5 11.
O-O d4 12. Nb5 Qb8 13. Bd2 Ngf6 14. Qa4 $4 {Time pressure.} Bc6 $1 15. Qxa7
Bxb5 16. Qxb8+ Nxb8 17. a4 {Time} Bxd3 18. Rf2 Na6 {Why?} 19. Nc1 c4 20. Nxd3
cxd3 21. Rd1 Nb4 $2 22. Bxb4 Bxb4 23. Rxd3 Bc5 24. Rc2 Nd7 25. b4 Be7 (25...
Bxb4 26. Rc8+ Ke7 27. Rxh8) 26. b5 O-O 27. a5 $2 Nc5 $1 28. Ra3 $2 Nxe4 29.
Raa2 Ng5 30. b6 $2 Nxf3+ 31. Kh1 ({Not} 31. Kg2) ({Nor} 31. Kf1) ({Or} 31. Kf2)
31... d3 32. Rc7 d2 33. Rxd2 Nxd2 34. b7 $2 (34. Rxe7 {is better}) 34... Bd6
35. Rc8 h6 36. Rxf8+ Kxf8 37. a6 Bb8 38. Kg2 e4 39. Kf2 Ke7 40. Ke3 Ke6 41.
Kxd2 Kd5 42. Ke3 g5 43. h3 f6 44. g4 Ke5 45. Ke2 f5 46. gxf5 Kxf5 47. Ke3 h5
48. Kd4 Kf4 49. Kc5 e3 50. Kb6 e2 51. a7 Bxa7+ 52. Kxa7 e1=Q 53. b8=Q+ {
NB Check!} Qe5 54. Qb4+ Kf5 55. Qf8+ Qf6 56. Qc5+ Kg6 57. Qc2+ Kf7 58. Qh7+ Qg7
$2 59. Qxh5+ Kf8+ 60. Kb6 Qd4+ 61. Kc6 Qe4+ 62. Kd6 Qf4+ 63. Ke6 {Draw agreed
due to time. The whole game was played in less than an hour. Time pressure
shows in many moves.} 1/2-1/2

