1. d4 d5 2. c4 Nc6 3. Nc3 e6 4. e3 Nf6 5. Nf3 Bb4 6. Bd2 Bxc3 7. Bxc3 O-O 8.
Bd3 h6 $2 9. O-O b6 10. Rc1 Ba6 11. Qa4 Na5 $2 12. Bxa5 bxa5 13. Qxa5 Qd6 $4
14. c5 $1 Qc6 15. Qxa6 Qxa6 16. Bxa6 Rfb8 17. Rb1 Rb4 18. b3 {or Black plays
18......Ra4 attacking the Bishop and winning a Pawn} Ne4 19. Rfc1 {to prevent
19......Nc3} Rab8 {This leaves the b4 Rook with no square of retreat.} 20. Ne5
$1 Nd2 $4 {This loses the N} 21. Rb2 $1 f6 $2 22. Nc6 Nxb3 23. axb3 Rxb3 24.
Rxb3 Rxb3 25. Bc8 (25. Nxa7 Ra3 {winning Knight or Bishop}) 25... e5 26. dxe5
fxe5 27. e4 d4 $4 {moving hurriedly} 28. Be6+ Kf8 29. Bxb3 d3 30. Nxe5 d2 31.
Rd1 g5 32. Rxd2 h5 33. Rd7 a6 34. Nf3 (34. Nf3 Z0 35. Nd4 Z0 36. Nf5 Z0 37.
Rd8#) 34... Ke8 35. Rxc7 Kd8 36. Ra7 g4 37. c6 gxf3 38. c7+ Kd7 39. Be6+ Kd6
40. c8=Q Ke5 41. Qc5+ Kxe6 42. Rxa6+ 1-0

