g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. Be2 O-O 7. O-O Bxf3 8. Bxf3 e5 9. Ne2 exd4
10. Qb3 $2 Nbd7 11. Qxb7 Nc5 12. Qb4 Nfxe4 13. Rd1 Rb8 14. Qe1 Re8 15. Nxd4 Ng5
16. Be2 Bxd4 17. Rxd4 {I have 2Bs v 2Ns} Qf6 18. Rd5 Nge6 19. Rb1 Nd4 20. Be3
Nc2 21. Qc1 Nxe3 22. fxe3 c6 23. Rd1 Nd7 24. c5 $4 Nxc5 25. b4 Ne4 26. Rf1 Qc3
27. Bc4 {A last chance.} d5 28. Qxc3 Nxc3 29. Rbc1 Rxe3 30. Rf3 Rxf3 31. gxf3
Rxb4 32. Rxc3 dxc4 33. a3 Rb3 34. Rxc4 ({Not} 34. Rxb3 $4 cxb3) 34... Rxf3 35.
Ra4 c5 36. Kg2 Rd3 37. Rxa7 Rd8 $2 38. Kf2 Rc8 39. Ke3 c4 40. Kd2 ({Not} 40.
Kd4 $4 c3 $1) 40... f5 41. Kc3 f4 42. Re7 $1 g5 $2 43. a4 $1 {My only hope.} h5
$4 44. Re5 g4 45. Rxh5 Rc7 46. a5 f3 47. a6 $1 f2 48. Rf5 Rf7 49. a7 Rxa7 ({Not
} 49... f1=Q $4 50. a8=Q+ $1 (50. Rxf1 $4 Rxf1 51. a8=Q+)) 50. Rxf2 Ra3+ 51.
Kxc4 Rh3 52. Rg2 Rh4 53. Kd3 Kh7 54. Ke3 Kh6 55. Kf2 Kh5 56. Kg3 Rh3+ 57. Kf4 {
Draw agreed. 3hrs Black absolutely threw a won game away. He should have
brought his K into the endgame.} 1/2-1/2

