Bb6 12. Rb1 Nd4 13. Be3 c6 (13... Z0 {or else....} 14. Nxf6+ Qxf6 15. Bxb7) 14.
b4 axb4 15. Rxb4 $4 {allowing an eventual pin on the R by B-a5} Nxe4 16. dxe4 (
{if....} 16. Bxe4 Ba5 {White loses a N}) (16. Nxe4 Ba5) 16... Ba5 17. Bxd4 exd4
18. Qxd4 $4 c5 19. Qd5 cxb4 20. Nb5 bxa3 21. Ra1 Bb4 22. Qxb7 Bxe2 23. e5 Rb8
24. Qa7 dxe5 25. Bd5 $1 {Threatens mate and gaurds the c-P} Re7 26. Qe3 Bh5 27.
Na7 $1 Qc7 28. Nc6 Bg6 29. Nxb8 Qxb8 30. Qb3 Qa7 $4 {My God!!!} 31. Qxb4 e4 32.
Rxa3 Qc7 33. Re3 Kh7 34. f3 {This wins a P} f5 35. Kf2 Qa7 36. Qa3 Bh5 37. Qxa7
Rxa7 38. fxe4 Ra2+ 39. Kg1 Ra1+ 40. Kf2 Ra2+ 41. Ke1 Rxh2 42. exf5 Ra2 43. Re4
Bf3 44. Re7 Bxd5 45. cxd5 Ra6 46. Re6 Ra5 (46... Rxe6+ 47. fxe6 $18) 47. Re5
