Rxd6 54. Rg6 Rd2+ 55. Ke1 Ra2 (55... Ke3 56. Z0 {followed by} Rb2 {threatening
mate might be worth a try.}) 56. f6 Ra8 57. Rxh6 $2 Kxg4 58. f7 Rf8 {Draw
agreed (3hrs) I had ofered a draw many times. I wanted to play on M.Lester the
same combination as C.North had played on me this morning. NB:M.J.Lester
finished =6-11th 7.5/11 (5W-5D-1L)} 1/2-1/2

