{Opponent info: Age 14-15 ;Bd 2 for HCGS II} 1. e4 c5 2. Bc4 {Obviously he
doesn't know the Sicillian.} d6 3. d4 {Making life difficult for himself} cxd4
4. Qxd4 Nc6 5. Qd3 a6 {To prevent 6.B-b5} 6. Ne2 (6. Nf3 {is a better position}
) 6... Qc7 7. Nbc3 $4 {He doesn't expect any threats this aely in the opening}
Ne5 $1 {Naturally!} 8. Qd4 Qxc4 $2 9. Qxc4 Nxc4 10. Nd5 $1 Kd7 $2 (10... Rb8)
11. b3 e6 {I made a mess of the previous few moves} 12. bxc4 exd5 13. cxd5 Nf6
14. Nc3 g6 15. Bb2 ({The b-file might have proffited the Q'sR} 15. Rb1) 15...
Bg7 16. Na4 $2 Kc7 17. g4 $4 {careless but also anti-positional} Bxg4 18. c4
Rhg8 $2 (18... Bf3 $1) 19. Rg1 Bd7 20. f3 $4 Bxa4 21. Rb1 Nd7 22. Bxg7 Rxg7 23.
f4 $2 Nc5 24. e5 dxe5 25. fxe5 Nd3+ 26. Kd2 Nxe5 27. c5 $4 Nf3+ 28. Kc3 Nxg1
29. Rxg1 b6 30. d6+ Kc6 31. Rg4 bxc5 32. Rxa4 Kxd6 33. Kc4 a5 34. Kb5 f5 35. h4
h6 36. Rf4 Re7 37. h5 Ke5 38. Rf1 g5 39. Kc4 Rd8 40. a3 Rf7 41. Re1+ Kd6 42.
Rd1+ Kc7 43. Rb1 f4 44. a4 f3 45. Rf1 f2 46. Kc3 g4 {I was feeling tired.
Previously I was on 6/6 L.Wheately was on 5/6} 0-1

