fxg6 hxg6 13. Re1 Nf6 $4 (13... Bxd4+ 14. Qxd4 Bf5 {might have been better})
14. Nxe7+ Kh8 15. Qf3 $1 Ra7 16. Ndc6 Nxc6 17. Nxc6 Qc7 ({not} 17... Qb6+ 18.
Be3) 18. Re7 $2 (18. Nxa7 $142) 18... Qxe7 19. Nxe7 Rxe7 20. Bg5 Bf5 21. Rd1 $4
Bg4 {He offered a draw accepted. An interesting game especially the end
position.} (21... Bg4 {White can draw by.....} 22. Qxf6 Bxf6 23. Bxf6+ Kg8 24.
Bxe7 Bxd1 25. Bxf8 Kxf8 {Match result Seniors 8.5 Juniors 3.5}) 1/2-1/2

