{Opponent Info: Age 15; Middlesex U-18} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6
5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7. d5 e6 8. e5 $2 (8. dxe6 Bxe6 {Leaves the d-Pawn weak})
8... Ne8 9. Bd3 Nc7 10. Ne4 dxe5 11. fxe5 exd5 12. Nd6 Bxe5 $6 13. Nxc8 Qxc8
14. Nxe5 Re8 15. O-O Rxe5 16. cxd5 Rxd5 17. Qf3 Qd7 18. Bc4 Rf5 19. Qxb7 Qd4+
20. Kh1 Rxf1+ 21. Bxf1 Qd6 (21... Qd8 $142) 22. g3 $1 Nd7 ({not} 22... Qc6+ $4
23. Qxc6 Nxc6 24. Bg2 $3) 23. Bf4 Qd5+ 24. Qxd5 Nxd5 25. Bg2 {The 2 Knights
are no match for the 2 Bishops} N7b6 26. Rd1 Rd8 27. Be3 Rd7 28. Bxc5 Nf6 29.
Rxd7 Nfxd7 30. Bd4 {Now White should win with the QS Pawns} a5 31. Bf1 Kf8 32.
Bb5 Ke7 33. Kg2 Kd6 34. Kf3 Kd5 35. Ke3 f5 36. Kd3 Nc5+ 37. Bxc5 Kxc5 38. Be8
Nc4 39. b3 Ne5+ 40. Ke3 Kb4 41. Kf4 Nd3+ 42. Kg5 Ka3 43. Kh6 Kxa2 44. Bf7 Kb2
45. Kxh7 Nc5 46. Kxg6 Nxb3 47. h4 a4 48. h5 a3 49. h6 a2 50. h7 a1=Q 51. h8=Q+
Kb1 52. Qxa1+ Nxa1 53. Kxf5 Nc2 54. g4 $4 Ne3+ 55. Kf4 Nxg4 1/2-1/2

