1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 g5 4. h4 g4 5. Ne5 d6 6. Nxg4 Bg7 7. d4 Nf6 (7...
Bxg4 8. Qxg4 Bxd4 9. Bxf4 {is playable}) 8. Nxf6+ Qxf6 9. Bc4 {He can try Pawn
snatches if he wants to} Qxd4 {He does!} 10. Qxd4 Bxd4 11. c3 Bb6 (11... Be5
12. O-O {is no better}) 12. Bxf4 Rg8 13. Bg5 h6 {This leaves White with a
powerful passer} 14. Bxh6 Rxg2 15. Rf1 Be6 16. Bxe6 fxe6 17. Rf8+ Kd7 {The
Knight can't be moved} 18. Nd2 Rg1+ 19. Nf1 Rg4 20. Rf4 Rxf4 21. Bxf4 Nc6 22.
O-O-O Rh8 23. Bg5 Rh5 $2 24. Ng3 Be3+ $2 {sacrificing the Bishop for the rooks
Pawn} 25. Bxe3 Rxh4 26. Bd4 e5 27. Bf2 Rf4 28. Rd2 b6 29. Re2 Kc8 30. Nf5 Kb7
31. Kd2 Nd8 32. Ne7 Ne6 33. Ke1 Nc5 $2 34. Bxc5 dxc5 35. Kd2 Rf7 36. Ng6 Rd7+
37. Ke1 Rg7 38. Nxe5 Rg1+ 39. Kf2 Rg5 (39... Ra1 40. b3) 40. Nf3 Rh5 41. e5 Rh8
