{Opponent Info: Age} 1. c4 Nf6 2. d4 g6 3. g3 Bg7 4. Bg2 O-O 5. Nf3 d6 6. O-O
Nbd7 7. Nc3 e5 8. e3 (8. e4 $142) (8. d5 $142) 8... Nh5 9. b3 f5 10. Ne2 {
to prevent f5} e4 11. Nd2 Nc5 12. Bb2 (12. dxc5 $4 Bxa1) 12... Nd3 13. Rb1 g5
14. f4 exf3 $2 (14... gxf4 $142) 15. Nxf3 Nxb2 16. Rxb2 g4 {once again too
hurried} 17. Ne1 (17. Nd2 Qe7 {causes some trouble}) 17... Qe7 18. Nc2 c6 19.
Rb1 {White offered a draw here.} Nf6 20. Nc3 Bd7 21. Qd2 Rad8 22. Rbe1 {
With 2.5 mins to the adjudication I offered a draw. This match decided the
shield.(HCGS I won 4.5-1.5) We were undefeated & Minet I had been beaten by
our 3rd team who had only been beaten by us. We had to win by 3 clear games on
age handicap and the time was 1hr 15 play. Thus we had no time to think as we
could not allow many draws, however when the bottom 3 boards had won the top 3
boards accepted draws to win the match and the shield.} 1/2-1/2

