1. e4 c6 2. Nc3 d5 3. d4 g6 4. e5 Bf5 5. Bg5 Bg7 6. Bd3 Bxd3 7. Qxd3 {My
Bishop did not have much future} f6 {more or less forced} 8. exf6 Nxf6 9. Nf3
O-O 10. O-O-O {better than 10.0-0} Qd6 11. h4 Ng4 12. Qe2 e5 13. dxe5 Nxe5 14.
Nxe5 Qxe5 15. f3 (15. Qxe5 Bxe5 {after} 16. Rhf1 {I have to accept double Ps}
Bxc3 17. bxc3) 15... Nd7 16. Qxe5 Bxe5 17. Ne2 Rae8 18. Nd4 Bf4+ 19. Bxf4 Rxf4
20. c3 Rf7 21. Rde1 Rfe7 22. Rxe7 Rxe7 23. Kd2 Kf7 24. Re1 $2 Rxe1 25. Kxe1 Kf6
26. f4 {dangerous} Nc5 27. Kd2 Ne6 28. Nxe6 $2 (28. Ne2 $142 $1) 28... Kxe6 29.
g4 $2 h5 $1 30. gxh5 gxh5 31. Ke3 Kf6 32. Ke2 c5 33. Kf3 Kf5 34. Ke3 Kg4 (34...
d4+ {might be better}) 35. c4 d4+ 36. Ke4 d3 37. Kxd3 Kxf4 38. Ke2 Kg4 39. Ke3
a6 40. a3 (40. Ke4 $142) 40... Kxh4 41. Kf4 Kh3 42. Kf3 h4 43. b3 $2 (43. b4 $1
b6 44. a4 cxb4 $2 (44... a5 $1) 45. a5 bxa5 46. c5 {A better chance than 43.b3}
) 43... a5 $1 44. Kf2 Kg4 45. Kg2 Kf4 46. Kh3 Ke3 47. Kxh4 Kd3 48. Kg4 Kc3 49.
Kf4 Kxb3 50. Ke4 Kxc4 51. Ke3 Kc3 52. Ke2 Kc2 53. Ke3 c4 54. Ke2 c3 55. Ke1 Kc1
56. Ke2 c2 57. Kd3 Kb2 58. a4 c1=Q 59. Kd4 Qc3+ 60. Kd5 Kb3 61. Kd6 Kb4 62. Kd5
Qc4+ 63. Ke5 Kc5 64. Kf6 Qe4 {P.Adams has now won the section B tournament
with10.5/11, Drawn with Mr Humphries.} 0-1

