1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. Nf3 O-O 5. e3 ({why not} 5. e4) 5... d6 6. Rb1
Nbd7 7. Bd3 $2 e5 8. d5 Nh5 9. Bd2 f5 10. Be2 Ndf6 11. Ng5 {better than 11.0-0}
Ng4 $1 12. h3 $2 Nxf2 13. Kxf2 Qxg5 14. Bxh5 gxh5 15. Re1 f4 16. e4 Qg3+ 17.
Kg1 Bxh3 18. Qf3 Qxf3 19. gxf3 Rf6 20. Kh2 Bd7 21. Rg1 Kf7 22. Be1 Rg6 23. Bh4
(23. Rxg6 hxg6 {sorts my Pawns out}) 23... Rg8 24. Ne2 Bf6 25. Bxf6 Kxf6 26.
Rxg6+ hxg6 27. Rg1 g5 {White will be trampled to death} 28. Rg2 g4 29. Ng1 g3+
30. Kh1 h4 31. Ne2 $2 Bg4 $3 32. Ng1 (32. fxg4 f3 {wins easily}) 32... h3 $3
33. fxg4 (33. Rc2 h2 $1) 33... hxg2+ 34. Kxg2 Rxg4 {A very interesting
enjoyable game. I have played 3 games with Mr. Humphries all of which I have
won.} 0-1

