Be6 7. g3 Nf6 8. Bg2 Be7 9. O-O O-O 10. d4 Nbd7 {I am not worried about an
isolated d-Pawn which can be easily defended.} 11. c4 dxc4 12. bxc4 Nb6 13. d5
Bf5 14. Re1 Re8 15. Ne5 $2 Bd6 $1 16. f4 Nfd7 17. Qf1 f6 18. Nxd7 Rxe1 19.
Nxf6+ $1 gxf6 20. Qxe1 Nxc4 21. Qc3 Nxb2 22. Qxb2 Qe7 23. Nd2 b5 24. Nf3 Be4
25. Re1 f5 26. Nh4 c4 $1 27. Bxe4 ({Now if} 27. Nxf5 $2 Bc5+ 28. Kh1 Bxg2+)
27... fxe4 28. Qe2 e3 29. Nf5 ({Not} 29. Qxe3 $4 Bc5 $1) 29... Qf8 30. Nxd6 (
30. Nxe3 Bc5 31. Z0 Re8) 30... Qxd6 31. Qg4+ Kf7 32. Qe6+ Qxe6 33. dxe6+ Kxe6
34. Rxe3+ Kd5 (34... Kf5 {might be better}) 35. Kf2 (35. f5 $142) 35... Rc8 36.
f5 $2 c3 37. Re1 c2 38. Rc1 Kd4 39. Ke2 Kc3 40. Ke3 Kb2 41. Kd2 Rd8+ {A good
accurate game.} 0-1

