1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 d5 {The most popular method nowadays. I have free
development.} 4. exd5 Nf6 5. Nc3 (5. Bb5+) 5... Nxd5 6. Nxd5 (6. Bc4) 6... Qxd5
7. d4 Bd6 {Hanging onto the Pawn} 8. Bd3 Nc6 9. c3 O-O 10. O-O Bg4 11. Qc2 h6
12. Be4 Qh5 $1 13. Bd2 Rae8 14. Bxc6 bxc6 15. Rae1 Bxf3 16. Rxe8 Rxe8 17. Rxf3
Re2 $3 18. Rf2 $4 f3 $1 19. g3 Rxf2 20. Kxf2 Qxh2+ 21. Kxf3 Qxg3+ 22. Ke2 Qg2+
23. Kd1 Qg1+ 24. Be1 Bg3 $1 {Forcing an exchange} 25. Qe2 Bxe1 26. Qxe1 Qxe1+
27. Kxe1 f5 {I have an easy win.} 28. Kf2 Kf7 29. Kf3 Ke6 30. Kf4 g5+ 31. Kf3
h5 32. a4 h4 33. Kg2 g4 34. b4 Kd5 35. Kf2 f4 36. Kg2 Ke4 37. Kf2 h3 38. Kg1 g3
39. Kh1 Kf3 40. c4 h2 41. d5 Kg4 42. dxc6 ({if} 42. Kg2 f3+ 43. Kf1 h1=Q#)
42... Kh3 0-1

