1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. a3 $2 {Timid} c5 4. Nf3 d5 5. Nc3 Be7 6. cxd5 Nxd5 7.
Nxd5 Qxd5 8. e3 O-O 9. Bd3 Nc6 10. dxc5 Bxc5 11. O-O Ne7 12. b4 Bd6 (12... Bb6
{prevents ....b6}) 13. Qc2 h6 14. Bb2 Bd7 15. Rfd1 Qc6 16. Qxc6 Bxc6 17. Bh7+
Kxh7 18. Rxd6 Ng6 {To prevent 19.Ne5} 19. Nd4 Bd5 20. Rc1 a5 21. Bc3 axb4 22.
Bxb4 Rfc8 23. Rxc8 Rxc8 24. h3 Nh4 25. f3 Rc1+ 26. Kh2 Rd1 27. Kg3 g5 28. Rd7
e5 29. Rxd5 exd4 30. exd4 Rxd4 31. Re5 (31. Rxd4 Nf5+) 31... Rd7 32. f4 $2 Ng6
33. Rb5 $2 Nxf4 34. Bc5 Kg6 35. Be3 Rd3 36. Kf3 $2 Nd5 37. Rxb7 {Despair} Rxe3+
38. Kg4 f5# {I played several more games with Mr.Russell and won them all but
one.} 0-1

