{Opponent Info: ex Middlesex U-15 champion; Harrow County School} 1. e4 e6 2.
d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 Qc7 7. Bd2 Ne7 8. Qg4 Ng6 9. h4
cxd4 10. cxd4 O-O ({The threat is....} 10... Nxe5 {the text prevents 11.Qxg7})
11. Bd3 f5 ({if now....} 11... Nxe5 12. Bxh7+ Kxh7 13. Qh5+ Kg8 14. Qxe5) 12.
Qe2 Nf4 13. Qf3 ({not} 13. Bxf4 $4 Qc3+) 13... Nxd3+ 14. Qxd3 Nc6 15. Nf3 Bd7
16. O-O Rac8 17. c3 Na5 $1 18. Qc2 $2 (18. Rfc1 $4 Nb3) (18. Z0 {the threat is}
Nc4 {exchanging N for B} ({or} 18... Nb3)) 18... Nc4 $1 19. Be1 $4 Bb5 {
This wins the exchange} 20. Qb3 Ba6 21. Nd2 Nxd2 22. Bxd2 Bxf1 23. Rxf1 b6 24.
Rb1 h6 25. Rc1 Qe7 26. g3 g5 27. h5 Qf7 28. Qd1 g4 29. Bxh6 Rfe8 30. Qd2 {
Time 55mins} Qxh5 {Time 30 mins} 31. Qg5+ Qxg5 32. Bxg5 Rc4 33. Kf1 Rec8 34.
Bd2 Kf7 35. Ke2 Rh8 36. Kd3 Rh2 37. Ke3 Rc8 38. Rb1 Kg6 39. Ke2 {To prevent 39.
Kg4} Rch8 40. Rb4 Rg2 41. Rb1 Rhh2 42. Rf1 Rxg3 43. Bf4 $4 {This wins the
exchange but loses the game. If I had not won the exchange it would have been
hard for Black to win.} Rgg2 44. Bxh2 Rxh2 45. Rg1 {to prevent 45......g6} Kg5
46. Kf1 f4 47. f3 g3 48. Ke1 Ra2 {A.K.Abel came 4th= with 6pts} 0-1

