8. Bd2 Nc6 9. Nc3 Nf6 10. O-O-O Be7 11. g3 ({Why not?} 11. g4) 11... O-O 12.
Bg2 Re8 13. Rhe1 Nd4 14. Qxb7 $2 {Too greedy} Rb8 {Now White has only two moves
} 15. Qxa7 $2 {The wrong one. Now another file endangers White's King and the
Queen is on thin ice.} Qd6 16. h3 $2 Rb6 17. Qa4 $2 Reb8 18. b3 $2 Ra6 19. Bf4
Qb6 20. Nd5 Nxd5 21. Qd7 {Greed doesn't pay} 0-1

