1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. e3 c6 6. Nf3 Bb4 7. a3 Bxc3+ 8.
bxc3 dxc4 9. Bxc4 Qa5 10. Qb3 $2 O-O $2 11. Qb4 {White wants a draw} Qb6 12.
Rb1 (12. Qxb6 {Leaves Black with the better position}) 12... Re8 13. Qxb6 axb6
14. Bxf6 Nxf6 15. Rb3 Ne4 16. O-O Nd6 17. Bd3 b5 18. Ng5 g6 19. Ne4 {Forcing
another exchange} Nxe4 20. Bxe4 e5 21. d5 f5 22. Bf3 Bd7 23. c4 Ra5 24. dxc6
bxc6 25. cxb5 Rxb5 26. Rxb5 cxb5 27. Bd5+ Kg7 28. Rc1 Kf6 29. Rc7 Rd8 {
Threatening 30......Be6} 30. g3 Bc8 31. Bb7 {Drawn. I had to play quickly as
the match only lasted one and a half hours. HCGS III won the match.} 1/2-1/2

