{Opponent Info: Capt HCGS III} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. Nf3 d6 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4
g6 6. Nxc6 $2 bxc6 7. Be2 Bg7 8. Bd2 Nf6 9. O-O O-O 10. Rb1 Qc7 11. Bf4 Be6 12.
Bf3 Rfd8 13. Re1 Nd7 14. Bg4 Bxc3 15. bxc3 Bxa2 16. Rb2 Be6 17. Bxe6 fxe6 18.
Qd4 e5 $2 {I had to play the game in a great hurry as this was the last game
of the round, and the draw for the next round was due. Therefore I hurried and
played correspondingly badly.} 19. Qc4+ d5 $2 20. exd5 {The threat is 21.d6+ I
realised this late.} Kg7 21. dxc6 Rac8 22. Rb7 $4 Qxb7 23. Bxe5+ Nxe5 24. Qe4
Qc7 25. g3 ({not} 25. Qxe5+ $4 Qxe5 26. Rxe5 Rd1+ 27. Re1 Rxe1#) 25... Nxc6 26.
Qe6 Qd6 27. h4 Qxe6 28. Rxe6 Rd2 29. g4 Rxc2 30. h5 a5 31. hxg6 hxg6 32. f4 $2
Rd8 33. Re1 Rdd2 34. Rf1 $4 Rg2+ 35. Kh1 Rh2+ 36. Kg1 Rcg2# {Not a very good
game played in a hurry (30 mins) [Dick played 3 three games on this day
including two matches. I believe this may have been played over a lunch hour 
(Dick had played friendlies in the lunch hour), and the "Minet Shield" after
school then the W.M.L match in the evening.SP.]} 0-1

