{Opponent Info: Age 16yr 11m; Bec Sch, Tooting, S.W.17 [Time limit 36 moves in
90 minutes]} 1. e4 c5 {I am Black for the 4th game out of 5.} 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4
cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 g6 6. Be2 Bg7 7. Be3 O-O 8. O-O a6 9. a4 Nc6 10. Nb3 e6
11. f4 Re8 {Prevents 12.f4, but is weak} 12. Qd2 Qc7 $2 13. Bf3 Rd8 $2 14. a5
$1 Qe7 $2 15. Rfe1 e5 $2 16. Nd5 Qd7 $4 17. Nb6 {I was very tired indeed and
was in no state to concentrate. I had a rest after this game and was fitter
for the afternoon. M.J.Lymer came 40th= with 5 pts.} 1-0

