{Opponent Info: Age 17yr 10m; City of Westminster College S.W.1 [Time limit 36
moves in 90 minutes]} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 e5 {Leaves the
d-Pawn backward.} 5. Nb3 Nf6 6. Nc3 Bb4 7. Bd3 Bxc3+ 8. bxc3 O-O 9. Ba3 d6 10.
O-O Ng4 $2 11. Be2 Qh4 $2 12. Bxg4 Bxg4 13. Qxd6 Be2 14. Rfe1 Bh5 (14... Qxe4
15. Nc1 {Black is in difficulties.}) 15. f3 Qg5 {Thretens 16.....?xf3.} 16. Qd3
Rfd8 17. Qe3 Qxe3+ 18. Rxe3 Rac8 19. h4 {Threatens 20.g4 followed by 21.h5} f6
20. Rd3 b6 21. Rad1 h6 22. c4 Bf7 23. Rxd8+ Nxd8 {[Time 57.5 mins]} 24. c5 {
[Time 36.5 mins]} Bxb3 25. cxb3 $2 (25. axb3 $142) 25... b5 26. b4 $2 Nc6 27.
Kf2 a5 28. Rb1 $2 (28. bxa5 $1 {Best. Yet again my concentration goes, due to
fatigue, in a position I would normally win.}) 28... axb4 29. Bxb4 Nxb4 30.
Rxb4 Rxc5 31. Rb2 Kf7 32. Ke3 Ke6 33. Kd3 Kd6 {Not my day today. I was tired
and drew two games that I should have won. In none of my games so far have I
concentrated as much as I should do. A.Hyams came 54th= with 4pts} 1/2-1/2

