1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 h6 $2 {Waste of time.} 5. O-O Nf6 $2 {
Loses a Pawn} 6. Bxc6 bxc6 7. Nxe5 Bb7 8. Nc3 Bd6 $2 {Loses a tempo.} 9. Nf3
Bc5 {10.e5 was threatened, but this loses another tempo.} 10. d4 Ba7 11. Re1 c5
$2 12. d5 c4 $2 {Loses another Pawn.} 13. Qe2 Ng4 14. Nd1 O-O 15. Qxc4 Re8 16.
h3 Ne5 $2 17. Nxe5 Rxe5 18. Bf4 Bxd5 $4 {Loses a piece for two Pawns.} 19. Qd3
Bxe4 20. Rxe4 Rf5 21. Ne3 Rb5 22. b3 c6 23. c4 d5 $4 24. cxb5 dxe4 25. Qxd8+
Rxd8 26. bxc6 Bb6 $2 27. c7 Rc8 28. Nd5 Ba5 $4 29. Ne7+ Kh7 30. Nxc8 e3 31.
fxe3 g5 32. Be5 f5 33. Ne7 f4 34. c8=Q h5 35. Qg8+ Kh6 36. Qg6# {An easy game
for this type of match. Hayes lost the match 2.5-5.5 (8Bd)} 1-0

