1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. Nge2 {very odd.} d6 4. d3 g6 5. g3 Bg7 6. Bg2 Bg4 7. h3
{Weakening the KS} Bd7 8. Bf4 e5 9. Bd2 Nge7 10. O-O O-O 11. Qc1 a6 12. a4 Be6
{Intending Qd7 or d5} 13. f4 Qd7 $4 {Played without thought I realised my
mistake immediately.} 14. f5 {The first time I have ended a game (won or lost)
with all pieces on the board. Another of my non-concentrating days. [Vernon
Bognador subsequently appered on TV as a "Political commentator" at election
time]} 1-0

