1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. O-O Nxe4 5. Re1 (5. d4) 5... Nd6 6. Nxe5 Nxe5
({Not} 6... Nxc4 $4 7. Nxc6+) 7. Rxe5+ Be7 8. Bb3 O-O 9. d4 Bf6 10. Re1 Nf5 11.
c3 Re8 12. Bf4 {Threatening 13.Bxc7} Re7 $2 (12... d6 $142) 13. Nd2 d6 $2 {
Now I disrupt his KS Pawns.} 14. Ne4 Nh6 $4 {There is no good move but the
move played is worse than bad.} (14... Re8 $2) 15. Bxh6 (15. Nxf6+ $142) 15...
gxh6 $2 (15... Rxe4) 16. Nxf6+ Kh8 17. Qf3 c6 18. Nh5 Re6 $2 19. Bxe6 Bxe6 20.
Rxe6 {based on the assumption my opponent would blunder again.} fxe6 21. Qf7
Qg8 $4 {He did.} 22. Qf6+ {HCGS Pupils (Captained by R.A.C.) won the 8Bd match
7-1.} 1-0

