1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 g6 3. g3 Bg7 4. Bg2 O-O 5. c3 d6 6. Nbd2 Nbd7 7. e4 e5 8. O-O
Re8 9. Re1 c6 10. Nc4 Qc7 11. dxe5 dxe5 12. Nd6 Rd8 {13.....Nc5 is the threat.}
({If} 12... Re6 $2 13. Nxf7 Kxf7 14. Ng5+ {is good.}) (12... Re7 13. Bg5 {
is a nuisance}) 13. Nxc8 Raxc8 14. Qc2 Nc5 15. Bg5 Re8 ({Not} 15... Rd7 16. Bh3
) 16. Bxf6 Bxf6 17. Rad1 Rcd8 18. Bh3 Rxd1 19. Rxd1 Rd8 {Threatening 20......
