1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. Nxe5 d6 4. Nf3 Bg4 $2 5. Nc3 c6 $2 {Intending 6....d5
but unnecessary.} 6. Be2 Bxf3 $2 7. Bxf3 Nbd7 8. d4 {Strong. Prevents .....Ne5
& Nc5.} h6 $2 {Another waste of time.} 9. O-O Be7 10. Re1 d5 $2 11. exd5 cxd5
12. Nxd5 Nxd5 13. Bxd5 O-O $2 14. Bxb7 Rb8 15. Bf3 Bh4 $2 16. g3 Bf6 17. Rb1 {
Removing the Rook from the long diagonal and freeing the Bishop.} Qb6 18. Be3
Rfe8 19. c3 Rbd8 20. Bf4 Rxe1+ 21. Qxe1 Bg5 $2 22. Bxg5 hxg5 23. Qe3 Qg6 $2 24.
Be4 f5 25. Bc2 Re8 $2 26. Bxf5 $1 Qh5 27. Qd3 Nf6 $2 28. Bg6 Qe2 29. Qxe2 Rxe2
30. Kf1 Rd2 $4 31. Ke1 Rxf2 32. Kxf2 Ng4+ 33. Kg1 Kf8 34. Re1 {Threatening
mate.} Nf6 35. d5 {Cushy Hayes won the match 6.5-1.5} 1-0

