{Time limit 30 moves per hour.} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 {I knew this opening was
unsound but I was gion all out for a win.} 3. exf5 e4 4. Nd4 Nf6 5. Bc4 d5 6.
Bb3 Bc5 7. Ne6 Bxe6 8. fxe6 {[4']} Qd6 {[7']} 9. Qe2 {[8']} Bb6 {[14']} (9...
Qxe6 10. Qb5+ Qc6 11. Qxc6+ Nxc6 {...and Black has the better position but as
i was playing for a win I wanted to keep the queens on. However 9.....QxP was
probably better.}) 10. Nc3 {[9']} Qxe6 {[14' 30s] lwading to trouble.} 11. d3 {
[10']} Nc6 {[24'] I was determined to find complications.} 12. dxe4 {[11']}
Nxe4 $2 {Initiating a Queen sacrifice which I knew was unsound but I thought
that White would have plenty of chences to go wrong especially with the 30
Move per hour time limit. A calculated risk.} (12... O-O-O) 13. Bxd5 {[13']}
Bxf2+ {[32']} 14. Kf1 {[14']} ({if} 14. Kd1 O-O-O) 14... Rf8 {[38'] Gone mad.}
15. Bxe6 {[16']} Nd4 {[41']} 16. Bf7+ {[20']} Rxf7 {[42']} 17. Qxe4+ {[21']}
Kf8 {[43']} 18. Ne2 {[25']} Bg3+ {[45']} 19. Nf4 {[27'] better than 19.Bf4} (
19. Bf4) 19... Nf5 {[46']} 20. Qf3 {[32']} (20. hxg3 $4 Nxg3+) 20... Bxf4 {
[47']} 21. Qxf4 {[35' 30s]} (21. Bxf4 $4) 21... Re8 {[49']} 22. Bd2 {[37']} Rd8
{[51']} 23. Bb4+ {[40']} Kg8 {[51' 30s]} 24. Kg1 {[41']} Rd4 {[53']} 25. Re1 {
[45']} (25. Qxd4 {wins .....although....} Nxd4 {threatens mate.}) 25... h6 {
[53' 30s]} 26. Re8+ {[47']} Kh7 {[53' 45s]} 27. Qxd4 {[49']} Nxd4 {[54']} 28.
c3 {[50']} Nc6 {[56']} 29. h3 {[50' 30s]} a5 {[59' 30s]} 30. Bc5 {Black lost
on time. A calculated risk so I wasn't surprised when it didn't work.} 1-0

