{[Time limit 36moves per 1hr 30 min]} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Bxc6
dxc6 5. O-O Bd6 6. d4 Bg4 {About the best I think.} ({If} 6... exd4 7. Qxd4 {
is strong.}) 7. dxe5 Bxf3 8. Qxf3 Bxe5 9. Nc3 Nf6 10. Bg5 Qd6 11. Bxf6 Bxf6 12.
Qe3 O-O 13. Rfd1 {Seizing the innitiative.} Qe7 (13... Qb4 14. e5) 14. Rd3 {
Preparing to double Rooks also the possibility of a KS attack with Rg3 or Rh3.}
Be5 {Heading for c5.} (14... Rad8 {Might be better.}) 15. Rad1 Bd6 16. Qd4 $1
h6 {[30']} ({If Black now plays...(either Rook)} 16... Rad8 {with the threat
of 17.....Bxh2+. He loses a Bishop.} 17. e5 $3 {....and if....} Bxe5 (17...
Qxe5 18. Qxe5 Bxe5 19. Rxd8) 18. Qxd8 $18) 17. Kf1 {[47'] Preparing for f4. I
didn't play the King to h1 because it's better placed here for the end-game,
however the f-file is soon opened.} f5 $1 18. exf5 {[53']} Rxf5 {[36']} 19.
Qc4+ {[56'] To gain some time on the clock.} Kh8 {[43']} 20. Ne4 ({I also
considered.} 20. Qe4) 20... Raf8 {[47'] Prevents 21.NxB} 21. g3 {[65']
Prepares for a possible f4.} ({Not} 21. f3 Bxh2) ({I didn't like} 21. Kg1 {
As it puts the King on the a7-g1 diagonal, and Black may get the chance to
sacrifice on f2.}) 21... Qe8 {[50'] I'm not sure why he played this. (To gain
time possibly?)} 22. Kg1 {[66'] Things wre getting rather hot.} b5 {Revealing
why he played 21.....Qe8 so as to defend the c-Pawn. When he played this move
I thought I was going to lose a Pawn but soon saw a way out.} 23. Qd4 {[70']}
Be5 {[55']} 24. Qb4 {[73']} Qf7 {Phew!} ({If....} 24... Bxb2 {I intended...}
25. Rd8 $1 {but wasn't very happy about it.e.g.} Qe5 ({..but then realised I'd
be attacking his Rook on f8 twice so Black would be obliged to play....} 25...
Qxd8 26. Rxd8 Rxd8 27. Qxb2 $18)) 25. Rd8 {[77']} Rxd8 {[74'] Black has taken
19 mins over his last two moves.} 26. Rxd8+ {[77']} Kh7 {[77']} 27. b3 {
[78'] A "safe" move (12 mins for 10 moves)} h5 {[77'] Rather dangerous when
one has 113 mins for 10 moves.} 28. Rd3 {[80']} h4 $2 {[82'] Black has 8 moves
to make in 8 mins (I have 10) and he has just made an inferior move.} 29. g4 $1
{[81']} Qg6 $8 {[84']} ({Not...} 29... Rf4) 30. Kh1 {[82']} Rf4 {[86']} ({
Not....} 30... Qxg4 $4 31. Nf6+) 31. f3 {[84']} Bd6 {[87']} 32. Qe1 {[86']} c5
$2 {[88']} 33. Qxh4+ {[87']} Kg8 {25 [88' 30s] Time was called!! Adjudicated
drawn. Middlesex won the match 35 -} ({Had time not been called I would have
won.We played on (whilst waiting for the adjudication result) and I won. It
took him several minutes to find the draw.} 33... Kg8 {When we played on I
played....} 34. Nxd6 cxd6 35. Qd8+ Kh7 36. Qxd6 Qxd6 37. Rxd6 $18) 1/2-1/2

