1. d4 {It's a long time since I played this in a match.} Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 c5
4. d5 b6 5. e4 g6 $2 {Very bad . He is now in a very compromised position.} 6.
e5 Ng8 7. d6 Bb7 {This Bishop is his best piece at the moment.} 8. f4 {
Securing the advanced Pawns.} Qh4+ $2 {Inferior.} (8... f6 {would be better
but his position would still be bad.}) 9. g3 Qh5 10. Be2 ({Not} 10. Qxh5 gxh5 {
and my Rook is en prise.}) 10... Qh6 {NowI will always have f5 as a threat.}
11. Nf3 Qh3 {f5 was threatened} 12. Ng1 {Best} (12. Bf1 Qh5 {Is not as good.})
12... Qh6 13. Bf3 Bxf3 {Giving up his only minor piece in play.} 14. Nxf3 Qh5 {
What else?} 15. h3 a6 $2 {Loses a lost game. He was scared of 16.Nb5} 16. g4
Qh6 17. f5 Qg7 (17... g5 {Is no better.}) 18. f6 Nxf6 19. exf6 Qxf6 {Black has
moved his Queen 9 times in the last 12 moves} 20. Qe2 {Threatening 21.Nd5} Bxd6
21. Nd5 Bg3+ 22. Kf1 Qg7 ({If} 22... Qd8 23. Bg5) 23. Nxb6 Ra7 24. Rg1 Bc7 ({
Not} 24... Bd6 $2 25. Nc8 $1) 25. Nd5 O-O 26. Nxc7 Rxc7 27. Bf4 {Heaven knows
how many tempi I have won in this game.} Rb7 28. Be5 f6 29. Bc3 Qe7 30. Qe4 d5
31. cxd5 f5 32. Qe5 Kf7 33. dxe6+ Ke8 34. g5 {To post my Bishop on f6} Nc6 {
The QKnight moves at last.} 35. Qd5 Nb4 $2 36. Bxb4 {Team I won the match.
Black was battered from pillar to post, but it was his own fault after move 5.}
(36. Bxb4 {If...} cxb4 {I mate in 5 at the most.} 37. Qc6+ Kd8 38. Rd1+ Rd7 39.
Rxd7+ Ke8 40. Rxe7+ Kxe7 41. Qd7#) 1-0

