1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 d5 $2 {An idiotic move.} 4. Nxe5 Qd6 $2 (4... Bd7
$142) ({If} 4... Qg5 5. Nf3 Qxg2 6. Rg1 Qh3 7. exd5 a6 8. Bf1 {Wins a piece.})
5. d4 f6 {Loses the exchange and a Pawn.} 6. Qh5+ g6 7. Nxg6 hxg6 8. Qxh8 Be6
