1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e3 d5 5. Bd3 O-O 6. Nge2 Nc6 7. O-O Re8 8. a3
Bd6 9. f4 b6 10. b4 a6 (10... dxc4 {would open the long diagonal for his Bishop
}) 11. c5 Bf8 {I played the opening quickly without thought and probably could
have done better if I had thought about it.} 12. Bd2 g6 13. Qc2 Bb7 14. b5 $2 {
Energetic after my previous lethargy but very risky.} axb5 15. cxb6 b4 16. bxc7
Qxc7 17. Nb5 Qd7 18. a4 $2 {This move probably loses the game, but I was
playing lethargically.} Rec8 {Threatens 19.....Nxd4} 19. Qb3 Ne4 20. Bxe4 dxe4
21. Nc1 Qd5 22. Qb2 Ba6 23. Na2 Bxb5 24. axb5 Qxb5 25. Rfb1 ({possibly better
is} 25. Rab1) 25... Rcb8 26. Qb3 Ra3 27. Qxa3 bxa3 28. Rxb5 Rxb5 29. Nc3 Rb2
30. Bc1 ({Not} 30. Nxe4 $4 f5) 30... Rc2 31. Nxe4 a2 32. Nd2 $4 Bb4 33. Ba3 {
or Resigns} Bxd2 34. Rd1 Bxe3+ 35. Kf1 Rf2+ 36. Ke1 Nxd4 0-1

