is so bad I considered resigning.} 20. Rxg1 {[38']} Nc5 {[28' 30s]} 21. Rg8+ {
[40']} Ke7 {[30']} 22. Bg6 {[52']} (22. Bf5 {Looks good too.}) 22... h4 {[33']}
