cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 e6 7. f4 Be7 8. Qf3 {[3']} Qc7 {[1']} 9. Nb3
{[5']} Bd7 10. O-O-O Nc6 {[2']} 11. Bd3 {[9']} Nb4 12. Kb1 Rc8 13. a3 Nxd3 14.
Qxd3 (14. Rxd3 Bb5) 14... Bc6 15. Rd2 {[17']} O-O 16. Re1 Rfd8 {The treat
was17.BxN BxB 18.QxP} 17. Qg3 b5 18. Nd4 Bb7 19. f5 e5 20. Bh6 $6 {Played
without due consideration. Black now has ample opportunity to go wrong but
selects the correct move.} Nh5 $1 ({If....} 20... g6 21. fxg6 $3 {..and now if.
.} fxg6 (21... hxg6 22. Ne6 $1 fxe6 23. Qxg6+) (21... exd4 22. gxh7+) 22. Ne6)
21. Qg4 exd4 22. Rxd4 g6 23. fxg6 hxg6 {[40']} 24. Re3 {[43']} Qd7 25. Qe2 {
[45']} Bf6 $2 {[47']} 26. e5 Bg7 27. Bxg7 Nxg7 28. Rxd6 (28. exd6 Nf5) 28...
Qe7 29. Red3 $2 Rxd6 {[58']} 30. exd6 {[52']} (30. Rxd6 Re8) 30... Qxe2 {[59']}
31. Nxe2 {[52']} Bxg2 {[61']} 32. d7 Rd8 33. Nf4 {[53']} Bc6 34. Rd6 Bb7 35.
Nd5 Bxd5 36. Rxd5 Ne6 37. a4 bxa4 38. c4 Nf8 39. Rd6 {Resigns is more to the
point.} Rxd7 40. Rxa6 f5 41. Rxa4 f4 42. Ra3 Rf7 {[1hr 15']} 43. Rf3 {[59']}
Ne6 44. Ka2 (44. Kc2 $4 Nd4+) 44... Nd4 45. Rf2 f3 46. Ka3 Re7 47. b4 {Loses
immediately but I was past caring.} Re3+ {I played this game badly due to
being 'annoyed' at my stupid loss this morning. I played quickly (8 moves in 3
mins at the start) and without much thought. I felt things weren't going too
well about move 13. I have come to the impression that I am a match player and
can't keep up my concentration in tournaments where I have to play game after
game. This game for example was my second four hour game in the space of 10
hours and I was also somewhat tired from the travelling.} 0-1

