[11']} d5 {[11']} 15. Nf2 {[11' 30s]} Qa5 {[13' 30s] An exchange of Queens is
good for me.} 16. c3 {[12'] This is even better for me.} d4 {[15']} 17. g4 {
[13']} ({Not....} 17. Nxd4 $2 Nxd4 18. cxd4 $4) 17... dxc3 {[15'] Ruining his
QS Pawns.} 18. bxc3 {[16']} Qd5 {[19']} 19. Qe2 {[17'] Weakens the c4 Pawn.}
Bc5 {[23'] I want to make various moves like ....e5 but the Knight on f2 is a
nuisance.} 20. Be4 {[20']} Bxf2+ {[23']} 21. Kxf2 {Loses another Pawn as it
turns out.} Qc5+ {[24']} 22. Kg2 (22. Qe3 {Allows an exchange of Queens.})
22... Qxc3 {[25']} 23. g5 {[21' 30s]} ({If} 23. Rac1 Qb4 24. Bxc6 bxc6 25. Rxc6
Qxf4) 23... f5 {[30'] Putting an end to his attack.} 24. gxf6 {[23' 30s]} Qxf6
{[31' 30s]} 25. Kf2 {[23' 30s] Practically giving up.} Qxf4 {[32' 30s]} 26.
Rhg1 {[24']} Qxh4+ {[33']} 27. Kf1 {[24']} Qf6 {[33' 30s]} 28. Re1 {[24' 30s]}
Nd4 {[35' 30s]} 29. Qb2 {..and White resigned before I could reply.} 0-1

