Nc5 9. Bg5 h6 {[17']} 10. Bxf6 {[6']} Qxf6 11. O-O Qe7 (11... a5 $142) 12. b4
Na6 ({Black spent quite a while considering.....} 12... Nxe4 13. Nxe4 f5 14.
Ned2 e4 {etc...}) 13. a3 f5 14. Nd2 f4 15. Ra2 {Removing the Rook from the
long diagonal and preparing to bring the Rook accross to the KS possibly.} Nb8
16. Qc1 {Preparing an eventual c5.} g5 17. h3 (17. gxf4 exf4 {Is good for
Black.}) 17... g4 (17... h5 {Looks better.}) 18. hxg4 Bxg4 19. f3 Bh5 20. g4
Bg6 21. Nb3 b6 22. a4 {Here he offered a draw and as I had another game this
afternoon I accepted.} 1/2-1/2

