{Time limit 36 moves in 90 mins then 24 per hour.} 1. e4 {[10']} c5 2. Bc4 a6
3. a3 Nc6 4. Nf3 d6 5. h3 {[11'] Unnecessary} Nf6 {[3']} 6. Nc3 b5 7. Ba2 {
[12']} b4 {[4']} 8. Ne2 Bb7 ({Not...} 8... Nxe4 $4 9. Bd5) 9. d3 g6 10. Ng3 Bg7
11. O-O $2 bxa3 12. c3 (12. bxa3 $2 Nxe4 $1) 12... axb2 13. Bxb2 {[21']} O-O {
[9']} 14. Re1 Qc7 {[10']} 15. Ng5 {[37']} h6 {[15']} ({Not....} 15... e6 16.
Bxe6) 16. Nf3 {[38']} e6 17. Qc2 Nd7 18. Bc1 $2 Nb4 19. cxb4 $6 {Sacrificing
the exchange for a Pawn and a promising attack which gives me some worrying
moments.} Bxa1 20. Bxh6 Bg7 21. Bxg7 Kxg7 22. d4 {This turns out quite well
and is probably best.} Rac8 23. Qc1 {[52'] Sacrificing another Pawn but he
gets more of an attack than I had expected.} cxb4 {[25']} 24. Nh5+ $1 {[59']}
Kh7 {[27']} ({Not....} 24... gxh5 $4 25. Qg5+ {and draws.}) 25. Qf4 $1 {
The best move I think.} ({If now} 25. Ng5+ Kg8 {the Queen's route is blocked.})
25... gxh5 {[35']} 26. Bb1 {Threatening 27.e5+} ({If now} 26. Ng5+ Kg6 $1 (
26... Kh6 $4 27. Nxe6+) (26... Kh8 27. Qh4 Nf6 28. e5)) 26... f6 $1 {I could
not find any other move which would save me (except possibly 26.....Rg8 but
eben this would probably have lost.} (26... Rg8 27. e5+ Kg7 28. Ng5 {etc.}) 27.
e5+ f5 28. Ng5+ Kg6 {[40']} 29. exd6 $1 {[72] Now I was in a quandry. My Queen
is attacked & I am threatened with 30.RxP+} e5 $1 {[46']} (29... Qd8 $2 30.
Rxe6+ Rf6 31. Bxf5+) 30. Qg3 {[75']} Qc3 $1 {The only move.} 31. Nf3+ Kh7 32.
Ng5+ Kh6 33. Qxc3 bxc3 34. dxe5 {His last hope is the e-Pawn or d-Pawn.} Kxg5
35. e6 Nf6 36. d7 Nxd7 37. exd7 Rc7 {[59']} 38. Re8 Rxd7 39. Rxf8 Rd1+ 40. Kh2
Rxb1 41. h4+ Kg6 42. g4 hxg4 43. h5+ {Trying for stalemate} Kxh5 44. Kg3 c2 45.
Kf4 c1=Q+ 46. Kxf5 Rb5+ 47. Ke6 Qc6+ {An extremely good game, not because it
was without error but due to the complications. At the end of the game my
nerves were all frayed.} 0-1

