$4 10. Ne6+ $18) (9... Nd7 10. e6) 10. e6 $18) 9. Bb5+ Kf8 (9... Bd7 10. e6)
10. Bc4 e6 ({I also considered....} 10... Nc7) 11. O-O Bxe5 12. Nxe6+ Bxe6 13.
Bh6+ Kg8 14. Nxd5 Qh4 ({Possibly better is.....} 14... Nc6 15. Z0 {Threatening.
