8. Bd2 {[8']} d6 $2 {This leaves his E-Pawn too weak.} 9. a3 Bxc3 10. Bxc3 {
[10']} Nbd7 {[10'] This loses a Pawn with the worse position but.......} 11.
Nd2 $2 {[15'] The wrong move. I played this in order to prevent .....Ne4, It
also prevents .....Be4 if I play an eventual Qc2} (11. Ng5 {Wins a pawn and
gets the better position, but I hadn't considered this.}) 11... Bxg2 {[17']}
12. Kxg2 Ne4 13. f3 Nxc3 14. bxc3 f4 {This move needed more preparation.} 15.
Qe1 Qf6 16. e3 e5 {[27']} 17. g4 {[28']} fxe3 {[35']} 18. Qxe3 exd4 19. cxd4
Rae8 20. Qd3 Qf4 21. Rae1 Nf6 22. Ne4 {[36']} h6 {[54'] I'm not sure why.} 23.
Nxf6+ Qxf6 24. Re3 {[40']} ({If...} 24. Rxe8 Rxe8 {He could control the e-file.
}) 24... Rxe3 {[56']} 25. Qxe3 Qf7 26. d5 {[47']} Re8 27. Qd2 {[50']} Qe7 28.
Kf2 Qe5 {[63']} 29. f4 {[53']} Qf6 30. Kg3 {[63']} (30. Kf3 {is not so good.})
30... g5 {[69'] Adjourned. Agreed drawn. My time was [75'] Hayes lost the
match 3-5 - 4.5. A pity about move 11.} (30... g5 {I would now probably play}
31. Qd3 ({Not...} 31. f5 {which loses a pawn.})) 1/2-1/2

