several tempi.} 4. fxe5 Nxe5 5. d4 Nc6 6. e5 ({Not as good is...} 6. d5 Ne5)
6... Ng8 7. Nf3 d6 {Trying to exchange off my advanced Pawns.} 8. Bb5 Bd7 (8...
dxe5 {is prevented due to} 9. Bxc6+ bxc6 10. Nxe5 {White stands well}) 9. O-O
dxe5 $2 {This is very bad but what else is there.} 10. Bxc6 Bxc6 {[15']} 11.
Nxe5 Bd5 {[24'] What else?} (11... Qe7 12. Nxc6 bxc6 13. Re1) (11... f6 12.
Qh5+) 12. Nxd5 Qxd5 13. Nxf7 {[13' 30s]} Nf6 14. Nxh8 O-O-O 15. c3 Bd6 16. Nf7
Qxf7 17. Bg5 Be7 18. Qf3 Rf8 19. Bxf6 Bxf6 20. Qf5+ Kb8 21. Kh1 {Black
threatened Bxd4+ winning the Queen.} (21. Qxh7 {Was good too.}) 21... h6 22. b3
Re8 23. Rae1 {[32'] 24....Rf8 but Black had exceeded the time limit. My fifth
consecutive 'Sunday Times' win also my fifth consecutive with White. Hayes won
3.5 - 2.5} 1-0

