{Time control 36 moves in 90m then 24 moves in 60m} 1. e4 e5 {I started with
15 mins on my clock.} 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. f4 d5 4. fxe5 Nxe4 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. Qe2 Bxf3 (
{I didn't know the opening..} 6... Ng5 {is better.}) 7. Qxf3 ({Not..} 7. gxf3
$4 Qh4+) 7... Nxc3 8. bxc3 Nc6 9. Bb5 Be7 10. O-O O-O 11. d4 Qd7 ({Not...} 
11... Bg5 12. Bxg5 Qxg5 13. Qxd5 Qe3+ 14. Kh1 Qxc3 15. Bxc6 Qxc6 16. Qxc6 bxc6
{When my Pawns are terrible.}) 12. Qg3 Qe6 13. Bd3 $1 g6 $2 (13... f5) 14. Bh6
(14. Bg5) 14... Rfe8 15. Bf5 Bh4 16. Bxe6 {A.K.Abel came 5th= with 7.5pts} ({
Not..} 16. Qxh4 gxf5) 1-0

