{Time control 36 moves in 90m then 24 moves in 60m} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 c5
4. c3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Bd7 6. Bd3 cxd4 7. cxd4 Nge7 8. g4 $2 {This leads to all
sorts of trouble but I was trying for a quick win.} Qb6 9. Bc2 O-O-O 10. O-O
Ng6 11. a3 Be7 12. Nc3 Nh4 13. Nxh4 Bxh4 14. Ne2 f6 15. f4 {This move causes
more trouble. I was trying to be too aggressive.} h5 16. exf6 gxf6 17. gxh5 e5
18. fxe5 fxe5 19. Ng3 Nxd4 20. Kg2 Rdg8 21. b4 Bg4 22. Qd3 Be2 23. Qc3+ Kb8 24.
Rf2 Bxh5 25. Qe3 Qe6 26. Kf1 (26. Z0 {Threatening....} Bxg3 27. hxg3 Qh3+ 28.
Kxh3 Bf3+ 29. Qh6 Rxh6+ 30. Bxh6 Rh8 31. g4 Rxh6+ 32. Kg3 {or various other
better variations.}) 26... Qh3+ 27. Ke1 Ka8 28. Bd3 Bg5 29. Qxe5 Re8 {I tried
to be aggressive but was hoist with my own petard. S.J.Ridout came 34th= with
4.5pts} 0-1

