{Time limit 36 moves in 90m then 24 moves in 60m} 1. d4 f5 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6
4. Bf4 Bg7 5. Nf3 O-O 6. e3 d6 7. Be2 c6 8. O-O Nbd7 ({I would normally play...
.} 8... Qc7 {in order to play .....e5 but as White has a Bishop on f4 I play
differently.}) 9. Ng5 Nb6 10. h4 h6 11. Nf3 Ng4 {Threatening 12.....e5} 12. Bg3
e5 13. dxe5 dxe5 14. Qxd8 Rxd8 15. Rfd1 Be6 16. b3 f4 17. Bh2 (17. exf4 $2 exf4
$19) 17... fxe3 18. fxe3 Rxd1+ 19. Nxd1 Nxh2 (19... e4 {is not so good.} 20.
Nd4 c5 21. Nxe6 Bxa1 22. Bxg4) 20. Nxh2 (20. Kxh2 $2 e4) 20... Rd8 21. Nf1 Bf6
22. h5 g5 23. g4 Nd7 24. Nf2 {[60']} Nc5 {[24']} 25. Rd1 Kf7 26. Rxd8 Bxd8 {
Here he offered a draw which I refused.} 27. Ng3 Bb6 28. e4 {Here I offered a
draw which he refused.} Ke7 29. Kg2 Bc7 {Draw agreed. H.Waldman came 23rd=
with 5.5pts.} 1/2-1/2

