{Time limit 24 per hour then 6 every} 1. d4 f5 2. e4 fxe4 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 e6
5. Nxe4 (5. Bxf6 Qxf6 6. Nxe4 {Looks better.}) 5... Be7 6. Nxf6+ Bxf6 7. Qh5+
g6 8. Bxf6 Qxf6 9. Qc5 Qf4 (9... c6 {Wasn't very good.}) 10. Nf3 b6 11. Qe5 O-O
12. Be2 Nc6 13. Qxf4 Rxf4 {Black has obtained an advantage from the opening.}
14. c3 Bb7 15. O-O Ne7 16. Ne5 d6 17. Nd3 Rf6 18. Rae1 Nf5 19. Nb4 Nh4 20. f3 (
20. g3 {is definatly bad.}) 20... a5 21. Nc2 ({Not..} 21. Nd3 $2 {in view of
me playing....} Nf5 22. Z0 Ne3 23. Z0 Ba6) 21... Raf8 22. Rf2 {Both sides now
engage on a strategy of subtle manoeuvering which gets nowhere fast.} g5 23.
Ref1 Ng6 24. g3 e5 25. Bc4+ {[58']} Kg7 {[34']} 26. d5 Bc8 27. Kg2 Ne7 28. Ne3
Bd7 29. Bd3 (29. Ng4 b5) 29... h5 30. Be4 {[65']} Kh6 {[45']} 31. h3 R6f7 32.
c4 Ng8 33. b3 Nf6 34. Bd3 Nh7 35. Rh1 Nf6 36. Re1 Ng8 37. Be4 Ne7 38. Rd1 Ng6 {
Adjourned Draw agreed} 1/2-1/2

