1. e4 e6 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 exd5 4. d4 Nf6 5. Bg5 Nbd7 6. c4 h6 7. Bh4 Be7 8.
Bd3 O-O 9. O-O Nb6 10. c5 {This move isn't very good despite the fact that
