is not as good.}) 11... Bxd2+ 12. Qxd2 Bd7 13. Rc1 h6 {White's threatened 14.
h5 didn't bother me but h6 does.} 14. a3 {Why?} O-O 15. g4 Nge7 16. g5 $2 {
premature.} h5 17. Qf4 Nf5 18. Ne3 g6 19. Nxf5 exf5 20. Rg1 Rac8 21. Rd1 {
