1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 e6 7. f4 Be7 8. Qf3
Qc7 9. O-O-O Nc6 10. Nb3 Bd7 11. Bd3 {This cuts off the Queens protection of
the Knight.} (11. Be2 $142) 11... h6 12. Bxf6 (12. Bh4 {Would lose a Pawn.})
12... Bxf6 13. Ne2 Nb4 14. a3 Nxd3+ 15. Qxd3 Bb5 16. Qd2 {White has definately
got the worst of the opening.} e5 17. h4 Bc4 18. Kb1 d5 {This is much stronger
than I realsied.} 19. exd5 O-O-O 20. g3 $2 {Rather an obvious blunder.} Bxd5
21. Qxd5 Rxd5 22. Rxd5 Kb8 23. Rhd1 exf4 24. Nxf4 Rd8 25. R1d3 Rxd5 26. Nxd5
Qe5 27. Nxf6 Qxf6 28. Nc5 Qf1+ 29. Ka2 Qf2 30. Rc3 Qd2 31. Nd3 f6 32. Nb4 g5
33. hxg5 hxg5 34. Rd3 Qg2 35. Kb3 f5 36. Nd5 Qe4 37. Kc3 f4 38. gxf4 gxf4 39.
Rd4 Qe1+ 40. Rd2 f3 41. Kd3 f2 42. Ne3 f1=Q+ 43. Nxf1 Qxf1+ 44. Kc3 Qf6+ 45.
Kb3 Qe6+ 46. c4 Qe3+ 47. Kc2 Qe4+ 48. Kc3 Qe3+ 49. Kc2 Ka7 50. Rd3 Qe2+ 51. Kc3
a5 52. Rd2 Qe3+ 53. Kc2 Kb6 54. b3 a4 55. bxa4 Qxa3 56. Rd5 Qxa4+ 57. Kc3 Kc6
58. Rb5 {This loses but I was probably lost anyway although I can't see
anything definite.} Qxb5 59. cxb5+ Kxb5 60. Kb3 b6 61. Ka3 Kc4 62. Kb2 Kb4 63.
Kb1 Kc3 64. Ka2 b5 65. Kb1 b4 66. Ka2 Kc2 67. Ka1 Kb3 68. Kb1 Ka3 69. Ka1 b3 {
10.05/0 Rather a blunder on move 20 but I might have survived by playing
differently on move 58. Midddlesex lost 9.5 -} 0-1

