1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 e5 5. Nf5 {Unusual but I intended to
control d5} d6 6. Ne3 Nf6 7. Nc3 a6 8. a3 Be7 ({He could have tried...} 8... b5
{to prevent Bc4}) 9. Bc4 b5 10. Ba2 O-O 11. O-O Nd4 $2 {This seems doubtful as
the Knight serves no useful purpose at d4 and proves an embarassment for Black.
} 12. Ned5 {The whole game depends on the control of d5.} Nxd5 13. Bxd5 Ra7 $2
{This was wrong as 14.Be3 gains force for me. 13.....Rb8 would assist a QS
advance.} (13... Rb8) 14. Be3 Bf6 {Hanging onto the Pawn but allowing my
powerful reply.} 15. f4 $1 {Threatens 16.f5 when Black won't last long.} Rc7 {
Waste of time but what else had he?} 16. f5 Bb7 $2 {Worse than useless.} 17.
Bxb7 Rxb7 18. Nd5 Rb8 19. c3 Nc6 {[28']} 20. Qg4 {[20'] Threatening 21.Bh6
then 22.Bxg BxB 23.f6} Kh8 21. Rf3 ({Possibly} 21. Nxf6 gxf6 {is quicker but
21.Rf3 just piles on the pressure.} ({Not} 21... Qxf6 $4 22. Bg5)) 21... g5 {
Desperation.} 22. Nxf6 Qxf6 23. Bxg5 Qg7 24. Qh4 f6 25. Bh6 Qf7 $2 {[36']} 26.
Bxf8 Rxf8 27. Rd1 Qe7 28. Rfd3 Rd8 29. Qf2 Na5 30. Qb6 $3 {Obviously I could
win by simple plodding. This move is probably sound but is too risky
considering that I have an easy win. I didn't know what was going to happen
for sure but was relying on his weak Pawns.} Nc4 31. Qxa6 ({I could play safe
by.} 31. Qf2) 31... Nxb2 32. R1d2 Nxd3 33. Rxd3 Qf8 {Possibly intending 34.....
Qh6, 34.....Rg8, 34.....Ra8} 34. Qxb5 Rb8 35. Qd5 Rb1+ 36. Rd1 Qb8 37. h4 $3 {
The significance of this is seen on move 42.} Rxd1+ 38. Qxd1 Qa7+ 39. Kh2 Qxa3
{The situation is not so easy as Black thinks.} 40. Qd5 $1 {Threatening 41.Qf7}
Qc1 {Relatively best.} (40... Qxc3 41. Qf7) (40... Qa7 41. Qxd6) (40... h6 41.
Qf7) (40... h5 41. Qf7) 41. Qxd6 {Threatening mate.} Qf4+ 42. Kh3 {The point
of 37.h4!! 37.h3 would have been useless in comparison.} Qe3+ 43. g3 {Black
has no checks.} Qxe4 $4 {Black had obviously forgotten about the mating threat
during the adjournment.} (43... Qh6 {Is forced.}) 44. Qf8# {Black was lost
anyway. after about move 14. match score Sotn 22 Portsmouth 28. I was the only
Soton player on the top 12 Bds to win.} 1-0

