1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nc6 {[1']} 3. f4 d6 {[10']} 4. Nf3 Nf6 5. Bc4 Bg4 6. O-O Nd4 {
This is all very well but it breaks the rules as the same piece is moved twice
before his development is completed.} 7. fxe5 dxe5 $2 {Suicidal.} 8. Bxf7+ Kxf7
{[34']} 9. Nxe5+ Ke8 10. Nxg4 Nxg4 11. Qxg4 Nxc2 {Hastens the end.} 12. Qh5+ {
Much better than 12.Rb1} (12. Rb1) 12... Kd7 13. Qf5+ Kc6 ({If} 13... Kd6 {
I don't bother about winning the Knight but transpose into the game by} 14.
Qd5+) 14. Qb5+ Kd6 15. Qd5+ Ke7 16. Rf7+ Ke8 {[44']} 17. Qe6+ {[11'] Rather
violent. University won 4.5 - 1.5} 1-0

