1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 {[1']} e6 6. a3 {[2']} Qb6 7.
Ndb5 {As it turns out this lands me in a terrible mess.} (7. Be3 {Was
obviously better.}) 7... Bc5 8. Nd6+ Ke7 9. Nxc8+ {There's not much choice
really.} Raxc8 10. Qf3 {I can't see any improvement on this.} Ne5 ({Equally
good would be....} 10... Nd4) 11. Qg3 {[45']} Neg4 {I was considering
resigning around here.} 12. Nd1 {Just about saving me (temporarily)} Nxe4 $1 {
Perfectly sound.} 13. Qxg4 Bxf2+ 14. Ke2 {[50']} ({If} 14. Nxf2 Qxf2+ 15. Kd1
Rxc2 {followed by Rhc8 and I won't last long.}) 14... Rxc2+ {I didn't expect
to last much longer.} 15. Kf3 Qb3+ {[46']} ({Better seems.} 15... Qd4) 16. Be3
{[52']} Bxe3 17. Qxe4 $1 {Better than taking with the Knight.} (17. Nxe3) 17...
Bc5+ 18. Qd3 Qxd3+ 19. Bxd3 Rd2 {Black has a great advantage and wins easily.}
20. Be2 Bd4 21. Rb1 Rc8 22. Ne3 {Something has to go.} Bxe3 23. Kxe3 Rcc2 24.
Bf3 Rxb2 25. Bxb7 d5 26. Rhc1 Rxb1 27. Rxb1 Rxg2 28. Bxd5 {As good as
resignation.} exd5 29. Rb7+ Ke6 30. Rxa7 Rxh2 31. a4 g5 32. a5 Ra2 33. a6 h5
34. Ra8 h4 35. a7 {Threatening 36.Re8+} Kf5 36. Rf8 Rxa7 {A good game by Black.
} 0-1

