{Time limit 24 moves per hour.} 1. d4 d5 {I arrived late and started with 30
minutes onmy clock.} 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. e3 c6 6. a3 {Passive.}
Be7 7. Bd3 O-O 8. Qc2 h6 9. Bh4 dxc4 10. Bxc4 Nd5 11. Bg3 N7b6 12. Bd3 Bd6 13.
Nge2 {This doesn't appear any better than 13.Nf3} Qe7 14. Nxd5 exd5 {White,
who has twiceas much time as me, should play something more promising than
this.} 15. O-O Bd7 16. Rfe1 Rad8 17. Nf4 Bc8 18. Rad1 Qc7 19. b4 a6 20. Be2
Rfe8 $1 {Not as I had originally intended} (20... Nd7 $2 {intending 21.....Nf6}
21. Nxd5 $1 cxd5 22. Qxc7 Bxc7 23. Bxc7 Rde8 24. Bd6) 21. Nd3 Bf5 22. Qc3 Bxd3
23. Bxd3 Bxg3 24. hxg3 {White failed to take advantage of his extra time.
Hayes won 7 - 1 !!} 1/2-1/2

