1. e4 Nf6 2. Nc3 d5 3. d3 {very tame and allowing Black to get on top.} d4 4.
Nce2 e5 5. c3 (5. f4 $142) 5... c5 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. Ng5 $2 {Hoping to get in a
rather belated f4.} h6 8. Nf3 g5 9. cxd4 cxd4 10. a3 g4 11. Nxe5 $6 Nxe5 12.
Qa4+ Nc6 13. b4 Bg7 $1 14. g3 (14. b5 Qa5+ 15. Qxa5 Nxa5 16. Nxd4 Nxe4 $1)
14... Bd7 15. Bd2 Ne5 16. Qb3 Be6 17. Qa4+ Bd7 18. b5 $4 Nxd3+ 19. Kd1 Nb2+ 20.
Ke1 Nxa4 {The rest was a waste of postage stamps.} 21. Nxd4 Nxe4 22. Be3 Qa5+
23. Kd1 Nb2+ 24. Kc1 Qc3+ 25. Kb1 Bxd4 26. h3 {No comment.} Qb3 27. Bc1 Nc3# {
Quite remarkable for a correspondence game.} 0-1

[Event "P.C.C. A-P-A A8 1963"]
[Site "?"]
