1. c4 f5 2. d4 Nf6 3. g3 e6 4. Bg2 Be7 5. Nc3 O-O 6. Nf3 d5 7. c5 {Releasing
the tension in the centre.} c6 8. O-O Nbd7 9. Ng5 {Gaining a tempo but listtle
else.} Nb8 10. f4 h6 11. Nf3 Nbd7 12. Ne5 Nxe5 13. fxe5 Ne4 14. Nxe4 dxe4 {
Better than.....} ({....} 14... fxe4) 15. e3 b6 16. b4 a5 17. Ba3 $2 {This
seems wrong as the a-Pawn becomes isolated.} axb4 18. Bxb4 Ba6 19. Rf2 Qd5 20.
Qb3 (20. Rc1 Bc4 21. a3 bxc5 22. Bxc5 Bxc5 23. dxc5 Qxd1+ 24. Rxd1 Rxa3) 20...
Bc4 {Winning the a-Pawn.} 21. Qc3 ({If} 21. Qc2 bxc5 22. Bxc5 Bxc5 23. dxc5 Bd3
24. Qc3 Rfb8 {Threatening 25......Rb5}) 21... bxc5 22. Bxc5 Bxc5 23. dxc5 Rxa2
24. Rfxa2 Bxa2 25. Qd4 Rb8 26. Bf1 Qxd4 27. exd4 Rb2 28. Re1 (28. Rd1 Bb3 {
Rook moves} 29. Re1 Rd2) 28... Bd5 ({If} 28... Rd2 29. Re2) 29. Re2 Rb1 30. Kf2
Rd1 31. Rc2 Rxd4 32. Ke3 Ra4 33. h4 Ra3+ (33... Ra3+ 34. Kf2 Rf3+ 35. Kg2 e3 {
etc.}) 0-1

