1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. f4 d6 4. Nc3 Nf6 5. Nf3 O-O 6. Bc4 c5 $2 {This plausible
move has unfortunate consequences.} 7. dxc5 $1 dxc5 8. Be3 b6 9. e5 Ng4 (9...
Nfd7 $2 10. Bd5) 10. Qe2 Nxe3 11. Qxe3 Bb7 12. Rd1 Qc8 (12... Qc7 {If} 13. O-O
Nc6 14. Nd5 Qc8 15. e6) 13. e6 f5 14. Nd5 Bxd5 15. Bxd5 Nc6 16. c3 {As a
result of 6......c5? Black has a 'hopeless' position.} h6 $2 17. Nh4 $1 Rb8 ({
If} 17... Kh7 18. Qf3 g5 19. fxg5 hxg5 20. Qh5+) 18. Nxg6 Rf6 19. Bxc6 (19. Nh4
$142) 19... Rxg6 20. Bd5 Qa6 21. Qd3 Qxd3 22. Rxd3 b5 23. Kf2 $2 b4 24. cxb4 {
I started to play very carelessly round here.} Rxb4 25. g3 Bxb2 26. Rb3 Rd4 27.
Rxb2 Rxd5 28. Re1 Rd6 29. Re5 Rgxe6 30. Rxf5 $2 {Again to careless.} ({Correct
was...} 30. Rxc5 Rf6 31. Rc7) 30... Rc6 31. Rc2 c4 32. Rd5 Red6 33. Re5 Kf7 34.
Re4 (34. Re3 $142 Z0 35. Rec3) 34... c3 35. Ke3 Re6 36. Rxe6 Kxe6 37. Kd4 Kf5
38. h3 (38. Rxc3 {Doesn't make it}) 38... h5 39. a4 $1 {Still trying to win a5
next move threatens RxP} Rd6+ 40. Ke3 Rc6 41. Kf3 (41. a5 {is more consistent})
41... a5 42. g4+ hxg4+ 43. hxg4+ Ke6 44. Ke4 Rc4+ $1 45. Kf3 Kd5 46. Ke3 Kc5
47. g5 {Useless.} Kb4 48. Kd3 Rxf4 49. Rg2 Kb3 50. g6 Rf8 51. g7 Rd8+ {I
played very badly from move 19 onwards with almost no analysis} 0-1

