1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. f4 d6 4. Bc4 Nc6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. O-O g6 7. d3 Nd4 8. fxe5
dxe5 $2 {The obvious move but an oversight.} 9. Bxf7+ Ke7 {Neither better or
worse than 9.....KxB} (9... Kxf7) 10. Bb3 c6 11. Bg5 Qb6 12. Bxf6+ Kxf6 13.
Nxd4+ Kg5 14. Qd2+ Kh5 15. h3 Qxd4+ 16. Kh2 Be6 {I didn't see what he had to
gain by giving up the Bishop. Not that it makes any difference as he's lost
anyway.} (16... Bd7 17. g4+ Kh4 18. Rxf8 $3 Raxf8 19. Qh6#) 17. Bxe6 Be7 18.
Bg4+ {I started in Rd 3 and won by default. My time <10' his 25'} (18. Bg4+ Kh4
19. Qh6# (19. g3#)) 1-0

