1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 Qc7 7. Nf3 Nc6 8. Bd3
Bd7 (8... f5 {Would be very bad positionaly, blocking the Qs and leaving White
free to attack on the KS.}) 9. a4 cxd4 10. cxd4 Nxd4 {Rhis wins a pawn at the
cost of development and space.} 11. Bb2 ({Inferior would be...} 11. Nxd4 Qc3+)
11... Nxf3+ 12. Qxf3 Ne7 13. O-O Ng6 {Now I have the threat .....h5 ......h4}
14. Qg3 O-O {Allowing my strong reply.} 15. Ba3 Qxe5 $6 16. Bxf8 Qxg3 ({Not} 
16... Rxf8 17. Bxg6 $1) 17. hxg3 Rxf8 (17... Kxf8 $142) 18. Rfe1 {Prevents 18..
....Ne5} f5 {Not as weakening as it looks.} 19. Bb5 Bc8 ({After...} 19... Bxb5
20. axb5 {he has two Pawns en prise.}) 20. a5 {So as to be able to retreat the
Bishop to a4, but this Pawn is liable to become weak.} a6 21. Ba4 Rf7 22. f4
Rc7 23. Bb3 Kf7 24. Kf2 Nf8 {I felt rotten here (flu) and offered a draw.} 25.
Ba4 Bd7 26. Bb3 Bb5 27. Re3 Nd7 28. Ke1 Nf6 29. Ra3 Ne4 30. Kd1 Kf6 31. Ba4 $2
{A miscalculation. I was trying to force a draw quickly.} d4 $1 {The move I
had missed.} 32. Reb3 Nc3+ 33. Kd2 Bxa4 34. Rb4 Ne4+ 35. Ke1 Bb5 36. Rxd4 Rxc2
37. Kd1 Rxg2 38. g4 Rxg4 {I had flu, so that's some excuse.} 0-1

