1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. Bd3 c5 6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2 Qb6 8. Nf3
cxd4 9. cxd4 Bb4+ {[3'] M.C.O. 9th Edn calls this double-edged.} 10. Kf1 {[4']}
a6 {[13']} ({M.C.O. gives....} 10... f6 11. Nf4 fxe5 12. Nxe6 Nf6 13. Nxg7+ Kf7
14. dxe5 Ng4 15. Qe2 Kxg7 16. h3 {[Menke - Elzold Corres1953]}) 11. g3 f6 12.
Nf4 {[25']} Na5 $2 {[30'] Putting the Knight hope;essly out of play and
leaving the KS bare.} (12... fxe5 $142 13. Z0 e4 $140) 13. Kg2 fxe5 $2 {[36']}
(13... f5 $142) 14. Nxe5 Nxe5 15. dxe5 g6 {[46'] Resigns is no better.} 16. h4
{[46']} Bd7 {[58']} 17. Be3 Qd8 {[64']} 18. Qg4 {Crushing.} Qc8 (18... Qe7 19.
a3 {is just as unhappy, even...} d4 {is a waste of time.}) 19. Nxg6 {of course.
} hxg6 {[80']} 20. Bxg6+ Kd8 21. Bg5+ 1-0

