1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 g6 3. e4 {To avoid the grunfeld} Bg7 $2 (3... d6 {is necessary
}) 4. e5 Ng8 5. d4 d6 6. f4 Nh6 {The Knight is badly placed but he has nowhere
to put it.} 7. Nf3 Bg4 {An ill chosen sortie.} 8. h3 Bxf3 9. Qxf3 Nc6 (9... c6
{is safer}) 10. d5 $1 {The e-Pawn isn't loose as the g7 Bishop has to gaurd
the Knight.} Nd4 11. Qf2 dxe5 12. fxe5 c5 {The e-Pawn is immune.} 13. Bd3 Qc7 {
Since he really isn't attacking my e-Pawn this seems a waste of time.} 14. O-O
{Threatens 15.BxN} O-O ({The desperate....} 14... O-O-O {offers more chances.})
15. g4 {Threatens 16.Qh4 winning the Knight} Kh8 16. Bf4 {Black doesn't stand
a chance.} g5 $4 {Desperation but he loses a piece.} 17. Bxg5 {Threatening 18.
Qh4 and the Knight can't move.} Qxe5 $2 {making life easy for White.} (17...
Ng8 $142) 18. Bf4 Qf6 19. g5 Qb6 20. gxh6 Bxh6 {He could have spared himself
the rest.} 21. Qh4 Rg8+ 22. Kh1 f5 23. Bxh6 Qxb2 24. Ne2 Nxe2 25. Bxe2 Qxe2 26.
Qf2 Qe4+ (26... Qh5 27. Qb2+) 27. Qf3 Qxf3+ 28. Rxf3 Rg6 29. Be3 b6 30. Rxf5
Rg3 31. Bg5 Rxh3+ 32. Kg2 Rc3 33. Rc1 Ra3 34. Bxe7 Rxa2+ 35. Kh1 Re2 36. d6 Re6
37. Bf6+ Kg8 38. Rg1+ Kf8 39. Be7+ Ke8 40. Rg8+ Kd7 41. Rxa8 {0 We won the
match 5 -} 1-0

