1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 dxe4 {Hoping to transpose but it doesn't turn out too
well.} 4. Nxe4 Nf6 ({Possibly...} 4... Be7 {first was better.}) 5. Nxf6+ Qxf6 (
{I didn't have time to cosider...} 5... gxf6 {properly.}) 6. Nf3 Qd8 {A 'safe'
move again made hurriedly} 7. Bd3 Be7 8. O-O Nd7 9. c4 c6 {Now it's more like
a Caro-Kan} 10. Re1 Qc7 11. Bc2 Nf6 12. Ne5 Bd6 13. Bg5 c5 {Trying toget some
air but with more time I wouldn't have played it.} 14. Ba4+ Bd7 $4 15. Bxf6 ({
I considered things like..} 15. Bxd7+ Nxd7 16. Nxf7 {but didn't get round to
the important line.}) 15... gxf6 16. Nxd7 O-O-O {In an ordinary game I would
have resigned.} 17. Nxf6 Bxh2+ 18. Kh1 ({Safer} 18. Kf1) 18... Rxd4 19. Qh5 Bd6
({I considered...} 19... Bg3 {also}) 20. Rad1 Rxc4 ({I considered...} 20... Rf4
{but then...} 21. Ne4 Be7 22. Rd7) 21. Bd7+ Kb8 22. Qxf7 $2 {Too greedy. The
Queen remains here, out of the game, until the end. His KS needed more
protection.} Rh4+ 23. Kg1 Bg3 $1 {The only chance.} 24. fxg3 ({safer was.} 24.
Ne4) 24... Qxg3 25. Re4 {This seems to force the Rooks off leaving me nothing
but I have hidden resources.} (25. Ne4 $4 {loses his Queen}) 25... Qh2+ 26. Kf2
Rf4+ 27. Rxf4 Qxf4+ 28. Kg1 Qe3+ 29. Kh1 Qh6+ {White now picked up his Knight
and put it on h5 and was about to let go of it when he stopped, thought for 15
secs and put it back, remarked that a person giving a simmul didn't have to
move a piece he touched. & played} 30. Kg1 (30. Nh5 $4 Rf8 $1) 30... Qe3+ 31.
Kf1 Qf4+ 32. Ke2 Qe5+ 33. Kf3 (33. Kd3 c4+) 33... Qf5+ 34. Kg3 Qe5+ 35. Kh4
Qh2+ 36. Kg5 h6+ {Never say die. Sccore was 16 - 9 to L.W.B. (13W 6D 6L)}
1/2-1/2

