1. d4 d5 2. c4 e5 3. dxe5 d4 4. g3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. Bg2 Bb4+ {Doubtful.} 7.
Bd2 Bxd2+ 8. Qxd2 $1 Bxf3 $2 9. Bxf3 Nxe5 $2 10. Bxb7 Rb8 11. Bd5 c5 (11... c6
12. Qxd4) 12. b3 Nf6 13. Qf4 $1 Ng6 14. Bc6+ Ke7 (14... Nd7 15. Bxd7+ Kxd7 (
15... Qxd7 $4 16. Qxb8+)) 15. Qd2 Ne5 16. Bg2 Re8 17. O-O Kf8 18. e3 dxe3 19.
Qxe3 Qd4 $6 20. Qxd4 cxd4 21. Nd2 Red8 22. h3 Nfd7 23. f4 Nd3 24. Ne4 N3c5 25.
Rfd1 Nxe4 26. Bxe4 Nc5 27. Bd5 d3 28. Rd2 Re8 29. Kf2 a5 30. Rb1 g6 31. Kf3 Kg7
32. a3 $4 {A stupid move due to playing too hurriedly. The match (which lasted
only 3 3/4 hours!) was coming to an end and I wanted to get the game finished
quickly so I moved very quickly and with more or less no forethought. A
ridiculous state of affairs.} Nxb3 33. Rxd3 {If Rook anywhere else I still
lose the exchange.} Nd2+ 34. Rxd2 Rxb1 35. c5 Rc1 36. c6 Rd8 37. Ke4 {The game
now developed into a sort of lightning game.} Rxc6 38. Rd3 f5+ 39. Kd4 Rc1 40.
h4 (40. Ke3 Rc5) 40... Kf6 41. Ke3 h6 42. Kd4 g5 43. hxg5+ hxg5 44. fxg5+ Kxg5
45. Ke5 Re8+ 46. Kd6 Rce1 47. Bc6 R8e3 48. Rd5 Re6+ $2 49. Kd7 Re7+ 50. Kd8 Ra7
51. Rd3 Ree7 52. a4 Rg7 53. Re3 Rac7 54. Be8 Rb7 55. Kc8 Rbe7 {1 The whole
game lasted 90 mins( = 75 secs per move) I played ridiculously fast and with
no care or attention. My Opponent was nearly as bad. University won 4 -} 0-1

