1. d4 e6 2. e4 d5 3. Nd2 Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. Bd3 c5 6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2 Be7 8. O-O {
[1']} O-O {[10']} 9. Nf3 {[3']} f6 {Possibly premature.} 10. Nf4 {I saw
Black's reply but didn't think it playable.} Ndxe5 $1 11. Bxh7+ ({After} 11.
dxe5 {Black's centre wins the game. Also Black's KS is now weakened.}) 11...
Kxh7 12. dxe5 (12. Qc2+ {Also offers some attacking prospects and may in fact
be better.}) 12... Qe8 $2 {Now he is very badly placed.} ({Correct was....} 
12... fxe5 $1 13. Nxe5 {If White plays deifefrently here the Black centre is
all powerful.} Nxe5 14. Qh5+ Kg8 15. Qxe5 Qd6 $1 $19) 13. Qc2+ g6 {About best.}
14. Re1 f5 15. Nh3 {To occupy g5.} Bd7 {Black can't attempt much.} 16. Nhg5+
Kg7 (16... Bxg5 17. Bxg5 Z0 {and} 18. Bf6 {Black won't last long.}) 17. Qd2 Rh8
{[52']} 18. Qf4 {[32']} Nd8 19. g4 {Breaking open Black's defences.} Nf7 20.
gxf5 gxf5 {Opening the g-file but there is no alternative.} 21. Kh1 Nxg5 (21...
Nh6 22. Rg1 Ng4 23. Rxg4 $1 fxg4 24. Qxg4 {and Black has no good move.}) 22.
Rg1 Kf7 23. Nxg5+ Bxg5 24. Qxg5 Qd8 25. Qg7+ {A good attack after Black's
mistake on move 12. Hayes lost the match 3.5 - 4.5} 1-0

