1. c4 c5 2. g3 Nf6 3. Bg2 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. d4 cxd4 6. Nxd4 d5 7. Nc3 dxc4 8.
Qa4+ Nbd7 9. Qxc4 O-O {I now wanted to take advantage of Black's weakness on
c7.} 10. Be3 {This defends d4 and allows the Queen to move.} ({However if} 10.
Ndb5 a6 11. Nc7 Rb8 12. Be3 b5 {is OK for Black.}) ({If} 10. Ncb5 a6 11. Nc7
Rb8 {My Knight is rather stranded.}) ({If I simply} 10. O-O Nb6 11. Qd3 e5)
10... Nb6 11. Qb3 Ng4 (11... e5 12. Nf3) 12. Nc2 {Threatens 13.BxN and
prevents the Pawns being broken up.} Nxe3 13. Nxe3 {Now I control d3} Be6 14.
Qa3 Bxc3+ {Black had no reason to give up his KBishop.} 15. Qxc3 (15. bxc3 {
The c-Pawn is weak.}) 15... Rc8 16. Qa3 Nd5 17. Bxd5 (17. Rd1 Nxe3 $1) (17.
Nxd5 Bxd5 18. Rd1 Bxg2 $1 19. Rxd8 Rfxd8 $1) 17... Bxd5 {I was now in a dilema.
I had two good variations.} 18. Rd1 ({The cautious one was} 18. O-O {
Threatening 19.Rd1 & 19.QxPa}) ({The other was} 18. Rd1 Bxh1 19. Rxd8 Rfxd8 20.
f3 $1 {e.g.} Rc1+ 21. Kf2 {When Black's Bishop is stuck and I have good
chances.}) 18... e6 {Black takes no risks.} 19. O-O Qb6 20. Nxd5 {So as not to
be left with N v B.} exd5 {The Pawn is weak but defensible.} 21. Rd2 ({Not} 21.
Rxd5 $2 Rc2 {With much the better of it.}) 21... Rfd8 22. Rfd1 d4 $2 23. Qa4 {
Attacking the Pawn and defending c2.} Re8 {He offered a draw here. His d-Pawn
is doomed.} 24. Kf1 Red8 25. Rxd4 Rxd4 26. Qxd4 Qxd4 27. Rxd4 Rc1+ 28. Kg2 Rc2
{Black gets a Rook on the 7th & this ties my Rook up in return for his Pawn.}
29. Rb4 b6 30. e4 Kf8 31. a4 Ke7 ({Intending if....} 31... Ke7 32. b3 Kd6 33.
Rd4+ Ke5 34. Rd7) 32. b3 Rb2 {Now his Rook is out of play and he can't check
me on the 3rd rank. Therefore a KS advance is called for.} 33. g4 g5 34. Kg3
Kd6 35. f3 ({If now} 35. Rb5 Kc6 36. h3 a6 37. Rb4 a5) 35... h6 36. Rb5 Ke6 37.
h3 $1 (37. a5 bxa5 38. Rxa5 Rxb3 39. Rxa7 Kf6 $1 {Therefore I deceided that if
I wasted a move he might play ......f6, so that he couldn't play 39......Kf6!
in the above variation.}) 37... f6 $2 {Black falls into the trap. This loses
his h_pawn.} 38. a5 bxa5 39. Rxa5 Rxb3 40. Rxa7 1-0

