1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 c5 6. d5 O-O 7. Nf3 e6 8. Be2 exd5
9. exd5 Re8 10. O-O Ng4 11. Bd3 Ne3 12. Bxe3 Rxe3 13. Qd2 Re8 14. h3 Nd7 15. g4
$2 (15. Rae1 $142) 15... Bd4+ 16. Nxd4 cxd4 17. Nb5 $2 Re3 18. g5 $2 {Trying
to block his Queen off from the KS.} ({If now} 18. Nxd6 Rxh3 19. Z0 Qh4) (18.
Nxd4 Nc5) 18... Nc5 19. Bc2 Rg3+ 20. Kh2 d3 21. Bd1 Ne4 22. Qe1 Rxh3+ 23. Kg2
Rg3+ 24. Qxg3 (24. Kh2 Qd7 $1 25. f5 gxf5 26. Bf3 f4 {and Black wins}) 24...
Nxg3 25. Kxg3 {Now White is hopelessly placed.} f6 $1 26. gxf6 (26. Kh4 Qe7 $1)
26... Qxf6 27. Bf3 Bf5 28. b3 h5 29. Rad1 Kg7 30. Rd2 Rh8 31. Nxa7 {There's
nothing else.} g5 32. Bd1 h4+ 33. Kh2 g4 0-1

