1. Nf3 d5 2. c4 d4 3. b3 {Unusual. Not as good as .......} (3. e3) 3... c5 4.
Bb2 Nc6 5. e3 e5 6. exd4 cxd4 (6... exd4 {is also good.}) 7. g3 $2 (7. d3 {
should be played first.}) 7... Bg4 {Stronger I think than 7......e4} (7... e4)
8. h3 {Forced.} ({If} 8. Be2 d3) 8... Bh5 9. g4 Bg6 10. d3 Bb4+ 11. Nbd2 e4 {
Not giving White time to rearrange his pieces.} 12. a3 $2 {A mistake in view
of Black's next move.} ({Correct was} 12. dxe4 Nf6 13. Bg2) 12... Qe7 $1 13.
axb4 ({Somewhat better chances were offered by} 13. dxe4 Bc3 $1 14. Rb1) 13...
exf3+ 14. Ne4 Bxe4 {Clearer than 14......QxP+} (14... Qxb4+) 15. dxe4 Qxe4+ 16.
Kd2 Qf4+ 17. Kc2 (17. Ke1 O-O-O 18. Z0 Re8+) 17... Nxb4+ 18. Kb1 Qe4+ 19. Kc1
Ne7 20. Ba3 Nec6 21. Bxb4 Nxb4 22. Qd2 a5 $1 23. Kb2 ({and not} 23. Qxb4 $2
axb4 24. Rxa8+ Ke7 $1 25. Rxh8 Qe1+ 26. Kb2 Qc3+ 27. Ka2 Qc2+ 28. Ka1 Qc1+ 29.
Ka2 Qa3+ 30. Kb1 Qxb3+ 31. Kc1 Qc3+ 32. Kd1 b3 $1 33. Bd3 {Forced.} Qxd3+ 34.
Ke1 (34. Kc1 Qc2#) 34... Qe2#) 23... O-O 24. Rd1 (24. Re1 Qg6 {the d-Pawn is
immune.} 25. Re8) 24... Rfe8 25. Bd3 $2 {There was no good move but this makes
it easier for Black.} Qxd3 26. Qxd3 Nxd3+ 27. Rxd3 Re2+ 28. Ka3 Rxf2 29. Rxd4
g6 30. Rd3 Re8 31. Rg1 Ree2 32. Ka4 {Forced.} Re5 33. b4 axb4 ({I considered} 
33... Ra2+ 34. Kb3 f2) 34. Rg3 Ra2+ 35. Kxb4 f2 36. Rgf3 Re1 37. Rd8+ Kg7 38.
Rd7 Rb1+ ({Now} 38... f1=Q {would simply lose two Pawns, but Black has other
reources.}) 39. Kc5 Ra5+ 40. Kd6 Rd1+ 41. Kc7 (41. Ke7 f1=Q) 41... Rc5+ 42. Kb6
Rxd7 43. Kxc5 Rd2 44. Kb6 Rb2+ 45. Kc7 b5 {There may be a quicker way
somewhere.} 46. cxb5 (46. c5 b4 {I win quickly}) 46... Rxb5 47. Rxf2 Rb3 48.
Rh2 Rd3 {I retuen for a Pawn I have tied up his Rook and cut off his King.} 49.
Kc6 h6 50. Kc5 g5 51. Kc4 Rd1 52. Rg2 (52. h4 Rg1) 52... Kg6 53. Rg3 f6 54. Kc3
h5 55. Rf3 {An oversight which shortens the game. White is lost after anything
else e.g} (55. Rg2 hxg4 56. hxg4 f5 {and with his King cut off he can't do
anything to stop the passer.}) 55... hxg4 56. Rg3 (56. hxg4 Rg1) 56... gxh3 57.
Rxh3 g4 58. Rg3 Kg5 59. Rg2 f5 60. Re2 g3 61. Re3 f4 62. Re5+ Kg4 0-1

