{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hours.} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. c4 {I didn't want to
play the O'Kelly system against this so I transposed to a Scheveningen.} e6 4.
Nc3 Nc6 5. Be2 d6 6. d4 cxd4 7. Nxd4 Be7 8. O-O Nf6 9. Be3 Bd7 10. f4 Qc7 {
I didn't want to castle into a Pawn storm so waited to see what White would
play.} 11. Nc2 Na5 {Taking advantage of the weak c-Pawn.} 12. Na3 (12. b3 b5 $1
) 12... b6 {I make a retreat for the Knigt.} (12... Bc6 $2 13. b4) 13. b4 {
Very strong. White threatens to invade b5.} Nb7 {I spent a long time on this
move and got rather behind.} (13... Nc6 14. b5) (13... Nxc4 $6 14. Nxc4 $1 b5
15. Nb6 Qxc3 16. Bd4 $1 {wins}) 14. Bf3 {[37']} ({The move I didn't want him
to play was} 14. Na4 {e.g.} Bxa4 15. Qxa4+ Qd7 16. Qxd7+ Nxd7 {and White
stands well.}) 14... O-O {[52']} 15. Qb3 Rab8 16. Rac1 Nd8 17. Rfd1 {I was now
limited in choice here.} ({I thought he might now try...} 17. b5 a5 18. Na4)
17... Nc6 18. b5 {After completing his development White presses on. My
position now becomes rather precarious.} Na5 19. Qb4 Bc8 $1 {[70]} 20. Qa4 ({
Not} 20. bxa6 $2 d5 {and White is in difficulties.}) 20... Bd7 {Hoping to gain
time by repeating moves.} 21. Ne2 Rfc8 22. Qb4 Kf8 23. Qb2 {[80']} Qa7 {[85']}
24. e5 dxe5 25. fxe5 Ne8 26. bxa6 {Hoping to benefit form the weak Bishop on
d7.} Ba4 27. Nb5 $6 {White considers his position strong enough to "mix it".}
Qxa6 28. Nd6 {Very risky. The position is very complicated. I didn't have time
to analyse all the possible moves here.} Rd8 {Also to be considered were.} (
28... Bxd1) (28... Bxd6) (28... Nxd6) (28... Rc7) 29. Rd4 {To defend the
c-Pawn but now I win the exchange.} Nxd6 30. exd6 Bf6 31. Qb4 Bxd4 32. Nxd4 {
[107'] White now has some chances as we were short of time.} ({Not} 32. d7+ Bc5
) 32... Bd7 {[107']} 33. Bg5 Rdc8 34. Nb5 Rxc4 $1 35. Rxc4 Nxc4 36. a4 {
As good as anything.} Rc8 37. Nc7 Qxa4 38. Qxa4 Bxa4 39. Bb7 Nxd6 40. Bxc8 Nxc8
{The last half dozen moves we played in a mad time scramble.} 41. Bd2 Ke7 42.
Kf2 Kd7 43. Na6 Nd6 44. Kf3 Bc6+ {He loses another Pawn.} 0-1

