{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hours} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 Nc6 3. Nc3 e5 $6 {Doesn't turn
out too well.} 4. cxd5 Nxd4 5. e3 Nf5 6. Nf3 Bd6 7. e4 Nh4 $6 {Overlooking
White's reply.} 8. Bb5+ Kf8 {[21']} (8... Bd7 9. Bxd7+ Kxd7 10. Ng5) 9. Be3 {
[20']} Bg4 {[46']} (9... Nxg2+ {Merely opens the g-file and doesn't help his
development.}) 10. Rg1 {[21'] Envisaging the opening of the g-file.} Qf6 {[58']
} 11. Be2 {[24']} Ne7 12. Bg5 {[30'] This results in a clear advantage for me.}
({I considered} 12. Nxe5 {but Black regains the Pawn by.....} Bxe5 13. Bxg4
Bxc3+) 12... Nxf3+ 13. Bxf3 {......} ({.......better than} 13. gxf3) 13... Qxg5
{[64']} ({Not} 13... Bxf3 $2 14. gxf3 Qg6 15. Bxe7+) 14. Bxg4 {[31']} Ng6 {
[77']} 15. g3 {[32']} h6 {[82']} 16. Rc1 {[33']} a6 {[85'] To prevent 17.Nb5}
17. h4 {[36']} Qd8 18. h5 Ne7 19. Rf1 {[35']} Nc8 20. Rc2 {So as to play... f4
- Qh5+ - R2f2} Kg8 {[90']} 21. f4 Kh7 {[95']} ({If} 21... exf4 22. Qf3) 22. Qf3
{[46']} Rf8 23. fxe5 {[47']} Bb4 {[98']} 24. Rff2 {[54']} Qe8 25. Qf4 Nb6 26.
b3 Rd8 27. Bf5+ {[63']} Kg8 ({If} 27... g6 28. hxg6+ fxg6 29. Rh2 $1) 28. g4
Qe7 29. Rg2 {So as to play g5. I didn't think Black's checks got him anywhere.}
Qh4+ 30. Kd2 $6 {Missing Black's reply.......} ({......but I didn't know I
could do any better by} 30. Ke2 Qh3 31. Qg3 Qh1) 30... Nxd5 $1 {Played in
desperation but it saves him half a point.} 31. exd5 Rxd5+ {[113']} 32. Ke2 {
[76']} Bxc3 33. Rxc3 Qh1 {Securing the draw.} 34. Bh7+ ({If now} 34. Qf3 Rd1 {
draws.}) 34... Kh8 ({Despite bad time-trouble Black avoids....} 34... Kxh7 $2
35. Qe4+) 35. Be4 {There's nothing better.} Qd1+ 36. Kf2 Rd2+ 37. Kg3 Qe1+ 38.
Kh3 Rxg2 39. Kxg2 ({Not} 39. Rc1 $2 Rf2 {wins}) 39... Qxc3 40. Qf5 Qd2+ ({Not} 
40... Qb2+ $4 41. Bc2 $18) 41. Kh3 {A fortunate 'swindle' for Black.} 1/2-1/2

