1. e4 g6 2. Nf3 Bg7 3. d4 d6 4. Bc4 Nd7 5. Bf4 Ngf6 6. Nc3 O-O 7. Qd2 a6 8. a4
Rb8 9. Bh6 c5 10. Bxg7 Kxg7 11. h4 Qc7 12. d5 h5 13. O-O Ng4 14. Ng5 e6 $5 {
Having drawn against Donovan I had to win at all costs in this game so I had
to take risks.} 15. g3 ({If} 15. dxe6 d5) 15... Nde5 16. Be2 ({Not} 16. Bb3 $4
f6) 16... f6 $6 {Trying to complicate things.} 17. Nxe6+ Bxe6 18. dxe6 Qe7 19.
f4 Nc6 20. Bxg4 hxg4 21. f5 Nd4 22. Qf4 gxf5 23. exf5 Rg8 24. Qxg4+ Kf8 25. Qf4
Rd8 26. Nd5 Ne2+ 27. Kh2 Nxf4 28. Nxe7 Kxe7 29. Rxf4 d5 30. c3 Kd6 31. Re1 Ke7
32. g4 d4 33. cxd4 cxd4 34. Rd1 d3 35. Kg3 d2 36. Rf3 Rd4 37. Rf4 Rd3+ 38. Kf2
Rgd8 39. Ke2 Rh3 40. h5 Rg3 41. Rf2 Rxg4 42. Rxd2 Rxd2+ 43. Kxd2 Rh4 44. Kc3
Rxh5 45. Rf4 Rh3+ 46. Kb4 b5 $2 47. axb5 axb5 48. Rd4 Rh8 49. Rd7+ Ke8 50. Kxb5
Rh2 51. b4 Re2 52. Rd5 Ke7 53. Kc6 Rc2+ 54. Kb7 Re2 55. b5 Re5 $1 56. Rxe5 $2
fxe5 57. Kc6 e4 58. b6 e3 59. b7 e2 60. b8=Q e1=Q 61. Qd6+ Kf6 62. e7+ Kg5 63.
Qg6+ Kf4 64. e8=Q Qc3+ 65. Kd6 Qd4+ 66. Ke7 Qe5+ 67. Kf7 Qd5+ 68. Kg7 Qd4+ 69.
Kh7 Qa7+ 70. Qef7 Qa8 71. Qg4+ $4 Ke3 $4 {We both thought the Pawn was going
the other way.} 72. Qb3+ Kf2 73. Qd4+ {E.H.Donovan & J.S.Bennett came =1st
with 4/5 I came =3rd with P.H.Collins} 1-0

