1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 g5 4. Bc4 d6 5. h4 g4 6. Ng5 Nh6 7. d4 f6 8. Bxf4 $6
{Much better in a speed game than.....} (8. Ne6) 8... fxg5 9. hxg5 Nf7 10. g6
Nh6 $6 ({Naturally not.....} 10... hxg6 11. Bxf7+) ({However} 10... Ng5 11. Qd2
Be7 12. g7) 11. Bxh6 Bxh6 12. Rxh6 Qf6 13. Bf7+ Kf8 14. Qd2 hxg6 15. Bxg6 Rxh6
16. Qxh6+ Qg7 17. Qg5 Qe7 18. Qxe7+ Kxe7 19. Nc3 Kf6 $4 20. Nd5+ Kxg6 21. Nxc7
Nc6 22. Nxa8 Nxd4 23. O-O-O Ne2+ 24. Kb1 Nf4 25. Rxd6+ Kf7 26. g3 Ne2 27. Rd3
Be6 28. b3 Kf6 29. Nc7 Ke5 30. Nxe6 Kxe6 31. Re3 Nd4 32. c3 Nf3 33. Kc2 Ke5 34.
Kd3 a6 35. Rxf3 1-0

