{Time control 40 moves per hour} 1. d4 Nf6 2. e3 b6 3. f4 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. Bd3
Ba6 {As recommended to me a couple of days before by P.J.Adams!} 6. c4 O-O 7.
O-O c5 8. d5 d6 9. h3 e6 10. e4 Qd7 ({Better} 10... Nbd7 11. Z0 {then...} e5)
11. Nc3 Ne8 {Hoping to get 12......f5 in.} 12. f5 e5 13. Be3 {[25']} Nc7 {[9']}
14. a4 Qe7 15. Qd2 Nd7 16. g4 {[30']} f6 {[13'] Hoping to get 17......g5 in.}
17. fxg6 {[34']} hxg6 {[13']} 18. Nh4 Kh7 $1 19. Nf3 {[39']} Bc8 {[16']} 20.
Kh2 Rf7 21. g5 Kg8 22. gxf6 Bxf6 23. Rg1 Nf8 24. Rg3 $2 Bh4 25. Nxh4 Qxh4 26.
Bg5 Qh5 27. Be2 {[47']} Qh7 {[22']} 28. Bg4 a6 29. Nd1 Ne8 30. Nf2 Nf6 $2 {
Up to here my defensive play had been very good.} 31. Be6 $1 Bxe6 32. dxe6 Nxe6
33. Qxd6 Nxg5 34. Rxg5 Qh4 35. Rxg6+ Kh7 36. Rg2 Qf4+ 37. Kh1 Qf3 38. Qxe5 Nh5
39. Qg5 $1 Nf4 ({I didn't reckon much on my chances after...} 39... Rg7 40.
Qf5+ Qxf5 {etc.}) 40. Qh4+ Nh5 41. Ng4 Kh8 42. Qxh5+ Rh7 43. Qe5+ Rg7 44. Qg3
Qxe4 45. Qh4+ Kg8 46. Nf6+ 1-0

