1. d4 d5 2. e3 Nd7 3. f4 f5 $2 4. Bd3 e6 5. Nf3 Ngf6 6. c4 c6 7. Ng5 Bb4+ 8.
Bd2 Qe7 {[10']} 9. O-O {[10']} Bxd2 10. Nxd2 Ne4 $2 11. Bxe4 dxe4 12. c5 Nf6
13. Nc4 O-O {[24']} 14. b4 {[24']} h6 {[32']} 15. Nh3 b6 16. Ne5 $2 Qd8 17. Nc4
Ba6 18. Nd6 Qd7 19. Re1 Ne8 20. Nxe8 Rfxe8 21. g4 Bc4 22. g5 Qf7 23. Kh1 h5 24.
Ng1 {[56']} g6 25. Ne2 b5 26. Nc1 $2 {I thought I could answer 26......a5 with
27.a4 but I didn't have time to consider it properly.} a5 27. bxa5 ({If...} 27.
a4 axb4 28. a5 Ra6 {etc.}) 27... Rxa5 28. Rg1 {I was very short of time around
here.} Rea8 29. Rg2 Ra3 30. Qe1 R8a5 31. Rb2 Qa7 32. Qd2 R5a4 {Adjudicated.
Rather a rush.} 0-1

