1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. e5 $2 {White started off playing
too quickly.} Qa5+ 6. Nc3 Qxe5+ 7. Be3 {[1']} Nc6 {Threatening to simplify
favourably with 8......NxN 9.QxN QxQ} 8. Be2 e6 9. Nxc6 bxc6 10. O-O Bc5 {
White threatened 11.Na4 to b6} 11. Qd2 (11. Bxc5 Qxc5 12. Na4 Qa5) 11... Bxe3
12. fxe3 d5 13. Rf3 a5 14. Raf1 Ba6 15. Bxa6 Rxa6 16. Qd3 Ra7 17. b3 Ng4 {
Intending to gain a tempo to play ......f5, thus blocking his attack along the
f-fileand prevent e4 for good.} 18. Rg3 $2 (18. Rh3 $142) 18... h5 19. Ne2 $2 {
[20'] Overlooking the threat.} Nxh2 $1 {[40'] White resigned havinh used [40']
Hayes won the match 6.5 - 1.5} 0-1

