1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e3 c5 5. Nf3 b6 6. Bd3 Bb7 7. O-O O-O 8. a3
Bxc3 9. bxc3 Ne4 10. Ne1 {The Knight must be displaced.} f5 11. f3 Nd6 {
Doubtful. Black decides to put presuure on c4 but this gives me control of the
centre.} 12. a4 Ba6 13. Qe2 Nc6 14. Ba3 {Or else he wins a Pawn with 14......
Na4} Nb7 15. Nc2 Nca5 16. e4 {White suddenly gets a stranglehold in the centre.
} f4 {Both to prevent Ne3 & f4 (after e5)} 17. e5 Rc8 18. Qe4 {Taking
advantages of his KS weaknesses and controlling the centre.} g6 19. d5 exd5 20.
cxd5 c4 $1 {His best chance.} 21. Be2 Nc5 22. Bxc5 Rxc5 23. Nb4 Bb7 24. Rfd1 {
I just made the time control} Qe8 {Threat 25......Rf5} 25. g3 $1 {The only way
to support the e-Pawn.} ({Not} 25. g4 g5) 25... fxg3 26. hxg3 Rf5 27. f4 d6 $2
{Loses a lost game.} 28. Bg4 Rf8 29. Be6+ Kg7 30. exd6 Bc8 31. Ra2 Rf6 32. Re2
Nb7 33. Bxc8 Qxe4 34. Rxe4 Rxc8 35. Re7+ Rf7 {hayes won 6.5 - 1.5} ({Time was
called but Black resigned as I win by...} 35... Rf7 36. d7 Rd8 {or c7} 37.
Rxf7+ Kxf7 38. Nc6 {he can't play} Rxd7 {because of} 39. Ne5+) 1-0

