{Time control 40 moves in 90 minutes} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 d6 3. Nc3 Nbd7 4. e4 e5
5. d5 c6 6. Be2 cxd5 7. cxd5 Nc5 8. a3 {A bit artificial, the idea is to
prevent .....Qa5 by threatening b4.} Bd7 9. Bg5 Be7 10. Bxf6 (10. Qb1 {Would
be good but for...} Nb3) 10... Bxf6 11. b4 Na6 12. Nf3 O-O 13. O-O Be7 {
Threat 14......f5} 14. Nd2 Rc8 15. Rc1 Nc7 16. Qb3 Bg5 17. Rc2 a6 18. Nc4 Nb5 {
I was already short of time and my next few moves were hurried.} 19. Nxb5 Bxb5
20. a4 $2 Bxc4 21. Bxc4 Qb6 22. b5 a5 23. Rd1 {To cover d4.} Rc7 24. Be2 Rfc8
25. Rxc7 {[72']} Rxc7 {[54']} 26. g3 {With 15 moves to make in 18 minutes I
was ata serious disadvantage.} Rc5 27. Kg2 Qc7 28. b6 $6 Qc8 29. h3 g6 30. h4
Bd8 31. Rd2 Kg7 32. Rb2 Rc3 33. Qb5 Qc5 34. Kh3 $2 {With only a few seconds
remaining I tried to find a 'safe' move, but this loses two Pawns.} Qxf2 35.
Bd3 Qe3 36. Rb3 {Played with the flag poised to fall.} Rxb3 37. Qxb3 Bxb6 38.
Qd1 {I could resign.} Bc5 39. h5 Bb4 40. Bc2 Be1 41. Qg4 Qf2 42. Bd1 Qf1+ 43.
Kh2 Bf2 44. Qf3 f5 45. hxg6 hxg6 46. exf5 gxf5 47. Be2 Bg1+ 48. Kh1 Qxf3+ 49.
Bxf3 Bd4 50. g4 {17.05/0 I spoilt the game by getting short of time & then
gave it away in the time-scramble. Surrey won the championship part of the
match 11.5 - 8.5 Surrey won the Amboyna Part of the match 32.5 -} 0-1

