1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. g3 b6 5. Bg2 Bb7 6. Nf3 Nbd7 7. O-O c6 {
Rather odd.} 8. Qc2 Bd6 9. Rd1 {Preventing 9......e5.} Rc8 10. Bg5 Qc7 11. a3
h6 12. Bxf6 Nxf6 13. Nd2 e5 14. dxe5 Bxe5 15. Nf3 O-O ({If} 15... Bd6 16. Nd4
Z0 17. Nf5) 16. Bh3 Rcd8 17. Nxe5 Qxe5 18. cxd5 Nxd5 {Hoping to escape without
an isolated Pawn.} 19. Nxd5 cxd5 20. Bg2 ({If} 20. Rac1 {intending 21.Qc7 then.
..} d4 21. Z0 Qe4 ({or} 21... Qd5)) 20... Rd7 {[55']} 21. e3 {[33']} Rfd8 22.
Rd4 Kf8 23. Rad1 Qe6 24. Qb3 (24. Qh7 {Doesn't do much.}) (24. Qd2 {is OK
though.}) 24... Qf5 25. Qd3 {This may be a mistake.} Qxd3 {[67']} 26. R1xd3 {
[45']} Ke8 27. Rd2 a6 28. Bh3 Re7 {Adjourned.} ({Not} 28... Rc7 $2 29. e4) {
Play resumed 24/11/64} 29. Bg2 {The sealed move.} Red7 30. Kf1 Ke7 31. Ke2 $2
Rd6 32. Rc2 {Had I made this move earlier I would be threatening Bh3} Rc6 33.
Rcd2 Rcd6 34. Rg4 Bc8 35. Rb4 ({Not} 35. Rxg7 Kf6) 35... Be6 36. Ra4 Bd7 37.
Rad4 Be6 38. R2d3 f6 {Black gets restless and starts to push Pawns. Just what
I wanted.} 39. Rc3 R8d7 40. Kd2 Kd8 41. Bf1 a5 42. Bg2 Ke7 43. Bf1 Ra7 44. Bb5
Bd7 {[115']} 45. Bxd7 {[110']} Raxd7 46. Kd3 g6 47. g4 f5 $2 {Very risky.
Better to sit still.} 48. gxf5 gxf5 49. Rh4 Rg6 50. Kd4 Kf6 51. Rh5 ({If} 51.
Rc6+ Kg7 {Looks good for White.} ({Not} 51... Kg5 $4 52. f4+ {etc.})) 51... Rd6
52. Rc8 Rg4+ 53. Kd3 Kg6 54. Rh3 Kg7 55. Rg3 h5 56. Rc7+ Kg6 57. Rc8 Kg7 58. b4
{I started to play too quickly here as the prospect of adjourning again was
loomomg ahead.} axb4 {[14']} 59. axb4 {[133']} h4 60. Rxg4+ fxg4 61. Rc1 Kf6
62. b5 Ke5 {2 Adjourned. I agreed a draw as I hadn't time to play at a later
date. I would have sealed: 63.Rc8 or 63.Rg1 Uni won the match 3 -} 1/2-1/2

