1. e4 c5 2. c3 d5 3. exd5 Qxd5 4. d4 {This seems wrong.} Nc6 5. dxc5 Qxc5 6.
Be3 Qa5 7. Nf3 Nf6 8. Bc4 Bg4 $4 {A ridiculous blunder. Not my day.} 9. Qb3
O-O-O {Making the best of a bad job.} 10. Bxf7 Qf5 $2 (10... Bxf3 $142) 11. h3
Na5 12. hxg4 $1 {I had missed this. The Knight gets trapped.} Nxb3 13. gxf5
Nxa1 14. Be6+ {Preventing my e-Pawn from moving.} Kb8 15. Na3 {Wins the Rook}
Nd5 {What a mess} 16. Ke2 Nxe3 17. fxe3 h5 18. Ne5 Re8 19. Nf7 Rh7 20. Bd7 {
Just one of those days. My worst loss for a long time. Uni lost 3.5 - 4.5} 1-0

