1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Qb3 c5 5. dxc5 Bxc5 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. Bg5 Qa5 {
I didn't know the opening and this is so rash!} 8. Bxf6 gxf6 9. g3 Nd4 10. Nxd4
Bxd4 11. Rc1 Qf5 12. e3 Qf3 13. Rg1 Bb6 ({Not} 13... Bxe3 14. fxe3 Qxe3+ 15.
Ne2 {defending both Rooks.}) (13... Be5 {may have been better.}) 14. Bg2 Qh5
15. Ne4 Qxh2 {This looked good but I get badly behind in development} (15...
Qh6 {may have been better.}) 16. Nxf6+ Ke7 17. Kf1 Qh6 18. Ne4 {[23'] Now I
was in a mess. 19.c5 is threatened & how do I develop my pieces.} Rd8 {[57']
Trying to get another piece in play.} 19. Qb4+ d6 20. Nxd6 $1 Rxd6 21. c5 Rd7
22. cxb6+ Ke8 23. bxa7 e5 {[69']} 24. Rh1 Qa6+ 25. Kg1 f5 26. Qb3 Rf7 27. Bd5 (
27. Rxh7 $18) 27... Rg7 28. Qc3 Qd6 29. Qxc8+ Rxc8 30. Rxc8+ Ke7 31. a8=Q Qxd5
32. Rc7+ Kf6 33. Qf8+ Ke6 34. Rh6+ {Rather rash opening play by Black.} 1-0

