1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 g6 4. Nc3 Bg7 5. e4 d6 6. f4 O-O 7. Nf3 e6 8. Be2 exd5
9. exd5 Re8 ({In Thorbergsson Tal Reykjavik 1964, Tal played.......} 9... b5 $1
10. Nxb5 Ne4 11. O-O a6 12. Na3 Ra7 $1 13. Bd3 Re7) 10. O-O Bf5 11. Bd3 (11.
Nh4 Ne4 12. Nxf5 {etc.}) 11... Bxd3 12. Qxd3 Nbd7 13. Bd2 a6 {[9']} 14. a4 {
[8']} Qc7 15. h3 {[19']} Re7 16. g4 Rae8 17. Rfe1 Rxe1+ 18. Rxe1 Rxe1+ 19. Bxe1
Qd8 20. Qe2 Qe8 21. Qxe8+ Nxe8 22. b3 {I thought I had a slight adbvantage
here, but it was rather illusionary} Ndf6 23. Kg2 Nc7 24. Kg3 Kf8 {[35']} 25.
Ng5 {[43']} Ke7 26. Nge4 Nce8 27. Kf3 Kd7 28. Nxf6+ Nxf6 29. Ne4 ({Not} 29. Bh4
$2 Nxg4) 29... Nxe4 30. Kxe4 Bf6 {or else I play g5 & f5 Hayes won the match.}
1/2-1/2

