{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hours} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 d6 3. Nc3 Nbd7 4. e4 e5 5.
Nge2 g6 6. g3 Bg7 7. Bg2 O-O 8. O-O ({In view of the continuation} 8. h3 {
might have been more useful here.}) 8... Re8 9. Be3 ({If} 9. h3 {Black gets a
good game with..} exd4 10. Nxd4 Nc5 {and I can't play} 11. Qc2 {because of...}
Nfxe4) 9... Ng4 10. Bc1 (10. Rc1 exd4 11. Nxd4 Nc5 {The position looks good
for Black. My d4-Knight is weak so I want to exchange it for one of Black's
Knights. Therefore......} 12. Nb3 $1 Ne5) 10... exd4 11. Nxd4 Nc5 {The
position looks good for Black. My d4-Knight is weak so I want to exchange it
for one of Black's Knights. Therefore......} 12. Nb3 $1 Ne5 ({Black can't win
the e-Pawn. e.g.} 12... Bxc3 13. bxc3 Nxe4 14. Bxe4 Rxe4 15. f3 Ne3 16. Qd3)
13. Nxc5 dxc5 14. Qb3 Nc6 ({Not for example...} 14... Qd3 $2 15. Nd5 $1) 15.
Qb5 Bf8 16. Qa4 {or my Queen gets in a mess.} Nd4 17. Bf4 {Threatening 18.Bxc7!
} (17. Rd1 {would have left my Queen out on a limb.}) 17... c6 18. Qd1 Be6 ({
Possibly better was} 18... Ne6 {as I can't play} 19. Qc1 Nxf4 20. Qxf4 {as} Qd4
{wins a Pawn}) 19. b3 {[79']} Bg7 {[86']} 20. Rc1 {[85']} ({I wanted to move
the Queen to e3, but if say} 20. Qe1 {Black has a good reply in....} Bh3) 20...
Qe7 21. Kh1 {We were both getting very short of time here.} Rad8 22. Qe1 h5 23.
Be3 $2 ({Correct was} 23. h4) 23... h4 24. h3 {I saw the following variation
now.} ({I thought I could answer 23......h4 by} 24. f4 {but Black plays} h3 $1
25. Bf3 Nxf3 26. Rxf3 Bg4 27. Rf2 Bxc3 28. Rxc3 Qxe4+) 24... hxg3 25. fxg3 Be5
{The play from now till move 40 was very rushed.} 26. Bf4 Qc7 27. Qe3 Bxf4 28.
gxf4 f5 {[115']} 29. e5 {[103']} Qe7 30. Rg1 Kf7 31. Qg3 Rg8 32. Bf1 Rg7 33.
Qe3 Rdg8 34. Ne2 Rd8 35. Rg5 Ke8 36. Ng3 Qf8 37. Rd1 Bf7 38. Ne2 {In the time
scramble I hadn't realised Black was threatening ......Ne6, but luckily this
move gives the Rook a retreat} Ne6 39. Rxd8+ Nxd8 40. Rg3 Ne6 41. Qd2 {[Sealed
move]} Qe7 42. Bg2 Qc7 43. Rd3 Bg8 44. Rd6 Rd7 {P.Cohen came =12th with 4.5
pts.} 1/2-1/2

