{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hours.} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e3 O-O 5.
Bd3 c5 6. Nf3 d5 7. O-O Nc6 8. a3 cxd4 9. axb4 (9. Nxd4 {isn't quite good
enough}) (9. exd4 {is playable}) 9... dxc3 10. bxc3 dxc4 11. Bxc4 Qc7 12. Qe2
b6 13. Bb2 Bb7 14. Bb3 a5 15. Rac1 Rfd8 16. b5 Ne5 17. Nd4 ({Not as good is} 
17. Nxe5 Qxe5 18. c4 Qg5) 17... Nfg4 $4 {Loses a piece} ({Also bad was} 17...
Neg4 18. g3 {White threatens 19.Nxe6!}) 18. f4 h5 19. h3 (19. fxe5 $2 Qxe5 {
Threatens mate and the e-Pawn.}) 19... Nf6 20. fxe5 Qxe5 21. Bc2 Rac8 22. c4
Qg3 23. Qf2 Qd6 24. Nf3 {The c-pawn is protected of course} Ne4 {Loses
outright but he no longer had any hope.} 25. Bxe4 Bxe4 26. Ng5 Bg6 27. Nxf7 Qb4
28. Nxd8 Rxd8 29. Bxg7 Rd2 30. Qf8+ Qxf8 31. Bxf8 Be4 32. Rf4 Rxg2+ 33. Kf1 Rh2
34. Ba3 {A.Crombleholme came = 6th with 5.5pts} 1-0

