{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hours} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 c5 4. c3 {I didnit
know this variation.} ({More ususal is} 4. exd5) 4... Nc6 5. exd5 Qxd5 (5...
exd5 {is a good altrenative}) 6. Qf3 Qxf3 7. Ngxf3 cxd4 {Black decides to give
me an isolated d-Pawn but it's easily defensable.} 8. Nxd4 Nxd4 9. cxd4 Bd7 10.
Ne4 Bb4+ 11. Bd2 Bxd2+ 12. Kxd2 Ke7 13. Bd3 Bc6 14. f3 Nh6 {Hoping to play ....
..f5 but the Knight is badly placed here.} 15. Ng3 Rhd8 16. Ke3 f5 {
Threatening 17......f4+ which gives Black good chances.} 17. Ne2 g6 ({I
expected} 17... g5 {and if} 18. g3) 18. Rhd1 Ng8 (18... g5 {can be answered by}
19. g3 {and if} g4 20. f4) 19. Bc4 Nf6 20. Nf4 Bd5 21. Rac1 {R.Hanscombe came
= 6th with 5.5pts.} 1/2-1/2

