1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3 Ba5 6. Nf3 cxd4 7. Qxd4 (7. Nxd4
Qc7 {Wins a pawn}) 7... Nc6 8. Bb5 Nge7 9. O-O Qc7 10. Re1 Bd7 11. Qg4 Nf5 12.
b4 Bb6 13. Bb2 Nce7 {I thought a very long time about this.} (13... O-O-O {
is very risky}) (13... h5 {is OK}) ({If} 13... d4 14. Bxc6 Qxc6 (14... Bxc6 15.
Nd5) 15. b5) ({If} 13... Ncd4 14. Bxd7+ Kxd7 15. Ng5) 14. Bd3 a6 15. a4 h6 16.
Bxf5 Nxf5 17. Nxd5 {Comes out level but I was short of time and this gave him
attacking chances.} exd5 18. e6 Bxe6 ({I didn't have time to consider} 18...
fxe6) 19. Qxf5 O-O 20. Qd3 Qc4 21. Qd2 Rac8 22. Bd4 Bc7 {It was now a rush to
move 30.} 23. c3 Qc6 24. Ne5 Bxe5 25. Rxe5 f6 26. Re3 Rce8 27. Rg3 {Threat 28.
Qxh6} Kh8 28. Rg6 Bg8 29. h3 Bh7 30. Rg3 Re4 {Adjourned.} 31. Rd1 {The sealed
move. Play resumed 23/2/65} Qxa4 32. Kh2 Qc6 33. f3 Re6 34. Rg4 Rf7 35. Bf2 Rd7
36. c4 ({If} 36. Rd4 Bg8) 36... Bg8 $6 {Makes life interesting.} 37. cxd5 Qb5
38. Bc5 (38. dxe6 {seems a dead draw.}) 38... Re2 39. Qf4 {[111']} Bxd5 {[115']
} ({If} 39... Rxd5 40. Rxd5 Bxd5 41. Bf8) ({I considered} 39... b6) 40. Qb8+
Kh7 {Threat 41......RxP+} 41. Qg3 {[123']} Be6 {[124'] We were both getting
very short of time.} 42. Rxd7 Qxd7 43. Rd4 Qf7 44. Rd8 Bd5 45. Qb8 Qh5 $1 46.
Rh8+ Kg6 {Threat 47......RxP+} 47. Qg3+ Qg5 {Now with 90 seconds for 7 moves
White blunders.} 48. Rg8 $4 Bxg8 {2 Uni won the match 3 -} 0-1

