1. e4 e6 2. Nf3 c5 3. Nc3 a6 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4 Qc7 6. g3 Nf6 7. Bg2 Bb4 8. O-O
{Offering a Pawn.} O-O ({The Pawn isn't worth it...} 8... Bxc3 9. bxc3 Qxc3 ({
Maybe} 9... Nc6 {was OK.}) 10. Bf4 Z0 {Threatens} 11. Bd6 Z0 {and} 12. e5) 9.
Bg5 Be7 $6 (9... Bxc3 {Was playable but I decided to revert to the
Scheveningen a tempo down. Probably a mistake.}) 10. Qe2 d6 11. Rad1 Nc6 12.
Kh1 h6 13. Be3 Bd7 14. f4 Nxd4 15. Bxd4 Rac8 $2 (15... Rad8 $142) 16. e5 Ne8 ({
If} 16... dxe5 17. Bxe5 Qb6 18. Bxf6 Bxf6 (18... gxf6 19. Rxd7) 19. Rxd7) 17.
f5 $1 dxe5 ({If} 17... exf5 18. Nd5 Qd8 19. Bb6 Nc7 20. Nxc7 Rxc7 21. exd6) 18.
Bxe5 Bd6 {Forced even though it loses Bishop & Knight for Rook} ({If} 18... Nd6
19. Qd3) ({or} 18... Qd8 19. Qd3) 19. Rxd6 Nxd6 20. Rd1 Rfe8 21. Bxd6 Qb6 22.
f6 {Probably best.} Bc6 23. Be5 g6 24. Ne4 Rcd8 25. Nd6 ({Not} 25. Rxd8 Rxd8
26. Nd6 $2 Rxd6 $1) 25... Bxg2+ 26. Kxg2 ({Had he played} 26. Qxg2 {I could
have played} Rd7) 26... Rf8 27. Rd3 {White wastes time around here.} Qc6+ 28.
Kg1 Rd7 29. Bf4 Qc5+ 30. Qf2 Qc6 31. Qe2 Rfd8 32. Ne4 ({If} 32. Qe5 Qxc2) 32...
Qb6+ 33. Kg2 Qxb2 34. Bd2 $2 {White misses the win.} ({Correct was} 34. Rxd7
Rxd7 35. Nc5 Rd8 36. Nxe6 $1) 34... Rxd3 35. cxd3 Qd4 36. Bxh6 Qxd3 {Hampsire
lost on the top 4 boards and also 6, 7 & 8.} 1/2-1/2

