1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 g6 5. Nc3 Bg7 6. Be3 d6 7. Qd2 a6 8. f3
h5 {An unusual line played to prevent the anti-dragon attack.(h4-h5)} 9. Bc4
Bd7 10. a3 Nf6 11. O-O-O Qc7 12. Ba2 Ne5 {[23']} 13. h3 {[11']} ({If} 13. f4
Bg4) 13... Nc4 14. Bxc4 ({If} 14. Qd3 Nxe3 15. Qxe3 Bh6 16. f4 e5) 14... Qxc4
15. Rhe1 {Intending to open up the centre} Qc7 {[37']} 16. f4 {[14']} O-O-O {
[42']} ({If} 16... O-O 17. f5 {etc.}) 17. Nf3 {[15'] With ideas of Qf2, Ng5,
or e5} Bc6 18. Ng5 Rhf8 ({If} 18... e6 19. Qf2 {is good for White}) 19. Qf2 Nd7
20. Nd5 (20. f5 {is also good}) 20... Bxd5 21. exd5 Rde8 22. Rd3 (22. Bd4 {
May have been better e.g.} Bxd4 23. Qxd4) 22... Nc5 {[61']} 23. Bxc5 {[30']} ({
If} 23. Rdd1 Na4 {is good for him.}) 23... Qxc5 24. Qxc5+ {Getting into a good
end-game.} ({If} 24. Qe2 {threat 25.Nxf7. Then} Qb5) 24... dxc5 25. Ne4 b6 {
[68']} 26. d6 {[32']} Kb7 $4 {Short of time Black blunders.} ({Correct was} 
26... Kb8 $1) 27. dxe7 {1 Uni won the match 4 -} 1-0

