1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 Nd4 4. Bc4 Bc5 5. Bxf7+ $4 {Going mad} ({Good is} 5.
Nxd4 Bxd4 6. c3 Bb6 7. d4) 5... Kxf7 6. Nxe5+ Kf8 7. Qh5 ({Maybe better} 7. c3
Nc6 8. Nxc6 dxc6 9. d4) 7... Qe7 {Best} ({Not} 7... Nxc2+ $4 8. Kd1) (7... g6
8. Nxd7+ Qxd7 9. Qxc5+) 8. Kd1 d6 {Now I'm in a terrible mess.} 9. b4 ({If} 9.
