({I can't play} 10. bxc5 {because of} g6 {Black hadn't seen this!}) 10... Nf6
11. Qg5 Nxe4 12. Qxe5 Bg4+ {I went right off the rails here. Southampton lost
the match 1.5 - 6.5} 0-1

