1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 c5 4. e3 Nf6 5. Nf3 Nc6 6. Bd3 Be7 7. O-O O-O 8. dxc5
Bxc5 9. b3 Qe7 10. Bb2 dxc4 11. Bxc4 a6 12. Bd3 e5 13. Ne4 Bg4 $2 {Puts him in
difficulties.} 14. Nxf6+ Qxf6 15. Qc2 Bxf3 16. gxf3 Qxf3 17. Bxh7+ Kh8 18. Be4
Qg4+ 19. Kh1 Rfd8 $4 {Loses a piece} 20. Rg1 Qh4 21. Bxc6 bxc6 22. Qxc5 Qe4+
23. Rg2 Qf3 {Threatening perpetual check.} 24. Qc1 (24. Qc2 $142) 24... Rd3 25.
Bxe5 Rad8 26. Bxg7+ $2 {Very risky.} ({Correct was} 26. Bd4 {with an easy win})
26... Kh7 27. Qc2 $4 {Loses.} (27. Bd4 $142) 27... f5 28. h4 Rd2 29. Qc1 {
Resigns in view of 29......Rxf2 Greed doesn't pay. I had an easy win by 26.Bd4}
0-1

