1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. g3 O-O 6. Bg2 Nc6 ({More usual is} 
6... e5 7. Nge2 exd4 8. Nxd4 Nc6 {However, we transpose.}) 7. Nge2 e5 8. d5 Nd4
9. Nxd4 $6 {Very risky trying to win a Pawn.} ({Sound is} 9. O-O) 9... exd4 10.
Ne2 ({Not} 10. Qxd4 $2 Nxe4) 10... c5 11. dxc6 bxc6 12. Qxd4 (12. Nxd4 {
is answered by} Qb6 {with a good game for Black}) 12... Re8 ({I expected} 12...
Ng4 13. Qd1 Ne5 {but 12......Re8 is also good.}) 13. Bg5 h6 ({If} 13... Qa5+
14. Bd2) 14. Bxf6 Bxf6 15. Qd2 Rb8 16. Rb1 {Black has a good position here.} ({
If} 16. Nc3 Ba6) 16... Be6 {This seems to win 2 Pawns} 17. Nd4 {The best chance
} ({If} 17. b3 Bxc4) ({or} 17. O-O Bxc4) 17... Bxd4 ({Black could probably win
even with..} 17... Bxc4) 18. Qxd4 Qa5+ 19. Qd2 {Here Black offered a draw.} (
19. Qd2 {Black has very good chances.} Qxa2 20. O-O Bxc4 21. Rfc1 d5) 1/2-1/2

