1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. Qg4 Ne7 6. dxc5 Nbc6 ({or} 6... Bxc3+)
({or} 6... Ng6) 7. Bd2 Ng6 8. Nf3 a6 9. Bd3 Bxc5 {We stopped for tea here!} 10.
O-O-O b5 {Trying to seize the innitiative. However I should have strengthened
the KS.} (10... Bxf2 {was too risky.}) 11. h4 {White had taken over an hour up
to here.} f5 {More or less forced.} 12. exf6 Qxf6 13. Rhe1 {Threat 14.Nxd5} O-O
14. Qh5 {[68']} Nb4 {[58'] To get rid of the KBishop} 15. Nxd5 $6 ({I expected.
} 15. Ne5) 15... Nxd3+ ({If} 15... Nxd5 16. Ng5 h6 17. Bxg6) 16. cxd3 exd5 17.
Qxd5+ Qf7 18. Qxc5 ({Not} 18. Qxa8 $4 Bb7) 18... Bf5 19. Qa3 Qd5 {White now
had less than 5' to reach move 36.} 20. Bc3 Rac8 {I had about 5' left now.} 21.
Kb1 a5 ({I wanted to play} 21... Nf4 {but White replies} 22. Re7) 22. Qb3 {
White had ony about 1' left I had about 3'. The play became a real scramble in
which I managed to grab a couple of Pawns.} Qxb3 23. axb3 b4 24. Bd2 Bxd3+ 25.
Ka1 Bc2 26. Rc1 Bxb3 27. Rxc8 Rxc8 28. Rc1 Rxc1+ 29. Bxc1 Bd5 30. Ng5 Nxh4 31.
g3 Ng6 32. Nh3 Bg2 33. Ng1 Kf7 34. Ne2 Bf3 35. Nd4 Be4 36. Nb3 a4 {We had lost
track of the score and made one more move each before realising we had made 36
moves. Both clocks were on the verge of falling.} 37. Nc5 Bc6 {Adjudicated.
Drawn. An exiting time scramble. Championship (20) Amboyna Shield (50)} 1/2-1/2

