1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 exd5 4. Bd3 Nf6 5. Qe2+ Be7 6. Nf3 O-O 7. O-O Bg4 8.
h3 {[3']} Bh5 {[2' 30s]} 9. Nc3 Re8 10. g4 Bg6 11. Bxg6 hxg6 ({I considered.} 
11... fxg6) 12. Be3 Nc6 13. Qd2 Qd7 {Intending 14......Bd6 15......Nxg4} 14.
Nh2 Bd6 15. f4 Bb4 16. Rf3 Ne4 17. Qd3 Ba5 {Intending 18......Nb4} 18. a3 Bxc3
19. bxc3 Na5 20. f5 g5 21. h4 gxh4 22. Rh3 Qc6 23. Bf4 Nc4 24. Rxh4 Nb2 {
Makes life interesting.} 25. Qh3 Kf8 {Best} 26. Re1 Na4 {Again best.} 27. Bd2
Ke7 28. Nf3 Kd7 $1 29. Ne5+ Rxe5 30. dxe5 Qc5+ {After much thought} ({If} 30...
Nxd2 31. e6+ {is a nuisance.}) 31. Be3 Qxc3 32. e6+ Ke7 33. Re2 Qa1+ 34. Kg2 {
[83']} Qd1 $2 {[116'] This could be the decisive error.....} ({.....I thought
it was at least as good as....} 34... Nac3 35. Bd4 Nxe2 {etc. but it probably
isn't. I was now getting short of time.}) 35. Qf3 Nac3 36. Rf2 {I had
overlooked the strength of this. I was now very short of time.} Nxf2 $2 (36...
Qxf3+ $142 {but I didn't have time to think.}) 37. Bc5+ {Now I'm lost.} Kf6 38.
Qxc3+ Kg5 39. Qxg7+ Kf4 40. Qh6+ Ke5 41. Bxf2 Qxc2 42. Qe3+ Qe4+ 43. Qxe4+ Kxe4
44. exf7 d4 45. Rh6 Rf8 46. Re6+ Kd5 47. Re7 Kd6 48. f6 d3 49. Be3 c5 50. g5 c4
51. Bd2 Rc8 52. Re8 {Scrappy but enjoyable.} 1-0

