1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 d6 4. d4 g5 5. Bc4 ({I'd play} 5. d5) 5... g4 6. O-O
$6 gxf3 7. Qxf3 Nc6 {The defence is relatively easy as White has no attack
worth mentioning.} 8. Qh5 ({I'd prefer} 8. Qxf4) 8... Qf6 9. e5 Qg6 10. Qf3
Nxd4 11. Qxf4 Ne6 12. Qf3 c6 ({Not} 12... dxe5 13. Bb5+ c6 14. Bxc6+) 13. Nc3
dxe5 14. Be3 f6 {Now White has no attack at all.} 15. Ne4 h5 16. Rad1 f5 17.
Nd6+ Bxd6 18. Rxd6 Nh6 19. Rfd1 Nf7 20. R6d2 Qg4 21. Qf1 f4 {Black is now
attacking} 22. Bf2 Rg8 23. c3 Neg5 24. Re2 f3 25. Rxe5+ {Puts a quick end to
it.} Nxe5 26. Bxg8 Nh3+ 27. Kh1 Nxf2+ 28. Qxf2 fxg2+ 29. Qxg2 Qxd1+ 30. Qf1
Qxf1# {0 Uni won the match 5 -} 0-1

