1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O b5 6. Bb3 Be7 7. Qe2 O-O 8. a4
b4 9. c3 Rb8 $2 10. Bd5 Bd6 {Black's position becomes rather embarassing due
to his handling of the opening.} 11. Bxc6 $2 {Now White goes wrong.} dxc6 12.
cxb4 Rxb4 13. Nc3 Be6 14. d3 h6 15. Rd1 Re8 16. Nd2 Bc5 17. Nc4 $2 Bg4 18. Qc2
Bxd1 19. Nxd1 Re6 20. b3 Bd4 21. Rb1 Nd7 22. Na5 c5 {[73']} 23. Bd2 {[31']} Rb8
24. Ne3 Rg6 25. Nf5 Nf8 26. Nc4 Ne6 27. Nce3 Kh7 $2 ({A lapse moment in the
time rush. I intended....} 27... Bxe3 {first but played the second move first
for some reason.}) 28. Nd5 Ng5 29. Kf1 Re6 $2 {Another time rush mistake.} 30.
h4 c6 {I was very short of time here the rest is a rush.} 31. Nc3 g6 32. Nxh6
Nf3 33. gxf3 Qxh4 34. Ng4 f5 35. Ne3 f4 36. Ng4 Kg7 37. Ne2 $4 {First move
after the time scramble and White blunders. This loses a piece.} Qh3+ 38. Kg1
$4 {Now he's mated} Rh8 {Very scrappy with the time scramble.} 0-1

