1. Nf3 d5 2. g3 c5 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. O-O g6 5. c4 d4 6. d3 Nc6 7. Na3 Bg7 8. Nc2
O-O 9. Rb1 a5 10. b3 Re8 11. a3 Qd6 12. b4 axb4 13. axb4 cxb4 14. Bd2 Nd7 15.
Nxb4 Nxb4 16. Bxb4 Qc7 17. Qc2 e5 18. Ng5 Nf6 19. Rb2 h6 20. Ne4 Nxe4 21. Bxe4
Bd7 22. Rfb1 Bc6 23. Bxc6 bxc6 24. Bc5 e4 25. Rb6 e3 26. f3 Be5 {Time sramble
now.} 27. Kg2 Bd6 $2 {A time rush error.} 28. Bxd4 c5 29. Bc3 Ra7 30. Qb2 Rea8
31. Bh8 Bf8 32. Be5 Qd7 33. Rb7 Qa4 34. Rxa7 Rxa7 35. Ra1 (35. Ra1 Qd7 36. Rxa7
Qxa7 37. Qc1 {wis another Pawn.}) 35... Qd7 {Time was called and Black
resigned. I lost the game in the time scramble.} 1-0

