1. d4 f5 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. Bg5 Bg7 5. h4 {Too inflexible. He should wait
till Black castles before deciding his intentions.} c6 6. d5 $2 {White is much
too rash.} d6 {I played this after some consideration of 6.......Qa5} (6... Qa5
{e.g.} 7. d6 $4 Ne4 {Whites best reply would probably be} 8. Bd2) 7. g3 {[30']}
Qb6 {[10'] I was satisfied with my position here. White is very shaky on the
Black squares.} 8. Qb3 {[40'] White was clearly unhappy here.} Ne4 9. Nxe4 {
[45']} ({If now} 9. Qxb6 Bxc3+ 10. bxc3 axb6 11. Bd2 Ra3) 9... fxe4 10. Be3 Qa6
11. Bh3 Nd7 12. Rc1 Ne5 13. Bxc8 Rxc8 14. Nh3 cxd5 {I think I missed the best
line somewhere around here.} 15. cxd5 Qa5+ 16. Kf1 Rxc1+ 17. Bxc1 Qc7 18. Kg2
O-O 19. Ng5 Qc4 {The best move. White was suddenly emerging from the fray.} (
19... Ng4 {isn't good enough.}) 20. Qxc4 Nxc4 21. Ne6 ({If} 21. Nxe4 Rc8) 21...
Rf5 ({Not} 21... Rc8 22. Nxg7 Kxg7 23. Bg5 Z0 {and} 24. Rc1) 22. b3 Nb6 {
White must lose a Pawn.} 23. Nxg7 Kxg7 24. Bb2+ Kf7 25. Rc1 Rxd5 26. Rc2 Ke6
27. g4 Ra5 28. Bd4 Nd5 29. e3 Nb4 30. Rc7 Rxa2 31. Rxb7 a5 (31... a5 32. Kg3 {
Black plays say.....} Ra3 33. Rb5 Rxb3 34. Rxa5 Nc6 35. Ra4 Nxd4 {etc.}) 32.
Kg3 {Adjourned} 0-1

