1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. g3 Nbd7 5. Bg2 Bb4 6. Nf3 Ne4 7. Qc2 O-O 8. O-O
Bxc3 9. bxc3 h6 10. a4 a5 11. c5 c6 12. Bf4 {White has control of the Black
squares} Re8 13. Ne5 Nf8 $2 {[35'] After overlooking the Pawn loss he's
strangled.} 14. Bxe4 {[7']} dxe4 15. Qxe4 g5 {Attempting to break out.} 16. Bd2
Kg7 17. h4 f6 18. Nc4 ({I considered} 18. Ng4) 18... Nd7 19. hxg5 hxg5 20. Nd6
Re7 21. Kg2 Nf8 {Black can do nothing but struggle.} 22. Rh1 Ng6 23. Rh5 {
With sacrifices on g5 in the offing.} Qg8 24. Rah1 Kf8 25. Qf3 $1 {The end.}
Kg7 {Black was practically out of time here.} 26. Rh6 Bd7 27. Rxg6+ 1-0

