1. c4 e5 {[15']} 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. g3 Bc5 4. Bg2 O-O 5. e3 Nc6 6. Nge2 Re8 7. O-O
d6 8. d4 exd4 9. exd4 Bb6 10. h3 Bf5 11. a3 h6 12. Be3 a5 13. Kh2 Qc8 14. Nf4
Ne7 15. b4 axb4 16. axb4 c6 17. Qd2 Qd7 18. Nd3 {[30']} Bc7 {[60']} 19. f4 Bxd3
20. Qxd3 d5 21. Na4 dxc4 22. Qd2 Ned5 23. Nc5 Qe7 24. Rxa8 Rxa8 25. Re1 b6 26.
Bf2 Qf8 27. Ne4 Nxe4 28. Rxe4 Qxb4 29. Qe2 Kf8 30. Be1 Qa3 $2 {A time-trouble
blunder. Black was now very short of time.} 31. Qxc4 Qa4 32. Qe2 Bd6 33. h4 Qa6
$4 {Blundering again in the time scramble.} 34. Re8+ Rxe8 35. Qxa6 Rxe1 36.
Bxd5 cxd5 37. Qxb6 Ke7 38. Qb7+ Ke6 39. f5+ Kf6 40. Qxd5 Be7 41. g4 g6 42. g5+
hxg5 43. hxg5+ Kxg5 44. Qg2+ Kf6 45. fxg6 Bd6+ 46. Kh3 Re3+ 47. Kh4 Bg3+ 48.
Kg4 Kxg6 49. Qc6+ f6 50. d5 Be5 51. Qe8+ Kh6 52. Kf5 Rf3+ 53. Ke6 Rd3 54. Qg8
Rd4 55. d6 $1 {If I'd have arrived on time I'd have not got in time trouble
and would probably have won} 1-0

