1. d4 f5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. c4 g6 4. Nc3 Bg7 5. Bf4 {Rearely a good move in this
variation.} O-O 6. g3 d6 7. Bg2 c6 8. O-O h6 9. h4 Nh5 10. e3 {Skating on thin
ice.} Nd7 11. d5 {Else 11......e5} Nb6 12. Qd3 ({Not} 12. Qb3 $2 e5 $1) 12...
Bd7 13. Nd4 Qc8 14. Rfe1 Kh8 (14... Kh7 $142) 15. Re2 Rd8 16. Rb1 Kh7 {I can
play 16.....e5 but prefer to play16.....Bf6 and .......g5if he lets me. Hence
the h-Pawn needs defending} 17. b4 {Action at last but Black reacts quickly.}
e5 18. dxe6 Bxe6 19. Nxe6 Qxe6 {Wins the c-Pawn} 20. b5 Rac8 21. bxc6 bxc6 22.
Reb2 Rd7 ({If} 22... Qxc4 23. Qxc4 Nxc4 24. Rb7 {is a nuisance.}) 23. Rb3 Nxf4
24. exf4 Qxc4 25. Qxc4 Nxc4 26. Rb7 Rcc7 27. Rxc7 Rxc7 {Now White was short of
time.} 28. Ne2 Re7 29. Nc1 $2 {A 'safe' hurried move.} Re1+ 30. Bf1 ({If} 30.
Kh2 Bb2) 30... Nd2 0-1

