1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7. d5 Na6 8. Bd3 Nc7
9. O-O b6 {Black's method is very slow.} 10. h3 a6 11. g4 Nd7 12. a4 Rb8 13.
Qe1 Bb7 14. h4 {intending a Pawn sacrifice for an attack on the KS.} Nf6 15. h5
Nxg4 ({If} 15... gxh5 16. g5 Z0 17. Qh4 {is suicidal for Black.}) 16. Qh4 Bc8
17. f5 Ne5 18. Nxe5 Bxe5 19. Bg5 Bf6 20. Bxf6 exf6 21. hxg6 fxg6 22. fxg6 hxg6
23. Qh6 Rf7 24. Kf2 Rg7 25. Rh1 Kf7 26. Rag1 Qg8 27. Qf4 Ne8 28. Rh6 Ke7 29.
Qg3 g5 30. Rgh1 Qf7 31. Be2 f5 32. Bh5 f4 33. Qd3 Qf8 34. e5 $1 Bf5 35. Qe2 Kd7
36. Bg4 dxe5 {A time-trouble error but it was very difficult.} 37. Qxe5 Bxg4
38. Qxb8 Qe7 39. Re1 Qf8 40. Qxb6 Re7 {Adjourned.} 41. Rxe7+ {Sealed move.}
Qxe7 42. Qb7+ Nc7 43. Qc6+ Kd8 44. Qf6 Qxf6 45. Rxf6 Bd7 46. b3 a5 47. Ne4 Ne8
48. Ra6 g4 49. Nxc5 g3+ 50. Kg2 Bf5 51. Ne6+ Bxe6 52. Rxe6 Ng7 53. Rg6 1-0

