1. d4 f5 2. Bg5 g6 3. e3 Bg7 4. c4 c5 5. Nf3 h6 {Black already has an
innitiative.} 6. Bh4 $4 {Loses outright. White didn't realise how bad his
position was.} cxd4 7. exd4 {Loses the Bishop.} ({However} 7. Nxd4 Qb6 $1 {
and what does White play?}) 7... g5 8. Ne5 Bxe5 {Simplest.} 9. Qh5+ Kf8 10.
dxe5 Qa5+ 11. Nc3 Qxe5+ 12. Be2 gxh4 13. O-O {White's superior development
isn't worth a piece.} Nf6 14. Qxh4 Nc6 15. Rfe1 f4 16. Rad1 Qg5 17. Qxg5 (17.
Qh3 d5 {is poor for White.}) 17... hxg5 18. Bf3 Kf7 ({If} 18... d6 19. c5 dxc5
20. Bxc6 bxc6 21. Rd8+) 19. h3 d6 20. Nd5 Ne5 21. Be2 Nxd5 22. cxd5 Bxh3 $1 23.
gxh3 Rxh3 24. Bf1 Nf3+ 25. Kg2 g4 26. Be2 Nxe1+ 27. Rxe1 f3+ 28. Bxf3 Rxf3 29.
