1. Nf3 d5 2. g3 c5 3. Bg2 Nc6 4. d4 Nf6 5. O-O cxd4 6. Nxd4 e5 7. Nxc6 bxc6 8.
c4 Be7 9. Bg5 {I wasn't too happy with the opening at this stage.} Bb7 10. Bxf6
Bxf6 11. cxd5 cxd5 12. Nc3 {Forced.} e4 13. Qa4+ (13. Qb3 $142) 13... Qd7 14.
Rad1 Qxa4 15. Nxa4 Rc8 16. Rc1 Ke7 17. Bh3 Rxc1 18. Rxc1 Kd6 19. e3 Bc6 20. Nc3
Rb8 21. b3 Be5 22. Ne2 Rb4 23. Rd1 g6 24. Nd4 Bb7 25. Bf1 Rb6 $2 {I saw
White's next move but ignored it for some reason.} 26. Nb5+ Ke6 27. Nxa7 Ba6
28. Rc1 Bxf1 29. Kxf1 Kd7 30. Rc5 Ra6 31. Nb5 Rxa2 32. Rxd5+ Ke6 33. Rd1 Rb2
34. Nd4+ {Allowing a drawn ending but I win the b-Pawn otherwise.} Bxd4 35.
Rxd4 Rxb3 36. Rxe4+ Kf5 37. Rf4+ Ke6 38. h4 Ra3 39. Kg2 Ra2 40. Kh3 Ra1 41. Kg4
Ra5 42. Re4+ Kf6 43. f4 Rb5 44. Rd4 h5+ 45. Kh3 Rb6 46. e4 Ra6 47. e5+ Ke6 48.
Rd3 Rb6 49. Kg2 Ra6 50. Kf3 Kf5 51. Ke3 Ke6 52. Ke4 Ra4+ 1/2-1/2

