dxe4 e5 6. Bg2 Nf6 7. Ne2 Nc6 8. O-O Bg4 9. h3 Bxe2 10. Qxe2 Nd4 {Too
ambitious but I played the whole game in a rapid and slapdash way.} 11. Qd3 b5
$6 12. b3 Be7 $2 {Giving away an unimportant Pawn.} 13. c3 Nc6 14. Qxb5 Qc7 15.
Qe2 O-O 16. Nc4 Na5 17. f4 Nxc4 18. Qxc4 Nd7 19. Be3 Rac8 20. Rad1 Nb6 21. Qe2
