1. d4 f5 2. g3 Nf6 3. Bg2 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. c4 O-O 6. Nc3 d6 7. O-O c6 8. Rb1 h6
({If} 8... Nbd7 9. Ng5 {is a nuisance.}) 9. b3 {An odd move considering his
8th.} Nh5 10. e3 {To prevent 10......c5} c5 11. Ne2 Qe8 $6 {A doubtful move,
showing I was rusty.} 12. dxc5 dxc5 13. Bb2 (13. Qd5+ Kh8 14. Qxc5 {was
probably playable}) 13... Nf6 14. Qc2 Nc6 15. Ne5 Nb4 16. Qd2 Ne4 17. Bxe4 $2 {
Allows Black to get on top.} fxe4 18. Bc3 Bxe5 19. Bxb4 ({If} 19. Bxe5 Bh3 20.
Rfd1 Nd3) 19... cxb4 20. Qd5+ Qf7 21. Qxe5 Bh3 {Winning the exchnage} 22. Qxe4
({If Rook moves e.g.} 22. Rfe1 Qf3) 22... Bxf1 23. Rxf1 Rad8 (23... g5 $142)
24. Nf4 Rd6 25. Qxb7 a5 26. Nd5 e6 27. Qxf7+ Rxf7 28. Nf4 g5 29. Ne2 Rd2 30.
Nd4 Rf6 $2 31. f4 Rxa2 32. Rc1 gxf4 33. exf4 e5 {The game is probably a draw
now.} 34. Nc2 $4 {Suicide.} exf4 35. c5 fxg3 36. hxg3 Rf3 0-1

