1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. Bd3 c5 6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2 Qb6 8. Nf3
Be7 9. b3 {To "Free" the Bishop.} O-O 10. O-O Re8 11. Nf4 {The d-Pawn is
defended.} cxd4 12. cxd4 Nf8 13. Be3 Bd7 14. Nh5 {Intending Ng5 and a
reasonable attack.} Nb4 15. Bb1 Bb5 16. Re1 Qa6 {Concentrating on d3 but it
was better to cocentrate on the c-file.} 17. Bd2 $1 {Best I think.} Nc6 $2 {
Loses a Pawn.} (17... Bd3 $4 {Loses a piece.}) (17... Nd3 18. Re3 {is good for
White.}) 18. a4 ({I also considered} 18. Bh6) ({Not however} 18. Nxg7 $2 {when}
Kxg7 19. a4 {leaves the a-Pawn pinned.}) 18... Bd3 19. Bxd3 Qxd3 20. Nxg7 Nxd4
{Black decides to give up the exchange.} 21. Nxd4 Qxd4 22. Nxe8 Rxe8 23. Be3
Qxe5 24. Bxa7 Qc7 25. Rc1 Qa5 26. Bd4 Ng6 27. g3 Bd6 28. h4 $1 e5 29. h5 Nf8
30. Qg4+ Kh8 31. Qf5 1-0

