1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 Nc6 4. f3 {What a fiasco. I intended 4.Nf3. I picked
up the knight , was about to put it on f3 when I found I was holding the pawn.}
Nxd4 5. c3 {I was in something of a quandary now.} Nc6 6. Bb5 Bd7 7. Qe2 {
Threatening the d-Pawn.} dxe4 8. fxe4 {This has freed White's game somewhat.}
a6 9. Bd3 Ne5 ({Black should develop or play.} 9... e5) 10. Bc2 Nf6 11. Ngf3
Nxf3+ 12. Nxf3 Bc6 13. Bg5 Be7 14. Rd1 Qc8 {White is right on top now.} 15. O-O
O-O $2 16. Ne5 h6 $2 {Fairly suicidal.} 17. Bh4 g5 $4 18. Nxc6 bxc6 19. e5 Nd7
20. Qd3 f5 21. Qxd7 ({If} 21. exf6 Rxf6 ({Not} 21... Nxf6 $4 22. Qg6+ Kh8 23.
Rxf6)) 21... Qxd7 22. Rxd7 Bd8 23. Bf2 Rb8 24. Bb3 Re8 25. Rfd1 f4 26. Bxe6+
Kh8 27. Bb3 Be7 28. e6 Rbc8 29. Bd4+ Kg8 30. Be5 Kf8 31. Bxc7 Bc5+ 32. Kf1 Be7
33. Bd6 Bxd6 34. R1xd6 a5 35. Rh7 {A Friday 13th game.} 1-0

