1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Bg5 Ne4 5. Bh4 c6 6. e3 Qa5 {Intending to
exert pressure on the QS Black squares.} 7. Rc1 Nxc3 8. Rxc3 e5 {Mixing it!} 9.
Bf6 Rg8 10. dxe5 $5 {Giving up the exchange for play in the centre. However,
White doesn't get enough play.} (10. a3 $142) 10... Bb4 11. Qd4 Bxc3+ 12. bxc3
Be6 {Threatens 13......c5.} ({Not} 12... Qxa2 $2 13. Qc5) 13. Nf3 c5 14. Qh4 {
Still hoping for an attack.} Qxc3+ 15. Nd2 h5 16. cxd5 Bxd5 17. Bb5+ Bc6 18.
Bxc6+ $8 Nxc6 19. e6 {The only chance.} Qc1+ 20. Ke2 Qxh1 21. exf7+ Kxf7 22.
Bc3 {Again the only hope.} Nd4+ $1 {Easiest.} 23. exd4 Rge8+ 24. Kd3 Qxg2 {
White should resign.} 25. d5 Qxd5+ 26. Kc2 Qxa2+ 27. Bb2 Qe6 28. Nf3 Qf5+ ({
White hoped for.} 28... Qe4+ 29. Qxe4 Rxe4 30. Ng5+) 29. Kc1 Qxf3 30. Qc4+ Re6
0-1

