1. d4 e6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 d6 4. e4 exd5 5. cxd5 g6 6. Nc3 Bg7 7. f4 f6 $2 {
Frightened already. Also Black was playing really fast.} 8. f5 Ne7 9. g4 a6 10.
a4 {Black is already in danger of suffocating.} g5 11. Nf3 Nd7 12. b3 {White
has plenty of time.} b6 13. Ra2 Bb7 {Black's time 2'!} 14. Rf2 Nc8 {[8']} 15.
Bb2 Qe7 16. Qd2 {[27']} Na7 17. Bd3 Kf7 {Very surprising after Black had
apparently cleared the decks for QS castling.} 18. Qe2 Nc8 19. h4 h6 20. Rfh2
Ra7 21. Bc1 Ne5 22. Rh3 Nxf3+ 23. Rxf3 Re8 $2 24. hxg5 fxg5 $2 {Suicidal.} 25.
f6 Qe5 26. fxg7+ Kxg7 27. O-O {Naturally the Knight is immune.} Ba8 $2 {
Black had now given up and the remaining moves took only a few minutes.} 28.
Bb2 Qd4+ 29. Kg2 Qb4 $4 {Speeds the end.} 30. Na2+ Qd4 31. Bxd4+ cxd4 32. Qb2
Rae7 33. Qxd4+ Kg8 34. Qf6 Bxd5 35. Qg6+ Rg7 36. Qxe8+ Kh7 37. exd5+ Rg6 38.
Rf7# 1-0

