1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 {I played this opening , without being able to remember any
of the variations, only because I expected to win easily.} 3. exf5 e4 4. Nd4
Nf6 5. Bc4 d5 6. Bb3 c5 {Doubtful.} (6... Bc5 $142) 7. Ba4+ Bd7 8. Bxd7+ Qxd7
9. Ne6 Na6 10. d3 Nc7 11. Nxf8 Rxf8 12. dxe4 O-O-O {Now Black has all his
pieces in play Black has none.} 13. O-O Nxe4 14. Bf4 Qxf5 15. g3 $2 ({Probably
losing a lost game.} 15. Bg3 {held out more hope.}) 15... Ne6 16. Be3 d4 17.
Bd2 N6g5 18. Bxg5 Nxg5 19. f4 Nh3+ {Apparently burying the Knight but Black
has resources.} 20. Kg2 d3 21. cxd3 Rxd3 22. Qe2 Qd7 23. a4 ({If} 23. Qh5 Re8)
23... Re8 24. Qc2 ({If} 24. Qh5 g6 $1) 24... Qd5+ $1 {Finishes it.} 25. Kxh3
Re6 26. f5 Rh6+ 27. Kg4 Qe4+ 28. Rf4 Rxg3+ 29. hxg3 Qxc2 30. a5 Qe2+ 31. Rf3
Rd6 32. Ra4 h5+ 33. Kf4 g5+ 34. Kxg5 Qxf3 {Instead of resigning White said
that he hoped I didn't mind if he played on.} 35. g4 hxg4 36. Rxg4 Qh1 37. f6
Qxb1 38. b4 Qf1 39. Rf4 Qxf4+ 40. Kxf4 Rxf6+ 41. Ke5 Rc6 42. bxc5 Rxc5+ 43. Kd4
Rxa5 44. Kc4 Rh5 45. Kb4 Kc7 46. Ka4 Kb6 47. Kb4 Rh4+ 48. Kc3 Kb5 49. Kb3 Rh3+
50. Kc2 Kb4 51. Kb2 Rh2+ 52. Ka1 Kb3 53. Kb1 Rh1# 0-1

