1. c4 e5 2. g3 d6 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. Nc3 Be7 5. b4 {Black was playing very
passively so I felt that vigerous action would not come amiss.} c6 6. d3 Bd7 7.
e3 a6 {Life is now rather difficult for his bKnight.} 8. Nge2 Qc8 9. a4 Bh3 10.
Bf3 Nbd7 11. Bb2 Nb6 $2 {A pointless move.} 12. a5 Nbd7 13. Nc1 {Threatening
14.g4 trapping his Bishop.} b5 $2 {Oblivious to the threat.} 14. g4 Nb8 15. Rg1
d5 16. cxb5 axb5 17. N1a2 Na6 (17... h5 $142) 18. Rg3 Bxg4 19. Bxg4 Nxg4 20.
Qxg4 Qxg4 21. Rxg4 O-O 22. Ne2 f5 23. Rg2 Bd6 24. Bc3 c5 25. bxc5 Nxc5 26. Nb4
Na4 27. Nxd5 Nxc3 28. Nexc3 b4 29. Nb5 Rfd8 30. Nxd6 Rxd6 31. Nxb4 Rb8 32. a6
Ra8 33. f3 Rb6 34. Rb2 g5 35. Raa2 h5 36. a7 Kg7 37. Nc6 Rxc6 38. Rb8 Rc8 39.
Rxc8 Rxc8 40. a8=Q Rxa8 41. Rxa8 g4 42. fxg4 fxg4 43. Ra6 1-0

