1. c4 e5 2. g3 Nf6 3. Bg2 Nc6 4. Nc3 d6 5. d3 Be6 6. e4 {I didn't particularly
want to block the Bishop's diagonal but but Black is getting rather cramped.
Also 6......d5 is now prevented.} Nd4 7. h3 g6 8. Nge2 Nxe2 9. Qxe2 Bg7 10. Bg5
({If} 10. f4 Nh5 {may be a nuisance. Also I want to retain the option of which
side to castle.}) 10... h6 11. Be3 Nd7 {possibly hoping for KS play by .......
f5} 12. f4 c5 {I didn't really see the point of this.} 13. O-O Nb6 {Where is
the Knight going? However the Bishop needed a retreat.} 14. f5 Bd7 15. Qf2 Qf6
16. a4 {Threatening 17.a5 & 18.Nd5} Bc6 ({If} 16... a5 17. Ra3 Z0 18. Rb3) 17.
Nb5 O-O 18. b4 a6 $6 19. Nc7 $6 {A bit involved and I was begining to get
short of time.} ({If} 19. Nxd6 {then} Qxd6 ({therefore} 19... Nxa4 20. bxc5 b5
{is unclear but seems to favour White.} 21. cxb5) 20. Bxc5 Qxd3 21. Bxf8 Bxf8
22. Qxb6 $18) ({If} 19. bxc5 axb5 {etc}) 19... Rac8 20. bxc5 (20. a5 Nd7) 20...
Nxa4 (20... Rxc7 21. cxd6 Qxd6 22. Bc5 Qxd3 23. Bxf8 $18) {Short of time I
played} 21. cxd6 ({There are now various tries. I considered} 21. Rxa4 Bxa4 22.
Nd5 Qd8 23. f6 Bh8 24. Bxh6 Re8 $13) 21... Qxd6 22. Nd5 Bxd5 23. exd5 Nc5 24.
f6 Bh8 25. Bxh6 Rfe8 26. Rad1 {Played in a big rush Black had ~20'} e4 $1 {
Excellnt in view pf my time trouble.} 27. Qd4 exd3 28. Qh4 Qe5 29. Bg5 Ne4 $2 {
With plenty of time he gives it away.} 30. Bxe4 {My flag fell immediately the
clock was touched again.} Qxe4 31. Qxe4 Rxe4 32. Rxd3 Rexc4 33. d6 $1 Rd8 34.
Re1 Rc5 35. d7 Rxg5 36. Re8+ Kh7 37. Rxd8 Bxf6 38. Rb8 {My worst time scramble
for some time. This was also a Lancaster C.C. game.} 1-0

