{Time limit 30 moves in 75 minutes} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 d6
5. Nc3 e6 6. Bc4 Be7 7. Be3 Nf6 8. f3 O-O 9. g4 {I expected to win tis game
fairly easily and was playing very fast. Time so far ~1' .} (9. Qd2 $142) 9...
Ne8 {[21'] Threat 10......Bh4+} 10. O-O {[5']} Nxd4 11. Qxd4 Bf6 12. Qd2 {[5']}
Qc7 13. Bb3 {[5']} b6 {Not active enough. Black should try for play on the QS
by ......a6 and ......b5} 14. Nb5 Qc6 15. Nd4 Qc7 16. Rad1 {My time so far [8']
} Ba6 {[35']} 17. Rf2 {[9']} Rd8 ({I had expected.} 17... Bc4) 18. g5 {[12']}
Bxd4 19. Bxd4 Qe7 {[43']} 20. h4 f6 {Trying to break out.} 21. f4 {[15']} Kh8 {
[51']} 22. Qe3 {[18']} Bc8 23. Bc3 {[19']} e5 {[66'] he now had 9' for 7 moves.
} 24. f5 {[19'] Black's flag fell whilst thinking about his next move. However
I didn't immediately claim a win preffering to establish a defiitively won
game in the next six moves.} Nc7 25. Rfd2 {[24']} Nb5 26. Bb4 Qc7 27. Ba4 Qc4
28. a3 Bxf5 {Black has a lost position, and realising that I can claim a win
on time anyway this seems as good as any.} 29. Bxb5 Qxe4 {A piece up I felt I
could legitamately end it. Hence.......} 30. Qxb6 $1 {and I claimed a win on
time.} 1-0

