1. g3 d5 2. Bg2 e5 3. d3 c5 4. Nf3 Nc6 5. O-O f5 6. c4 d4 7. e3 Nf6 8. exd4
exd4 9. Re1+ Be7 10. Bf4 O-O 11. Ne5 Nxe5 12. Bxe5 Ng4 13. Nd2 Nxe5 14. Rxe5
Bd6 15. Re1 g5 {I felt that I had the innitiative here and could embark on a
KS assault.} 16. a3 g4 {Preventing 17.Nf3 and intending ......f4.} (16... a5 {
May have been more prudent.}) 17. b4 cxb4 18. c5 Bc7 {Preffering the KS attack
to winning a pawn.} 19. axb4 f4 20. gxf4 Bxf4 21. Ne4 {Just sufficient.} h5 22.
Qb3+ Kh8 $2 23. c6 $1 {After about 30 mins thought. I was now rather
overconfident and didn't give my next move much thought.} bxc6 {It's very
doubtful I can save it after this. Alternatves were........} (23... b6) (23...
Qc7) 24. Ra5 {I'd overlooked this.} Qe8 $2 {Turns out catastrophically, but
the alternatives weren't too bright.......} (24... Rf5 25. Rxf5 Bxf5 26. Qf7) (
{Or} 24... Bf5 25. Ng3 {may be best.}) 25. Qc4 Rf5 26. Qxd4+ Be5 27. Nd6 Qf8
28. Raxe5 Rxe5 29. Rxe5 {I shouldn't have lost this. I was playng much too
superficially after getting on top and took only a few seconds over move 23.}
1-0

