{Time control 20 moves per hour.} 1. c4 e6 2. g3 d5 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. Nf3 Nbd7 5.
O-O Be7 6. d4 O-O 7. c5 ({I was in two minds about this and} 7. b3 {is
probably better.}) 7... c6 8. Nc3 Re8 9. b4 Bf8 10. Bf4 Nh5 11. b5 {Energetic
play seems in order. The doubled f-Pawns didn't bother me.} Nxf4 12. gxf4 f6
13. bxc6 bxc6 14. e4 {Keeping the initiative and hoping to remove a Pawn from
the long White diagonal.} dxe4 15. Nxe4 Qc7 ({I intended to meet} 15... e5 {
with} 16. d5) 16. Qc1 Ba6 17. Re1 Rad8 {Black is getting rather cramped.} 18.
Bh3 {A strong move.} Nb8 ({If} 18... e5 19. fxe5 fxe5 20. Neg5) 19. a4 Bc8 20.
Ra3 a5 21. Ng3 (21. Ng3 {Intending.....} Z0 22. Re4 Z0 23. Rae3 {and keeping
his e-Pawn under pressure.}) ({I considered} 21. Nxf6+) ({and} 21. Bxe6+ {
but either are good enough.}) 21... Na6 22. Qc4 Nb4 {Decidig to give up the
e-Pawn and get his Knight into play.} ({If} 22... Qxf4 23. Re4 {etc.}) 23.
Bxe6+ Bxe6 24. Rxe6 Nd5 25. Rxe8 Rxe8 26. Re3 Qf7 ({This was a surprise. I
expected......} 26... Rb8) 27. Rxe8 Qxe8 28. Qa6 Nxf4 29. Qxa5 Qe6 30. Qa6 $2 {
Already getting short of time I blunder.} (30. Qe1 $142) (30. Qd2 $142) 30...
g5 $2 ({Missing his chance. Correct was} 30... Qd5 31. Ne1 Nh3+ 32. Kf1 Qxd4
33. Z0 Bxc5) 31. Qf1 h5 {Things were difficult now as time was short.} 32. Nd2
{Hoping to be able to play 33.Qc4 exchanging Queens} Kg7 33. Qd1 Kh6 34. Qb1 {
Threatening 35.Nf5+ and a discovered check.} h4 35. Nf5+ Kh5 36. Qe4 Qa2 37.
Qf3+ $2 ({With no time to thik I miss} 37. Qe8+ $1 Ng6 (37... Kg4 38. Ne3+ Kh3
39. Qxc6 $1 Qa1+ 40. Ndf1 g4 41. Qc8) 38. Qe2+ g4 39. h3) 37... Kg6 38. Nxh4+
Kf7 {Black had plenty of time.} 39. Qb3+ {Played in a flash. I had no time to
think.} (39. Qe3 {Seems to save the piece.}) 39... Qxb3 40. Nxb3 {With no time
to spare.} gxh4 {After all my hard work, the time rush leaves me with a lost
game.} 41. a5 Nd5 42. a6 Ke6 43. Kg2 f5 44. a7 Nc7 45. Kf3 Bh6 46. h3 Kd5 47.
Na5 Bg7 ({Hoping for.} 47... Kxd4 48. Nxc6+ Kxc5 49. Ne7 Kb6 50. Nxf5) 48. Nb3
{The only hope.} Bh6 {Black isn't happy.} ({If} 48... Bxd4 49. Nxd4 Kxd4 50.
Kf4 {and I hoped to Queen my f-Pawn. I move after Black Queens his c-Pawn.})
49. Na5 Bg7 50. Nb3 (50. Nb3 {However if...} Bxd4 51. Nxd4 Kxd4 52. Kf4 Kxc5
53. Kxf5 Kb6 $3 54. Ke5 Kxa7 55. f4 Kb6 56. f5 Ne8 57. Ke6 c5 58. Ke7 Ng7 59.
f6 Nf5+ 60. Ke8 Nh6 {winning for Black.}) 50... Bh6 {Black couldn't find a win.
Givig away half a point by leaving myself short of time.} 1/2-1/2

