{Brian had a Handicap of 3 and R.A.C had 1. The difference of handicaps was 2.
Therefore I have to mate him in 6 given moves + 30. I had the choice of colour.
The opening given was.........} 1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 g5 4. h4 g4 5. Ng5
h6 6. Nxf7 Kxf7 {Much to the surprise of the spectators I chose Black.} 7. Qxg4
({The alternative is} 7. Bc4+ d5 8. Bxd5+ Ke8) 7... Nf6 8. Qxf4 Bd6 9. Bc4+ ({
Naturally not} 9. e5 Bxe5) 9... Kg7 10. Qf5 $4 {Suicide.} (10. Qf3 $142) 10...
Bg3+ 11. Ke2 d5 {Suddenly it's Black who has the attack.} 12. Qf1 Bg4+ 13. Ke3
Re8 ({Alao good is} 13... dxc4 {and if} 14. Qxc4 Nd5+) 14. d4 {Trying to find
an escape for the King.} Rxe4+ 15. Kd3 Rxd4+ 16. Kxd4 dxc4+ 17. Kc3 Be5+ 18.
Kb4 a5+ 19. Ka3 Qd6+ 20. Ka4 Qb4# {Quite an attack.} 0-1

