{Time control 24 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Bf4 Bg7 5.
e3 O-O 6. cxd5 Nxd5 7. Nxd5 Qxd5 8. Bxc7 Na6 9. Bxa6 {Better than........} ({
.........} 9. Bg3 $2 Bf5 10. a3 Rac8 11. h3 Bc2 {[Alatortsev - Lillienthal
Moscow 1936]}) 9... bxa6 10. Qf3 {Pachman considers this inferior to 10.Nf3}
Bb7 11. Qxd5 Bxd5 12. Nf3 Rac8 13. Ba5 Bxa2 $1 {Doesn't win a Pawn but swaps
one of his a-Pawns for mine.} ({If Now} 13... Rc2 14. Bc3 {and the Rook is
stuck.}) 14. Bb4 Rfe8 15. Bc5 Bc4 16. Bxa7 Bb5 17. Kd2 e5 {Mixing a bit
considering he was short of time.} 18. Rhc1 e4 19. Ng5 h6 $2 {Short of time he
gives away a Pawn.} 20. Rxc8 Rxc8 21. Nxe4 f5 22. Nd6 Ra8 23. Nxb5 axb5 24. Ra3
Bf8 25. Bc5 Rxa3 26. bxa3 ({Not} 26. Bxa3 $4 b4) 26... Bxc5 27. dxc5 Kf7 28.
Kc3 Ke6 29. Kb4 Kd7 30. Kxb5 Kc8 31. a4 g5 32. a5 h5 33. a6 Kb8 34. c6 f4 35.
Kb6 h4 36. a7+ Ka8 37. c7 {This made me L,M & D individual champion for 1971-72
} 1-0

