1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nf3 Bg7 4. g3 O-O 5. Bg2 d6 6. Nc3 c5 7. e3 Nc6 8. O-O a6
9. a3 cxd4 {I had been ill in bed and played both the previous game [ against
Arthur] and this one in the evening. Thus I was not at my best.} 10. Nxd4 Ne5
11. Qb3 Qc7 12. Nd5 Nxd5 13. cxd5 Qc4 14. Qc3 Qxc3 15. bxc3 Nc4 16. Re1 e5 17.
dxe6 fxe6 18. a4 Na5 19. Rb1 Rb8 20. Rb6 Nc4 21. Rb1 d5 22. Bf1 Na5 23. Ba3 Re8
24. Rb6 Bf8 25. Bb4 Bxb4 26. cxb4 e5 27. Nf3 Nc4 28. Rf6 $4 Kg7 29. Bxc4 Kxf6
30. Bxd5 Bd7 31. a5 Bc6 32. Rd1 Red8 33. e4 Rd7 34. h4 Bxd5 35. exd5 Rbd8 36.
Ng5 Rxd5 37. Nxh7+ Kg7 38. Rxd5 Rxd5 39. Ng5 Rb5 40. Kf1 Rxb4 41. Ke2 Ra4 42.
Kf3 Rxa5 43. Ke4 b5 44. Kxe5 b4+ 45. Kd4 Ra2 46. Ne4 Rc2 47. Kd3 b3 48. Nd2 Kh6
49. g4 a5 50. Nxb3 Rxf2 51. Nxa5 Rf4 52. h5 g5 53. Nb3 Rxg4 54. Nd4 Rxd4+ 55.
Kxd4 Kxh5 56. Ke3 Kg4 57. Kf2 Kh3 58. Kg1 Kg3 59. Kh1 Kf2 60. Kh2 g4 61. Kh1
Kf3 62. Kg1 Kg3 63. Kh1 Kf2 64. Kh2 g3+ {After an agreed draw with A.J.Owen 
(game not played) I became Lancaster Club Champion for 1971-72} 0-1

