1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 Qe7 5. Nc3 ({Pachman gives} 5. g3 {
as better.}) 5... O-O 6. e3 b6 7. Bd3 Bb7 8. O-O d6 9. Qe2 Bxc3 10. Bxc3 Ne4
11. Rac1 Nd7 12. Nd2 f5 13. f3 Nxc3 14. Rxc3 {This doesn't turn out too well.}
c5 15. Nb3 e5 16. d5 Rf6 17. Qc2 Raf8 18. Nd2 Qf7 19. f4 e4 20. Bxe4 $6 {
For various reasons this has to be a 'do or die' game. I didn't want a draw.}
fxe4 21. Nxe4 Rh6 22. g4 Qe7 23. Ng5 Nf6 24. Ne6 Nxg4 25. Nxf8 Qxf8 26. Qe4 Bc8
27. f5 Ne5 28. Qf4 Qf6 29. Ra3 $2 Rh4 30. Qf2 Ng4 31. Qg3 Nxh2 32. Rf4 Rh5 33.
Qf2 Qg5+ 34. Qg2 Qf6 35. Qe4 Bd7 36. Rxa7 $2 {Too ambitious. Short of time
though.} (36. Rf2 $142) 36... Qxb2 37. Rf2 {Too late.} ({I considered} 37. Qe7
{which probably draws.}) 37... Qc1+ 38. Kg2 Rg5+ 39. Kh3 Rh5+ 40. Kg2 Rg5+ 41.
Kh3 Qg1 42. Ra8+ Kf7 43. Qh4 Nf3 0-1

