1. c4 e6 2. g3 Nf6 3. Bg2 c6 4. Nf3 Be7 5. O-O d5 6. d4 Nbd7 7. Nc3 O-O 8. Bf4
Ne4 9. Rc1 f5 10. Qb3 g5 11. cxd5 $1 {A piece sacrifice offering very good
chances over the board.} ({Not} 11. Bd2 $2 g4) 11... gxf4 12. dxc6 Nxc3 ({
Alternatives were...} 12... bxc6 13. Qxe6+ Kh8 14. Qxc6) ({Or} 12... Nb6 13.
cxb7 {etc.}) 13. Qxe6+ ({Alternatively} 13. cxd7 Nxe2+ 14. Kh1) 13... Rf7 $2 ({
Inferior to} 13... Kh8 {in view of subsequent threats Ne5 Bd5}) 14. Rxc3 Nf8 $2
{Losig outright as e5 is left unprotected.} ({I expected} 14... bxc6 15. Qxc6 {
etc.}) 15. Qc4 bxc6 16. Ne5 Be6 17. Nxf7 Kxf7 18. Qxc6 fxg3 $6 (18... Rc8 19.
Qa4 {is hopeless for Black so he has a last fling hoping for something on the
KS.}) 19. Qxa8 gxh2+ 20. Kxh2 Bd6+ 21. Kg1 Qe7 22. Qf3 Qh4 23. Qh3 Qxd4 24. Rd3
Qc5 25. Qe3 Qb4 26. Qxa7+ Kg8 27. Qd4 Qxd4 28. Rxd4 Be5 29. Rd2 Bxa2 30. Bd5+
Bxd5 31. Rxd5 {A pleasing game.} 1-0

