1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Bc5 3. f4 d6 ({An alternative was} 3... Bxg1 4. Rxg1 exf4) 4.
Nf3 Nc6 5. Bb5 a6 6. Bxc6+ {He end up rather weak on the White squares now.}
bxc6 7. d4 {Results in a weakening of his KS.} exd4 8. Nxd4 Qh4+ 9. g3 Qh3 10.
Be3 ({If now} 10. Nxc6 Qg2 11. Rf1 Bh3) 10... Bg4 11. Qd2 Ne7 12. Nf5 $6 {
After much thought.} Nxf5 13. Bxc5 ({If} 13. exf5 Bxe3 14. Qxe3+ Kd7 {is
embarassing for White.}) 13... Nxg3 ({I considered} 13... dxc5 14. exf5 O-O)
14. Rg1 Nh5 15. Be3 {White was now very short of time.} Rb8 $1 {Now 16.Rb1 and
he can't castle QS. 16.b3 weakens his Knight.} 16. b3 O-O 17. f5 $2 {Loses but
he only had a few minutes} Rfe8 {18......Bxf5 is threatened.} 18. Qf2 {White
has no time to think. he's lost anyway.} Bxf5 19. Qxf5 Qxe3+ {White lost on
time. [W.P.barry was Lancaster Club President]} 0-1

