1. c4 e6 2. g3 c6 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. Nf3 Be7 {Before the game Black said that he
felt it was only a question of how long he'd last. He plays the whole game in
a very passive and dispirited fashion.} 5. O-O Na6 $2 6. d4 Qc7 $2 ({Either} 
6... d5) ({or} 6... O-O {is much better.}) 7. Bf4 Bd6 $2 {Horrible.} 8. Bd2 b6
(8... Be7 $142 9. Z0 d5) 9. Qa4 Bb7 10. b4 Ne4 11. a3 O-O 12. Rc1 Qd8 13. Nc3
Nf6 $2 ({Black must try for something via exchanges or by...} 13... f5) 14. e4
c5 $2 {Loses a piece.} 15. b5 cxd4 ({If} 15... Nc7 16. e5 cxd4 17. Nd1 $1 {
wins a piece.}) 16. bxa6 Bxe4 {Black hopes to keep two Pawns for the piece.} ({
If} 16... dxc3 17. axb7 cxd2 18. bxa8=Q dxc1=Q+ 19. Rxc1 Qxa8 20. e5) 17. Nxe4
Nxe4 18. Bb4 Bc5 19. Qd1 e5 $2 {Unnecessarily giving a Pawn back.} 20. Nxe5 d5
{Loses another Pawn.} 21. Bxc5 bxc5 22. cxd5 Qxd5 23. Bxe4 Qxe4 24. Rxc5 Rfd8
25. Qd3 Qxd3 26. Nxd3 f6 27. Rc7 1-0

