{[#] In the L.M&D Individulal Championship I played against one of the club
"Novices", R.Newton aged about 13. From the diagram I played.} 1... d4 $6 {
To which he replied.} 2. Bh6 $3 {There followed} Qd6 3. Nf5 ({and he missed.} 
3. Bxg7 $1) 3... Nxe5 4. Nxe7+ Qxe7 5. Rae1 Rfe8 6. Rxe5 Qxe5 7. Qxg4 g6 {
I eventually won in about 50 moves.} 1-0

