1. d4 e6 2. c4 f5 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Be7 5. Bxf6 $2 {The outcome of the game
demonstrates the futility of this weakening of the Black squares.} Bxf6 6. e3
c5 7. Be2 b6 ({I also considered.} 7... Qb6) 8. O-O {[6']} Bb7 {[5']} 9. Nc3
cxd4 10. exd4 O-O 11. d5 {Premature.} e5 12. Nd2 d6 13. f3 {Over-passive.} a5 {
Intending 14......Na6 (or d7) .......Nc5} 14. a4 {Pointless, especially as he
eventually loses this Pawn.} Na6 15. Nb5 Nc5 16. Qc2 Bg5 {Threatening 17......
BxN} 17. Rae1 $2 {Overlooking the other threat.} (17. Ra3 $142) 17... Nxa4 18.
Qxa4 Bxd2 19. Rd1 {[35']} Be3+ {[17']} 20. Kh1 Qh4 21. Qa3 $2 {Oblivious as to
how weak his KS is. Not that he had much hope.} Bf4 22. h3 Rf6 23. Nc7 {
Much the same as resigning.} Qg3 24. Kg1 Rg6 25. Rf2 Qh2+ 26. Kf1 Qh1# {
1 I had a bye in Rd} 0-1

