1. c4 Nf6 2. g3 g6 3. Bg2 Bg7 4. Nc3 O-O 5. d4 d6 6. e4 Bg4 7. Qd3 {I'm not
very happy with this.} c6 8. h3 Bc8 9. f4 e6 10. Nge2 Na6 {Too timid Black
should attempt to break up the centre.} 11. a3 Nc7 {[23']} 12. e5 $6 {[13'] I
was playing much too fast and over-confidently. This seems premature.} dxe5 13.
fxe5 Nd7 14. g4 $4 {Rubbish. I had seen the reply before I played 12.e5?! but
forgot it (playing too quickly). 14.g4?? is to prevent 14......f5} Nxe5 15. Qg3
Nxc4 {White has some positional compensation. I now pied my hopes on a KS
attack.} 16. b3 Nb6 17. Bf4 Ncd5 18. Bd6 Nxc3 19. Nxc3 Re8 20. O-O-O Nd5 21.
Ne4 Qb6 22. Bc5 Qa5 23. g5 {Else Black does well with 23......f5} Rd8 24. h4
Bf8 25. b4 Qa4 ({|Expecting} 25... Qc7 26. Nf6+ Kg7 27. Qxc7 Nxc7 28. Bxf8+
Rxf8 29. h5 {with some hope.}) ({Not} 25... Qa6 $4 26. Bf1 {and if...} Qa4 $4
27. Bxf8 Rxf8 $4 28. Nc5) 26. Bf1 (26. h5 $142) 26... b6 (26... Bxc5 $4 27.
Nxc5) 27. Bxf8 Rxf8 28. h5 Ba6 29. Nf6+ Nxf6 30. gxf6 Bxf1 31. Rdxf1 Qb5 {
The threat was 32.Qe3, 33.Qh6} 32. hxg6 {Hoping for something} ({If} 32. Qe3 g5
$1) 32... Qc4+ $4 {Giving it away the Queen is needed on the 4th rank.} ({If} 
32... fxg6 {White has nothing definative. e.g.} 33. f7+ Rxf7 34. Rxf7 Kxf7 35.
Rxh7+ Kf6 $1 {and White has no win.}) 33. Kb1 fxg6 34. f7+ Kg7 ({Now if} 34...
Rxf7 35. Rxf7 Kxf7 36. Rxh7+ {and Black loses his other Rook as he can't go to
f6! He ends it more quickly.}) 35. Qe5# {Very poor. Playing much too quickly.}
1-0

