1. f4 {An experiment which immediately had Black worried.} e6 2. e4 d6 {
C.W's big problem is playing too passively in the opening.} 3. d4 Be7 4. Nf3 b6
5. Bd3 Bh4+ $2 {Pretty pointless.} 6. g3 Be7 7. O-O {[3']} Bb7 8. Be3 Nf6 9.
Nc3 O-O 10. Qe2 Nfd7 11. g4 {To prevent 11......f5} f5 $2 {Anyhow? Giving up a
pawn to try for some play but it leaves him hopelessy placed.} 12. exf5 exf5
13. Bxf5 Rxf5 {Do or die!} 14. gxf5 Nf6 15. Ng5 Qd7 16. Qc4+ d5 ({And not} 
16... Kh8 $4 17. Nf7+ {with a smothered mate in 3.} Kg8 18. Nh6+ Kh8 (18... Kf8
19. Qf7#) 19. Qg8+ Nxg8 20. Nf7#) 17. Qe2 Qxf5 18. Bf2 Qg4+ (18... Qxf4 $4 19.
Qe6+ (19. Qxe7 Qxg5+) 19... Kh8 20. Nf7+ Kg8 21. Bg3 $3 {and wins.}) 19. Qxg4
Nxg4 20. Rae1 Bxg5 21. fxg5 Nxf2 22. Rxf2 Bc6 $2 {[35'] Black has no hope at
all but this speeds the end.} 23. Nxd5 {[19']} 1-0

