1. d4 d5 2. e4 {The first time I've played this.} Nf6 {....and Black isn't
interested.} 3. e5 Nfd7 4. Bd3 {Threatening 5.e6} e6 5. Qg4 c5 6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2
Qb6 8. a3 cxd4 9. cxd4 Qb3 {Doesn't achieve much.} 10. Nbc3 a6 11. O-O Ndxe5 $6
{Desperation already!} 12. dxe5 Nxe5 13. Qg3 Nc6 14. Bf4 Bd7 {Surely not
intending 15......O-O-O.} ({Naturally not} 14... Qxb2 $4) 15. Rfd1 Rc8 16. Bd6
Bxd6 17. Qxd6 Ne7 18. Rd2 Rc6 $2 19. Qg3 Qb6 20. Qxg7 Rg8 21. Qd4 Qc7 22. Bxh7
e5 $6 23. Nxd5 Nxd5 24. Qxd5 Rh8 25. Be4 Rch6 26. Rc1 Rxh2 27. g3 Bc6 28. Rxc6
bxc6 29. Qc5 R2h6 30. Rc2 Kd7 31. Qc4 Rf6 32. Qxa6 Rhh6 33. Qc4 Ke8 34. Nc3 Qd7
35. Bg2 Rd6 36. Qe2 Kf8 37. Rc1 ({Not} 37. Qxe5 $2 Rd1+) 37... Qe7 38. Rd1 Rdg6
39. Qd3 Kg7 40. Qe3 f5 41. Qd3 e4 42. Qd7 Re6 {And Black resigned. I intended
43.Qc8 Lancaster (Collins, Turner, Mollit, Lawrence, Owen, Dixon, Lucker) won
7-0} 1-0

