{Time limit 2 hr 30' for the whole game.} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 e6 4. Nc3 d6
5. e4 Be7 6. f4 exd5 7. cxd5 Nbd7 {Allowing the following energetis advance.}
8. g4 Nb6 9. g5 Bg4 10. Bb5+ Kf8 {[14']} 11. Qd3 {[16'] So as to cover g3
after ......Nh5} (11. h3 Bd7 12. Be2) 11... Ne8 12. Bxe8 Qxe8 13. b3 f6 {[20']}
14. Qg3 {[10']} Bd7 15. h4 Qh5 16. Bb2 fxg5 $2 {Doubtful, Opening lines.} 17.
fxg5 Be8 $2 {Black was obviously stuck for a continuation. There seems little
point in this.} (17... Qg4 $142) 18. Nh3 {[18']} Bd7 19. Nf4 Qf7 $2 {Loses
outright.} ({If} 19... Qg4 20. Qf2 {Threatens various things including 21.Rg1})
(19... Qe8 {was about the only move. It's doubtful if he'd last long though.})
20. O-O Ke8 21. Ne6 Bxe6 (21... Qg6 22. h5 $3 {Would have been nice.}) 22. Rxf7
Bxf7 23. Nb5 {14 teams entered (4 from Lancaster) P.O.Telephones won after
handicap points were included.} 1-0

