{Time limit 36 moves in 2hrs} 1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 g6 3. c4 Bg7 4. Nc3 O-O 5. e4 d6
6. Be2 e5 7. O-O Nc6 8. d5 Ne7 9. b4 {Suggested by Taimanov.} a5 ({Pachman 
(Indian Systems) suggests} 9... Nh5) 10. Ba3 axb4 11. Bxb4 Nd7 12. Nb5 ({
Possibly better is} 12. a4 $1 {[Van Scheltinga v Euwe Beverwijk1958]}) 12... f5
({Aggressive but maybe 12......h6 first was better. I did not want to play} 
12... b6 {because of} 13. a4 Z0 14. a5) 13. Ng5 (13. c5 {is an alternative.})
13... Nc5 14. Bxc5 dxc5 15. Ne6 Bxe6 16. dxe6 c6 17. Nd6 Qc7 18. Nf7 fxe4 {
Intending 19...Nf5 & 20...Nd4.} 19. g4 $6 Nc8 20. g5 Qe7 21. Bg4 ({If} 21. Qd7
Qxd7 22. exd7 Kxf7) 21... Ra3 22. Qe2 ({If} 22. Qd7 Rd3) 22... Nd6 23. Nxd6
Qxd6 24. Qb2 Rd3 25. Qxb7 Rf4 $1 26. Qc8+ ({Not} 26. h3 $2 Rxg4+) 26... Bf8 27.
e7 Qxe7 28. Qe6+ Kg7 $1 {Winning another Pawn.} 29. Qxe7+ Bxe7 30. Bc8 Bxg5 $2
({Too hasty. The pawn won't run away. Correct was} 30... Ra3 {After the text
his a-pawn runs amok.}) 31. a4 e3 32. a5 Rxc4 ({Black is probably lost. Neither
} 32... exf2+) ({nor} 32... e2 {are good enough.}) 33. a6 exf2+ 34. Kh1 Rd8 35.
Bb7 Rb4 36. Rxf2 $2 {Throwing it away.} ({After} 36. Bxc6 {Black loses Rook
for Pawn.}) 36... Be3 {Gaining one tempo.} 37. Rfa2 Bd4 {and another.} 38. Rf1
c4 39. Bxc6 ({Now if} 39. a7 Bxa7 $1 40. Rxa7 Rd7 {wins the Bishop.}) 39... Ba7
40. Kg2 c3 41. Rf3 Rc4 {An interesting start but one bad mistake each.} 0-1

