{Time limit 36 moves in 2hrs} 1. d4 {[5' late]} d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Nf3
dxc4 5. a4 Bf5 6. e3 e6 7. Bxc4 Bb4 8. O-O O-O 9. Bd2 {I couldn't remember
much about the Slav so was therefore playing solidly.} Nbd7 10. Ne4 Bxd2 11.
Nxf6+ Nxf6 12. Nxd2 Qe7 ({I had expected.} 12... Qa5) 13. Qb3 Rfd8 14. Nf3 Ne4
15. Rfd1 Bg4 16. Be2 Ng5 17. Qc2 (17. Nxg5 {Gives up Bishop for Knight.}) 17...
Nxf3+ 18. Bxf3 Bxf3 19. gxf3 Rd5 20. f4 Rad8 21. f3 Qh4 22. b4 ({Not} 22. Qg2
c5) 22... Qh5 23. Qg2 R5d6 {Threatening ......e5} 24. Kh1 g6 (24... g6 25. Rdc1
{[=]} ({Not} 25. Qg5 $2 Qxg5 26. fxg5 e5 $1)) 25. Rdc1 {Here he offered a draw
which I accepted. Leaders now: Homer 3 Brigden, Collins, Skulason 2.5} 1/2-1/2

