{Time limit 36 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 {The first time I have played
this against "non-local" opposition.} 3. Nxe5 ({I feel that} 3. Bc4 {may be
the best to which I would have replied} d6) 3... Qf6 4. Nc4 ({More usual is} 4.
d4) 4... fxe4 5. Nc3 Qg6 6. d3 {I was becoming rather unhappy with the opening.
} Bb4 7. Bd2 {Best.} Bxc3 8. Bxc3 Nf6 9. Ne5 Qf5 10. dxe4 Nxe4 {Threatening
mate.} ({White thought that} 10... Qxe4+ {was better.}) 11. Qd4 c5 $2 {I'm
possibly lost after this. I was trying for too much.} ({Quite satisfactory was
} 11... Nxc3 12. Qxc3 O-O) 12. Qe3 {I was stuck now.} O-O $4 ({If} 12... Nxc3
13. Ng6+) (12... Kd8 {is horrible}) ({and neither} 12... d6) ({nor} 12... d5 {
are adequate.}) {I was thinking thar after} 13. Bc4+ {13......Kh8 14.Nf7+ RxN
15.BxR I would be able to play KxB, as if the King were still on g8. I
realised my mistake.} Kh8 14. Nf7+ Rxf7 15. Bxf7 d5 {Playing rapidly now as
the alternative was to resign.} 16. Bxd5 Qxd5 17. Rd1 Qg8 18. Qxe4 Nc6 19. Rd3
Bd7 20. Rxd7 {One of those days.} 1-0

