{Time limit 20mph} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 Bc5 3. Bg2 Nc6 4. Nc3 {[4']} a6 {[5']} 5. a3
{[4']} d6 6. e3 Nge7 7. b4 Ba7 8. Nge2 Be6 9. d3 Qd7 10. Rb1 Bh3 11. Bf3 {[28']
} Nd8 {[29']} 12. a4 {[35']} c6 {[35']} 13. Ba3 {[39']} Ne6 {[38']} 14. Ng1 {
[45']} Bf5 {[41']} 15. h4 {[47'] Threatening to win the Bishop. However, being
out of practice I was taking too long, getting short of time and making rather
artificial moves.} h6 {[44']} 16. b5 {[54'] A hurried move as time was getting
on.} axb5 17. cxb5 Bc5 {[46']} 18. Bb4 {[58']} O-O 19. e4 Bh7 {[50']} 20. Nge2
f5 {[56']} 21. O-O Kh8 22. Bg2 f4 23. Bxc5 Nxc5 24. gxf4 exf4 25. f3 Ng6 26. d4
Ne6 27. h5 Nh4 {[71']} 28. Bh3 {[87']} Qf7 29. Bg4 {[92']} Qf6 30. d5 $1 {
Securing White a definite innitiative.} cxd5 31. Nxd5 Qg5 {[86']} 32. Kf2 $4 {
[102'] Missing his reply completely.} Bxe4 $1 33. Rg1 Qxd5 34. Bxe6 $2 {
Stunned by the first blunder I make a second.} (34. fxe4 $142 Qxe4 35. Bxe6
Qxe6 36. Qd4) 34... Qc5+ 35. Qd4 Qxd4+ 36. Nxd4 Bxb1 37. Rxb1 Rxa4 38. Ne2 Re8
39. Bd7 Re7 40. Bg4 {[119'30s]} Ra2 41. Re1 Re5 42. b6 Nf5 43. Bxf5 Rxf5 44.
Kf1 Rxh5 45. Ng1 Re5 46. Rc1 Rb5 47. Ne2 g5 48. Rc8+ Kg7 49. Rc7+ Kg6 50. Rxb7
Rab2 51. Nd4 Rxb6 52. Re7 d5 53. Ne6 Kf6 {Caught cold in first game of the
season. This is the first level match or tournament game I have ever lost to a
Lancaster club member.} 0-1

