{Time limit 20mph} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. g3 Nf6 4. Bg2 c6 5. Nf3 h6 {Seems
hardly necessary.} 6. O-O Nbd7 7. c5 {After some consideration. It leaves
Black very cramped.} Qc7 $2 {Black wants to force ......e5 but this move just
asks for trouble.} 8. Bf4 {naturally.} Qa5 9. Nc3 Ne4 10. Nxe4 dxe4 11. Nd2 {
Threatening the e-Pawn and Nc4-d6.} Qb4 {Black is getting dangerously behind
in development.} 12. Nxe4 Qxb2 {[17']} 13. Qd3 {[11']} Qb5 14. Qf3 a5 {To give
the Queen a retreat.} 15. Bd6 Qa4 {Turns out to be a bad square.} 16. Bxf8 Rxf8
17. Qg4 Rg8 18. Qf4 $1 {The Queen is moved to a defended squareon the 4th rank,
the point of which is shown next move.} Rf8 19. d5 $1 Nxc5 {Black decides to
give up a Knight for two Pawns to free his position and obtain some passed
Pawns.} 20. Nxc5 Qxf4 21. gxf4 exd5 22. e4 b6 {Black's hope is QS Pawn roller.}
23. exd5 $1 {This surprised him.} bxc5 24. Rfe1+ Kd8 25. dxc6 Ra6 26. Rad1+ Kc7
(26... Kc7 27. Re7+ {If} Kb6 ({Or} 27... Kb8 28. c7+ Ka7 29. Rd8) 28. Rb1#) 27.
Re7+ 1-0

