{Time limit 42 moves in 1hr 30'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4
O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7. d5 e6 8. Be2 exd5 9. exd5 Re8 10. O-O Na6 {[21]} 11. Bd3 {[1']
} Bg4 {I didn't like this. It gets White's KS going.} (11... Nh5 $142 12. Z0 f5
) 12. h3 Bd7 13. g4 {[3']} h5 14. Nh2 {[5']} hxg4 {[47']} 15. hxg4 {[5']} Nh7 {
[50'] Black was already badly behind on the clock. Rather a problem at this
fast time limit.} 16. f5 {[12'] Necessary else Black gets 16.....f5} gxf5 17.
gxf5 Qh4 {[60']} 18. Bf4 {[14']} Ng5 19. Qd2 Nh3+ 20. Kg2 {[23']} ({If} 20. Kh1
Bd4 {is a nuisance.}) 20... Nxf4+ {[82']} 21. Rxf4 Qh6 {[87']} 22. Kh1 Kh8 {
~[89'] Black has no hope now with 20 moves to make in about 1'} 23. Rg1 Be5 ({
If} 23... Bd4 24. Rxd4 $1) ({Best was} 23... Rg8 {although he is still in
trouble after} 24. Rgg4) 24. Rf3 Qh5 ({Lightning stuff but he avoids} 24...
Qxd2) 25. Rg5 Qh4 26. Qg2 Qe1+ 27. Nf1 {Black lost on time.} 1-0

