{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O
6. Nf3 c5 7. d5 Na6 {This has the disadvantage over 3......e6 (e.g. yesterday)
in that I can play my Bishop straight to d3} 8. Bd3 Nc7 9. O-O {[1']} e6 {[18']
} 10. Qc2 {[3']} exd5 11. exd5 Bd7 12. a4 Na6 13. Qd1 Nb4 14. Bb1 a6 {[28']}
15. a5 {[13']} b5 16. axb6 Qxb6 {Black's QSmanoeuvering is too slow.} 17. f5
Rae8 {[43']} 18. Nh4 {[21'] White's game plays itself.} Bc8 {Black is getting
nowhere.} 19. g4 {Now life is very difficult for Black} Qc7 $4 {Virtually
losing a piece.} ({He had to play.} 19... Nd7) 20. g5 {Naturally} Nd7 21. f6
Bh8 {It's all over now.} 22. Nf3 {[40'] After considering the alternatives.....
.....} (22. Nxg6) (22. Nf5) 22... Ne5 23. Nxe5 Rxe5 24. Bf4 {[42']} Bxf6 {
As good as anything else I suppose} 25. gxf6 Rh5 26. Ne4 Rd8 27. Ra3 Bf5 28.
Ng3 Bxb1 29. Nxh5 gxh5 30. Qxb1 Qd7 31. Rg3+ Kh8 32. Rg7 1-0

