{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. d4 f5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. c4 e6 4. Nc3 Be7 5. Bf4
O-O 6. e3 b6 7. Bd3 Bb7 8. Qc2 Nh5 9. Bg3 g5 {Energetic measures are called
for in these short matches} 10. O-O-O Nc6 ({Not} 10... f4 {2winning a piece" as
} 11. Bxh7+ Kh8 {followed by the opening of the h-file gives White a winning
attack.}) 11. h3 d6 12. Bh2 Nb4 13. Qe2 Nxd3+ 14. Rxd3 Qe8 {else 15.Nxg5 A
complete oversight in these "rapid" games.} 15. g4 $4 fxg4 16. hxg4 Bxf3 17.
Qf1 Bxh1 18. Qxh1 Nf6 19. f3 Qc6 {A remarable match result! The first win for
the Lancaster Gambit team.(5 - 2)} 0-1

