{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 ({
I beat the same opponent a couple of weeks ago with} 4... Qd7) 5. a3 cxd4 6.
Qxd4 Nc6 7. Bb5 ({Seems to give Black equality, but so does} 7. Qg4) 7... Bxc3+
8. Qxc3 Nge7 9. Ne2 Qc7 10. Bf4 Bd7 11. Bxc6 {[14']} Bxc6 {[7'] Black's Bishop
is now a rather better piece than White's} 12. O-O Rc8 13. Rfe1 {Black
threatened 13.......Bb5} Nf5 14. Rad1 Qd7 15. Qd2 Bb5 16. g4 $6 {Possibly
provoked by Black's time marking.} Nh4 17. Nd4 Rc4 {Black has aquired a
certain innitiative.} 18. Re3 h5 19. gxh5 Rxh5 20. Rh3 g5 $1 21. Bxg5 (21. Be3
{is also unclear}) 21... Rxd4 22. Qxd4 Rxg5+ 23. Kh1 Ng6 24. b3 {For the rest
of the game White suffers from a shortage of good moves.} Qc7 25. Rc3 Qd7 26.
Re1 Bc6 27. f4 Rf5 28. Rf3 ({Not} 28. Rf1 $2 Nxe5) 28... Qe7 29. Ref1 a6 ({
I thought about} 29... Nh4 30. Rh3 Qg5 {but} 31. Rg3 {is OK for White}) 30. c3
Qxa3 {White hadn't even considered this} 31. b4 Qa2 32. R3f2 Qc4 33. Qa7 $6 {
White didn't like the ending after exchanging, but his Queen just goes out of
play.} d4+ {Premature?!} 34. Kg1 Kf8 35. cxd4 ({Probably} 35. Qxd4 {draws} Qxd4
36. cxd4 Bb5 {etc.}) 35... Qxb4 36. Qb8+ $2 (36. Qc5+ $142) 36... Kg7 37. Qd8 {
White may be beyond saving now.} Qc3 38. Qd6 Qe3 {3 Not a bad game. L.Gambit
won the match 4 -} 0-1

