{Time limit 20mph} 1. c4 c6 2. g3 d5 3. Bg2 e5 4. b3 g6 5. Bb2 Bg7 6. f4 {
very doubtful} f6 7. fxe5 {[20']} fxe5 {[5']} 8. Nf3 Qc7 9. O-O Ne7 10. d4 e4
11. Ne5 Nf5 12. Qc1 $2 {[32'] Very artificial. Black can now play 12.......
Nxd4, but misses it.} Bxe5 $2 {[10']} (12... Nxd4 13. Bxd4 Bxe5) 13. dxe5 Qb6+
14. c5 $2 {Played without a thought.} (14. Kh1 {is much sounder. My Pawns are
left rather ragged now.}) 14... Qd8 15. g4 $2 (15. e6 $142 {which I considered
but rejected for some reason.} Rf8 (15... Rg8 16. g4 Nh4 17. Bf6 $18) 16. g4
Nh4 17. Rxf8+ Kxf8 18. Qh6+ $18) 15... Nh4 16. Qh6 $6 {I was expecting an easy
win here.} Qe7 {He has little choice.} 17. e6 {I'm in a quandry here with
loose Pawns everywhere.} Rg8 18. Bh3 {[28'] What else?} Bxe6 19. b4 {[58']} Nd7
{[20']} 20. Nd2 O-O-O 21. Qe3 g5 22. Nb3 Ng6 23. b5 Nge5 24. bxc6 Nxc6 25. Rfc1
Rdf8 26. Nd4 Nde5 27. Nb5 $2 (27. Nxe6 $142) 27... Nc4 28. Nd6+ Qxd6 29. Rxc4
Qf4 30. Rc3 d4 31. Qxf4 gxf4 32. Ra3 Bxg4 33. Kh1 Bxh3 34. Rxh3 Rf7 35. Rf1 Rg5
36. Ba3 Rd5 37. Kg2 Na5 38. Rc1 Nc6 39. Kf1 Rg5 40. Kf2 Rfg7 41. Rf1 Rf7 42.
Ke1 Rgf5 43. Rh4 Kd7 44. Kf2 Ne7 45. Bb2 Rd5 46. Rd1 Nf5 $2 47. Rxf4 Re7 48.
Ba3 Kc6 49. Rg1 Re6 50. Rf1 Ne3 51. Rc1 Rf5 52. Rxf5 Nxf5 53. Rg1 Rg6 54. Rf1
$2 Ne3 55. Rh1 Rg2+ 56. Ke1 Nc2+ 57. Kf1 Rg6 58. Bc1 Kxc5 59. e3 d3 60. Bd2 Kc4
61. Kf2 b6 62. h4 h5 63. Rh3 a5 64. Rg3 Rxg3 65. Kxg3 Na3 66. Kf4 Nb1 67. Be1
d2 68. Bxd2 Nxd2 69. Kg5 Nf3+ 70. Kxh5 Nxh4 71. Kxh4 Kd3 {A very poor game. A
much too casual approach, expecing to win against an opponent that I've
previously murdered.} 0-1

