{Time limit 20mph} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 b6 $6 4. d5 e6 5. c4 Be7 6. Bd3 e5
{[8']} 7. h3 {[3']} h6 8. Nc3 Bd7 9. Be3 Qc8 10. g4 {To prevent 10......f5.} g5
{[15'] Not a happy sight. Visions of a complete blcokage.} 11. Qd2 {[6']} f6
12. O-O-O a6 13. Qe2 {[8']} Bd8 14. Nh2 {How to break thro'? I intended
something on the lines of. 15.h4 hxg 16.f4} Ne7 15. h4 {[10']} Ng6 16. hxg5
hxg5 17. f3 Qb7 (17... Nf4 $142 18. Bxf4 exf4 {Leaving my Knight a little lost.
}) 18. Rdg1 Bc8 {[28']} 19. Nf1 {[13']} Qg7 (19... Nf4 {is still to be
recommeended but the h-file is a problem for Black.}) 20. Ng3 Ra7 21. Nf5 Bxf5
22. exf5 Rxh1 23. Rxh1 Nf4 24. Bxf4 gxf4 25. Ne4 {Having no chance of winning
the competition I was playing quickly.} Be7 ({Not} 25... Ke7 26. g5 $1) 26. Qh2
Nd7 27. Qh5+ Qf7 28. Qh8+ Qf8 29. g5 fxg5 30. Nxg5 Bxg5 31. Qh5+ Qf7 32. Qxg5
Nf6 {Good moves are conspicuous by there absence.} 33. Rh6 {Wins outright.} Nd7
({If} 33... Ke7 34. Rg6) 34. Re6+ Kf8 1-0

[Event "Lancaster Club Championship"]
