{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5.
O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5 7. Bb3 O-O 8. c3 d5 9. exd5 Nxd5 10. Nxe5 Nxe5 11. Rxe5 c6 {
I couldn't remember much about this opening and hadn't expected this move.} 12.
Bxd5 cxd5 {[3']} 13. Qf3 {[10']} Bb7 {[7']} 14. d4 {[11']} Bd6 {[14']} 15. Re1
{[17']} Qc7 16. g3 {[20']} Rfe8 17. Rxe8+ Rxe8 18. Be3 {[21']} b4 {[18']} 19.
a3 {[28']} a5 {[21']} 20. Qd1 $6 {[33']} Bxg3 $1 {His best chance} 21. hxg3 {
[44'] This is correct but not what follows.} (21. hxg3 {I had decided that.....
.} Rxe3 22. fxe3 Qxg3+ 23. Kf1 Bc8 24. Qe1 $1 {Was probably won for me. Thus I
played the next two moves without further consideration. (Too much haste as
seceral times this season.)}) 21... Rxe3 22. fxe3 ({Possibly} 22. Kg2 {is best}
) 22... Qxg3+ 23. Kf1 $4 ({Missing completely} 23. Kh1 $11) 23... Ba6+ {
Horrible! This must be my worst season ever. I have lost 4 games due to simple
tactical oversights and over-hasty play.} 0-1

