1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3 Ba5 6. Nf3 $6 {Leads to problems.}
cxd4 7. Nxd4 $6 {Now I win a Pawn.} ({On} 7. Qxd4 {I intended} Qc7) 7... Bxc3+
8. bxc3 Qc7 9. Qd3 Qxe5+ 10. Be2 a6 11. O-O Nf6 12. Qf3 Qc7 13. Bg5 $2 {
Seems to lose another Pawn.} Ne4 14. Be3 Qxc3 15. Bd3 Nd2 16. Bxd2 Qxd2 17.
Rfe1 Nc6 18. Nf5 O-O $1 19. Ne3 ({If} 19. Nxg7 Kxg7 20. Qg3+ Kh8 21. Qh4 f5 {
Wins.}) 19... f5 {Blocking his KS attack and threatening 20......Ne5} 20. Nxd5
$6 {Desperation?} exd5 21. Qxd5+ Kh8 22. Re2 Qa5 23. Qxa5 Nxa5 {He could have
resigned now and saved a lot of postage.} 24. Rae1 Nc6 25. c3 g6 26. h4 Bd7 27.
Re3 Rae8 28. Rxe8 Rxe8 29. Rb1 b5 30. c4 $2 Ne5 31. Rd1 bxc4 32. Be2 Bb5 33. f3
c3 34. Bxb5 axb5 35. Rb1 c2 36. Rf1 Rc8 {No trouble here.} 0-1

