10. Kb1 {Threatening e5 winning a piece.} ({If} 10. e5 dxe5 11. fxe5 Nd5 12.
Nxd5 Bxg5+ 13. Ne3) 10... Nbd7 (10... Z0 11. e5 dxe5 12. fxe5 Nd5 13. Nxd5) 11.
