continuing} 6. Qb3 {but} e4 {is a nuisance.}) 6... exd4 7. Qxd4 Nc6 8. Qd1 Bb4
9. e3 O-O 10. Nf3 ({If} 10. Nge2 Bg4) 10... Re8 11. O-O Bg4 12. Ne2 Qb6 13. Bd2
