b6 9. Bb5+ Bd7 10. Bd3 Nbc6 11. O-O h6 12. Re1 Na5 13. Bf4 g5 $5 {Rather
loosening. He's trying to play on both sides of the board at once.} 14. Be3 c4
$5 {Blocking the QS for a while when I have all the play on the KS.} 15. Bf1
Ng6 16. h3 Bc6 17. Nh2 {Quite happy to let the a-pawb go if he plays 17......
Qd7} O-O-O 18. Ng4 Qe7 19. Nf6 Nf8 20. f4 {Opening it up.} gxf4 21. Bxf4 Nd7
22. Nh5 Rdg8 ({Not} 22... f5 23. exf6 Nxf6 24. Be5) 23. Kh2 Rg6 24. Qd2 Nf8 25.
g4 Nh7 26. Bg2 Qd7 27. Bxh6 Bxa4 28. Rf1 Bb5 29. Rf2 Qe7 30. Raf1 Be8 {Blac is
getting ties up} 31. Bg7 Rg8 32. Bf6 Qc7 33. Nf4 {Wins the exchange.} Nxf6 34.
Nxg6 Nxg4+ 35. hxg4 Rxg6 36. Bh3 Nc6 37. Rf6 Ne7 38. Rxg6 Nxg6 39. g5 b5 40.
Bg4 a5 41. Kg3 Kb7 42. Bh5 Ka6 43. Qf2 b4 $2 {Fatally opening the position.}
44. cxb4 axb4 45. Bxg6 fxg6 46. Qf8 Qb8 47. Ra1+ 1-0

