9. O-O-O b6 10. Bd3 a5 11. Nge2 Na6 12. Rdg1 Nf6 13. Bh6 Nc5 14. Bxg7 Kxg7 15.
h3 Nxd3+ ({I fancied} 15... fxe4 16. Nxe4 ({However White can play} 16. Bxe4 {
therefore take the Bishop first.}) 16... Nxd3+ 17. Qxd3 Bf5 18. Qe3 Bxe4 19.
fxe4 Nh5 $17) 16. Qxd3 fxe4 17. fxe4 Nh5 18. g4 Nf4 19. Nxf4 Rxf4 20. Ne2 Rf2
