Rf1 Qg2 ({If} 24... Qc5 25. b3 Rf8 26. Rxf8 Kxf8 27. Qf3+ Kg7 28. g5 $16) 25.
Kb1 Rf8 26. b3 {I had expected him to exchange.} Rf2 27. Rxf2 Qxf2 28. Ne2 Qf1+
29. Kb2 Bc8 30. Qe3 Qg2 31. Ka3 Bd7 32. Nc3 h6 33. Nd1 Qc2 {With thoughts of ..
....a5} 34. Nc3 Qg2 35. Qd3 $5 h5 {Winning a Pawn.} 36. gxh5 gxh5 37. Nb5 Qxh3
38. Qc2 Qe3 39. Nxc7 $4 {A complete oversight.} ({Expecting maybe} 39. Qg2+ Kh7
40. Qh2 Bxb5 41. cxb5 ({or} 41. Qxh5+) 41... Qxe4 42. Qxh5+ Kg7 43. Qg5+ Kf7 {
etc.}) 39... Qc5+ 40. Kb2 Qxc7 41. Qg2+ Bg4 42. Qf2 Qc5 43. Qh4 Kg6 44. Qd8
Qf2+ 45. Ka3 Qf6 46. Qxb6 h4 47. Qxa5 h3 {10 APA A6 1973 Collins 10.5 Archer}
0-1

