{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 {[4']} e6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 c5 4. c3 Nc6 5.
Nf3 Qb6 6. Bd3 Bd7 7. O-O cxd4 8. cxd4 Nxd4 {Quite playable according to M.C.O.
11} 9. Nxd4 Qxd4 10. Nc3 a6 {M.C.O.11 gives this a !} 11. Re1 {M.C.O.gives
only the following....} (11. Qe2) (11. Kh1) 11... Qh4 {[25']} 12. Qf3 Bb4 13.
Bd2 Bc6 14. g3 Qd8 15. Qg4 Bf8 {Compare developments! Black's position isn't
too bad though.} 16. Bg5 Qb6 {[50'] Black's KS is OK as it is.} 17. Re2 {[50']}
Qb4 18. Qf3 {[57']} Rc8 {[55']} 19. a3 {[59']} Qb3 {[65']} 20. Rc1 {[62']} h6 {
[75']} 21. Qh5 $6 {[70']} d4 $6 {[86']} ({If} 21... g6 22. Bxg6 fxg6 23. Qxg6+
Kd7 {Black is probably OK. However I was short of time so I felt that I could
do better with a move that has been in the offing for a while.}) 22. Bc2 {[80']
} Qxb2 $2 {[87'] I saw now that White can play 23.Bg6 and intended 23......
Qxa3. I felt that after 24.Bxf7+ Kd7 White was lost.} ({Much better is} 22...
Qc4 {with various threats.}) 23. Bg6 (23. Bg6 Qxa3 24. Bxf7+ Kd7 {I now saw
that White can play} 25. Bxe6+ {and Black has had it} Kxe6 26. Qg4+ {What to
do?}) 23... hxg5 {[108'] After 21' thought. I now have only 12' for 25 moves!
I felt that I must be lost with so little time. The move played is the best
chance giving up the Queen for three pieces,} 24. Bxf7+ Ke7 25. Qxg5+ Kxf7 26.
Rxb2 dxc3 {[111']} 27. Rxc3 {[86']} Ne7 {[112']} 28. Rd2 Nf5 29. Qf4 Be7 30.
Rdc2 g5 31. Qc1 Rxh2 $1 {Finding the best move despite the rush.} 32. Rxc6 ({
naturally not} 32. Kxh2 $4 {and he is mated.}) 32... Rch8 {[114']} 33. Rc7 Rh1+
{Here I offered a draw and he agreed. I view of my time trouble he probably
should have continued. An exiting start to the season.} 1/2-1/2

