{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 c5 4. c3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Qb6 {
Looks familiar} 6. b3 $6 ({Better first is} 6. Be2 {then} Z0 7. O-O) 6... cxd4
7. cxd4 Bb4+ 8. Bd2 $6 Nxd4 9. Bxb4 $6 {Better moves are difficult to find.} ({
e.g.} 9. Bd3 Nxf3+ 10. Qxf3 Qd4) 9... Nxf3+ 10. Qxf3 Qxb4+ 11. Nd2 ({If} 11.
Qc3 Qe4+) 11... Qd4 12. Rc1 {[54']} ({I had expected} 12. Bb5+) 12... Qxe5+ 13.
Be2 Nf6 {[15']} 14. O-O Bd7 15. Rc2 O-O 16. Re1 $2 {Pinning his Bishop.} Rac8 {
[23']} 17. Rxc8 {[40']} Rxc8 {[23']} 18. Qe3 {[41'] White seemed to want to
get it over with.} Qxe3 19. fxe3 Rc2 {[24']} 20. Nf3 Rxa2 21. Ne5 Rc2 22. Bd1 {
[46']} Rc1 {[30']} 23. Kf2 Ne4+ 24. Kf1 Bb5+ 25. Be2 Bxe2+ 26. Kxe2 Rc2+ {[34']
} 27. Kd3 {Putting an end to it.} Rd2# {No problems there.} 0-1

