{Time limit 20mph} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 {For the 4th time in 8 games.} c5 4.
c3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Qb6 6. Be2 f6 7. O-O Bd7 8. Na3 $6 cxd4 9. cxd4 fxe5 10. dxe5
Bxa3 11. bxa3 Nge7 12. Be3 Qc7 13. Bf4 O-O 14. Bg3 Nf5 15. Qc2 Rac8 16. Rac1 {
[15']} Qa5 {[18']} 17. Qb2 Nxg3 18. fxg3 {Having got the worst of the opening
White hopes for play on the f-file} Rc7 19. Bd3 Nd8 20. Ng5 Rxf1+ 21. Rxf1 Qc5+
22. Kh1 {From now on White is plagued by back-rank mating possibilities.} h6
23. Nh7 $6 {His best hope.} Nf7 24. Qe2 Bb5 {The most active course.} 25. Nf6+
gxf6 26. Bxb5 fxe5 {After much thought. If} (26... f5 27. g4 {is a nuisance.})
27. Be8 $1 Kf8 {Again after much thought.7 I Thought that this gave him a draw
but could find nothing better.} 28. Ba4 $2 {Now he's lost. Correct is...} ({
....} 28. Bxf7 Rxf7 29. Rxf7+ Kxf7 30. Qh5+ Ke7 31. Qxh6 $1 {Wheh his Queen
prevents mat on c1.}) 28... Qc4 29. Qd1 e4 {The centre Pawns win.} 30. Bb3 Qd3
31. Qe1 Kg7 32. Qf2 Qc3 33. Qf4 {[50']} Qe5 {[94']} 34. Qg4+ Kh7 35. Qe2 d4 36.
Rd1 d3 37. Qd2 Qg5 38. Qf2 d2 39. Rf1 e3 40. Qe2 Ne5 41. Kg1 ({If} 41. Bxe6 Rc1
) 41... Rf7 42. Bd1 ({If} 42. Rxf7+ Nxf7 43. Bxe6 Qg6 $1) 42... Rxf1+ 43. Kxf1
Qf5+ 44. Kg1 Nc4 $1 {Neatest. Black cannot prevent 45.Nb2. He takes the
quicker way out.} 45. Qxc4 Qf2+ 46. Kh1 Qe1+ 0-1

