{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5.
Nc3 Nc6 6. Bg5 a6 $2 {Leads to trouble} 7. Nxc6 dxc6 $2 {Now I win a Pawn.} ({
Relatively better was.} 7... bxc6) 8. Qxd8+ Kxd8 9. e5 h6 10. Bxf6+ gxf6 11.
exf6 Rg8 {[6']} 12. O-O-O+ {[10']} Bd7 13. g3 Kc7 14. Bh3 Rd8 15. Rd3 Rg6 16.
Ne4 Bc8 17. Rxd8 Kxd8 18. f4 {To prevent 18......e5} h5 19. Rd1+ Kc7 $2 {
Although he was no doubt lost anyway, this move leaving his (f)Bishop and
f-Pawn undefended hastens the end.} 20. Ng5 $1 {Were his King on e8 this would
be unplayable.} e5 $6 {After some thought if......} (20... Rxf6 21. Nh7 Rh6 22.
Nxf8 Rh8 23. Nxe6+) 21. Bxc8 Kxc8 22. Nxf7 Bh6 {Giving up. If.....} (22... Rxf6
23. Rd8+ Kc7 24. Rxf8 {and if say...} exf4 25. gxf4 Rxf4 26. Nd8 $1 Rxf8 27.
Ne6+) 23. Nxh6 Rxh6 24. fxe5 Rh8 25. e6 Rd8 26. f7 {Lancaster A won the match
5 - 2 Played at Morecambe Chess Club} 1-0

