{Time limit 20mph} 1. c4 Nf6 2. d4 e6 3. g3 Be7 4. Bg2 O-O 5. e4 d6 6. Ne2 Nbd7
7. O-O e5 8. Nbc3 a6 9. h3 h6 {Black plays very passivly and White gets big
advantage in space.} 10. f4 exd4 11. Nxd4 Re8 12. a4 Bf8 {All very slow.} 13.
Rb1 Nc5 14. Re1 a5 15. b3 Rb8 16. Rb2 Bd7 {Black can't find a plan.} 17. Rbe2
Qc8 18. Kh2 Bc6 19. Ba3 {Threatening to treble his c-Pawns} Ne6 $2 {Probably
the decisive error. Better was....} ({....} 19... Ncd7) ({or} 19... Na6) 20.
Nxc6 bxc6 21. e5 {Winning a Pawn} dxe5 22. Bxf8 Rxf8 23. fxe5 Nh5 ({If} 23...
Rd8 24. Rd2) 24. Rd2 Rxb3 $4 {A complete oversight. However, he was lost
anyway.} 25. Qxb3 Ng5 {Playing on a few moves.} 26. Qd1 g6 27. h4 Ne6 28. Bxc6
Nhg7 29. Nd5 Kh8 30. Nf6 Nc5 31. Qf3 Qa6 $2 32. Qe3 {Winning another piece.
Colin Fisher is blind and uses a braille set. He won section II last year.} 1-0

