{Time limit 20mph} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 Nf6 3. Bg2 c6 4. Nf3 e4 5. Nd4 Bc5 6. Nb3 Be7
7. c5 {Attempting to prevent him supporting his e-Pawn with .......d5. I
thought he might play .......b6} d5 {Preffering straigntforward development.}
8. cxd6 Bxd6 9. Nc3 Qe7 10. d4 {or else I get a bit cramped.} exd3 11. Qxd3 O-O
12. O-O Ng4 (12... Nbd7 $142) 13. Ne4 Bc7 ({I had expected} 13... Rd8) 14. Bg5
$1 {A useful move provoking 14......f6 and thus giving him problems in a few
moves.} f6 15. Bd2 Rd8 16. Qc2 Bf5 17. Bc3 Na6 18. Nd4 ({and not} 18. Nxf6+ $4
Qxf6) 18... Bg6 $2 {Overlooking my next moves.} 19. h3 {Hoping he wuld put the
Knight on e5 thus blocking his Queens attack on my Knight after my next move.}
Nh6 20. Qb3+ Nf7 (20... Kh8 {would prevent problems of a similar nature.}) 21.
Qxb7 Bxe4 22. Qxa6 ({I didn't like} 22. Bxe4 Qxe4 23. Qxa6 Rxd4) 22... Bxg2 ({
Interesting and worrying for me at the time is} 22... Rxd4 23. Bxd4 Bxg2 24.
Kxg2 Qe4+ 25. Kh2 Qxd4 26. Qxc6 Qd8 27. Rfd1 Qc8 28. Rac1) 23. Kxg2 Qe4+ 24. f3
({I felt that} 24. Nf3 {was rather inactive.....}) ({...and I didn't like as I
was still not too happy about.....} 24. Kh2 Rxd4) 24... Qe5 25. f4 Qe4+ 26. Nf3
Bb6 27. Kh2 Rd5 ({I was worried about moves like.} 27... g5) 28. Nd2 Qg6 29. e4
{I felt better now.} Rh5 $6 {Active but risky} 30. Qe2 Nh6 31. Kg2 Rh4 $4 {
The last move before the adjourning. It loses a Rook. [I sealed]} 32. f5 {
Adjourned. The game commenced on 23/11/73} Qh5 33. Qc4+ Kh8 34. gxh4 Qxh4 35.
Nf3 Qh5 36. Bd4 Bc7 37. Qxc6 Rc8 38. Qd7 Qe8 39. Qxe8+ Rxe8 40. Rac1 Bb8 41.
Rc6 1-0

