{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. c4 e5 2. Nc3 f5 3. g3 Nf6 4. Bg2 Bc5 5. e3
e4 6. d3 exd3 7. Qxd3 d6 8. Nf3 O-O 9. O-O Nc6 10. b3 Kh8 {Biding my time.} 11.
Bb2 Be6 12. Rad1 Qe8 ({If} 12... Qe7 13. Nd4 {is a nuisance.}) 13. a3 a5 14.
Nb5 Bb6 15. Nbd4 Ne4 $6 16. Nxe6 Qxe6 17. Nd4 Bxd4 $2 {Doubtful.} 18. exd4 $1
d5 $6 {Loses a Pawn.} 19. Rde1 Qd7 20. cxd5 Qxd5 21. Bxe4 fxe4 22. Rxe4 Rae8
23. Rfe1 Rxe4 24. Rxe4 h6 ({If} 24... Qf5 25. Rf4) 25. Qe3 Kh7 26. Re6 $2 Rf3 {
Uninspired stuff due mainly to the ill-feeling and upset caused by pre-match
team-order problems.} 1/2-1/2

