{Time limit 20mph} 1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. Be3 Bg4 6. Be2
O-O 7. Nd2 Bxe2 8. Qxe2 Nbd7 9. f4 e5 10. O-O-O Qe7 11. g4 $5 {All out KS
attack but a little loosening.} c6 ({I now thought about} 11... Nxg4 12. Qxg4
exd4 {but} 13. Nd5 {hence my next move.}) 12. h4 ({Not worried about} 12. g5
Nh5) 12... h5 {Taking the sting out of the KS advance.} 13. gxh5 Nxh5 14. f5 $2
{Too impetuous} exd4 {In his haste to break open the KS he had apparently
overlooked this. He immediately decided that he's lost a piece and after about
one seconds thought, played.} 15. Bxd4 $2 ({A better chance was} 15. Bg5 {
with the possibility of some complications after} f6 ({However easier for
Black is} 15... Qe8 $1 16. Na4 b5)) 15... Bxd4 16. Qf3 Qf6 17. Nb3 Ne5 18. Qe2
Bxc3 19. bxc3 Ng3 0-1

