1. d4 e6 2. e3 c5 3. c3 b6 4. Nd2 Bb7 5. Ngf3 Qc7 6. Bd3 f5 {Active stuff is
called for against this opponent.} 7. O-O Nf6 8. h3 {[8']} Be7 {[3']} 9. Ne5 d6
{Too impulsive played without a thought.} 10. Bb5+ Nbd7 $5 (10... Kf8 {may be
more prudent.}) 11. Bxd7+ Nxd7 12. Qh5+ $6 {Wins a Pawn, but very dangerous.}
g6 13. Nxg6 Nf6 14. Qh6 Rg8 15. Nh4 Kd7 $6 {Too casual. I was convinced I was
in a completely won position.} (15... O-O-O $142) 16. f3 Nd5 {Starting to go
right off the rails.} 17. e4 Ne3 {There was little else. If............} ({
.........} 17... Qd8 18. exd5 {Threatens the e-Pawn.}) 18. Qxe3 Bxh4 19. exf5
$1 {Now I'm in a terrible mess, I have no good move.} Rae8 20. Qf4 Qd8 21. dxc5
bxc5 22. Ne4 Kc7 $2 {Fuzzy thinking. I was right off form. I had seen 23.Nxc5
but assumed that I could play 23......e5. Too late I saw 24.Ne6+ RxN and 25.
Qc4+} 23. Nxc5 Bg5 (23... e5 24. Ne6+ Rxe6 25. Qc4+) 24. Nxe6+ Rxe6 25. Qc4+
Kb8 26. fxe6 Qb6+ 27. Qd4 Qc7 28. Bxg5 Rxg5 29. Rad1 d5 30. c4 Qg3 31. Rf2 Qxh3
32. Qf4+ {Rubbish. Completly off form.} 1-0

