{Time limit 30 movesin 1hr 15'} 1. d4 f5 {I was expecting him to play the
Stonewall so I was ready for his next move.} 2. f4 b6 3. Nf3 Bb7 4. e3 Nf6 5.
Nbd2 e6 6. Bd3 Be7 7. O-O d6 8. Qe2 {Threatening e4.} Ne4 9. Bc4 Qd7 10. Nxe4
$2 {Leaving his centre transfixed. I felt on top now.} fxe4 11. Ng5 d5 12. Bb3
(12. Qh5+ {Simply loses a piece.}) 12... a5 {I have the initiative now.} 13. c4
$6 (13. a3 {was the alternative}) ({Not} 13. c3 $2 a4 14. Bc2 Ba6) 13... Ba6
14. a4 O-O 15. Qg4 Bxg5 16. fxg5 Rxf1+ 17. Kxf1 Qc6 18. Kg1 dxc4 19. Ba2 ({
I had expected} 19. Bc2 Bb7) 19... Nd7 20. Bb1 Bb7 21. Ra3 Rf8 22. Rc3 e5 {
Positive action in the centre is needed or else I just lose the c-Pawn} 23. b3
exd4 24. Rxc4 $2 {Overlooking my reply.} Ba6 {wins outright.} 25. Bxe4 Bxc4 26.
bxc4 Qxc4 27. Qd1 Nc5 ({Not} 27... dxe3 $4 28. Bd5+) 28. Bc2 d3 29. Bb1 Rd8 30.
Ba3 Qxa4 31. Qxa4 Nxa4 32. Ba2+ Kh8 33. Bb3 b5 34. Kf2 d2 35. Ke2 Nc3+ 1-0

