1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nb3 Be6 7. Bg5 Nc6 8.
Qd2 a5 {Discouraging 9.O-O-O. However 8......a6 would have been more prudent.}
9. Rd1 Bxb3 $2 {Uncalled for. It weakens his centre and causes White no bother.
} 10. axb3 Nd4 $2 {Trying to block the d-file but to no avail.} 11. Bxf6 Qxf6 (
11... gxf6 {may have turned out better.}) 12. Nd5 Qd8 13. c3 Nc6 ({Both} 13...
Nxb3) ({and} 13... Ne6 {lose to} 14. Bb5+) 14. Bb5 {[14']} Rc8 15. O-O {
Leaving Black stuck for a move.} Be7 {[19'] Giving up a Pawn but what else was
there?} 16. Nxe7 Qxe7 17. Qxd6 {[16']} Qxd6 {[20']} 18. Rxd6 O-O 19. Rfd1 {
White has a comfertable win now. Black hastens the end.} f5 $2 {Losing a Pawn.}
20. exf5 Rxf5 $2 {No, the exchange.} 21. Bc4+ Kf8 $4 {No a Rook. Lancaster A
won 5.5 - 1.5} 1-0

