1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 d5 4. exd5 Qxd5 $2 {Leaves him way behind in
development.} 5. Nc3 Qd8 6. Bc4 Nh6 $2 {Unnecessary panic. He had visions of
sacrifices on f7.} 7. O-O Nc6 8. d4 Be7 9. Bxf4 {Black is really in a state
now.} Bg4 10. Bxh6 {Simplest.} gxh6 11. Bxf7+ ({I considered} 11. d5 Bc5+ {
etc. but the text move is the most straightforward.}) 11... Kxf7 12. Ne5+ Ke8
13. Qxg4 Qxd4+ 14. Qxd4 Nxd4 15. Nd5 Rc8 {He has no good move.} 16. c3 Nb5 17.
Rae1 {Threatening 18.NxB} Bc5+ 18. Kh1 Rg8 {Losing outright but the only
alternative was to resign.} 19. Nf6+ Kf8 20. Ned7+ Kg7 21. Nxg8 Kxg8 22. Nxc5
Nd6 23. Re7 Rd8 24. Rg7+ Kh8 25. Ne6 Re8 26. Re7 Kg8 27. Rxe8+ Nxe8 28. Rf8# {
The game took only ~1hr.} 1-0

