{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 6 moves per 15'} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 {
For the 5th time this season.} c5 4. Nf3 Nc6 5. c3 {[5']} Qb6 {[0']} 6. Be2 {
[9']} cxd4 {[2'] I played very quickly in an attempt to obtain a win in the
short match time available.} 7. cxd4 Bb4+ 8. Nc3 Nge7 9. a3 {[20']} Bxc3+ 10.
bxc3 Bd7 {[4']} 11. O-O Na5 {[6'] I was a long way up on time but playing too
quickly.} 12. Qc2 {[32']} Rc8 13. Rb1 Qc7 {[8']} 14. Bd2 Nc4 $6 {Trying too
hard to win quickly. Better to consolidate first.} 15. Bxc4 dxc4 16. Ng5 {
Rather a nuisance. Threatening 17.Ne4 18.Nd6} f5 $6 {Dkating on very thin ice
in an attempt to work up some play.} (16... f6 {Was O.K}) 17. exf6 gxf6 18. Ne4
{[51']} Bc6 {[21']} ({I had intended....} 18... Kf7 {but now saw..} 19. Rxb7 $1
) 19. Nxf6+ Kf7 20. Ng4 Nf5 21. Ne5+ Kf8 ({I had intended} 21... Ke7 {but
didn't like} 22. Bg5+) 22. Nxc6 Qxc6 23. Rfe1 Rg8 $2 {Still rushing on, White
being in time trouble. If I'd gone just a little slower I'd have seen his next
move before I'd played mine, instead of just after.} 24. Qe4 Nh4 $1 {The last
chance.} 25. Bh6+ Ke8 26. Qxe6+ Qxe6 27. Rxe6+ Kd8 28. g3 b6 29. Kf1 Nf3 30. h4
$2 {With seconds to spare but weakening his b-Pawn. Better to let the h-Pawn
go.} Kd7 31. Re2 ({Possibly better was} 31. Rf6) 31... Rg6 {I was still
playing fast as he was short of time.} 32. Bf4 Rg4 33. Rb5 Rcg8 {Threat 34.....
..RxB} 34. Re4 $2 {Another time trouble error.} Nd2+ {Much relieved!} 35. Bxd2
{Trying too hard and too fast. Bailrigg Bishop are the University B team.}
1/2-1/2

