6. Bd3 cxd4 7. cxd4 Bd7 8. O-O Nxd4 9. Nxd4 Qxd4 10. Nc3 a6 11. Re1 Qh4 {
The second time this season that I've been in this position against this
opponent. [Game 21 Book 16]} 12. a3 ({In he other game he played.} 12. Qf3)
12... Qd8 13. Be3 Bc6 14. Bd4 Ne7 15. f4 g6 {Obviously to prevent 16.f5} 16.
Bf2 {Playing it careful.} ({I envisioned as possible something like} 16. g4 h5
