{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 g6 3. Bg2 Bg7 4. Nc3 c6 5. e4 {
Expecting to be able to force the d-Pawn to d4 in due course.} Nh6 {Black
decides that ......f5 is to be the freeing move.} 6. Nge2 O-O 7. d3 {A change
of plan I have thoughts of f4.} d6 8. Be3 (8. h3 {First may be best.}) 8... Ng4
9. Qd2 Nd7 ({Positive action in the form of} 9... f5 {seems best.}) 10. O-O-O
Nxe3 11. Qxe3 Nf6 ({I would still prefer} 11... f5) 12. h3 Be6 13. Kb1 Qc7 14.
g4 a6 {Black's manoeuvering is a bit slow.} 15. f4 c5 $2 {Very doubtful
allowing me to make progress on the KS and leaving a big hole on d5.} 16. f5
Bd7 $2 {Fatal losing a piece for two Pawns.} (16... gxf5 {Wasn't too exciting
either.}) 17. g5 Ne8 18. f6 Bxf6 (18... Bh8 $4 19. Nd5 Qd8 20. Ne7+ {Was to be
avoided.}) 19. Nd5 Qd8 20. gxf6 Nxf6 21. Nxf6+ Qxf6 22. Rdf1 Qd8 23. h4 b5 24.
Nc3 Be6 25. Bh3 {Best.} b4 26. Nd5 Bxd5 27. cxd5 h5 ({Not} 27... Qxh4 $2 28.
Bf5 $1 Qe7 29. Qh6 f6 30. Bxg6) 28. Qg3 Kh7 29. Rhg1 Qc7 30. Be6 $1 {The
quickest.} fxe6 ({If} 30... Ra7 31. Bxf7 Rxf7 32. Qxg6+ {and mates.}) (30...
Kh8 31. Qg5) (30... Kg7 31. Bxf7 Rxf7 32. Qxg6+ Kf8 33. Qg8+) 31. Qxg6+ Kh8 32.
Qh6+ {My 6th game in consecutive days.} 1-0

