{Time limit 24mph} 1. e4 c5 {I knew that he liked to play against the Fench.}
2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 g6 5. Nc3 Bg7 6. Be3 Nc6 7. Bb5 {A little unusual.
} Bd7 8. Qd2 a6 9. Ba4 Nf6 10. Bb3 Ng4 11. Nf3 Nxe3 12. Qxe3 Qa5 13. O-O h6 {
After some thought. f2 was a bit weak and .......Ng4 was a nuisance in some
variations.} 14. h3 Rc8 15. Rad1 Bxc3 {I was loathe to give up the Bishop but
I felt that my position was fairly solid and that I would get a good endgame.}
16. bxc3 Ne5 17. Nxe5 Qxe5 18. c4 Bc6 {[52'] I was a bit worried about time
now.} 19. Rfe1 g5 {To prevent 20.f4} 20. Qf3 O-O {[57']} 21. Qh5 Kg7 22. Rd3 f6
{Solid but leaving the White squares vulnerable.} 23. h4 a5 {Threatening 24....
..a4} 24. hxg5 hxg5 $6 {Played with seconds to spare.} (24... fxg5 {May be
better with} 25. Z0 Rf6 {as a good defensive ,ove.}) 25. c5 $1 {His best
chance.} Be8 26. Qg4 Rxc5 27. Rh3 Rc3 28. g3 Bg6 29. Kg2 $2 ({The move that I
was worried about was} 29. Be6 {preventing my Rook coming back to c8.}) 29...
Rcc8 30. Bd5 Rh8 31. Reh1 Rxh3 32. Qxc8 $2 {Miscalculating. Now he's lost} (32.
Rxh3 $142 {When Black can't play} Rh8 33. Rxh8 Kxh8 34. Qc8+ Kg7 35. Qg8+ {etc.
}) 32... Bxe4+ 33. Kxh3 {Ending it quickly but he was lost anyway. After.....}
({....} 33. Bxe4 Rxh1 $1) 33... Bf5+ {A good game.} 1-0

