{Time limit 24mph} 1. e4 e6 {I was unwell when this game was played and unable
to concentrate. Since I had to play I decided to play solidly and if it were a
draw I would have White in the replay.} 2. d4 d5 3. e5 {What else this season?}
c5 4. c3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Qb6 6. Be2 f5 {Double edged.} 7. O-O Bd7 8. Qd3 cxd4 9.
cxd4 Rc8 10. a3 Na5 11. b4 Nc4 12. Nbd2 Nxd2 13. Bxd2 Ne7 14. Rfc1 Rxc1+ 15.
Rxc1 Nc6 16. Qb5 $5 {White was also playing for a draw, apparently to improve
his grading.} Qxb5 {I decided to play safe as my concentration was below par.}
({I gave much thought to} 16... Nxd4 {but like neither...} 17. Qxb6 ({nor} 17.
Nxd4 $6) 17... Nxf3+ (17... Nxe2+ 18. Kf1 axb6 {my QS Pawns are weak.}) 18.
gxf3 axb6 19. Rc7) 17. Bxb5 Be7 18. Bg5 {Still trying to exchange.} a6 ({If} 
18... Bxg5 19. Nxg5 Nxe5 {is prevented by} 20. Rc8+) 19. Bxe7 Kxe7 20. Bxc6
Bxc6 21. Nd2 Kd7 22. Nb3 b6 23. f4 Ba4 24. Nd2 h6 25. h4 Rg8 26. Nf3 Rc8 {
Now the game peters out.} 27. Rxc8 Kxc8 28. Kf2 Kd7 29. Ke3 Kc6 30. Kd3 Bb5+
31. Kc3 Be2 32. Nd2 Kb5 33. Kb3 Bd1+ 34. Kb2 Kc6 35. Nb1 Kb5 {He offered a
draw which I accepted} 1/2-1/2

