{Time limit 24mph} 1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qa5 4. Nf3 Bg4 5. h3 Bxf3 6.
Qxf3 c6 7. d4 Nf6 8. Bd2 e6 9. Qg3 Qb6 10. O-O-O {Sharp play despite the fact
I was ill with Gastro-Enteritis and felt even worse than in the game last week.
} Nbd7 11. Be3 Nd5 12. Ne4 Qc7 $5 {He admitted that he was playing for a draw.
This move gives White a very good game.} 13. Qxc7 Nxc7 14. Bf4 Nd5 15. Nd6+
Bxd6 16. Bxd6 O-O-O 17. Bg3 N7f6 18. Bh4 Rhg8 {I was a little surprised by
this.} 19. c4 Nf4 20. Bg5 Ng6 ({Not} 20... N4h5 21. g4) 21. f3 h6 22. Be3 Nh5
23. Bf2 Rd6 24. g3 e5 $2 25. c5 $1 Rd7 26. Bd3 {Coming into the game at last.}
Ne7 27. dxe5 g5 $2 28. Bc4 Nd5 29. h4 {Probably not the best method.} Ng7 ({Not
} 29... gxh4 30. Rxh4 Nxg3 $4 31. Rg1) 30. hxg5 hxg5 31. Rh7 Kd8 32. a3 Ke7 33.
f4 gxf4 34. gxf4 Nf5 ({Not} 34... Nxf4 $4 35. Bh4+ Ke8 36. Bxf7+ Rxf7 37. Rd8#)
35. Re1 {Doubtful.} Ke6 36. Bd3 $2 {Giving it away.} Nxf4 {We now adjourned.}
37. Bc4+ {[Sealed move] The game resumed on 23/4/74} ({I had intended} 37.
Bxf5+ Kxf5 38. e6 {but after} Nxe6 {I have nothing.}) 37... Nd5 38. Bd3 Nfe7 ({
Hoping for..} 38... Rg2 39. Bxf5+ Kxf5 40. e6) 39. Rh6+ Ng6 40. Rh5 Nde7 41.
Bc4+ Nd5 {'Average' play on my part, mainly due to ill health. Good play early
on} 1/2-1/2

