1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Bd3 c5 4. Nf3 dxe4 5. Bxe4 Nf6 6. Bg5 $2 Qa5+ 7. Bd2 Qb6
8. dxc5 $5 Bxc5 9. Nc3 Bxf2+ 10. Kf1 Bc5 11. Bd3 Bd7 12. Ne4 Nxe4 13. Bxe4 Bb5+
14. Bd3 Bxd3+ 15. cxd3 Nc6 16. Rc1 Rd8 17. Ke2 O-O 18. Re1 Rd5 19. Kf1 Rxd3 20.
Qe2 Rd5 21. Bc3 Nd4 22. Bxd4 Bxd4 23. Qc4 Be3 24. Rc3 Rc5 25. Qe4 Rxc3 26. bxc3
Qb5+ $4 {Rubbish. Playing too quickly and casually.} 27. c4 Qb2 28. Rxe3 Qxa2
29. Ng5 g6 30. h4 Rc8 {White now seemed to be in a complete quandry. He
thought for ages, ran short of time (to move 36) and eventually played a
hurried....} 31. Qxb7 Qxc4+ 32. Kf2 $2 Qxh4+ 33. Rg3 Rc2+ 34. Kf1 {Finishes it
quickly.} Qh1# 0-1

