{Time limit 24mph} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 c5 3. Nf3 {Preffering a Sicillian than a
Benoni set up with 3.d5} cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. Nc3 Qc7 6. Bd3 Nc6 7. Nxc6 $5 bxc6
8. Be3 ({I felt that} 8. g3 Z0 9. Bf4 {might be good for White.}) 8... d5 9.
O-O Nf6 ({If} 9... Bd6 10. f4 {is good for White}) 10. a3 Be7 {I thought that
the Bishop may get a good post on f6 eventually} 11. f4 {His best chance of
attack.} c5 12. exd5 ({After} 12. e5 Nd7 {White caan make little progress and
Black would have the better of it.}) 12... exd5 13. Na4 $2 {Probably the
losing move.} (13. Bd2 $142) 13... d4 14. Bd2 Bb7 {Already threatening to win
the Knight by ......Qc6} 15. c3 Rd8 {Best bringing pressure to bear on the
d-file} (15... c4 16. Be2 d3 {is much too rash}) 16. cxd4 Rxd4 {Crushing.} 17.
Bc3 {Loses a piece but there is no alternative.} ({If} 17. Bc2 Qd7 18. Rf2 Ng4
19. Re2 Ne3 {wins}) 17... Qc6 18. Rf3 Qxa4 {White could now resign but plays a
few more rapid moves to the time control.} 19. Qxa4+ Rxa4 20. Re3 Nd5 21. Re4
Nxc3 22. Rxe7+ Kxe7 23. bxc3 Rd8 24. Re1+ Kf6 {Having recovered from my
illness I played well in this game to regain the Silver knight.} 0-1

