{Time limit 1hr 10' each for all moves.} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 Bc5 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. Nc3
d6 5. b4 Bd4 6. Bb2 Nc6 7. Qb3 {[2']} Be6 {[15'] Already getting behind on
time. With the 70' time allocation these games have to be played fast.} 8. e3
Bb6 9. a4 {One has to play actively in these fast games.} a5 10. b5 Nb4 11.
Bxb7 {Not too worried about 11.......Nd3+} Rb8 ({An alternative was} 11... Nd3+
12. Kf1 Rb8 13. Bc6+ Bd7 {etc.}) 12. Bd5 Nfxd5 13. Nxd5 Bxd5 {leaving White
with a strong bind on the QS.} 14. cxd5 Qg5 15. Ba3 Bc5 16. Rc1 Rb7 17. Qc4 {
[18']} O-O {[37']} 18. Ne2 Qf5 19. Bxb4 Bxb4 20. Nc3 {[21']} Ba3 ({If} 20...
Qf3 21. Qe4) 21. Rd1 Bb4 22. O-O Qf3 {To prevent 23.f5} 23. Qe4 Qh5 24. f4 {
Mainly to counteract any KS advance by Black.} f5 25. Qc4 {[26']} Bc5 $2 {
[48'] Worried by the clock he hurries and blunders.} 26. fxe5 {[27']} dxe5 $2 {
Still hurrying, he leaves the Bishop en prise. He was lost anyway after e6.}
27. Qxc5 Rf6 28. Qe7 g5 {Losing interest} 29. Qxf6 Rb6 30. Qxf5 1-0

