{Time limit 1hr 15' each for all moves.} 1. d4 f5 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. g3 Bg7
5. Bg2 O-O 6. Nf3 d6 7. O-O c6 8. Bg5 h6 9. Bd2 Nbd7 10. Re1 {[7']} e5 {[7']}
11. d5 c5 12. e4 fxe4 13. Nxe4 Nxe4 14. Rxe4 Nf6 15. Re1 {[18']} Bg4 {[13']}
16. Qc2 Bf5 17. Qc1 Kh7 18. Nh4 Qd7 19. Nxf5 gxf5 $2 {Too risky but we were
playing very fast.} 20. Qc2 {This pin is more of a nuisance than I expected.}
Kh8 21. Bh3 Ng8 22. f4 {[29']} Qf7 {[29']} 23. fxe5 Bxe5 24. Bc3 Qh5 {I was
unhappy here.} 25. Bg2 Qg4 26. Qd3 Qg7 27. Bxe5 dxe5 28. Qc3 e4 29. Qxg7+ Kxg7
30. Rad1 Nf6 31. h3 h5 32. Re3 Rae8 33. a3 {He offered a draw which I accepted.
The first game of the season, rather rusty, and played very fast becuase of
the time limit. The match was a tie 5.5 each.} 1/2-1/2

