{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3
Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 Ne7 7. Nf3 Nbc6 8. a4 Qa5 {Else 9.Ba3 gives White an edge.} 9.
Bd2 Qc7 10. Bd3 Bd7 11. O-O h6 (11... O-O $2 {Would be suicide}) ({I had
thoughts of} 11... c4 12. Be2 O-O-O {but} 13. Bg5 {or 13.Ng5 are a nuisance.} (
13. Ng5)) 12. Re1 Na5 13. Bc1 {After much thought and a good move intending 14.
Ba3} Rc8 14. Ba3 b6 {[28]} 15. Nd2 {[53']} Bxa4 $5 {[35'] Mixing it, but
played without due consideration. I missed his 17th move.} 16. dxc5 bxc5 17.
Qg4 {A bit of a problem now.} Bd7 18. Qxg7 Rg8 19. Qf6 (19. Qxh6 $142) 19...
Ng6 20. Nf3 Qd8 21. Qxd8+ Kxd8 22. Bc1 Nc6 23. Bxh6 Ra8 24. Bxg6 {After which
he no longer has a passed Pawn.} ({I had expected} 24. Ra6) 24... fxg6 25. Be3
c4 26. Nd4 a6 ({Not} 26... Nxe5 $4 27. Bg5+) 27. Nxc6+ Bxc6 28. Reb1 Kd7 ({Not
} 28... Bb5 $4 29. Rxb5) 29. Kf1 {[73']} Bb5 {[65']} 30. Ke1 {[74']} Raf8 {
All the other games were finished and I needed a draw to win the match.} 31.
Bd4 Rh8 32. h3 Rf5 33. Ke2 Rh4 {The Rest won the match 6.5 - 5.5} 1/2-1/2

