{Time limit 24 mph} 1. e4 {I arrived 30' late after a round trip to Harwell.}
e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 {For the first time in my life.} Nf6 4. d4 d6 5. Bc4 Nxe4
6. dxe5 $2 {Doubtful.} (6. Bd5 $142 {and if} Nf6 7. Bxc6+ bxc6 8. dxe5 dxe5 9.
Qxd8+ Kxd8 10. Nxe5 {Wins a Pawn.}) 6... dxe5 7. Qa4 $2 {Too casual against a
young opponent.} (7. Bd5 $142) 7... Bd7 $2 {Now he's in trouble.} (7... Nc5
$142) 8. Bxf7+ Kxf7 9. Qxe4 Ke8 10. O-O h6 {Leaves a hole on g6.} 11. Nxe5 Nxe5
12. Qxe5+ Qe7 13. Qxc7 Bc6 14. Qg3 Rd8 15. Bf4 Bb5 16. Rc1 Qe2 17. Na3 Qxb2 18.
Nxb5 Qxb5 19. Qg6+ Kd7 20. Rd1+ Kc8 21. Qe6+ Qd7 22. Rxd7 Rxd7 23. Rd1 {
In the preliminary section Players were put in five groups.The top two players
from each group would qualify for the final section.} 1-0

