{Time limit 35 moves in 1hr 45'} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2 c5 4. exd5 exd5 5.
Ngf3 Nf6 ({M.C.O. 11 gives} 5... a6 {to prevent 6.Bb5+}) 6. Bb5+ Nc6 {After
some thought} 7. O-O Be7 {After much thought. I wasn't happy with this.} ({
I didn't like} 7... Be6 8. Ng5) ({Maybe} 7... cxd4 {is best.}) 8. dxc5 O-O 9.
Bxc6 bxc6 10. Nb3 Ne4 11. Be3 f5 12. Ne5 Qc7 13. f4 {[21']} Rb8 {[39']} ({
Possibly} 13... Ba6 {first is better.}) 14. Qd3 {[29']} Nf6 {[55'] Using a lot
of time and not particularly good. I had thought of .......Nd7} 15. Rae1 g6 16.
Bd4 {[36'] Threat 17.......Nxc6} Ne4 {[59']} 17. g4 $1 {[46'] Cleverly
initiating a KS attack} Ra8 $2 {[71']} ({Not} 17... fxg4 $2 18. Rxe4 $1) (17...
Bf6 {Contesting the long diagonal may be best.}) 18. g5 a5 $6 {May be OK but
risky.} 19. a4 ({Not liking} 19. Qh3 a4 20. Qh6 axb3 21. Nxg6 Bxc5) 19... Ba6
$6 20. Qh3 Bxf1 21. Rxf1 Nxg5 {When I played 19.......Ba6 I had intended ......
..Nf6 here which seemed better here. Time trouble was starting to creep in.}
22. fxg5 {[64']} Bxg5 {[87'] I started to play too qquickly here.} 23. Nxg6
Be3+ {Hasty stuff} ({I had intended} 23... Bf6 {but after} 24. Nxf8 Qg7+ 25.
Qg3 {wins}) 24. Qxe3 ({I was also concerned about} 24. Kh1 $6 Rfe8 {etc}) 24...
hxg6 25. Qg5 {[74']} ({I had expected} 25. Qe6+ Kh7 26. Rf3) 25... Qh7 $2 {
[94']} (25... Qf7 $142) 26. Rf4 Qf7 {[99']} 27. Qh6 Qh7 28. Qxh7+ Kxh7 29. Rh4+
Kg8 30. Rh8+ Kf7 31. Rh7+ Ke6 32. Rc7 Rfc8 33. Rxc8 Rxc8 34. Bc3 Ra8 35. Kf2 g5
36. Nd4+ Kd7 37. Kg3 ({Not} 37. Nxf5 $4 Rf8) 37... Rf8 {A lot of innacuracies 
(not back to form). Also time trouble.} 1-0

