Nbd7 7. O-O c6 8. b3 Qc7 9. Bb2 a6 10. Qc2 {[21']} h6 {[7']} ({I felt that} 
10... e5 11. dxe5 dxe5 12. e4 {wasn't too exciting.}) 11. Rac1 Nh7 12. Ne4 $2 (
12. e4 $142) 12... f5 13. Ng3 Rf7 {So as to be able to play Nf8 to protect the
g-Pawn against Nh4. Also a possible doubling of Rooks later on.} 14. h4 $2 {
Weakening. He can't prevent ........g5 anyway.} Ndf8 15. Bd3 e5 {Now he's in
trouble.} 16. dxe5 dxe5 17. e4 {[37'] He must be lost now, but better moves
are not apparent.} f4 {[22']} 18. Ne2 g5 19. h5 $2 {Loses a Pawn but what else?
} ({If} 19. g3 $4 Bh3 20. Rfe1 fxg3) 19... Bg4 20. g3 $4 {Time trouble panic.}
Bxf3 21. gxf4 gxf4 22. Kh2 Qe7 23. Ng1 Qh4+ 24. Nh3 Ng5 0-1

