{Time limit 24 mph} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 exd4 5. e5 Qe7 6. Qe2
$2 {Showing my unfamiliarity with the variation. This loses a pawn.} Ng4 $2 {
Probably the losing move leaving the Knight rather embarassed.} (6... d3 $1 {
Wins a Pawn.}) 7. cxd4 Qb4+ 8. Qd2 {Happy to go into an endgame.} Qxd2+ 9. Bxd2
Bb4 {Hoping to deflect my Bishop.} 10. Nc3 O-O 11. h3 Bxc3 12. bxc3 Nh6 13.
Bxh6 {[11']} gxh6 {[20']} 14. Bd3 Re8 15. Kd2 Ne7 16. Rab1 a6 {[22']} 17. Be4 {
[16']} Rb8 18. Rb2 d6 19. exd6 cxd6 20. Re1 $1 {Winning material. Now, neither
Rook, Knight nor Bishop can move.} Ng6 {[29']} ({If} 20... b5 21. Bc6) ({If} 
20... d5 21. Bxd5) ({If} 20... Kh8 21. Bc6 {then} Z0 22. Rb6) 21. Bxg6 {[21']}
Rxe1 22. Bxf7+ Kxf7 23. Kxe1 b5 {[32']} 24. Nd2 Bf5 25. f3 d5 {[35']} 26. Nf1 {
[25']} Rc8 27. Kd2 Rb8 28. Ne3 Be6 29. Rb1 h5 30. a3 Kf6 {[49']} 31. Re1 {[30']
} Rg8 32. Re2 Rg3 33. Ke1 h6 34. Kf2 h4 $2 (34... Rg8 $142) 35. Ng4+ Bxg4 36.
hxg4 h5 {Forced else 37.Re5} 37. gxh5 Rg8 38. h6 {Trying to defelect the Rook
from attacking my c-Pawn.} Rh8 39. Re5 {[45']} Rxh6 40. Rxd5 Kg7 41. Rc5 Kf7
42. d5 Ke7 43. Rc6 Rd6 44. Rxd6 Kxd6 45. f4 Kxd5 46. Kf3 a5 47. Kg4 Ke6 48.
Kxh4 Kf5 49. g3 Kg6 50. g4 Kf6 51. Kh5 a4 52. Kh6 Kf7 53. Kh7 1-0

