{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5.
Nc3 Qc7 6. Be2 {Unnecessarily timid.} Nc6 7. Nf3 b5 8. a3 Bb7 9. Bd3 {[6']} Bc5
{[2'] Playing very fast} 10. O-O Nge7 11. Qe2 Rd8 12. Be3 Bd6 $6 {[6'] Mixing
it up a bit. I was playing rather too quickly and casually. I felt that I
could get away with this sort of thing against the 4th team.} 13. Qd2 {
Threatening 14.Bxb5} Ne5 {[10']} 14. Nxe5 {[19']} Bxe5 15. g3 {[19']} Bxc3 {
I felt that I would get a good endgame. However, I was rather over-optimistic
and should have given it a little more thought.} 16. Qxc3 Qxc3 17. bxc3 Rc8 18.
Bd4 {[20']} f6 {[16']} 19. e5 ({I expected} 19. f4 {, but 19e5 is better.})
19... f5 {[16'] Played without much thought.} 20. Rab1 {I now realised my
position was not too good. 21.a4 was threatened} Bd5 {[25']} 21. Rb2 $2 {
Missing his chance. Black gets on top now.} ({Correct was} 21. a4 $1 Bc4 22.
axb5 axb5 23. Bxc4 bxc4 24. Rb7 {etc.}) 21... Bc4 {Now he gets tied down.} 22.
Rfb1 Nd5 23. Bxc4 Rxc4 24. Rb3 {[31']} O-O {[27']} 25. Rd1 f4 26. Rd3 g5 27. h3
Kg7 28. Kh2 fxg3+ 29. fxg3 h5 30. h4 gxh4 31. gxh4 Rf4 32. Kg3 $4 {A blunder
but it was very difficult for him anyway.} Rg4+ {Rather vapid stuff. 64 are
the Lancaster 'D' team.} 0-1

