{Time limit 20mph} 1. e4 Nc6 {His speciality, which I expected.} 2. d4 d5 3. e5
Bf5 4. c3 e6 5. Bd3 Bxd3 {[0']} 6. Qxd3 h5 {[0']} 7. h4 Nh6 8. Ne2 Nf5 9. Ng3
$2 {I don't know what I was thinking here. Too slack.} Nxh4 10. Kf1 {I now
decided I had better get round to it.} Be7 11. f4 g6 12. b4 a6 {[10']} 13. a4 {
[17']} Kd7 {Starting to get rattled?} 14. Nd2 Nf5 15. Ne2 h4 16. Nb3 Ng3+ {
Doesn't turn out too well.} 17. Nxg3 hxg3 18. Rh3 Rxh3 19. gxh3 Bh4 20. Nc5+ {
I was feeling more confident now.} Kc8 {[59']} 21. Rb1 ({I couldn't see
anything definite in} 21. b5) 21... Nb8 {To take the sting out of 22.b5} 22.
Bd2 b6 23. Nb3 Qe8 24. Ra1 ({If} 24. a5 Qa4) 24... Qc6 {[90']} 25. Be1 {
[43'] Intending to win bac the g-Pawn with the better game.} Qc4 $2 {Seeing
his position deteriorating he makes a desperate attempt to simplify but gives
up a Pawn.} 26. Qxc4 dxc4 27. Nd2 Kd7 28. Kg2 Kc6 29. Nxc4 Kd5 $2 30. Nd2 Nd7
31. Rc1 {He misses the point of this.} Rh8 {The game was adjourned here. I
sealed.....} 32. Kf1 $1 {4 The games resumed 23/2/75. Threatening mate in} Nb8
$4 {With a week to analyse he misses it.} 33. b5 {Now he saw it!} c6 34. c4+
Kxd4 35. Nb3+ {Lancaster I won the match 4.5 - 1.5} 1-0

