{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d3 Nc6 4. g3 d6 5. Bg2
Nf6 6. O-O Be7 7. Re1 Qc7 8. c3 e5 {I didn't like d4 threatening e5} 9. d4 Bg4
10. d5 Nb8 11. Nbd2 Nbd7 12. Nf1 {A good move threatening N-e3-f5} Nf8 13. Ne3
Bd7 14. Nh4 g6 15. Rf1 h6 {Taking my time. I was contemplating QS castling.}
16. f4 $5 {Giving up a Pawn for speculative chances.} exf4 17. gxf4 Nxe4 18.
Bxe4 ({If} 18. Nxg6 Nxc3 (18... Nxg6 {with play on the g-file.}) (18... fxg6
19. Bxe4)) 18... Bxh4 19. f5 {The best chance and awkward for Black.} gxf5 20.
Nxf5 Bxf5 21. Bxf5 Kd8 {Black is skating on thin ice.} 22. Qg4 Qe7 {Black has
the advantage of covering e1 with his Bishop.} 23. Bf4 Kc7 24. Kh1 (24. Bg3 Z0
25. Rfe1 {Looks better.}) 24... Re8 25. Rf3 h5 {I felt I was out of the woods
now.} 26. Qh3 Ng6 27. Bxg6 fxg6 {We were both short of time here.} 28. Re3 Qf6
29. Rf1 Rxe3 30. Bxe3 Qe7 31. Qf3 Rh7 32. b4 {A "nothing move" weakening his
QS for no reason.} b6 33. bxc5 bxc5 34. c4 g5 35. a4 g4 36. Qf4 Rg7 37. Bxc5 $5
Bg5 38. Qg3 h4 39. Bxd6+ Qxd6 40. Qxg4 (40. Qxg4 Qe5 41. Rd1 {Black's best may
be} ({If} 41. h3 Be7 42. Qf4 (42. Qf3 Rg3) 42... Qxf4 43. Rxf4 Rg3 44. Kh2 Bd6
$1 {and wins}) 41... Kd6 {and White is tied up, his Queen must cover e4 and
Black threatens to exchange.}) 40... Qe5 {The game was adjourned and White
sealed 41.Rd1 but resigned without resuming.} 0-1

