{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. Be3 Nf6 5. h3
O-O 6. Nf3 c6 7. Qd2 b5 8. a3 a5 {May not be best.} 9. Bd3 Bb7 {White
threatened d5.} 10. O-O Re8 ({I also considered} 10... e5) 11. d5 cxd5 12. exd5
({Interesting is} 12. Bxb5 dxe4 13. Bxe8 exf3 14. Bg5 fxg2) 12... Nxd5 13. Nxd5
Bxd5 14. Ng5 $1 ({If} 14. Bxb5 {I was considering} Bxf3 15. Bxe8 Qxe8) 14... e6
$1 {Best I think.} ({If} 14... Bc6 15. Bxb5 Bxb5 16. Qd5 {atacks....}) 15. Bxb5
Re7 16. c3 $2 (16. c4 $142 {Gaining a tempo. Now I wreck his KS Pawns.}) 16...
h6 17. Nf3 Bxf3 18. gxf3 Kh7 19. Kh1 Rb7 20. Bd3 (20. c4 {Is best as I would
have difficulty then in developing my KS}) 20... Nc6 21. Rg1 Rab8 22. Rab1 (22.
b4 {is unplayable.}) 22... Ne5 23. Be2 d5 24. Bf4 Qh4 25. Bf1 $6 {Giving up a
weak Pawn. I had expected....} ({....} 25. Kg2) 25... Nxf3 26. Qe3 Nxg1 ({
Alternatively} 26... Rxb2 27. Rxb2 Rxb2 28. Qxf3 Rxf2 29. Bg3 Rxf3 30. Bxh4
Rxc3 {etc.}) 27. Bxb8 Rxb8 ({Not} 27... Nxh3 28. Bg3 {etc.}) 28. Kxg1 d4 29.
cxd4 Bxd4 30. Qd2 Qg3+ 31. Bg2 Qe5 32. b4 {Missing my 33rd move?} Bc3 33. Qd7
Qf5 34. Rc1 axb4 35. axb4 Bxb4 36. Rc7 Kg7 37. Qd4+ $1 {Setting a little trap.}
Kg8 ({Not} 37... Qf6 38. Rxf7+ $1) 38. Be4 Qf4 ({Not} 38... Qxh3 $4 39. Bxg6 $1
) 39. Rd7 Bf8 40. Qc4 {There were no good moves.} Rb4 41. Qc8 Qxe4 42. Rd8 Rb1+
43. Kh2 Rh1+ {10 A good game. My opening play was rather loose, however,
especially 8 .......a5 and .......Re8} 0-1

