{Time limit 24 mph} 1. e4 Nf6 {As expected.} 2. e5 Nd5 3. Nc3 {But I don't
think he expected this line.} Nxc3 4. bxc3 d6 5. f4 Nc6 {Not very promising,
he gets a very cramped game.} 6. d4 {[1']} e6 {[7']} ({Apparently he didn't
like} 6... Bf5 7. Bd3) 7. Nf3 {[2']} Be7 {[11']} 8. Bd3 b6 9. Bb5 Bb7 $4 {
He didn't give this much thought, obviously not sensing any danger.} 10. d5 {
Wins a piece.} exd5 {[20']} 11. Qxd5 Qd7 {[23']} 12. Nd4 {[7']} dxe5 {[25']
The alternative was to resign.} 13. Bxc6 Bxc6 14. Qxc6 {[8']} exd4 {
Desperation.} 15. Qxa8+ Bd8 16. Qe4+ {[9']} Be7 17. cxd4 O-O 18. O-O Re8 19.
Re1 Kf8 20. Qxh7 Qxd4+ 21. Be3 {Too much so Resigns. This must have been his
worst defeat for some time. [R.J.lawrence came 2nd in prelim C with 3.5/4]} 1-0

