{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 Nc6 {As expected} 2. d4 d5 3. e5 Bf5 4.
c3 e6 5. Bd3 Bxd3 6. Qxd3 h5 7. h4 Be7 {Deviating from our game earlier this
season.} 8. Nf3 Nh6 9. b4 {Playing actively as in our previous game.} a6 10. g3
Nf5 11. Bf4 Qd7 12. Nbd2 Na7 {Black starts some rather obscure manoeuvres in
order to contain White.} 13. O-O Qa4 {Halts my QS advance but ties his Queen
up.} 14. Nb3 b6 15. Rfc1 {After much thought.} Kd7 {[33'] Again after much
thought but very risky} 16. c4 {[28']} c6 {[36']} ({He can hardly risk} 16...
Bxb4 17. cxd5) 17. a3 Rhc8 18. Qc2 {Threatening not so much 19.Nc5+ as 19.c5}
Ke8 19. c5 Bd8 (19... b5 {Would have left his Queen embarassed}) 20. Nfd2 {
Intending either. Nf1-e3 or Nb1-c3} Nb5 21. Nb1 g6 22. Nc3 Nxc3 23. Qxc3 Rab8
24. Qb2 Rb7 {Black was short of time.} 25. Qc3 Rbb8 {Marking time.} 26. Bg5 Bc7
27. Kh2 {With thoughts of a possible combination.} Kd7 $2 {He seems determined
to leave his King here.} 28. f3 $1 {I need to shift his Knight.} Qb5 29. Rc2
Qa4 30. g4 $1 hxg4 31. fxg4 Ne7 32. cxb6 Bxb6 33. Qc5 $1 {Good enough to
confuse him.} Re8 $2 {Fatal.} (33... Bd8 $142 {as suggested by P.H.C. [I think
this is Dick's brother]}) 34. Qd6+ Kc8 35. Bxe7 Qxb3 {Ending it quickly but if.
.....} ({.......} 35... Bc7 36. Qxc6 Qxc6 37. Rxc6 Rxe7 38. Rxa6) 36. Qxc6+ {
A neat finish. [CEGB were a team from Heysam Power Station captained by A.
Russell]} 1-0

