1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. Be2 Qc7 6. O-O {[6']} b5 {[1']} 7.
Bd2 Nf6 8. Bd3 Bb7 9. Qe2 Nc6 10. Nf3 Be7 11. Nc3 d6 12. Nd1 {[13']} d5 {
[6'] Rather a lightning game.} 13. exd5 Nxd5 14. c4 bxc4 15. Bxc4 {[16']} Nf4 {
[8']} 16. Bxf4 {[20']} Qxf4 {[8']} 17. Bb3 {[24']} Qg4 {[11']} 18. Ne3 Qf4 19.
Rad1 O-O {[20']} (19... Bf6 {Not} 20. Nd5) 20. Rd7 {[35']} Rab8 {[24'] I
couldn't be bothered (in this sort of match) to work out the possibilities of..
....} ({......} 20... Bd6 21. Rd1 Ne5) 21. Nc4 Bf6 22. Rfd1 {We broe for a
buffet supper here.} Nb4 {[26']} 23. Nfe5 {[47']} Bd5 24. g3 {[56']} Qf5 {[36']
} 25. f4 Rfc8 $4 {Skittles stuff.} 26. Nd6 Qh3 27. Nxc8 Rxc8 28. Bxd5 $2 {
Leads to trouble.} exd5 {Threatening .......BxN and ......QxR} 29. Rd6 $2 Be7
30. Rd7 Bc5+ 31. Kh1 f6 32. Ng4 ({If} 32. Qg4 Qxg4 33. Nxg4 h5) 32... h5 33.
Nxf6+ {[76']} ({More chances were offered by} 33. Qe6+ Kh8 34. Rxg7) 33... gxf6
{[46']} 34. Rb7 Qg4 35. Qf1 Nc2 36. Rd3 Ne3 37. Qg1 Qf3+ {6 Very much a
skittles game as in this match last year, against the same opponent. My 26th
game (out of 34) with Black this season. Lansil won the match 7 -} 0-1

