{Time limit 1hr 10' each for the whole game.} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Bc5 4.
d4 exd4 5. cxd4 Bb6 6. Bc4 Qe7 7. O-O d6 8. h3 Bd7 9. Bg5 {[6']} f6 {[4']} 10.
Be3 Qxe4 $2 11. Nc3 Qg6 $4 12. Kh1 $4 {Ridiculous, but it was almost a
lightning game.} (12. Nh4 {Wins the Queen.}) 12... h5 13. Nh4 {[10']} Qh7 {[7']
} 14. Bd3 f5 15. Re1 O-O-O {[8'] There was really no need for us to play this
fast.} 16. Nf3 {[13']} Nge7 17. Bc4 Rhf8 18. Ng5 Qh8 $4 19. Nf7 Rxf7 20. Bxf7
g6 {[14']} 21. f4 {[19']} Qf6 22. Bc4 Nxd4 23. Bxd4 Bxd4 24. Rxe7 Bxc3 25. Rf7
Qd4 26. Qb3 Ba5 27. Be6 Qh8 28. Bxd7+ Rxd7 29. Rxd7 Kxd7 30. Qb5+ c6 31. Qxa5
Qxb2 32. Re1 a6 33. Qa4 Qd2 34. Rd1 Qe3 35. Qb4 Kc8 36. Qxd6 Qe8 37. Qe5 Qf7
38. Rd6 {Just a skittles game as usual in these events (also, as usual against
this opponent)} ({Quicker is} 38. Qh8+ Kc7 39. Qd8#) 1-0

