{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hrs 30' then 16 moves per hour} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6
3. c3 Be7 4. d4 d6 5. h3 Nf6 6. d5 Nb8 7. Bd3 O-O 8. c4 b6 9. Nc3 Kh8 10. Be3
a5 11. O-O {After some thought. I had ideas of QS castling. Black was playing
very quickly.} Ng8 12. g4 {Again after much reflection. I was concerned about
12.......h5 possibly 13.Kg2?!} Na6 13. Kh2 {I wasn't sure of the best square
for the King.} g6 14. Nd2 f5 15. exf5 {[59']} gxf5 {[15']} 16. gxf5 {[61]} ({
I considered} 16. f4) 16... Bxf5 17. Bxf5 Rxf5 18. Qg4 Rf6 19. f4 Rg6 20. Qe2
exf4 21. Rxf4 Bf6 {[40']} 22. Qf2 {[94'] f6 is a little weak with my Knights
coming in.} Be5 23. Bd4 Nc5 24. Bxe5+ dxe5 25. Rf3 Nf6 26. Rf1 Kg7 {[54']} 27.
Qe3 {[1hr 51']} Qe7 28. Nde4 Ncxe4 29. Nxe4 Nxe4 30. Qxe4 Qg5 {His best chance
of counterplay.} 31. Rf7+ Kh6 32. Qf3 e4 33. Qf4 Rag8 34. Qxg5+ Rxg5 35. R1f6+
R8g6 36. Rxg6+ Kxg6 37. Rxc7 Re5 {I had doubts whether Black could hold it
from here on.} 38. Kg2 e3 39. Kf1 b5 {[1hr 22']} 40. b3 {[2hr 24']} bxc4 41.
bxc4 Rf5+ {A touch of desperation now.} 42. Ke2 Rf2+ 43. Kxe3 Rxa2 44. d6 Ra3+
45. Kd4 Rxh3 46. d7 Rh1 47. Rc6+ Kf7 48. Rd6 {A pleasing start to the
tournament.} 1-0

