{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hrs 30' then 16 moves per hour} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3.
d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. Nc3 Qc7 6. g3 Nc6 {Moiseev's book suggests 6......b5} 7.
Bg2 Nf6 8. O-O Be7 9. Kh1 {So as to be able to advance the f-Pawn.} b5 $2 {
Much too risky and loosening.} 10. e5 Ng8 {[14']} 11. f4 {[48']} f5 ({
Unfortunately} 11... d5 {loses a Knight and a Rook}) 12. exf6 {[67']} Nxf6 {
[25']} 13. Nxc6 dxc6 {Now he will hammer away at the e-Pawn.} 14. Be3 O-O 15.
Bd4 {[1hr 17']} Bd7 {[32']} 16. Be5 Qa7 17. Qe2 Rae8 18. Rad1 Nd5 19. Ne4 Rd8 {
Threatening 20.....Ne3} 20. Rfe1 Qb6 21. Qg4 Bf6 ({I was unsure about} 21...
Nf6 22. Nxf6+ Bxf6 23. Rxd7 Rxd7 24. Qxe6+ Rdf7 25. Bxc6 {Threatening 26.Bd5})
22. Nxf6+ {[1hr 55']} Nxf6 {[1hr 24']} 23. Qe2 Nd5 24. Bh3 Bc8 25. c3 {[2hr 9']
} c5 {[1hr 44']} 26. Kg1 {[2hr 10']} Ne7 27. Qf2 {[2hr 14']} Nd5 {[2hr 5']} ({
If} 27... Ng6 28. Rxd8 Rxd8 29. b4) 28. b3 a5 29. c4 Nb4 30. Qe2 bxc4 31. bxc4
Rxd1 32. Rxd1 Rd8 33. a3 Nc6 34. Rxd8+ {[2hr 24']} Qxd8 {[2hr 20']} 35. Bc3 Nd4
36. Qd3 Bb7 $2 {Short of time I blunder.} 37. Bxd4 Bc8 38. Qe4 cxd4 39. Bxe6+
Bxe6 40. Qxe6+ Kh8 ({With seconds left I didn't want to risk} 40... Kf8) 41.
Qd5 {[2hr 33'] The game was adjourned.} Qe8 {[2hr 32'] The sealed move.} 42.
Kf1 h6 43. Qxd4 Qh5 44. Qd8+ Kh7 45. Qd3+ Kh8 46. Kg2 Qc5 47. g4 Qc6+ 48. Qd5 {
[3hr]} Qf6 {[2hr 45']} 49. Qa8+ Kh7 50. Qe4+ Kh8 51. Qa8+ Kh7 52. Qe4+ Kh8 53.
Qe8+ Kh7 54. Qe5 Qc6+ 55. Qd5 Qf6 $4 {Catastrophe, my concentration goes.} 56.
Qf5+ {Horrible! Although it was probably lost, to lose concentration, even
after 6+ hours of play, is unforgiveable. My concentration has been suspect
for the last 2 games.} 1-0

