{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hrs 30' then 16 moves per hour} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3.
Nd2 Nf6 4. e5 Ne4 {A surprise for me.} 5. Nxe4 ({Possibly} 5. Bd3 {is best.}) (
{I can't win the Knight by} 5. Nb3 Z0 6. f3 {(followed by 7.h4) because of}
Qh4+) 5... dxe4 6. Be3 {I thought that this would discourage 6.......c5.
However,} c5 7. dxc5 Nd7 8. b4 ({I also considered} 8. c6) ({and} 8. f4) 8...
b6 9. Qd4 bxc5 10. Qxe4 Rb8 11. b5 {Seems best.} Bb7 {The Bishop is very
strong on this diagonal.} 12. Qd3 {[53']} ({I had originally intended} 12. Qa4
{However none of the discovered attacks comes to much.}) ({or} 12. Qf4 Qc7 {
is good for Black.}) 12... Nxe5 {[56']} ({He also considered} 12... Qh4 {
but didn't like} 13. Qc3) 13. Qxd8+ Rxd8 14. f3 {It is difficult to develop my
KS.} Be7 15. Nh3 {I wasn't happy about this but could find no good line.} Bh4+
16. Nf2 Bf6 17. Rd1 {[1hr 18']} (17. Rc1 $142) 17... Rc8 {Here he offered a
draw which I accepted. I was unhappy about the strength of his Bishops and the
problem of developing my KS.} (17... Rc8 {The game could go} 18. c4 Bd8 19. Bd2
{etc.}) 1/2-1/2

