d4 d5 3. Nd2 {[12']} a6 {Designed to prevent 4.exd5 exd5 and Bb5+ after ...c5.}
4. Ngf3 {[22']} c5 5. exd5 exd5 6. dxc5 Bxc5 7. Nb3 Bd6 8. Bd3 ({I considered} 
8. Qd4 Nf6 9. Bg5 {but didn't like} Nc6 10. Bxf6 Nxd4 11. Bxd8 Nxf3+) 8... Ne7
9. O-O (9. h3 $142) 9... Bg4 {[10']} 10. Re1 {[34']} Nbc6 {[14']} 11. Be2 {
[40'] Obviously not a happy move but 11......Ne5 was threatened and I felt
that a piece rearrangement was needed. Clearly the opening has gone wrong.} O-O
{[15']} 12. Bg5 {[48']} Qd7 13. c3 {[53']} Rae8 {[42']} 14. Nbd4 {[62']} Bb8 {
[58']} 15. Qd2 Qd6 {[58']} 16. g3 {Weakens the KS but I felt it was necessary.}
Ng6 {Prevents 17.Bf4} 17. Be3 f5 {[1hr 11'] It was getting rather hot now. A
few tactical diversions are needed.} 18. Nb3 {[1hr 21'] Threat 19.Bc5} Rxe3 $5
{[1hr 24'] Well, it is the last round!} 19. fxe3 f4 {This really is the moment
of decision. I felt I could hold it after} 20. exf4 {[1hr 39'] so I might as
well grab all the material I can} ({One possibility is} 20. e4 {e.g.} fxg3 21.
Qxd5+ Qxd5 22. exd5 Bxf3 23. Bxf3 gxh2+ 24. Kh1 Rxf3 25. dxc6 {etc.}) 20...
Nxf4 {The only continuation worth considering.} 21. gxf4 Rxf4 22. Rf1 {[1hr
51'] Simplest.} Qg6 23. Kh1 {[1hr 58']} ({and not} 23. Qxd5+ $4 Be6+ 24. Qg5
Rg4+) 23... Qh5 {Now it's getting rather hot again. I felt that I could give
up a piece to stem the attack to leave me the exchange up in the endgame .]}
24. Nfd4 {[2hr 5']} Rxd4 25. Bxg4 Rxd2 $4 ({After} 25... Rxg4 {White could win
but with considerable difficulty.}) 26. Be6+ ({With dreams of} 26. Bxh5 $2
Rxh2+ {with a good game. However 26.Be6+}) 1-0

