1. d4 f5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. g3 b6 4. Bg2 Bb7 5. c4 e6 6. O-O Be7 7. Nc3 O-O {
This position for the 3rd time in 5 games.} 8. b3 h6 9. d5 Qe8 10. dxe6 dxe6
11. Ne5 Bxg2 12. Kxg2 Bd6 13. Nf3 g5 {Pushing on post haste} (13... a6 {
is probably best.}) 14. Nb5 Qc6 15. Kg1 Na6 16. Bb2 Ne4 {A shade risky but
suitable for this sort of "Skittles match".} 17. Qd4 Rf6 18. Ne5 Qe8 19. Nc3
Nac5 20. Nxe4 Nxe4 21. Nd3 Rd8 22. Qe3 Rf7 23. Rad1 Rfd7 24. Qc1 (24. Ne5 {
loses to} Bc5) 24... Qh5 25. f3 $5 {Just the move I wanted.} Bxg3 {I couldn't
play anything else in a match like this.} 26. hxg3 Nxg3 {3 Threatening mate in}
27. Nf2 $4 {Playing quickly he sees the mate but not the other threat.} Nxe2+ {
Just a Skittles match, played after the AGM, without clocks ~30' for my moves.}
0-1

