decided that he had lost and played on very rapidly.} 12. Bc4 dxe5 {I wasn't
really too happy about this.} 13. fxe5 $4 {In his haste he throws it away.} ({
Correct is} 13. Bxe6+ Kh8 14. Bxf5) 13... Nd5 14. b4 Bg5 15. e4 Nxc3 16. Qe1
