{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. Bb5 $2 {Pretty horrible.
} a6 4. Bc4 $2 {Just as bad.} b5 5. Be2 Bb7 6. c4 $2 bxc4 7. Bxc4 Bxe4 8. Nc3 {
[8']} Bb7 {[5']} 9. Qe2 {Another strange move.} Nc6 10. b3 Nd4 11. Nxd4 cxd4
12. Nd5 Qa5 13. Nf4 Qg5 14. d3 $5 {He's in trouble anyway but now his Bishop
has no retreat after .......d5} Bb4+ 15. Kd1 Qe7 16. Qe5 Bc3 17. Nh5 $2 {
Things get worse.} ({Relatively better were either the speculative} 17. Ba3) ({
or} 17. Qxg7 Qf6 18. Qxf6 Nxf6 19. Rb1) 17... f6 {Now his Queen, Rook and
g-Pawn were en-prise and I threaten ......d5} 18. Qg3 g6 19. Nf4 Bxa1 20. Nxe6
{Desperation.} dxe6 21. Bxe6 Bc3 (21... Qxe6 {Also wins.}) 22. Bd2 Bxd2 23.
Kxd2 Kf8 24. Re1 Qb4+ 25. Kd1 Re8 26. Qc7 {Threatens mate.} 0-1

