{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hrs} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. c4
Nf6 6. Bd3 {I have a slight preference for this over.....} (6. Nc3 Bb4) 6...
Nc6 7. Nxc6 dxc6 8. O-O e5 9. Nc3 {[11']} (9. Qc2 Bc5 {Benko - Smyslov 1959})
9... Be6 {[33']} 10. Qe2 {Played in preference to 10.Qc2 as I expected black
to try for ........b5 and opening of the c-file.} (10. Qc2 b5) 10... Be7 11.
Bg5 ({I thought for a while about} 11. f4 Z0 12. Be3) (11. f3) ({or} 11. h3)
11... O-O 12. Rad1 {Doubtful. I meandered a bit around here.} Qa5 13. Bd2 {
A change of strategy.} Qc7 14. Rc1 Rfd8 15. Nd5 $5 {No doubt unsound but I
felt that it gave mechances 'over the board'. It certainly makes it
interesting.} cxd5 ({If} 15... Bxd5 {I had intended} 16. cxd5 Qd6 17. Ba5 Rd7
18. dxc6 {and if} Qxd3 19. cxd7 Qxe2 20. Rc8+ {and wins}) 16. cxd5 Qd6 17. Ba5
Bg4 {Best.} ({If} 17... Rd7 18. dxe6 $1 Qxd3 19. exd7 {as in the last note.})
18. f3 {[59']} b6 {[1hr 30'] Black continues to find the best moves.} 19. Rc6
Qb8 20. Bxb6 {Pretty well forced.} ({If} 20. Rxb6 Bc5+ {The g1 - a7 diagonal
is a problem.}) 20... Rd6 21. Rxd6 {After much thought. I felt that I may now
be lost with only two Pawns for the piece. However, Black was getting very
short of time.} ({If} 21. Bc7 Qa7+ 22. Bb6 Qb7) 21... Bxd6 22. Be3 Bd7 $2 {
Starting to hurry he leaves his a-Pawn adrift.} 23. Bxa6 {Now I have 3 passed
Pawns for the piece.} Ne8 24. b3 Nc7 25. Bc4 Nb5 {Black was rushing now.} 26.
a4 Na3 27. Rc1 Qb4 28. Bd2 Bc5+ 29. Kh1 Qb6 30. Bc3 Bd4 31. h3 Nxc4 32. Bxd4
Qxd4 33. Rxc4 Qa1+ 34. Kh2 Rb8 35. Qc2 {Black lost on time. A pleasing win for
my first game for Cumbria. Cumbria won 9.5 - 6.5} 1-0

