{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5.
Nc3 g6 6. f4 Bg7 $2 7. e5 dxe5 ({In the British Ch this year (1975) Eley v
Littlewood went} 7... Nh5 8. Bb5+ Bd7 9. e6 fxe6 {and Black won.}) 8. fxe5 Nd5
9. Bb5+ Kf8 10. Nf3 {I felt that it was best not to rush it down the f-file.}
e6 11. Be3 (11. Bc4 {Wins a pawn but I was hoping for more}) ({If} 11. Bg5 Qa5
{is a nuisance.}) 11... b6 {Prevents the Bishop check but now the Queen can't
go to a5.} 12. Bg5 f6 13. exf6 Bxf6 14. Bxf6 Qxf6 15. Nxd5 exd5 16. Qxd5 Qe6+
17. Qxe6 Bxe6 18. O-O-O Kg7 19. Rhe1 Bf7 {makes it easier for me.} 20. Re7 Rf8
21. Ne5 Kf6 22. Rxf7+ Rxf7 23. Nxf7 Kxf7 24. Rd8 Ke7 25. Rh8 Kd6 26. Rxh7 Nc6
27. Bxc6 Kxc6 28. Rg7 Rh8 29. Rxg6+ Kb7 30. h3 {[33']} Rf8 {[56']} 31. b3 Rf7
32. Rd6 Kc7 33. Rd1 Rf2 34. Rg1 Kd6 35. g4 Ke6 36. g5 Kf7 37. g6+ Kg7 38. h4
Rf6 39. h5 Rf8 40. Kb2 Rh8 41. Rg5 Kh6 42. Rd5 Rg8 43. b4 1-0

