{Time limit 20 mph} 1. g4 {I Played this (a) just to try it out and (b) as it
might prove effective in producing an interesting game against C.W. who plays
defensive blocking stuff.} d5 2. Bg2 c6 {Recommended by Pachman} 3. c4 e6 ({
Better is} 3... dxc4 {when I might have tried the Grob gambit} 4. b3) 4. Qc2 g6
5. Nf3 Bg7 6. d3 Bf6 $2 {Based on some idea of prventing Bg5} 7. Nc3 Nd7 8. Bd2
{[12']} Ne5 9. Nxe5 Bxe5 10. O-O-O {With rather a lead in development.} Bf6 $2
11. f4 Ne7 {[28']} 12. e4 {[20']} d4 13. Ne2 e5 {[36']} 14. f5 {[21']} c5 $4
15. g5 Nc6 {The rest is a waste of time} 16. gxf6 Qxf6 17. fxg6 fxg6 18. Rdf1
Qd6 19. a3 Bd7 20. Bg5 h6 21. Bh4 g5 22. Be1 Be6 $2 23. Rf6 Kd7 24. Bh3 Rae8
25. Rhf1 Kc7 26. Ng3 Qd7 27. Rf7 Re7 28. Bxe6 Qxe6 29. Rxe7+ Nxe7 30. Qf2 Ng6
31. Qf7+ Qxf7 32. Rxf7+ Kc8 33. Nf5 1-0

