O-O 6. c4 d6 7. Nc3 c6 8. d5 {[20']} Bd7 {[25']} ({M.C.O. gives} 8... e5 {
but I was a little concerned about the d-pawn.}) 9. Qb3 {[35']} Qc8 {[33']} ({
If} 9... Qb6 {then} 10. Qxb6 axb6 11. Be3 {is a nuisance.}) 10. Be3 {[47']} Na6
{[38']} 11. Rac1 Kh8 {There is still no immediate threat on the white diagonal
but the King is safer on h8.} 12. Qa3 {[55']} c5 {Seems best White has to
back-track} 13. Qb3 Nc7 14. Qc2 b5 {Siezing the innititive.} 15. Rcd1 {[1hr
11']} bxc4 {[61']} (15... b4 {also seemed reasonable.}) 16. Nd2 {[1hr 15']} Qa6
{[63']} 17. Bf4 Nh5 {[68'] Possibly it was better to concentrate on the QS.}
18. Bg5 Rae8 19. Nf3 f4 $5 {Rather impetuous losing control of e4.} 20. Nh4 Nb5
{There are possibilities of Be4 and sacrifices on g6 so action on the QS is
needed.} 21. Nxb5 Qxb5 22. Rd2 fxg3 23. hxg3 Qa4 24. Qxa4 Bxa4 25. Rc1 {
[1hr 28']} Bb5 {[1hr 28']} 26. Bh3 Bf6 27. Nf3 Ng7 28. Bh6 Rb8 29. Ng5 Rfe8 30.
Ne4 Be5 31. Nc3 a6 32. e3 Nf5 33. Bg5 Kg7 34. Kg2 Rb7 35. g4 Nh6 36. f4 Bxc3
37. Rxc3 Nf7 {The last few moves before the time control were fairly hurried
by both sides.} 38. Bh4 h6 39. Be1 g5 40. Ra3 {Intending 41.Ra5 & 42.a4} Rbb8 {
Time was called and a draw agreed. There is too much play in the final
position for my extra Pawn to count for much.} 1/2-1/2

