Nc6 6. Nxc6 dxc6 7. O-O e5 {Not too good in view of an eventual f4.} 8. Nd2 Nf6
9. Nc4 Qc7 10. Bg5 Be7 11. f4 exf4 12. Bxf4 Bg4 $4 {Horrific! I worked out
various lines then picked up my Bishop! Heaven knows why. As I picked it up I
realised that it was the wrong piece but I had touched it so put it on g4.} 13.
Bxc7 {A disaster of the first magnitude. I think that I shall now write my
moves down before playing them.} 1-0

