{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hrs} 1. d4 f5 2. e4 fxe4 3. Nc3 Nf6 {[3']} 4. g4 {
I could remember looking at this line once, but nothing about it. After much
thought I decided on:} e6 {[19']} ({M.C.O. 11 prefers} 4... h6 5. g5 hxg5 6.
Bxg5) 5. g5 Nd5 6. Nxe4 {[1']} Be7 {Again after much thought.} ({I considered} 
6... Bd6 {to answer} 7. c4 {with} Ne7) 7. Qh5+ {[4'] He gave this little
thought} (7. c4 {seems much stronger.}) 7... g6 {[32']} 8. Qh6 {[20']} ({
I was expecting} 8. Qf3 Rf8 9. Qh3 Rf7 {etc.}) 8... Bf8 9. Qh4 {[20']} Bg7 {
[35'] I felt happier now his d-Pawn was en-prise and 10.c4 is answered by .....
Nb4} 10. c3 {[38']} (10. c4 Nb4) 10... Nc6 {[40']} 11. Ne2 {[50']} Nce7 ({
I considered} 11... e5 {but} 12. Bg2 {"eyes" my Knight}) 12. N2g3 Nf5 13. Nxf5
exf5 14. Ng3 {[59']} d6 15. Bd2 {[60']} Qe7+ {[58']} 16. Ne2 (16. Be2 O-O {
prevents} 17. O-O-O $2 f4) 16... Be6 17. O-O-O {[67']} O-O {[1hr 11']} 18. Bg2
{[1hr 21']} c6 19. Rhe1 Qd7 {[1hr 16']} 20. c4 {[1hr 27'] Risky} Nb6 21. d5
cxd5 22. Nf4 Bf7 23. Nxd5 Nxd5 ({I wanted to play} 23... Rfc8 {but} 24. Ne7+ {
stops it.}) ({If} 23... Nxc4 24. Nf6+ $1 {The various other tries just don't
make it.}) 24. Bxd5 Bxd5 25. cxd5 Rac8+ {Threatening 26.......f4 27.BxP Qf5} (
25... Rac8+ 26. Bc3 (26. Kb1 f4 27. Z0 Qf5+) 26... f4 27. Z0 Qf5) 26. Kb1 Qb5
27. Qb4 Qxb4 ({Getting short of time I was unwilling to risk.} 27... Qxd5) ({or
} 27... Qd3+ {However} 28. Ka1 Rc4 {looks good.}) 28. Bxb4 Be5 29. Bd2 {
[1hr 50']} (29. Rxe5 {isn't good.}) 29... f4 {[1hr 49'] I prevent 30.f4.} 30.
f3 b6 1/2-1/2

