Nd4 $5 {Striving too early for an advantage but my state of health (flu)
prevented clarity of thought.} 6. Nxd4 cxd4 ({I had originally intended the
superior} 6... Bxd4+ 7. Kh1 Qa5) 7. d3 e6 {[25'] I foresaw the reply but
underestimated it's strength.} 8. f5 $1 {Now I'm in trouble.} e5 {[50'] Now
I'm in time trouble as well.} 9. Na3 {Headed for d6} gxf5 {[65']} 10. Rxf5 Qe7
{[1hr 10']} 11. Nc4 {[62']} f6 {[1hr 16']} 12. b3 $1 {Help!} Bf8 {[1hr 25']} ({
Possibly best was} 12... Nh6 13. Ba3 Nxf5) 13. Ba3 {[1hr 20']} Qg7 14. Qh5+ {
[1hr 25']} Qg6 {[1hr 26']} 15. Rxe5+ $1 Kd8 16. Bxf8 fxe5 {[1hr 44']} 17. Qxe5
Qf6 18. Bg7 Qxe5 19. Nxe5 $1 {I lost on time with 30 (!) moves to make. V.poor
but I was rather ill, being completely unable to speak and having breathing
problems} 1-0

