{Time limit 48 moves in 2 hrs} 1. c4 f5 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 b6 4. f3 {After much
thought.} Bb7 5. Qc2 {[20']} e6 6. Bg5 h6 7. Bh4 Bb4 (7... Be7 $142) 8. a3
Bxc3+ 9. Qxc3 g5 {Possibly a little impetuous.} 10. Bf2 d6 11. e3 Nbd7 {[18']}
12. Bd3 Qe7 13. O-O-O O-O 14. Ne2 Rac8 15. h4 {[53']} g4 $5 {[44'] Very risky.}
(15... Kg7 {Was more solid.}) 16. Nf4 Rfe8 {The threat of 17.d5 is very strong.
} 17. Kb1 {[71']} ({Why not} 17. d5) 17... Nf8 18. d5 e5 19. Bxf5 $6 {I felt
that this was played with a touch of desperation.} (19. Ne2 e4 20. fxe4 Nxe4
$17) 19... exf4 20. exf4 Rb8 21. Bd4 N6h7 22. Rde1 Qf7 23. fxg4 Bc8 24. Qd3
Bxf5 25. gxf5 Nf6 26. Qg3+ Kh7 27. Qf3 Re7 28. g4 Rbe8 29. Re6 $3 {Crushing. I
have no move.} ({I expected} 29. Rxe7 Qxe7 {with good play.}) 29... Nxe6 30.
dxe6 Qf8 31. g5 Nd7 32. Qd3 Kg8 {I was now in a time scramble and rushing.} 33.
f6 Ne5 {Hoping for something in the time rush.} 34. f7+ Rxf7 35. exf7+ Qxf7 36.
fxe5 dxe5 37. Rf1 Qe6 38. Rf6 Qd7 39. Qg6+ Kh8 40. Qxh6+ Qh7+ {White now
played 41.Rf8+. I was then thrown into confusion, then pointed out that it was
an illegal move. The pieces went back and he played.......} 41. Qxh7+ {This is
ILLEGAL! He had touched the Rook} ({Therefore....} 41. Rg6 exd4 {Thrown into
confusion by his first illegal move I didn't realise in the rush it was
illegal so.......}) 41... Kxh7 42. Bc3 {2 Illegal moves by my opponent! - in
my time trouble. I feel rather hard done by ( There should be a rule against
it). Match played at Ulverston} 1-0

