{Time limit 24 mph} 1. e4 Nf6 2. e5 Nd5 3. Nc3 {Deviating from our game a
month ago.} Nxc3 4. bxc3 Nc6 $2 {Not very good it gets in the way of the
c-Pawn.} 5. f4 d6 6. d4 dxe5 7. fxe5 Bf5 8. Qf3 {Good alternatives are.....} (
8. Rb1) (8. Bd3) 8... e6 ({Not} 8... Bxc2 {or 8......Bg6} 9. Bb5 Qd7 10. d5) (
8... Bg6 9. Bb5 Qd7 10. d5) 9. Bd3 Bxd3 10. Qxd3 Be7 11. Nf3 O-O 12. h4 h6 {
Doubtful but it's difficult to find good moves.} 13. Ng5 $1 g6 {[36'] The
Knight was untouchable.} 14. Ne4 {[19']} ({I would like to have played} 14.
Nxe6 {but it seems only a draw.}) 14... Kh7 {Loses pretty quickly but......} (
14... h5 15. g4 hxg4 16. h5 {is not too good for Black.}) 15. h5 Nxe5 {
Effective resignation.} 16. dxe5 Qxd3 17. hxg6+ Kxg6 18. Rxh6+ Kf5 19. cxd3
Kxe5 20. Rb1 b6 21. g3 Kd5 22. Bf4 Kc6 23. Ke2 f6 24. d4 a5 25. a4 Kd7 26. Rh7
Kd8 27. Bxc7+ 1-0

