{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 d5 5. Bb5
Nxe4 {[15']} 6. Nxe5 Bd7 7. Nxd7 ({Also possible is} 7. Qb3) 7... Qxd7 8. O-O
Be7 9. c4 $2 {Another of those moves I knew ws wrong when I played it.} a6 10.
Bxc6 bxc6 $5 (10... Qxc6 {is good for Black. The text move isn't.}) 11. f3 Nd6
{[30']} 12. c5 {[17']} Nf5 13. Re1 O-O 14. Na3 Rab8 15. b3 $2 {Casual stuff.}
Nxd4 {I had briefly considered this intending 16.RxB. However I end up mated.}
16. Be3 (16. Rxe7 Qxe7 17. Qxd4 Qe1#) 16... Nf5 17. Bf2 d4 $2 {A poor move
blocking the long diagonal and giving me c4.} 18. Rc1 Rfd8 19. Qd3 Qd5 20. Nc4
{Prevents Queen or Bishop capture on c5, and more solid than 20.g4} Bf6 21. g4
Nh4 $4 {Walking into a little trap, but he hardly gave it any thought anyway.}
22. Bxh4 Bxh4 23. Re5 Qd7 24. Rh5 g6 25. Rxh4 Re8 26. g5 Re7 27. Rxd4 {A
scrappy game, unfortunately played in a noisy and casual atmosphere. It's
difficult to play under these conditions.} 1-0

