{Time limit 48 moves in 2 hrs} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. Nc3 a6 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4
Qc7 6. Bd3 Nc6 7. Nxc6 bxc6 8. O-O Nf6 {[3']} 9. Qe2 {[31']} d5 10. Bg5 {[40']}
Bb4 {[14']} 11. e5 {[60']} Nd7 {[18']} 12. f4 Nc5 13. Rae1 $2 {[1hr 15'] An
oversight. He apparently saw his mistake immediately.} d4 14. Ne4 $2 {[1hr 15']
} (14. a3 $142) 14... Nxe4 {[30']} 15. Bxe4 Bxe1 16. Rxe1 Bd7 17. Qd3 {[1hr
23']} (17. Qc4) 17... Qb6 $4 {[40'] My worst blunder for some time, probably
due to overconfidence. I had expected 17.Qc4 and I had intended 17........Qb6
to prevent 18.Qb4 or c5} 18. Qa3 d3+ {It's all desperation now.} 19. Kh1 f6 20.
exf6 O-O-O 21. fxg7 d2 22. Rd1 Rhg8 23. Bxd8 Kxd8 24. Qf8+ ({Hoping for} 24.
Bxh7 Rxg7 25. Qf8+ Kc7 26. Qxg7 Qf2 27. Qg3 Qe2 $1 {and wins}) 24... Kc7 25.
Rxd2 Qxb2 26. Qd6+ Kb6 27. Qxd7 Rxg7 28. Qxc6+ Ka5 29. Qc5+ {A costly lapse of
concentration.} 1-0

