Bb3 Bb7 7. Nd2 Bc5 8. c3 $2 {Loses a pawn.} Qb6 9. N2f3 Bxe4 10. Be3 Nc6 11.
Ng5 Bg6 12. Qf3 Rc8 13. Rd1 Nf6 14. O-O $2 Bh5 15. Qg3 Bxd1 {I was in two
