3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 exd4 5. e5 Ne4 6. cxd4 (6. Qe2 {Is an alternative.}) 6... Bb4+
7. Bd2 Nxd2 8. Nbxd2 d6 9. a3 Bxd2+ 10. Qxd2 dxe5 11. Nxe5 (11. dxe5 Qxd2+ 12.
Kxd2 Bg4 {wins the e-Pawn.}) ({Possible is} 11. d5 Ne7 12. Bc4) 11... Nxd4 12.
Rd1 Ne6 ({If} 12... c5 13. Bb5+) ({I had expected.} 12... Qe7) 13. Qxd8+ {
Simplifies to a drawn ending.} ({If} 13. Bb5+ c6 14. Nxc6 Qxd2+ 15. Rxd2 O-O)
13... Nxd8 14. Rxd8+ Kxd8 15. Nxf7+ Ke7 16. Nxh8 Bf5 17. Nf7 Kxf7 18. Bc4+ Kf6
19. Kd2 {Lancaster won the match 5.5 - 1.5} 1/2-1/2

