Nf6 6. Nc3 Bb4 7. Bd3 Bxc3+ {I wasn't happy here and don't like this position.}
({Moiseev gives} 7... Nc6 {but I didn't like} 8. Nxc6 dxc6 9. e5) 8. bxc3 {[5']
} Qa5 {[35']} 9. Qc2 {[12']} Nc6 10. O-O d6 11. f4 Qc5 12. Kh1 Nxd4 $5 {[64']}
13. cxd4 {[21']} Qxd4 14. Bb2 Qc5 15. e5 dxe5 16. Bxe5 Ng4 {[1hr 18'] Still
fishing in muddy waters.} 17. Bxg7 Rg8 18. Qc3 f6 $5 {Missing his 21st move.}
19. Bxf6 Nf2+ 20. Rxf2 Qxf2 21. Bg5 $1 {Now I was in some trouble and time was
getting short.} ({I had reckoned on} 21. Be4) 21... h6 22. Bh7 hxg5 23. Bxg8 {
[50']} Qxf4 {[1hr 43']} 24. Qh8 Qf8 25. Qh5+ Kd7 26. Rd1+ Kc6 27. Qxg5 Bd7 28.
Bh7 Re8 29. Qe5 Bc8 30. Be4+ Kb6 {Five minutes left.} 31. Rb1+ Ka7 32. Qd4+ Kb8
33. Qb6 Re7 {One minute left.} 34. Qxa6 Qf4 35. Bd3 ({If} 35. Bf3 Rh7 $3) 35...
Qd4 36. Qa3 Rf7 37. c5 e5 38. c6 e4 39. Ba6 Rc7 40. Bxb7 Bxb7 41. cxb7 Rxb7 42.
Rf1 {Time was called. Adjudicated. I resigned.} (42. Rf1 Qf2 $1 {(suggested by
Brenda)-No good} ({Dick & Fritz} 42... Rb4 43. h3 Qc5 44. Qg3+ Qc7 45. Qg8+ Ka7
46. Qe8 Qc4 47. Qe7+ Rb7 48. Qa3+ Kb8 49. Qg3+ Rc7 50. Rb1+) 43. Qd6+ Ka7 44.
Qd1 Qxa2 45. Qd4+ Ka8 46. h3 e3 47. Kh2 Rb2 48. Rf8+ Rb8 49. Qe4+ Ka7 50. Qxe3+
Kb7 51. Rxb8+) 1-0

