1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 3. Nxe5 Qf6 4. d4 d6 5. Nc4 fxe4 6. Nc3 Bf5 7. Nd5 Qf7 8.
Nde3 c6 9. Nxf5 Qxc4 10. Ne3 Qf7 11. Qg4 {Pawn grabbing.} Nd7 12. Qxe4+ Be7 13.
Nf5 O-O-O 14. Nxe7+ Nxe7 {I preffered my position here.} 15. Be2 Rhf8 16. O-O
Rde8 17. Qd3 h5 18. b4 Nf5 19. Bf3 Nh4 20. Bg5 Nxf3+ 21. gxf3 Qd5 {I gave this
a lot of thought and began to get short of time.} 22. f4 Re4 23. Rfe1 Rfe8 24.
Rxe4 Rxe4 25. Rd1 Qe6 {All a bit of a rush.} 26. f3 Re3 27. Qf1 Qd5 28. Re1
Qxd4 29. Rxe3 Qxe3+ 30. Qf2 Qa3 {Just making the T.C. but there must be
something better.} 31. Qe2 Nf6 32. Qe6+ Kc7 33. Qe7+ Kb6 34. Qxd6 Qc1+ 35. Kg2
Qxc2+ 36. Kg3 (36. Kg3 Qf5 37. Qe5 h4+) 36... Qf5 {Time was called. Draw
agreed. I didn't like 37.Qe5! forcing h4+ I took too long early on.} 1/2-1/2

