{Time limit 48 moves in 2 hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 {Feeling ill and not caring,
else I wouldn't have played this.} 3. Nxe5 Qf6 4. d4 d6 5. Nc4 fxe4 6. Nc3 Qg6
7. Bf4 Nf6 8. Qd2 Be7 9. O-O-O O-O 10. h3 Bd7 {makes development of the Knight
difficult.} 11. g4 b5 12. Ne3 a6 13. Bg2 c6 14. f3 b4 {[57']} ({I spent a long
time considering.} 14... Nxg4) 15. Ne2 {[58']} d5 16. fxe4 Nxe4 17. Bxe4 Qxe4 (
{Maybe} 17... dxe4 {is best.}) 18. Rhf1 a5 19. Ng3 Qg6 {I felt that I was lost
here, but I wsn't thinking to clearly} 20. Nef5 Bxf5 21. Nxf5 Bf6 22. Rde1 Re8
23. Rxe8+ Qxe8 24. Re1 Qd7 $2 25. Be5 Bxe5 {[1hr 44'] I could find no good
move.} 26. dxe5 Qc8 $2 {Rubbish. I felt very ill and had 2 more games to play
today.} 1-0

