{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs} 1. d4 f5 2. e4 fxe4 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 e6 {
A bit unusual.} 5. Bxf6 Qxf6 6. Nxe4 Qg6 7. Bd3 Qxg2 $6 {I felt that I had
nothing to lose in this game..} 8. Ng3 Qd5 {The threat was 9.Be4} 9. Qg4 Nc6 {
Intending to answer 10.c3 with 10.......Ne5.} 10. Nf3 {Has the disadvantage
over Ne2 (answered again by ......Ne5) that he isn't threatening 11.Bxh7 RxB
12.Qg6+ Kmoves 13.QxR beacause of 13.......QxN} d6 {[30'] Black is on thin ice.
} 11. O-O {[67'] White was taking a long time.} ({If} 11. Nh5 {I intended} Bd7
12. Nxg7+ Bxg7 13. Qxg7 O-O-O) (11. Bxh7 Rxh7 12. Qg6+ Kd8 13. Qxh7 Qxf3) 11...
e5 ({I had intended} 11... Bd7 {but} 12. Ng5 $1 {prevents} O-O-O) 12. Qe4 {
[1hr 18'] Surprise, giving up a Pawn.} Qxe4 {[40']} 13. Bxe4 {[1hr 20']} Nxd4
14. Nxd4 {[80']} exd4 15. Rfe1 {[80']} Kd8 16. Rad1 c5 17. Rd3 g6 18. Rf3 {
[1hr 27']} Rb8 {[58']} 19. Rf7 Bd7 20. Bd5 Be8 {Returning a Pawn to get a good
endgame.} 21. Rxb7 Rxb7 22. Bxb7 Bd7 23. Bd5 Bg7 24. Kf1 Bb5+ 25. Kg1 Re8 26.
Rxe8+ Kxe8 27. Ne4 Ke7 28. b3 {White was getting very short of time.} Bh6 29.
Kg2 d3 30. cxd3 Bxd3 31. Kf3 Bg7 32. Ke3 Bb1 33. a4 h6 34. f4 Bd4+ 35. Kf3 {
White was really rushing now.} Bd3 36. Kg3 Ba6 37. Nd2 {White now had seconds
left and anything had to do.} Bc8 38. Nf3 Bc3 39. Ng1 {White picked up his
knight was about to put it on h4 then noticed Be1+ so put it on g1.} (39. Nh4
Be1+) 39... Be6 40. Bc4 d5 41. Bd3 Bf5 42. Bxf5 gxf5 43. Ne2 Be1+ 44. Kf3 d4
45. Nc1 Ba5 46. Nd3 Kd6 47. h3 Kd5 48. Ke2 {I don't know how he made the time
control.} Bc7 {[1hr 49'] The clock was now stopped and 10' added to each for
the rest of the game.[Clock times remaining White 10' -- Black 21']} 49. Kf3 a5
50. Ke2 c4 51. bxc4+ Kxc4 52. Kd2 Bd6 53. Kc2 Kd5 54. Kb3 Ke4 55. Kc4 Bxf4 56.
Nc5+ Ke3 57. Nb3 d3 {Again White had only a few seconds so ......Resigns.} 0-1

