{Time limit 20 moves in 1 hr} 1. g4 d5 2. Bg2 e5 3. e3 ({Harding gives} 3. c4)
3... Nc6 4. d4 exd4 5. exd4 Qe7+ 6. Be3 Nf6 {A good move.} ({If} 6... Qb4+ 7.
Nc3 Qxb2 8. Nxd5) 7. h3 ({If} 7. g5 Ng4) 7... Qb4+ 8. Nc3 Be6 9. Qd2 h6 10.
Nge2 {[19']} g5 {[20']} 11. O-O {[19']} a6 {Black has meandered for a few
moves to leave White well on top. We were both playing quickly.} 12. a3 Qd6 13.
f4 {[20']} Be7 14. f5 (14. fxg5 {is much too dangerous.}) 14... Bc8 ({If} 14...
Bd7 15. Bf2 ({or} 15. Nf4 $3)) 15. Bf2 {[23']} Qd8 16. Be3 Qd6 17. Rae1 {[26']}
b6 18. Bf2 Bb7 19. Bg3 Qd7 20. Nc1 O-O-O 21. b4 a5 $5 22. b5 Nxd4 $5 {A touch
of desperation here.} 23. Rxe7 Qxe7 24. Qxd4 Qc5 $4 {Played without much
thought, it loses a piece.} 25. Qxc5 bxc5 26. Be5 Rhe8 27. Bxf6 Rd6 {[47']} 28.
Bg7 {[37']} Re3 29. Nb3 Rg3 30. Nxc5 Rxg2+ 31. Kxg2 d4+ 32. Nxb7 Kxb7 33. Ne4 {
[43']} Rd5 34. a4 d3 35. cxd3 Kb6 36. d4 c6 37. bxc6 Kxc6 38. Nc3 Rd7 39. Rc1
Kb6 40. Bxh6 Rxd4 41. Bxg5 {Rather a skittles game.} 1-0

