{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nf3 d6 4. Nc3 Bg4 5. Bc4
e6 6. Be3 Nc6 7. Qd2 Bxf3 8. gxf3 Nge7 9. O-O-O e5 10. d5 Nd4 {Gives up a Pawn
but with QS files opened up.} 11. Bxd4 exd4 12. Ne2 c5 13. dxc6 {I had
originally intended 13.Bb5+ but the Black QS Pawns march forward murderously.}
(13. Bb5+) 13... bxc6 14. Nxd4 O-O 15. Nb3 Nc8 16. c3 Qf6 {This was where I
started to go wrong. I thought for a very long time here, got short of time
and indecision mounted.} 17. Qe2 ({I had originally intended} 17. Ba6 {which
may be good}) ({If} 17. Be2 Qh4) 17... Nb6 18. Nd2 {It may be better to
abandon a f-Pawn. Black threatened 18......Na4 and in turn the b-pawn and the
c-Pawn.} Na4 19. Nf1 Rab8 20. Bb3 Nc5 21. Kc2 {This is probably wrong but I
had little time left.} (21. Ne3 {May be best.}) 21... a5 22. Qe3 {To gaurd the
c-Pawn.} a4 23. Bc4 d5 24. e5 {I had no time to work it out but avoided......}
(24. Qxc5 Rxb2+) 24... Qf5+ 25. Bd3 {Playing like lightning.} ({Maybe} 25. Kc1
{was better.}) 25... Nxd3 26. Qxd3 Qxe5 27. Ne3 Rb7 28. Qd4 $2 {is too
dangerous.} ({It may just be possible to save it by} 28. Rb1) ({or} 28. Ng4)
28... Qb8 29. Qxa4 Rxb2+ 30. Kd3 {I just made it [T.C.]} Qe5 31. Qa3 Rxf2 32.
Rdf1 Re8 33. Qc5 Bh6 34. Nd1 Rd2# {We lost the match 4.5 - 1.5} 0-1

