{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs then 10' for the rest} 1. d4 {I don't know why I
played this, having intended 1.e4. However, I arrived after a long journey,
very harassed and simply rushed on to defeat instead of waiting to regain my
composure.} d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 c5 4. cxd5 cxd4 {The Henning Schara gambit
which I knew nothing about.} 5. Qxd4 Nc6 6. Qd1 exd5 7. Nf3 $2 ({White should
continue} 7. Qxd5 Be6 8. Qxd8+ Rxd8 9. e3) 7... d4 8. Nb1 {From now on I'm
struggling.} Bf5 9. Qa4 Nf6 10. Bd2 Qb6 11. Qb3 Bc5 12. Qxb6 Bxb6 13. Na3 O-O
14. Nc4 {How do I develop my KBishop?} Bc7 15. h3 Rfe8 16. Rc1 Nd5 17. Kd1 {
In view of the threat .....Nb4-d3} Rad8 18. Rg1 Rd7 19. g4 Be4 20. Bg2 Nf4 21.
Bf1 d3 $1 {There is no reply.} 22. exd3 Bxf3+ {A bad start. I never got going.}
0-1

