{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs then 10' for the rest} 1. e4 c5 2. f4 e6 3. Nf3
Nc6 4. Nc3 a6 5. g3 Qc7 6. Bg2 d6 7. d3 Nf6 8. O-O Be7 9. Kh1 b5 10. b3 Bb7 11.
Bb2 O-O 12. Qd2 g6 {Creates a weakness. If he was hoping to prevent 13.f5 then
he is disapointed} 13. f5 exf5 14. exf5 d5 {Hoping to close the long Black
diagonal.} 15. Rae1 d4 16. Ne4 Nxe4 17. dxe4 Ne5 18. c3 Nxf3 19. Rxf3 dxc3 {
Leading to a fatal opening of the position.} 20. Bxc3 f6 {Forced.} 21. fxg6
hxg6 22. Qh6 Rf7 ({Not} 22... g5 $2 23. Qg6+ Kh8 24. g4 Z0 25. Rh3#) 23. Qxg6+
Rg7 24. Qf5 Rf8 25. Qe6+ Rgf7 26. Rf4 Bc8 27. Rg4+ Kh7 28. Rh4+ Kg6 29. Qd5 f5
30. exf5+ Bxf5 31. Re6+ Bf6 (31... Bxe6 32. Qh5#) 32. Be4 {A fairly violent
attack.} 1-0

