{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs then 10' for the rest} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3
dxe4 4. Nxe4 Nf6 5. Nxf6+ gxf6 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. Be2 Qc7 8. h3 Bh5 ({In the future
I might prefer} 8... Bf5) 9. O-O Nd7 10. c4 Nb6 {I'm not sure about this.} 11.
Qb3 e6 12. Be3 O-O-O 13. a4 Nd7 14. a5 e5 $5 {Active but very risky} 15. Qc2 ({
I was worried about} 15. d5 {Threatening the a-Pawn and Bb6}) 15... Bg6 16. Qc3
Kb8 17. Rfd1 e4 18. Ne1 Bd6 {Threatening to simplify by ......Bf4} 19. g3 $5 {
Gives Black a lot of chances.} Rhg8 20. Kh2 Bf5 {Threatening 21......Bxg3+} 21.
Bc1 $8 e3 $5 {Looks good but maybe......} (21... c5 {is best}) 22. Qxe3 Rde8
23. Qf3 Be4 24. Qc3 c5 25. dxc5 Nxc5 $2 {Allowing White to simplify down.} (
25... Bxc5 $142) (25... Be5 $142) 26. Rxd6 Qxd6 27. Bf4 Re5 28. Rd1 Qc7 29. Nf3
Bxf3 30. Bxf3 Ne6 31. Bxe5 fxe5 32. Rd5 Nd4 33. Bg2 a6 34. Qe3 f6 {White was
getting short of time.} 35. b4 {I tried to rush White (foolishly)instead of
taking my time and played....} Kc8 $4 (35... Qxc4 {is answered by} 36. Rd7) 36.
Rxd4 {A pity losing in my opponents time-trouble; possibly tiredness in the
3rd game of the day.} 1-0

