{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs then 10' for the rest} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5
cxd5 4. c4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. cxd5 Nxd5 8. Be2 e6 9. O-O Be7 {
Intending to pressurise the d-Pawn later.} 10. h3 Bf5 11. Be3 O-O 12. Rc1 Nxe3
{I was a little concerned that this might oversimplify things too much but I
felt that I would get practical chances.} 13. fxe3 Bg5 14. Nxg5 Qxg5 15. Rf3 {
After much thought.} e5 (15... e5 16. Z0 {Threatening} e4 {and} (16... exd4 17.
exd4 Nxd4 $1)) 16. h4 {Again after much thought and probably best.} Qg6 17. Nd5
Rae8 18. h5 {Again his best chance.} Qg5 ({Not} 18... Qxh5 $4 19. Nf6+ $1) ({
An alternative I considered was} 18... Qd6) 19. Rc5 {Again White thought for a
long time but could find no good continuation.} Be4 20. Qb3 ({Alternatively.} 
20. Rf2 Bxd5 21. Rxd5 Qxe3) 20... Bxf3 21. Bxf3 exd4 22. e4 Ne5 23. Be2 Rc8 24.
Rxc8 Rxc8 {Another success for the Caro-Kann} 0-1

