1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 exd4 5. e5 Nd5 6. cxd4 d6 7. Bb5 a6 {
Leaves him a weak Pawn on c6.} 8. Bxc6+ bxc6 9. O-O Be7 10. Qc2 Nb4 $2 {
Gets him in trouble.} 11. Qa4 dxe5 $2 {Very dangerous with his King stuck in
the middle.} 12. a3 e4 $2 (12... Nd3 {Might make it last longer.}) 13. Ne5 Qxd4
14. axb4 Qb6 15. Be3 Qb7 16. Qxc6+ Qxc6 17. Nxc6 Bf6 18. Nc3 Bd7 19. Nd4 Bxd4
$2 20. Bxd4 Bc6 21. b5 Bb7 22. bxa6 Rxa6 23. Nxe4 Rxa1 24. Rxa1 Bxe4 25. Re1 f6
26. Rxe4+ Kf7 27. Bc5 Kg6 28. Re7 Rd8 29. g3 Rb8 30. b4 c6 31. Rc7 h5 32. Rxc6
