{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr} 1. d4 f5 2. g3 g6 3. Bg2 Bg7 4. Nf3 Nh6 5. Bxh6 $2
{Leaves him very weak on the black squares} Bxh6 6. c4 O-O 7. e3 d6 8. Nc3 c6
9. O-O Nd7 10. Qb3 {[16']} Kh8 {[6']} 11. Rae1 e5 {I felt that I stood better
now.} 12. Nd2 $2 {An oversight which loses a Pawn and ties him up completely.}
exd4 13. Nd1 Nc5 14. Qc2 d3 {Maybe not the most sound but the most interesting.
} 15. Qb1 a5 16. f4 Be6 17. Nc3 {[33']} Bg7 {[18']} 18. e4 {Abreak for freedom}
fxe4 19. Ncxe4 Nxe4 20. Bxe4 Bh3 21. Rf2 ({Probably better was} 21. Bg2 Qb6+
22. Kh1 Bxg2+ 23. Kxg2 Qxb2 24. Qxb2 Bxb2 25. Re7) 21... Bd4 22. Qxd3 Bxf2+ 23.
Kxf2 Qf6 24. Nf3 Qxb2+ 25. Re2 Qf6 26. Qb1 Rf7 27. Kg1 ({Not} 27. Ng5 $4 Qxg5)
27... Bg4 28. Rb2 Bxf3 29. Bxf3 Qd4+ 30. Kg2 Qxc4 31. Be2 (31. Rxb7 {Probably
offered more chances.}) 31... Qe6 32. Rc2 d5 33. h3 Re7 34. Bg4 Qf6 35. Qb2 {
More or less giving up} Qxb2 36. Rxb2 d4 37. Rd2 Rd8 0-1

