1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. c3 {Colin Jex did well against Julian with
this system} dxc3 5. Nxc3 e6 6. Bc4 Bb4 {He has trouble on the Black squares
after this.} 7. Bd2 Nge7 8. a3 Ba5 9. O-O O-O 10. b4 Bc7 11. Bg5 f6 12. Be3 Ne5
13. Ba2 N7g6 14. Rc1 a6 15. Nd4 Nc6 16. Nf5 Kh8 17. Nd6 Bxd6 18. Qxd6 Qe7 19.
Bc5 Qxd6 20. Bxd6 Rf7 {Loses the exchange.} 21. Na4 b5 {Else he loses a piece.}
22. Nb6 Bb7 23. Nxa8 Bxa8 24. f3 ({Possibly} 24. f4 Z0 {threatening} 25. f5 {
is more energetic.}) 24... h5 25. Rc5 f5 26. exf5 Rxf5 27. Rxf5 exf5 28. Re1
Bb7 29. Re8+ Kh7 30. Bg8+ Kh6 31. f4 h4 32. Bf7 Kh7 33. Bxg6+ Kxg6 34. Rh8 Nd4
35. Rxh4 Nc2 36. Rh3 Be4 37. Be5 Kf7 38. Rg3 g6 39. Bb2 d5 40. Kf2 d4 41. Ke2
d3+ 42. Kd2 {Zugzwang!} Ke6 43. Rxg6+ Kd5 44. h4 {Agood game at this speed.}
1-0

