{Time limit 20 moves per hr} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 {The first time I've had to
play against this.} 3. exf5 e4 4. Ne5 Nf6 5. Be2 {One of the sharpest lines in
all the matches and tournaments that I've played the Greco in. I've never had
to face this line myself.} Qe7 $2 {After much though and already desperate.} ({
M.C.O.11 gives} 5... d6) ({But} 5... Bc5 6. Bh5+ Kf8 7. Nf7 Qe8 8. Nxh8 {
Looks OK for Black}) 6. Bh5+ g6 (6... g6 7. fxg6 {Resigns. After} Qxe5 8. g7+
Nxh5 9. gxh8=Q Qxh8 10. Qxh5+ {White wins easily.}) 7. fxg6 {My shortest ever
tournament game.} 1-0

