d4 Nxd5 4. Nf3 Bg4 5. Be2 e6 6. O-O Be7 7. c4 {Previously in this position I
have played} (7. Ne5) (7. h3) 7... Nf6 8. Nc3 O-O 9. h3 Bh5 10. Be3 Nbd7 11. a3
a5 12. Bf4 c6 {Very passive.} (12... c5 $142) 13. Qd2 Bg6 14. Bd3 Nb6 15. Rad1
({Not} 15. Bxg6 Nxc4 16. Bxh7+ Nxh7) 15... Nfd7 16. Bxg6 hxg6 17. Qe2 Nf6 18.
Rfe1 Nh5 {Doubtful} 19. Be5 Bf6 $2 {A tactical oversight.} 20. g4 Bxe5 {
Securing 2 Pawns for the piece.} 21. dxe5 Nf4 22. Qe3 Nxh3+ 23. Kh2 Nxc4 24.
Rxd8 Nxe3 25. Rxf8+ Kxf8 26. Kxh3 Nc4 27. Re2 Ke7 28. Ne4 Rd8 29. Rc2 Rd3 30.
Rxc4 Rxf3+ 31. Kg2 Rb3 32. Rc2 f6 33. exf6+ gxf6 34. Nc3 f5 35. gxf5 gxf5 36.
Rd2 e5 37. Kf1 b5 38. Ne2 Ke6 $2 {Missing a secod threat.} 39. Kg2 $1 {Wins
the exchange.} a4 40. Nc1 c5 41. Nxb3 axb3 1-0

