{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 6 moves per 15'} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nd2
Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. Bd3 c5 6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2 cxd4 8. cxd4 f6 9. exf6 ({M.C.O.11
gives} 9. Nf4) 9... Nxf6 10. Nf3 Bd6 11. O-O {I rather had the feeling I was
castling into it.} O-O 12. Bg5 Bd7 13. a3 {After a lot of thought and a bit
doubtful.} e5 14. dxe5 Nxe5 15. Nxe5 Bxe5 16. Qd2 Qb6 17. Rab1 $2 {I
considered his reply but underestimated it.} (17. Bxf6 $142) 17... Ng4 {
Now I really am in trouble.} 18. Ng3 {After a lot of time consuming thought.} (
{If} 18. Bf4 Rxf4 19. Nxf4 Qh6) 18... Bd4 19. Nh1 Qd6 20. g3 Bb6 21. Bf4 Qf6
22. Be2 d4 {I was short of time now.} 23. Rfe1 Qg6 24. Qd3 Qh5 25. Bxg4 Bxg4
26. Rbc1 {I had intended......} ({....} 26. Re5 {but didn't have time to work
out the various possibilities.}) 26... Rac8 27. Rxc8 Rxc8 28. h4 Qd5 29. Kh2 {
Probably a wasted move but I had no time.} Qf3 30. Qxf3 $2 {The only move I
dared to play with seconds left.} (30. Qb5 $142) 30... Bxf3 31. Rc1 Rxc1 32.
Bxc1 h5 33. Bg5 Kf7 34. g4 hxg4 35. Ng3 Ke6 36. Kg1 Kd5 {The game was
adjourned.} 37. Nf5 {Sealed move. The game resumed 1/12/76} Kc4 {The game is
lost but the match stood 3.5 - 2.5 to us so I had to continue.} 38. Nxg7 Kb3
39. h5 d3 40. Nf5 Be4 41. Nd6 Bd5 42. h6 g3 43. h7 Bxf2+ 44. Kf1 Bd4 0-1

