{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 d6 3. f4 e5 $5 {This makes
life a little difficult for Black.} 4. f5 Nf6 5. Bc4 a6 6. a4 g6 7. g4 Nxe4 {
After a long think. This probably offers better chances than anything else.} 8.
Bxf7+ (8. Qf3 {isn't so good after} Ng5) 8... Kxf7 9. fxg6+ hxg6 ({I had
expected} 9... Kxg6 {to get the King off the f-file.}) 10. Nxe4 Qh4+ 11. Nf2
Nc6 12. Ra3 Qd8 $5 {There seems no need for this.} (12... Nd4 {looks OK}) 13.
Rf3+ Kg7 14. c3 Be6 15. d3 Be7 16. Ngh3 Bd5 17. Ne4 Bxe4 {This is uncalled for.
} 18. dxe4 Bh4+ 19. Ke2 Be7 $2 {Again an unnecessary retreat from h4.} (19...
Qe7 $142) 20. Rhf1 Rf8 21. Qd2 {Crushing.} Rf4 {The alternative was to resign.}
22. Nxf4 exf4 23. Qxf4 Ne5 24. Qh6+ Kg8 25. Rh3 Bf6 26. Qh7+ Kf8 27. g5 {
Fairly decisive Lancaster won 6.5 - 0.5 [Collins 1, Jex1, Lawrence 1, Seery 1,
Ward 1, Fisher 1, M.Kearns 0.5]} 1-0

