{Time limit 24 moves per hour} 1. f4 d5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. e3 Nf6 4. Bb5 Bd7 5. O-O
e6 6. b3 Bd6 7. Bb2 Qe7 8. Qe1 {[3']} O-O-O 9. d4 Ne4 10. Nbd2 {[6']} Nb4 11.
Bxd7+ Rxd7 12. Qd1 f5 {[25']} 13. c4 {[9']} Nd3 14. Qc2 Nxb2 15. Qxb2 ({
Unfortunately} 15. c5 Nxc5 16. dxc5 Bxc5 17. Qxb2 Bxe3+ 18. Kh1 Bxf4 {is too
good for Black. However I was happy to give up Bishop for Knight.}) 15... Ba3
16. Qc2 g5 $5 {Desperation?} 17. Nxe4 fxe4 18. Ne5 Rdd8 {[46']} 19. c5 gxf4 20.
c6 b6 21. Qe2 Rdf8 22. Qa6+ Kd8 23. Qxa7 Ke8 $2 (23... Qd6 $142 {I had intended
} 24. Rxf4 Rxf4 25. Qa8+ Ke7 26. Qxh8) 24. Qa8+ Qd8 25. Qxa3 {[26']} fxe3 26.
Nd7 Rf5 27. Qa6 Rg8 28. Qe2 Qg5 ({Unfortunately for Black} 28... Rxg2+ 29. Qxg2
Rg5 {Fails to} 30. Rf8+) 29. Rxf5 exf5 30. Qh5+ Ke7 31. Qxg5+ Rxg5 32. Rf1 {
[37']} Ke6 33. Ne5 Rg8 34. g3 h5 35. Kg2 h4 36. g4 fxg4 ({Not} 36... e2 37. Re1
f4 38. Rxe2 f3+ 39. Nxf3) 37. Re1 Rf8 38. Rxe3 Rf4 39. Ng6 h3+ 40. Kg3 Rf3+ 41.
Rxf3 gxf3 42. a4 Kd6 43. Ne5 Ke7 44. b4 Kd8 45. b5 Kc8 46. Kxh3 f2 47. Kg2 e3
48. h4 1-0

