{Time limit 20 mph} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 Nxe4 5. d5 Bc5 $5 {
G.B.Fraser's counter attack.} 6. dxc6 Nxf2 ({Harding gives} 6... Bxf2+ {as best
}) 7. Qd5 Nxh1 $5 ({Harding gives} 7... Qe7) 8. Qxc5 d6 $2 {Giving away
another piece.} 9. cxb7 Bxb7 {[19']} 10. Qb5+ {[12']} Qd7 11. Qxb7 O-O 12. Qe4
d5 13. Qh4 e4 14. Nd4 c5 {[25'] Black gets some pressure with his central
Pawns.} 15. Nc2 {[16']} Rab8 16. b3 d4 17. Bf4 {[19']} Rb6 18. Nca3 e3 ({
Afterwards he suggested} 18... Rf6 {may be best.}) 19. Bd3 g6 20. Nc4 dxc3 {
[43'] This breaks up his Pawn centre.} 21. Bc2 {[27']} Re6 22. Bxe3 {He may
have overlooked that this was possible.} f5 23. Qf4 g5 {Running out of ideas.}
24. Qxg5+ Rg6 25. Ne5 Rxg5 26. Nxd7 Rxg2 27. Nxf8 Rxc2 28. Na3 Rxh2 {Black was
starting to feel outnumbered.} 29. Bxc5 Ng3 30. O-O-O Ne4 31. Nd7 Rxa2 32. Nc2
Kf7 $2 33. Ba3 f4 {Losing the Rook but White threatened ........} 34. Kb1 Rxa3
35. Nxa3 f3 36. Ne5+ Kf6 37. Nxf3 1-0

