{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs then 10 moves in 30'} 1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 e6 3. g3
Bb4 4. Bg2 O-O 5. Nf3 Nc6 6. O-O d6 7. Na4 $5 {Trying to take advantage of the
position of his Bishop but rather artificial} d5 8. a3 Be7 9. cxd5 exd5 10. d4
Re8 11. b4 {This may not be a terribly good idea either.} Ne4 12. Bb2 Bf6 13.
Rc1 a5 {I had epected this which gives Black good play.} 14. Qb3 axb4 15. axb4
Bg4 {Threat 16......BxN 17......Nd2} 16. Rfd1 Nd6 {Threatening the e-Pawn.} 17.
h3 ({If} 17. e3 Ne4 {threatening} 18. Z0 Ng5) 17... Bd7 18. Nc3 Ne7 19. e3 c6
20. Ra1 b5 21. Ne1 Nc4 22. Nd3 Nf5 {Threats to the e-Pawn loom.} 23. Rxa8 Qxa8
24. Ra1 Qc8 25. Nd1 Nfd6 26. Kh2 Bf5 27. Nc5 h5 28. Nc3 Bg5 (28... h4 {can be
answered by} 29. Ne2) 29. Bc1 Bd8 30. Ra2 Bg6 31. Qd1 h4 32. g4 Bc7 33. Kg1 Bb8
34. Na6 Be4 35. Nxb8 Qxb8 36. Nxe4 Nxe4 37. Bxe4 Rxe4 38. Qe1 g6 39. Ra6 Qc8
40. Ra7 Qb8 41. Ra6 Qb7 42. Ra2 Re8 43. Kh1 Qe7 44. f3 {After much thought.}
Qf6 {Threatening 45......Qxd4} 45. Qf2 Qd6 46. Qe1 Kg7 47. Kg1 Qe7 48. Kh1 Qb7
49. Kg1 Ra8 50. Rxa8 Qxa8 {Adjudicated. Draw At the end White can safely play
51.Qxh4} 1/2-1/2

[Event "K.L.Secondary Tournament"]
