{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 d6 3. f4 Nf6 4. Bc4 $2 {
A much too casual move leading to trouble.} e6 5. Nf3 a6 6. a4 d5 7. exd5 exd5
8. Ba2 Be7 9. d4 cxd4 10. Nxd4 O-O 11. O-O Nc6 12. Kh1 Bb4 ({I was also
concerned about} 12... Bg4 {now} 13. Nxc6 bxc6 14. Qd4 {is OK but I didn't
want a draw soplayed for a more complicated position.}) 13. Nce2 Bg4 14. Nf3
Re8 ({I was worried about.} 14... Bc5 15. Z0 Ne4) 15. h3 Bf5 16. Ng3 Be4 17.
Ng5 h6 18. N3xe4 Nxe4 19. Nxe4 dxe4 20. Be3 ({I now considered} 20. c3 {and if}
Bc5 ({However if} 20... Qxd1 21. Rxd1 Bc5 {I can't develop my Queen Bishop.})
21. Bxf7+ Kxf7 22. Qh5+ Kg8 23. Qxc5) 20... Qf6 21. c3 Ba5 (21... Rad8 $142)
22. Qb3 Rad8 23. Rad1 ({If} 23. Qxb7 Rb8) 23... Rxd1 $2 ({Stronger is} 23...
Rd3) 24. Rxd1 Rd8 $2 {Short of time he goes to pieces.} 25. Rxd8+ Nxd8 26. Qd5
{Winning a Pawn.} Qe6 $4 {With the flag hovering it all goes wrong.} 27. Qxa5
Qxa2 28. Qxd8+ Kh7 29. Qe7 Qb1+ 30. Kh2 Qxb2 31. Qxe4+ {A successful outcome
after a poor (casual) start. I had a bye in Rd1.} 1-0

