{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. c4 Nf6 5. Nc3
Nc6 6. Bg5 e6 7. Nf3 ({MCO 11 prefers} 7. c5) ({or} 7. cxd5 {Next time I'll
play 7.c5}) 7... Be7 8. c5 O-O 9. Bd3 ({Maybe} 9. Bb5 {immediately is better.})
9... b6 10. Bb5 Bb7 11. Bxc6 Bxc6 12. b4 bxc5 13. bxc5 Qa5 14. Bd2 {Best} ({If
} 14. Qd2 Bb5 {is OK for Black.}) 14... Qa6 15. Qe2 Qxe2+ 16. Kxe2 Nd7 {
Now I had to think. Black intends ....f6 folllowed by ...e5. I can't stop this
so take aim at his d-pawn} 17. Rhd1 $1 {Turns out well.} e5 18. Be3 e4 ({
Now he finds that} 18... exd4 {is a bit embarrassing e.g.} 19. Nxd4 Rac8 20.
Nxc6 Rxc6 21. Nxd5 $18) 19. Nd2 f5 20. f4 Rfb8 ({I had expected} 20... exf3+
21. Nxf3) 21. Rab1 Bd8 22. Rxb8 Rxb8 23. Rb1 Ba5 24. Rxb8+ Nxb8 25. Ndb1 Bb7
26. Kf2 ({If} 26. Bd2 Nc6 27. Ke3 Nb4) 26... Bc6 27. Bd2 Kf7 $2 {A moments
relaxation.} 28. Nxe4 fxe4 29. Bxa5 g6 30. Nc3 Ke6 31. Nd1 Ba4 32. Ne3 Nc6 33.
Bc3 h5 34. h3 Ne7 35. g4 Bd7 36. Kg3 Be8 37. Kh4 Bf7 {[1hr 44']} ({I had
expected} 37... Kf6 {to keep my King out.}) 38. Kg5 {[1hr 35']} Kd7 {Black is
a bit short of moves now.} 39. Kf6 Be8 40. gxh5 gxh5 41. f5 {A Fair effort. K.
L. won the match 3.5 - 2.5 The match was played at Carlisle.} 1-0

