{48 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 4. Nxe4 Nf6 5. Nxf6+ gxf6 6.
c3 Bf5 7. Ne2 h5 8. h4 Qc7 {[24'] Possibly a mistake.} 9. Ng3 {[37']} Bg6 $2 {
[36']} ({Possibly better is} 9... Bg4 {as I had originally intended.} 10. Be2
Bxe2 11. Qxe2 Qa5) 10. Be2 {[38']} e5 $5 {[35'] My play is all rather
artificial.} 11. Bxh5 {[43']} exd4 {[43']} 12. Bxg6 fxg6 13. Qg4 {[55'] This
surprised me somewhat.} Qe5+ {[59']} 14. Kf1 {[1hr 20']} Qb5+ {[1hr 17']} ({
Maybe} 14... dxc3 {is best but it's very complicated. Apparently he intended}
15. Qxg6+ {rather than} (15. Qc8+)) 15. Kg1 Kf7 16. cxd4 {[1hr 25']} f5 {
[1hr 29']} 17. Qf3 Bg7 $2 {Probably the losing move.} ({I considered} 17... Qd5
{but wanted more! Overpressing.} 18. Qxd5+ cxd5 {Black has good drawing
chances. Short of time I missed his 20th move.}) 18. h5 Nd7 19. hxg6+ Kxg6 20.
Rh5 $1 {[ 1hr 37'] I'd missed this.} Qa5 {[1hr 47'] I could resign.} 21. Bd2
Qd5 22. Rg5+ Kh7 {[1hr 49']} 23. Nxf5 {[1hr 44']} Bh6 {[1hr 52']} 24. Qh5 {
My play was much too artificial, not helped by the opening variation which I
feel doesn't suit my style.} 1-0

