{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 c5 4. d5 exd5 5.
cxd5 d6 6. e4 g6 7. Bb5+ Nbd7 8. Bf4 a6 9. Ba4 $5 b5 10. Bc2 Nh5 11. Be3 Bg7
12. Qd2 O-O 13. Bh6 Nb6 14. Bxg7 {[32']} Kxg7 {[14']} 15. b3 Qf6 16. Rb1 c4 17.
Nge2 b4 {A bit impetuous.} 18. Nd1 c3 19. Qd4 Qxd4 20. Nxd4 {Unfortunately
this Knight is very strong.} Re8 21. O-O Bd7 22. Ne3 Nf6 23. f3 Re7 $5 24. Ra1
Ree8 25. Bd3 Reb8 26. a3 a5 27. Nec2 {I wasn't too happy here. However White
was short of time so I felt that I could risk a Pawn sacrifice to stir it up
so....} a4 $6 28. Nxb4 axb3 29. Nxb3 Na4 {White now looked at the clock (my
new one) and asked how long he had. I replied ' one and a half minutes' he
started thinking, thought for one and a half minutes and lost on time. A
surprising end.} 0-1

