1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 d6 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4 Nc6 6. Bc4 {On the line that
I follow up with this isn't especially good} g6 7. f3 Bg7 8. Be3 a6 9. Qd2 O-O
{[13']} 10. O-O-O {[5']} e6 $4 {Suicide. This doesn't merely lose a pawn but
leaves him with a hopeless position.} 11. Nxc6 bxc6 12. Qxd6 Qxd6 13. Rxd6 Bb7
{[17']} 14. Rhd1 {[7']} Rfe8 15. Na4 Bf8 16. R6d3 Be7 17. Rb3 Bc8 18. Nb6 Rb8
19. Bf4 {Black could reisgn.} Rxb6 20. Rxb6 Nd7 {[38']} 21. Rxc6 {[17']} a5 22.
Rxc8 {This clinched the K.L. Championship for me for the second year.} 1-0

