over 30' late then looked a bit scared about a From Gambit.} 3. Nf3 d6 4. d4 g5
5. Bc4 Bg7 6. O-O {[45']} h6 {[5']} 7. c3 Ne7 8. Qb3 {[62']} O-O {[10']} 9. Na3
