{Time limit 24 moves per hr} 1. e4 e5 2. Bc4 {[0'] The first time that I've
played this in a serious game.} Bc5 3. Nc3 {[8']} Nf6 4. d3 c6 {Not very good.}
5. Nf3 d6 {[13']} 6. h3 {[13']} Be6 7. Bb3 Nbd7 8. O-O {[16']} h6 {[28']} 9. d4
{I felt that opening it up would be to my advantage.} exd4 10. Nxd4 Qe7 11. Re1
{[26']} O-O {[37']} 12. Be3 Bxb3 13. axb3 {Black now thought for ages deciding
whether to take the e-Pawn.} Nxe4 {[53']} 14. Bxh6 {[41']} f5 $1 {[57'] A good
move but only 3' left for 10 moves.} 15. Bf4 {[46']} g5 16. Bh2 Qf6 {I was
getting a little worried now but he was very short of time.} 17. Nce2 Rae8 {
Black plays "good" developing moves.} 18. c3 a6 $2 {In the rush he misses the
point of my last move.} (18... g4 $142) 19. f3 {Winning a piece. Black lost on
time. Short and sweet.} 1-0

