g6 6. c4 Bg7 7. Be3 O-O 8. Be2 Nc6 9. Qd2 Bd7 10. Nc3 a6 11. O-O Re8 12. Rfd1
Rc8 {[14']} 13. Rac1 {[8']} Ne5 {[17'] Black was already taking much longer
than I.} 14. b3 Qa5 15. h3 {I was happy to mark time as Black was getting
short on time on the clock.} Rb8 16. a4 Rec8 17. g4 Nc6 18. Kg2 e5 $5 {Black
starts to get worried.} 19. Nc2 Be6 20. b4 Qd8 ({If} 20... Nxb4 21. Nxb4 Qxb4
22. Rb1 Qa5 23. Bb6) 21. b5 axb5 {[32'] With only 8' left Black was rushing
