27. Ne1 hxg4 28. hxg4 Nxg4 29. fxg4 Bxg4 30. Qd2 Bh3+ 31. Kg1 Qe6 32. Rd1 Qe7
33. Qd6 Qe8 34. Nf3 {Black lost on time. The tournament was played at Trinity
Church Hall, Carlisle.} 1-0

