4... Bd6 5. Bd3 Bg4 6. Nbd2 {Not a good sequence unless he can persuade me to
play ........BxN which is unlikely.} Nc6 {[1']} 7. c4 $5 {I don't like this.}
Nb4 {[9']} ({I didn't like} 7... dxc4 8. Bxc4 Nxd4) ({or} 7... Nxd4 8. O-O) 8.
O-O Nxd3 9. Qe2+ Ne7 10. Qxd3 O-O 11. c5 $2 {White's main object is to force
pieces off to get a draw. However his d-pawn is left weak.} Bf4 12. Nb3 {[13']}
Ng6 {[23']} 13. h3 {[15']} Bd7 {[32']} 14. Bxf4 {[18'] Possibly not good as
the Knight is strong on f4.} Nxf4 15. Qe3 Qf6 16. Rfd1 $2 {Loses but it was
very difficult for White.} ({If} 16. Qe5 Nxh3+ 17. Kh2 Qh6) 16... Rfe8 17. Ne5
Qg5 18. g4 {Loses more quickly than either.....} (18. g3 Nxh3+) ({or} 18. Qf3
Bxh3) 18... f6 19. h4 {[32']} Qh6 {[48']} 20. Qf3 ({If} 20. g5 Qxh4 21. gxf6
Qg5+ ({Not} 21... gxf6 22. Qg3+)) 20... fxe5 21. dxe5 Rxe5 22. Nd4 Rf8 23. Qg3
Re4 {Threatening24......RxN} 24. Kf1 {Preventing 24......RxN?} Rxd4 $1 {
Quickest.} 25. Rxd4 Qa6+ 0-1

