{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 6 moves per 15'} 1. e4 d6 2. d4 g6 3. Bc4
Bg7 4. c3 Nd7 5. Nf3 c6 6. O-O b5 7. Bb3 Ngf6 8. e5 {One needs to take the
innitiative in these matches.} Ne4 ({If} 8... Nd5 9. Bxd5 cxd5 10. exd6 exd6
11. Qe2+) 9. d5 Nxe5 (9... cxd5 {Would be glorious suicide.}) 10. Nxe5 dxe5 11.
dxc6 Qc7 ({I had expected} 11... Qxd1 {after which Black has a fair game.}) 12.
Bxf7+ {Black gets good play now.} ({Maybe} 12. Bd5 {was better.}) 12... Kxf7
13. Qd5+ Be6 14. Qxe4 Rhd8 15. Na3 Bd5 16. Qg4 Qxc6 17. Nc2 h5 18. Qg3 h4 19.
Qg4 a5 20. Ne3 Be6 21. Qxh4 $5 {I felt that I could hold his KS attack but
didn't realise how many chances he would get.} Rh8 22. Qg3 Rh5 23. f3 Qc5 24.
Qf2 Rah8 25. Ng4 Qc4 ({Unfortunately for Black he can't play.} 25... Bxg4) 26.
h3 Bf6 27. Qe3 {Black now thought for a long while, could see no way to make
progress so.....} Rxh3 $6 28. gxh3 Rxh3 {Short of time I considered just about
all Knight moves, Rook moves, King & Queen movesand found.....} 29. b3 $1 Qc7
30. Qe2 Rg3+ 31. Kh1 Bxg4 32. fxg4 Qxc3 {Running out of time again, I couldn't
find a move at first but with very little time left found} 33. Bd2 Rh3+ 34. Kg1
Qg3+ (34... Rg3+ 35. Kf2 {he can't play} Bh4) 35. Qg2 Qd3 36. Be1 {Now I have
made the time control Black has no hope.} g5 37. Bf2 Rf3 38. Rfd1 Qe2 39. Qh2
e4 40. Re1 Qd3 41. Rad1 Qc3 42. Qh7+ Bg7 43. Qh5+ Kf6 44. Bd4+ {An exciting
game.} 1-0

