c6 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. O-O ({For a fleeting moment I thought I could play} 7. Bxf7+)
7... e6 8. h3 Bxf3 ({If} 8... Bh5 9. g4 Bg6 10. Ne5 {etc.}) 9. Qxf3 Nbd7 10.
Bd2 Be7 11. Qe3 {Possibly a waste of a move. Black was worried about.....} ({
.......} 11. Nd5 {but after} Qxd2 12. Nc7+ Kf8 $1 13. Nxa8 Qa5 14. Qg3 Ne8 {
Black wins the Knight. After the text move 11......0-0 is prevented.}) 11...
Qc7 12. Rfe1 O-O 13. Rad1 Rfe8 14. Qf3 Rad8 15. Ne4 Nxe4 16. Qxe4 Nf6 17. Qe5 {
Black now picked up his Queen, went to put it on b6, noticed 18.Ba5,put it
back on c7, asked me if he had to move his Queen, I said 'yes' so he played 17.
......Qd7.} ({If} 17. Qe3 c5) 17... Qd7 {[59']} (17... Qb6 18. Ba5) 18. c3 {
[63']} b6 {[64']} 19. a4 {[1hr 10'] To prevent 19.......c5} a5 {[67']} 20. Bf4
{[1hr 19']} Bd6 21. Qg5 Nd5 22. Bxd6 Qxd6 23. Re4 Qe7 24. Qg3 Qd6 {I was now
getting short of time so} 25. Qxd6 {A bit of a waste of time. After the game
\black said that he had a 'bad back' and had been playing for a draw from the
start.} 1/2-1/2

