1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. f3 Nc6 6. Be2 g6 7. c4 Bg7 8. Be3
O-O 9. Qd2 a6 10. Nc3 Re8 11. O-O Bd7 12. Rac1 Rc8 13. b3 Na7 14. a4 Nc6 15.
Rfd1 Qc7 16. Kh1 Red8 $2 17. Nd5 Nxd5 18. cxd5 Bxd4 19. Bxd4 Qa5 20. dxc6 {
In the previous rounds I beat: J.Short, D.J.Barr and P.A.Leigh} 1-0

