{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. d4 e6 2. c4 b6 3. Nc3 Bb7 4. e3 f5 5. Nf3
Bb4 6. Bd2 Nf6 7. Bd3 O-O 8. O-O Bxc3 9. Bxc3 d6 10. Nd2 {Intending to close
the long diagonal but rather denuding the KS.} Nbd7 11. Qc2 Ng4 12. h3 Nh6 {
After some consideration of.......} ({.....} 12... Qh4 13. hxg4 Rf6) 13. f4 g5
14. fxg5 ({I was more concerned about.} 14. g3) 14... Qxg5 15. Nf3 ({I had
expected} 15. e4 {but possibly the text is better.}) 15... Qxe3+ {This may
only lead to simplification.} 16. Kh1 Be4 ({The alternative was} 16... Bxf3 17.
Rxf3 Qg5 {but White gets KS attacking chances.}) 17. Bxe4 Qxe4 18. Qxe4 fxe4
19. Ng5 Nf5 20. Kh2 $2 (20. Kg1 {is correct after which Black has no good
continuation.}) 20... Ne3 21. Rxf8+ Rxf8 22. Nxe4 ({If} 22. Nxe6 Rf2 {and if}
23. Rg1 Nf1+ 24. Kh1 e3) 22... Nxc4 23. Re1 e5 24. b3 exd4 25. Bxd4 Nce5 26.
Re2 {He was short of time now.} Re8 27. Rf2 $2 {Shedding another Pawn in time
trouble.} Ng4+ 28. hxg4 Rxe4 29. Bb2 Rxg4 30. Kh3 Rg6 31. Kh2 c5 32. Kg1 d5 33.
Kf1 Re6 34. Re2 Rxe2 35. Kxe2 Kf7 36. Ke3 Ke6 37. a3 Kf5 38. Kf3 d4 39. g4+ Ke5
40. Bc1 b5 41. g5 c4 42. b4 Kf5 0-1

