{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 6 moves per 15'} 1. c4 e6 2. Nf3 b6 3. g3
Bb7 4. Bg2 f5 5. O-O Nf6 6. Nc3 Be7 7. Qc2 O-O 8. d3 h6 9. Re1 Nc6 10. a3 a5 {
Possibly unnecessary.} ({Maybe} 10... e5) 11. e4 fxe4 12. Nxe4 Qe8 ({Possibly} 
12... Nxe4 13. dxe4 Bf6 {is best}) 13. Bf4 Rc8 14. Rad1 Qg6 $5 ({Again} 14...
Nxe4 {is better. Against weaker opponents I felt I could be more enterprising})
15. Ne5 {[34']} Qf5 {[48']} 16. Nxc6 {[43']} ({He doesn't fancy} 16. Nxf6+ Bxf6
17. Nxd7 Nd4 18. Nxf6+ Rxf6 19. Qd2 Bxg2 20. Kxg2 g5 21. Be3 Nf3) 16... Bxc6 {
[50']} 17. Nxf6+ Bxf6 {[52']} 18. Bxc6 {[45']} dxc6 {[52']} 19. Qe2 {[46']} g5
{[57']} 20. Bd2 Rce8 $5 ({Running short of time I didn't want to risk} 20...
Bxb2 21. Bxg5 Bxa3) (20... Rfe8 {may be better}) 21. Bc3 Bxc3 (21... c5 {
Looks better}) 22. bxc3 {[56']} Qc5 $2 {[68'] Running short of time I look for
tactical chances but it's s abit sloppy.} 23. Ra1 Qf5 {[71']} 24. Ra2 Qf3 25.
Qe4 Qxe4 {[73']} 26. Rxe4 Rf6 27. a4 Kf7 28. h4 c5 29. d4 cxd4 30. cxd4 Rf3 31.
hxg5 hxg5 32. Re3 Rf6 33. Kg2 Rd8 34. Rd2 Rd6 35. Red3 Rc6 36. Rc3 Rf5 37. f3 {
[1hr 16']} Ke7 {[1hr 35']} 38. Kf2 g4 39. f4 {He offered a draw here.} Rh5 40.
Re2 Rd6 41. Ke3 Rh3 {[Sealed Move] The game resumed on 22/1/78} 42. Rg2 {
White decided that to draw (his aspiration!) he should double Rooks on his
second rank.} ({I expected} 42. Ke4 {after which I play} Rh1 {When he has 4
possibilities} 43. Ke5 (43. d5 Rd1 44. Rd3 Rc1 45. Rd4 Kf6 46. dxe6 (46. Rh2
exd5+ 47. cxd5 Re1+ 48. Kd3 c5) 46... Rxe6+ 47. Kd3 Rd1+ 48. Rd2 Rg1) (43. Rd2
Re1+ 44. Re3 Rc1) (43. c5 {I couldn't find a good line against this} Rc6 {
isn't good.} (43... Rd5 44. cxb6 cxb6 45. Rc4 $13)) 43... Rd1 44. Re4 (44. d5
Kf7 45. Rh2 Kg6 {etc.}) 44... c5 45. f5 ({Not} 45. dxc5 $4 R1d5+) 45... Rf1 $1)
42... Rh1 43. Rcc2 Rd8 44. c5 Ra1 45. Ra2 Rxa2 46. Rxa2 bxc5 47. dxc5 Rd5 48.
Rc2 Kd7 49. Rc4 c6 $2 {Another sloppy move.} ({I decided that} 49... Kc6 50.
Ke4 Rxc5 (50... Rd1 51. Ke5 Re1+ 52. Kd4 Rg1 {etc.} 53. Rc3 Ra1 54. Rc4 Ra3 55.
Rc3 Rxc3 56. Kxc3 Kxc5 {Maybe I had a win here.}) 51. Rxc5+ Kxc5 52. Ke5 Kb6
53. Kxe6 c5 {was no good. So decided to move ........Ke7-f6-f5, then ......c6
& .....e5. But for some reason played 19......c6?}) 50. Rd4 {Naturally} Ke7 51.
Rxd5 cxd5 {The only chance of getting something out of it.} 52. Kd4 Kd7 53. Ke5
Kc6 54. Kd4 $1 ({Not} 54. Kxe6 $2 d4 55. f5 d3 56. f6 d2 57. f7 d1=Q 58. f8=Q
Qd5+ 59. Kf6 Qf3+ 60. Kg7 Qxf8+ $19) 54... Kd7 {Casual, Sloppy play. A bad
game.} 1/2-1/2

