a3 {Another doubtful move.} Nge7 8. Nbd2 $2 f5 {[3']} 9. Nb3 {[19']} O-O {[5']}
10. c4 {[23'] Active but Black is ahead on development and also White's d-Pawn
is left weak.} dxc4 {[10']} 11. Bxc4+ Kh8 12. O-O {[28']} Qe8 {[12'] With the
nasty threat of 13......Qh5} 13. Be2 {[41']} ({Possibly he could risk} 13. h3 {
as} Qh5 14. hxg4 fxg4 {is unclear}) 13... Nd5 {[15']} 14. Bc1 {[47']} Rd8 {
[30'] Playing it safe after much thought. This move 'eyes' the d-Pawnand also
defends the Knight od d5.} ({However maybe I was too careful after} 14... Qh5
15. h3 ({Apparently he would have played} 15. g3) 15... Bxh3 16. gxh3 Qxh3 17.
Qd3 {say} Nf4 {Looks good for Black. With ......Rf6 and ......Rg6+ coming.})
15. g3 {[50']} ({After} 15. h3 Qh5 16. hxg4 fxg4 17. Ne5 Nxe5 18. dxe5 Bxe5)
15... f4 {[35']} 16. Qd3 Bf5 17. Qd1 ({An interesting line is} 17. Qd2 Bh3 18.
Re1 fxg3 19. fxg3 Qe4 20. Bd1 Rxf3 $1) 17... Bh3 18. Re1 {[57']} fxg3 {[45']}
19. hxg3 Bg4 20. Nh2 {[62']} Be6 {[53'] White was getting a bit short of time
now.} 21. Bc4 Qf7 22. Qc2 $2 {Pretty suicidal but he was short of time.} Ndb4
$1 ({My immediate thoughtwas} 22... Ne3 {but} 23. Bxe3 {holds it together.})
23. axb4 {[1hr 10']} Bxc4 {[55']} 24. Nc5 Nxd4 25. Qd2 Bxc5 26. bxc5 Nf3+ 27.
