b4 12. Na4 Nxe4 13. Bf3 f5 14. Re1 {etc.}) 12. Bg5 $2 {A wasted move, as it
turns out.} Bc5 13. Rd3 {I was feeling a bit unhappy now the text is to double
Rooks and play Be3} Be6 14. Be3 Bxe3 15. Rxe3 Ke7 16. a3 a5 17. f3 Nd7 {
He offered a draw here.} 18. Rd1 Nb6 19. Kf2 b4 20. Nb1 c5 21. c3 Na4 22. cxb4
