{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Bc4 Nf6 3. Nc3 Nc6 ({I was rather
hoping for the} 3... Nxe4 4. Qh5 {line}) 4. d3 d6 5. h3 Na5 6. Bb3 Nxb3 7. axb3
g6 8. Bg5 Bg7 9. Nd5 {Possibly this helps Black equalise.} h6 10. Nxf6+ Bxf6
11. Bxf6 Qxf6 12. Qd2 a6 13. Ne2 Qg5 14. Qxg5 hxg5 15. Kd2 Be6 16. Ra5 {
I was worried about this after playing it.. I felt that 16......g4 might be
good for Black.} Ke7 {He payed this quickly without seeming to consider.....} (
{....} 16... g4) 17. f3 g4 18. fxg4 Bxg4 19. Rf1 Be6 20. d4 {I realised that
this left my e-Pawn weak but wanted to do something active.} f6 21. b4 {
I offered a draw here.} Rh4 22. dxe5 fxe5 23. Ke3 Bc4 24. Rf2 Bxe2 25. Rxe2 Rg8
26. Ra3 g5 27. Kf2 g4 28. Rg3 Rf8+ 29. Ke3 gxh3 30. gxh3 ({I wasn't sure about
} 30. Rxh3 Rxh3+ 31. gxh3 Rh8 32. Rh2 Rh4) 30... Kd7 31. Kd3 Rf1 32. Ree3 Kc6
33. Rg2 ({If} 33. Rgf3 Rd1+ 34. Kc3 Rd4 {may be a problem.}) 33... Rh1 34. Rgg3
Kb5 35. Kc3 c5 {I was rather relieved at this.} 36. bxc5 Kxc5 37. Kb3 Rd1 {
A bit of a rush now.} 38. Rc3+ Kb5 ({Not} 38... Kd4 $4 39. Rgd3+) 39. Rcd3 Re1
40. Rge3 (40. Rge3 Rxe4 {It could go} 41. Rxe4 Rxe4 42. Rxd6 Kc5 43. Rd7 Re2
44. Kc3 e4 45. Rxb7 Re3+ 46. Kd2 Rxh3 47. Rd7 {Draws}) 40... Rxe4 {Adjudicated
drawn.} 1/2-1/2

