{Time limit 48 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Qc7 3. Nc3 a6 4. Nd5 {The
text-book variations all transpose to common lines. I rather like 4.Nd5} Qa5 5.
c3 Nf6 ({Possibly better is.} 5... e6) 6. b4 {Gaining space} cxb4 7. cxb4 Qd8
8. Nxf6+ ({If} 8. Nc3 d5) 8... gxf6 9. Bb2 Nc6 10. Qb3 e6 11. a3 Bg7 12. Be2 d6
{[34']} 13. O-O {[30']} Bd7 14. d4 Qb6 15. Rfd1 O-O 16. d5 $5 {Maybe too
impetuous.} Ne5 17. Bd4 Qd8 18. Qb2 $2 {Dithering and almost losing the game.}
Nxf3+ 19. Bxf3 e5 20. Be3 $5 (20. Bc3 {looks safer.}) 20... f5 {I thought that
I was lost now.} 21. Rac1 fxe4 22. Bxe4 f5 23. Bb1 f4 24. Bd2 Qh4 25. Be4 f3 {
Help!} 26. Qb1 Qg4 {My first thought was whether I would have to resign now.}
27. Bxh7+ ({If} 27. g3 Qh3 28. Bxf3 Rxf3) ({or} 27. Bxf3 Rxf3 {However 27.Bxh7+
}) 27... Kh8 28. Qg6 Qh4 29. Rc7 Rad8 30. Bg5 Qxh7 31. Qxh7+ Kxh7 32. Bxd8 Rxd8
33. gxf3 Kg6 ({I was expecting} 33... Bh3) 34. Rxb7 {I'm hopelessly out of
form, this being my 3rd game since February. I was conscious of being 'rusty'
during the game.} 1/2-1/2

