a3 Nc6 7. Nb3 b5 8. Be2 Bb7 9. Bf3 {Doesn't turn out too well.} Ne5 10. Nd2 {
Getting cramped.} Bc5 11. Nb3 Bd6 12. h3 Nf6 13. Nd2 {This Knight is carrying
on like a yo-yo. In 13 moves he has moved the Knight 6 times.} Rc8 14. O-O g5
$1 {This soon sorts him out.} 15. g4 {Leads to a pretty rapid collapse.} h5 16.
gxh5 Nxf3+ 17. Nxf3 $2 (17. Qxf3 {Hangs on for longer.}) 17... Nxe4 18. Nxe4
Bxe4 19. c3 ({If} 19. Bxg5 Rg8) (19. Nxg5 Bh2#) 19... Rxh5 20. Kg2 Ke7 21. Rh1
Rg8 22. Bxg5+ {A final fling rather than resigning. There was nothing to be
done.} Rgxg5+ 23. Kf1 Qc4+ 24. Ke1 Bxf3 25. Qxf3 Rd5 26. Qe3 Bf4 27. Qe2 Rhe5
28. Qxe5 Rxe5+ 0-1

