{Time limit 40 mives in 2hrs} 1. d4 e6 2. c4 b6 3. Nc3 Bb7 4. e4 Bb4 5. f3 f5 {
Recommended by Keene.} ({with} 5... Qh4+ {as an alternative.}) (5... d5 {is OK.
}) 6. exf5 exf5 7. Qe2+ Qe7 ({I didn't like} 7... Ne7 8. Bg5) ({Nor} 7... Kf7)
8. Bg5 Qxe2+ 9. Ngxe2 Nc6 {This may well be wrong.} ({Possibly} 9... d5) ({or} 
9... d6) 10. O-O-O Bxc3 11. Nxc3 h6 12. Bf4 d6 $2 13. d5 {Cramping me and
allowing an eventual Ne6.} Nce7 14. Nb5 Kd7 15. h4 Ng6 {Black is probably lost.
} 16. Bd2 Ne5 17. Bc3 Nf6 $2 (17... Ne7 {is probably better.}) 18. h5 a6 19.
Nd4 f4 20. Ne6 c6 {Trying to create some play.} 21. Nxf4 cxd5 22. cxd5 Rac8 {
As it turns out the other Rook should have moved.} 23. Kb1 Nc4 {I missed his
next move} 24. g3 $1 {A Killer!} Ke8 {Where else?} 25. Bh3 {I now considered
resigning.} Na3+ (25... Z0 {He threatens} 26. Rhe1+ Kf7 27. Be6+ Kf8 28. Ng6+ {
I thought that I'd try to hang on.}) 26. Ka1 Nc2+ 27. Kb1 Na3+ 28. Kc1 Rc4 29.
Rhe1+ Kd8 30. Ne6+ Kc8 31. Nc5+ Kb8 32. Nxb7 Kxb7 33. Re7+ Kb8 34. Bf1 Rc5 35.
Bxa6 Nxh5 36. Rd3 Nxg3 {Hoping for something.} 37. bxa3 h5 38. Kb2 Nf5 39. Rb7+
Ka8 40. f4 h4 {Time was called and I resigned. Rather casual opening play.} 1-0

