{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 30'} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nge7 5.
d4 exd4 6. Nxd4 g6 7. O-O Bg7 8. c3 O-O 9. Bg5 Nxd4 10. cxd4 c6 ({Interesting
is} 10... c5 {When White can play} 11. Be3 ({or try} 11. dxc5 Bxb2 12. Nd2 Bxa1
13. Qxa1 f6 14. Bxf6)) 11. Nc3 {[9']} d6 {[11']} (11... d5 {Loses a Pawn}) 12.
Kh1 Qc7 13. Rc1 {[13']} b5 14. Bb3 c5 {Now I thought for a while. I was a bit
worried that a big exchange would be drawish.} 15. Bd5 {The best bet.} Bb7 $2 (
15... Nxd5 16. Nxd5 {is very awkward for him.}) 16. Bxb7 Qxb7 17. dxc5 dxc5 18.
Qd6 Nc6 19. Qxc5 Ne5 20. Qe3 Nc4 21. Qe2 Rfe8 22. f3 Rac8 23. b3 b4 $1 24. Na4
({Unfortunately} 24. Nd5 {is met by} Qxd5 $3) 24... Qb5 25. Bf4 Nd6 26. Qd2 Nb7
27. h3 {There were back rank threats in some lines.} Nc5 28. Nxc5 Rxc5 29. Rxc5
Qxc5 ({If} 29... Qxf1+ 30. Kh2 {Black's Queen is a bit stuck.}) 30. Qd7 Qb5 (
30... Rc8 {Seems playable e.g.} 31. Rc1 Qxc1+ 32. Bxc1 Rxc1+ 33. Kh2 Be5+) 31.
Qxb5 axb5 32. Rd1 f5 ({If} 32... Ra8 33. Rd5 Rxa2 $4 34. Rd8+ Bf8 35. Bh6) 33.
exf5 gxf5 34. Rd5 Bc3 35. Rxb5 Ra8 36. Bh6 {Ties him up} Re8 37. Rxf5 Re1+ 38.
Kh2 Re2 39. Rc5 Re8 40. f4 Ra8 41. Kg3 Re8 42. Kf3 Rd8 43. Ke4 Rd4+ 44. Ke5
Rd8+ 45. Ke6 Bg7 46. Rg5 {on 27/11/78 I beat J.Short and H.Duckworth in the
same event} 1-0

