{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. Nf3 d5 2. d4 c5 3. e3 Bg4 4. b3 e6 5. Bb2
Nf6 6. Bd3 Nc6 7. a3 a6 8. dxc5 Bxc5 9. Nbd2 e5 {I felt that I had equalised
here.} 10. Be2 Qe7 11. h3 Bf5 12. c4 $2 {Much better to Castle first. Now he
is in trouble.} d4 13. Nf1 {Trying to keep the e-file closed. Now his King
Bishop is stuck.} Rd8 {Better than......} (13... d3 14. Bxd3 Rd8 15. Bxf5 Rxd1+
16. Rxd1) 14. exd4 exd4 15. Ng3 Bg6 16. O-O ({On} 16. b4 {Black can either
retreat the Bishop or try....} Nxb4) 16... d3 17. b4 dxe2 18. Qxe2 Qxe2 19.
Nxe2 Bb6 20. c5 Bc7 21. Ned4 O-O 22. Nxc6 bxc6 23. a4 Rb8 24. Bxf6 gxf6 25. Nd4
Be4 26. Rfe1 Bd5 27. Rab1 Be5 28. Red1 (28. Nc2 {Loses the exchange.}) 28...
Rfd8 29. b5 axb5 30. axb5 Be4 31. Rb4 cxb5 32. f3 Bc6 {Simplest} 33. Kf2 Bxd4+
34. Rdxd4 Rxd4 35. Rxd4 b4 36. Rd2 b3 37. Rb2 Bd5 38. Ke3 Be6 39. Kd4 Kf8 40.
c6 Rb5 41. c7 Rd5+ 42. Ke4 Rc5 0-1

