{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O
Be7 {I was fed up with cramped positions e.g. from the French so opted for a
more open game. It doesn't go quite the way that I intended.} 6. Bxc6 dxc6 7.
Nc3 Bg4 {This seemed O.K. but it turns out badly.} ({M.C.O. 11 recommends} 7...
Nd7) 8. h3 Bxf3 ({If} 8... Bh5 9. g4 $1) 9. Qxf3 O-O ({I'd like to castle QS
but} 9... Qd7 10. Qg3 {is no good. However, my pieces now have little scope.})
10. d3 {[7']} Qd6 {[23']} ({If} 10... Bd6 11. Bg5 {is a nuisance.}) ({I don't
want to play} 10... h6) ({and if} 10... Qd7 11. Qg3) 11. Qe2 {[18'] Now f4 is
coming.} Nd7 {[34']} 12. f4 {[22']} f6 {[42'] I thought I'd be able to hold it
after 13.f5} ({Maybe} 12... exf4 {is best.}) 13. f5 Qd4+ 14. Kh1 ({Not} 14. Be3
Qxe3+ $1) 14... Rf7 $2 {The start of tying myself up in knots.} (14... Bc5 $142
) 15. Be3 Qd6 16. h4 Nf8 $2 ({Maybe best to try.} 16... g5) 17. Rf3 {[51']} h6
$2 {[1hr 12'] Horrific.} 18. Rg3 Nd7 {[1hr 24']} 19. Bxh6 Kf8 $2 20. Rxg7 {
A poor effort.} 1-0

