{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 6 moves per 15'} 1. Nf3 c5 2. e4 e6 3. d4
cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. Nc3 Qc7 6. Be2 Nc6 7. Be3 Bb4 8. Qd2 Nf6 9. f3 d5 {Possibly
premature.} (9... O-O $142) 10. exd5 Bxc3 11. bxc3 Nxd5 12. Nxc6 Nxe3 13. Qxe3
Qxc6 14. O-O Bd7 15. f4 {White still has a bit of an edge.} Rc8 16. Rf3 Qc5 {
Trying to get into an endgame where White has a weak c-Pawn.} (16... O-O $142)
17. Rb1 Qf5 $2 ({If} 17... Qxe3+ 18. Rxe3 Bc6 19. f5 {However the text move
isn't very good.}) (17... Qa5 $142) 18. Bd3 Qa5 19. Be4 b5 20. Qd4 {Building
up the pressure.} f6 21. Rg3 Rc4 $6 {I had to risk this.} 22. Qd6 ({I expected
} 22. Qxc4 {but he headn't seen it.}) 22... g6 {I can hang on now.} 23. Rd1 Qc7
24. Qxc7 Rxc7 25. Rd6 f5 26. Bd3 Rc6 ({Maybe} 26... Bc8 {is better.}) 27. Rxc6
Bxc6 28. c4 Ke7 29. cxb5 axb5 30. Be2 Ra8 31. a3 Ra4 32. Rb3 Rxf4 {Seems to
offer the best chances.} 33. Bxb5 Bxb5 34. Rxb5 Rc4 35. Rb7+ Kf6 36. Rxh7 Ra4
$6 37. Kf2 Rxa3 38. Rc7 e5 39. Rc6+ Kg5 40. g3 f4 41. gxf4+ exf4 42. c3 Ra2+
43. Kf3 Rxh2 44. Rc5+ Kf6 45. Kxf4 1/2-1/2

