{Time limit 40 moves in 2 hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 d6 5. Bxc6+
bxc6 6. d4 f6 7. O-O ({M.C.O.11 gives} 7. Be3 $1) 7... Ne7 8. dxe5 dxe5 {
I wasn't happy about this but if........} ({.......} 8... fxe5 9. Ng5 Ng6 10.
Qh5) 9. Qe2 Be6 10. Be3 Ng6 11. g3 {I couldn't see the reason for this.} Bd6
12. Nfd2 {I thought this preceeded 13.f4 which I intended to meet with 13......
.f5} O-O 13. Nc3 Qb8 14. Nb3 Bh3 $5 {I spent a long time around here trying to
find good moves. This may be too ambituous.} 15. Rfd1 {[45']} Qc8 {[61']} 16.
Bc5 {A good move.} Qe6 17. Rd3 f5 18. Rad1 {[61']} Rad8 {[1hr 28']} 19. Bxd6
Rxd6 ({If} 19... cxd6 20. Nc5) 20. Nc5 Qc4 21. Rxd6 Qxc5 22. Na4 {[1hr 16']} ({
I had expected} 22. Rd7 Bg4) 22... Qb4 {[1hr 45']} 23. Rxc6 Qxa4 24. Qc4+ Qxc4
25. Rxc4 fxe4 26. Rxc7 h5 {I was rushing now.} 27. Rc6 Kh7 28. Rxa6 Bg4 29. Re1
Rc8 30. c3 Bf3 31. Ra5 h4 32. Rc1 hxg3 33. hxg3 Rc6 34. Kf1 Rd6 35. Ke1 Nf8 36.
Rxe5 Nd7 37. Rb5 Nb6 38. b3 Nd5 39. Rc5 g5 40. a4 g4 {Adjudicated Lost.} 1-0

