Nb6 4. d4 d6 5. f4 dxe5 6. fxe5 Nc6 7. Be3 Bf5 8. Nc3 e6 9. a3 Be7 10. Nf3 O-O
11. Bd3 Bxd3 12. Qxd3 {[4']} Na5 13. Nd2 {[2']} Bh4+ {[16']} 14. g3 Be7 15. b4
{[9']} Nc6 16. Nf3 {[10']} Nd7 17. O-O $2 {Simply the result of playing too
quickly and casually. I expected to win easily and had trouble motivating
myself. I started thinking now.} Ndxe5 18. Qe2 Nxf3+ 19. Qxf3 Nxd4 20. Qxb7 Nf5
21. Bf2 (21. Bxa7 {Seems risky.}) 21... Bf6 22. Rad1 {[21']} Qc8 {[45']} 23.
Qf3 Rd8 24. Ne4 Be7 25. Bd4 {[35'] A neat way of getting the Bishop back into
play.} Rf8 26. Bc3 Rb8 {[66']} 27. c5 c6 28. Qg4 f6 ({Despitr being short of
time he avoids.} 28... g6 $2 29. Nf6+) 29. Qe2 a6 30. g4 {[43']} Nh6 {[1hr 13']
} 31. Nd6 Bxd6 32. Rxd6 e5 33. h3 Ra8 34. Qe4 Nf7 35. Rxc6 Qe8 36. h4 Nd8 37.
Qc4+ ({I didn't like} 37. Rxa6 Rxa6 38. Qc4+ Kh8 39. Qxa6 Qg6) 37... Qf7 38.
Qxf7+ Rxf7 39. Rd6 Rf8 40. Rfd1 Nf7 41. Rd7 Rfd8 42. a4 Rxd7 43. Rxd7 Kf8 44.
b5 axb5 45. axb5 Ke8 46. c6 Rb8 47. c7 Rc8 48. Rxf7 Kxf7 49. b6 e4 {He goes on
to the bitter end} 50. Ba5 {[60']} e3 51. b7 Re8 52. c8=Q h6 53. Qxe8+ Kxe8 54.
b8=Q+ Kf7 55. Qa7+ Kg6 56. Qxe3 Kh7 57. h5 Kg8 58. Qe8+ Kh7 59. Bc3 f5 60. Qg6+
Kg8 61. Qxg7# {A very poor game, played much too fast and casually- as happens
in these evening matches.} 1-0

