{Time limit 36 moves in 1hr 30' Somewhere in Liverpool we arrived after 4hrs
travelling through snow, fog, etc. Match started at} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4
cxd4 4. Nxd4 Bc5 {I know virtually nothing about this line.} 5. Nb3 Bb6 6. Nc3
{[2']} Ne7 {[0']} 7. Be2 O-O 8. O-O {[5']} ({Maybe} 8. Qd3 Z0 {and} 9. Bf3 {
would be better.}) 8... f5 {[3'] Having got any breath back from the long
journey I was confronted by this.} 9. Bg5 {[20'] I couldn't find a better move.
} fxe4 {[7']} 10. Qd6 {[26']} Nbc6 {[7']} (10... Nf5 {Loses the exchange.}) 11.
Nxe4 Bc7 {[8']} 12. Qd2 {[28']} d5 {[9']} 13. Ng3 {[14']} h6 14. Be3 e5 {[17']}
15. c3 {[41']} Qd6 {[25']} 16. f3 {[44']} b6 {[28']} 17. Bd3 {[46']} Nf5 {[35']
} 18. Bf2 {[50']} Be6 {[45']} 19. Nxf5 {[51']} Bxf5 {[45']} 20. Bg3 {[52']}
Rad8 {[48']} 21. Rad1 {[54']} a5 {[53'] Afterwards he said that he felt that
it was level here. Possibly so but it's much easier for Black.} 22. Qc2 $2 {
[58']} (22. Kh1 $142) (22. Bxf5 $142) 22... Bxd3 {[57']} 23. Qxd3 {[64']} ({If
} 23. Rxd3 Qg6) 23... a4 {[60']} 24. Nc1 {[64']} Qc5+ {[63'] Now my mistake on
move 22 shows up. I should have played 22.Kh1 or 22.BxB} 25. Bf2 {[67']} ({
Possibly} 25. Kh1 {is still better.}) 25... d4 {[63'] Black is winning now.}
26. Ne2 {[1hr 10']} b5 {[1hr 10']} 27. cxd4 {[1hr 13']} exd4 28. Rc1 Qd5 {
[1hr 11']} 29. a3 {[1hr 16']} Bb6 30. Ng3 {[1hr 20'] I was stuck here.} Ne5 {
[1hr 14']} 31. Qe4 {[1hr 22']} Nc4 32. Qg6 {[1hr 26']} Rd6 33. Qc2 d3 34. Qb1
Nd2 35. Qa1 Nb3 {I lost on time. An interesting opening by Black. Imprecise
play after move 20: poor concentration maybe.} 0-1

