{Time limit 40' each player per game.} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 f5 3. Nxe5 Qf6 4. Nc4
fxe4 5. Be2 d5 6. Ne3 Bc5 7. O-O {[4']} Ne7 {[3']} 8. d3 d4 {I wasn't too sure
about this but couldn't spend too long thinking.} 9. Ng4 Bxg4 10. Bxg4 h5 $2 {
Worth a try at this speed.} 11. Bh3 {Unwilling to open the h-file.} g5 {[13']}
12. dxe4 $5 {After some apparently worried thought.} g4 13. Bxg4 hxg4 14. Qxg4
{White now has 4 united passed Pawns. Black gets an attack which I hoped would
prevail in the time rush.} Nd7 15. Bg5 Qg6 16. f4 {[15']} O-O-O {[19']} ({Both
} 16... Qxe4) ({and} 16... d3+ {looked risky}) 17. Kh1 Kb8 18. Nd2 Rh5 19. Rae1
Nf6 20. Qg3 Rdh8 21. h3 Nh7 22. Nf3 Bd6 23. Qf2 Nxg5 24. Nxg5 Bc5 25. c3 {
Time was getting short now for White.} Nc6 26. Qd2 dxc3 27. Qxc3 $2 Bb4 28. Qc4
Bxe1 29. Rxe1 Rd8 30. Ne6 {It was a big rush now.} Rg8 31. Ng5 Rh4 32. g3 Rxh3+
{The KS attack breaks through at last.} 33. Nxh3 Qxg3 34. Qf1 Rh8 35. e5 Rxh3+
36. Qxh3 Qxh3+ 37. Kg1 Qg3+ 38. Kf1 Qxf4+ {I won in Rounds 2 & 3 then the rate
changed to 30' per game. In Rd 4 I tried to win a drawn game and lost, in Rd 5
I played rubbish and lost. In Rd 6 I won in 7 moves in22' (including the score
fo the game) On 5/2/79 I beat J.Short in the K.L. Club Ch qf & H.Duckworth in
the Ladder Comp. On 13/2/79 at Castle School Lancaster I gave a simul for
charity P29 W26 L3} 0-1

