{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. d4 e6 2. Nf3 c5 3. c4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. g3
Nc6 6. Bg2 Nf6 7. O-O Be7 8. Nc3 Qc7 ({If} 8... O-O {maybe} 9. Bf4) 9. b3 {
[16']} d6 {[15']} 10. Bb2 {[18']} Bd7 {[15']} 11. Rc1 {Threatening 12.Ncb5 or
12.Ncd5} Rd8 $2 {After much thought but underestimating his reply.} ({I felt
that} 11... Qb8 {would be good enough}) ({but} 11... Nxd4 {not so good.}) 12.
Nd5 $1 {Best.} ({If} 12. Ncb5 Qb8 {is OK}) 12... Qb8 13. Nxc6 Bxc6 14. Nxe7
Kxe7 15. Bxc6 bxc6 16. Qd3 c5 {else 17.c5} 17. e4 Qb7 ({Maybe} 17... e5 18. f4
Nd7 {is best}) 18. e5 dxe5 19. Qe3 Qc6 20. Bxe5 Rd7 $2 {I realised my mistake
immediately} 21. Qg5 Kf8 {There is no good move.} ({I liked} 21... Qe4 22. Qxg7
Ng4 23. Qxh8 (23. Bf6+ $1) 23... Nxe5) 22. Bxf6 gxf6 23. Qxf6 Rg8 24. Rcd1 Rg7
25. Rfe1 {Just a waiting move.} Kg8 $4 {Good grief!} 26. Qd8+ {A very poor
effort - I'm not sure why.} 1-0

