{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 d6 3. Nc3 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. e3
O-O 6. Bd3 (6. Be2 $142) 6... Bg4 7. b3 {Doesn't turn out too well weakening
the long diagonal.} c5 8. Bb2 cxd4 9. exd4 Nc6 10. Be2 {An admission that his
6th move was wrong.} d5 {White looked rather worrried now.} 11. c5 {Trying to
keep it closedbut his d-pawn is left weak.} Ne8 12. Qd2 Nc7 {Now that my
d-Pawn is secure his d-Pawn is threatened. White decided that his d-pawn was
lost anyway.} 13. Rd1 Bxf3 14. Bxf3 Nxd4 15. Be2 ({I had rather hoped for} 15.
Bxd5 Nxd5 16. Nxd5 Qxd5 17. Bxd4 Qxg2 18. Rf1 Bxd4 19. Qxd4 Rad8 20. Qxd8 Qe4+
$19) 15... Nxe2 16. Nxe2 Bxb2 17. Qxb2 a5 {His c-Pawn is the target now.} 18.
O-O e6 19. Qc3 Qe7 20. a3 Nb5 21. Qc1 Rfc8 22. b4 axb4 23. axb4 b6 {A second
Pawn goes} 0-1

