{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. c4 Nf6 5. Nc3
e6 6. c5 {[1']} Be7 {[13']} 7. Nf3 {[1']} O-O 8. Bd3 b6 {[15']} 9. b4 {[7']} a5
{[15']} 10. Na4 {[7']} Nbd7 11. a3 {[13']} axb4 12. axb4 bxc5 13. bxc5 {[16']}
e5 {[51'] All of this is M.C.O.11col 9which now gives 14.Nxe5 leading to an
unclear position.} 14. dxe5 {[22']} (14. Nxe5 $13) 14... Ne4 {[59']} 15. O-O {
[33'] I was not totally happy here.} ({No doubt} 15. c6 {is worth playing.})
15... Ndxc5 {[62']} 16. Bc2 $5 {[41'] Probably not best as Black wins the
exchange for a Pawn. I felt,however, that the position would still be level.}
Nc3 {[1hr 25'] 23' thought!} 17. Nxc3 {[41']} Rxa1 {[1hr 25']} 18. Nxd5 {[42']}
Bb7 {[1hr 25']} 19. Qd4 $2 {[51'] Careless, missing the point of his 21st move.
} Rxc1 ({I had thoughts of something like} 19... Ra5 20. Nxe7+ Qxe7 21. Bxh7+
Kxh7 22. Ng5+ {etc.}) 20. Nxe7+ Qxe7 21. Rxc1 Bxf3 {Ouch!} 22. Qe3 (22. gxf3
Qg5+) ({If} 22. Qxc5 Qg5) 22... Ba8 23. Qxc5 Qxc5 ({I still expected} 23... Qg5
24. Bxh7+ Kxh7) 24. Bxh7+ Kxh7 25. Rxc5 Rb8 26. h3 Rb2 27. Rc4 {[1hr 40']} Re2
{[1hr 40']} 28. Rh4+ Kg8 29. Rd4 {[1hr 45']} Bc6 {[1hr 47']} 30. Rd6 Bb5 31.
Rd5 {[1hr 52']} (31. Rd8+ $142) 31... Be8 32. Kf1 $2 {Short of time I waste a
couple of moves. I have to risk pushing the Pawns.} Rb2 33. Kg1 {[1hr 54']} Kf8
34. f3 Ke7 35. Kh2 Ke6 36. Rd1 {A mad scramble now.} Re2 37. Rd8 Bb5 38. f4 Kf5
39. Rf8 Bc4 40. Kg1 Kxf4 {Having made the time control I now had time to
resign.} 0-1

