{Time limit 24 moves per hr} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. c3 dxc3 5. Nxc3
d6 6. Bc4 e6 7. O-O {[3']} Bd7 {[2'] An old film leaving his d-Pawn weak.} 8.
Bf4 a6 {[10']} 9. Bxd6 Bxd6 10. Qxd6 Rc8 11. Rfd1 Qe7 12. Be2 Nh6 13. h3 f5 14.
Ng5 Rd8 15. f4 {[39']} Bc8 {[28']} 16. Qxe7+ Kxe7 17. e5 Nf7 18. Nf3 g5 19. g3
gxf4 20. gxf4 b5 21. Kf2 Rhg8 22. Rg1 {[46']} Bb7 {[35']} 23. Rad1 Rxd1 $5 24.
Rxg8 Rd8 25. Rg7 h6 26. Ke3 Rd7 27. Nh4 Kf8 28. Rg1 Nd4 29. Bd3 Nc6 30. a3 Ne7
31. Be2 Nd8 32. Bh5 Bc6 33. Ng6+ Nxg6 34. Rxg6 Rh7 35. Kd4 Ke7 36. Rg8 {
Threatening 37.Bg6} Kd7 37. Kc5 Bb7 38. Kb6 Kc8 39. a4 bxa4 40. Nxa4 {The game
now degenerates somewhat. Time was getting on if we adjourned I would have
trouble meeting the limit date for the round, so play speeded up and became
scrappy.#} Rc7 41. Ka5 Rc2 42. Kb6 Bc6 43. Bd1 $5 {trying to force matters.}
Rc4 44. Nc5 Bd7 45. Be2 Rb4+ 46. Ka5 Rxb2 47. Bxa6+ Kc7 48. Nxd7 Kxd7 49. Bb5+
Kc7 50. Rg7+ Kb8 51. Kb6 Rd2 $2 {Loses outright.} 52. Rd7 Rd5 53. Rxd5 exd5 54.
Bd7 d4 55. Bxf5 Nf7 56. Kc5 Kc7 57. Kxd4 Kd8 58. Bg6 {Now the caretaker
arrived to throw us out so Black resigned. Scrappy stuff.} 1-0

