6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2 Qb6 {I'll play 8......PxP here next time (after exchanging
Pawns)} 8. Nf3 cxd4 9. cxd4 f6 10. exf6 {[6']} Nxf6 {[8']} 11. O-O Bd6 12. Re1
O-O 13. a3 Bd7 {[12']} 14. Bf4 {[27']} Nxd4 {[28'] I didn't like any of the
other lines.} 15. Nfxd4 e5 16. Be3 exd4 17. Bxd4 Bc5 18. Bxc5 Qxc5 19. b4 {
[44']} Qd6 $5 {[32']} ({I think that} 19... Qb6 $5 {[32'] may be better. I was
concerned about the d-Pawn (rather ironic as it turns out)}) 20. Ng3 Ng4 $2 {
[31'] Careless impetuous play. There's no excuse for this.} 21. Bc4 Nxf2 {
[1hr 23'] 43' thought produced nothing better.} ({If} 21... Nf6 22. Ne4) ({If} 
21... Qb6 22. Qxd5+ Kh8 23. Qxd7 Nxf2 24. Re2 $1 {and Black has no good move.})
22. Qxd5+ Qxd5 23. Bxd5+ Kh8 24. Bxb7 Rab8 25. Bd5 Rbd8 26. Rf1 $2 {This seems
to give some hope.} (26. Re7 {Seems good.}) 26... Bb5 27. Rxf2 Rxf2 28. Kxf2 {
[65']} Rxd5 {[1hr 31']} 29. Rc1 Rd8 30. Rc3 g6 $2 (30... h6 $142) 31. Ne4 {
[1hr 15']} Rd7 {[1hr 42']} 32. Rc8+ Kg7 33. Nc5 Re7 $2 {[1hr 50'] I was really
playing rubbish now.} 34. Rc7 Kf7 35. Rxe7+ Kxe7 36. Ke3 Bf1 37. g3 Kd6 38. Kd4
Kc6 39. a4 Be2 40. Ne4 Bd1 41. Nc3 Bc2 42. Kc4 g5 {Adjudicated Very Poor my
play (e.g.move 20) was careless and lacking in concentration. I must stop
trying to play forcingmoves when my position contains weaknesses. The match
was played at Lancaster Royal Grammar School.} 1-0

