{Time limit 40' for all moves} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Bc5 5. Nb3
Bb6 6. Nc3 Ne7 7. Qg4 {Possibly worth trying in a 40' game.} O-O 8. Bh6 Ng6 9.
Bg5 f6 10. Bh4 {[6']} d5 {[2'] Black is on top now.} 11. Bg3 e5 12. Qe2 d4 13.
Qc4+ Kh8 {[4']} 14. O-O-O Re8 15. Ne2 {[19']} Be6 {[5']} 16. Qd3 Nc6 17. a3 Rc8
18. f4 Bf7 19. f5 Nf8 20. Be1 Nd7 21. g4 a6 22. Ng3 Ba7 23. h4 b5 24. Bd2 Nb6 {
I felt that I could mark time to some extent as White was well behind on time
and would soon have to start rushing} 25. g5 {[27']} Qe7 {[12']} 26. Qf3 Rc7
27. Nh5 Rec8 28. gxf6 gxf6 29. Qg4 Rg8 30. Qf3 Nd7 31. Be2 Qe8 32. Rdg1 $2 {
The mistake was bound to come as his time ran short.} Rxg1+ 33. Rxg1 d3 34. Qg4
Qf8 35. Bf3 Bxg1 36. Qxg1 Bxb3 37. cxb3 Nd4+ 38. Kd1 Nxf3 0-1

