{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15'} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5.
f3 g6 {Not so good as.......} ({......} 5... e5) 6. c4 Bg7 7. Be3 Nc6 8. Qd2
Bd7 9. Nc3 a6 10. Be2 {[1']} h5 {[16'] He was obviously less familiar with
this line than I was.} 11. Rc1 Nxd4 {[30']} 12. Qxd4 {[2']} ({If} 12. Bxd4 Bh6
{is a nuisance.}) 12... O-O 13. Qd2 Bc6 {[43']} 14. O-O {[3'] I moved fairly
quicklyas he was obviously going to get a bit short of time.} Rb8 15. a4 b6 {
[46']} ({Maybe} 15... Qa5 {would allow him to force .......b5}) 16. b3 {[5']}
Qd7 17. Rfd1 {[7']} Rfd8 {[52']} 18. Bf1 e6 19. Qf2 {[11']} Qb7 ({If} 19... Qc7
20. Nd5) 20. Bf4 Ne8 {[60']} 21. Be3 {[20']} Nf6 22. Rc2 Ne8 {[64']} 23. Na2 {
[22']} d5 $2 {Short of time he tries to break out.} ({If} 23... b5 $2 24. Ba7
Rbc8 25. Bb6 Rd7 26. cxb5 {Black chose an alternate way of losing.}) 24. cxd5 (
24. cxd5 exd5 $2 25. Bxa6 {after} Qxa6 ({After} 25... Qd7 26. Nb4 Ba8 ({or} 
26... Bb7 27. Bxb7 Rxb7 28. Bxb6 Rc8 29. Rxc8 Qxc8 30. Nxd5) 27. Bxb6 Rdc8 28.
Bxc8) 26. Nb4 {He loses the exchange as well as a Pawn.}) 24... exd5 $2 {
An instantaneous reply but immediately fatal. 24......Bd7 was best.} 25. Bxa6 {
Instant disaster for Black.} 1-0

