dxe5 6. Qxd8+ Kxd8 7. Bg5+ f6 8. O-O-O+ ({Against Phil Cunningham [2/2/79
Lancaster, Morecambe & Dist Lge Lancaster A - Uni A] I played} 8. Be3) 8... Nd7
9. Be3 Bh6 10. Bxh6 {[17']} Nxh6 {[10']} 11. h3 c6 12. Nf3 Kc7 13. g4 $5 {
[24'] Creating holes for his Knights.} Nf7 {[13']} 14. Be2 Nc5 {Heading for d4
or f4. I was rather unhappy now.} 15. Nh4 $5 {Turns out badly. I intended Ng2
- e3.} Ne6 {[17']} 16. Rd2 {[45'] This doesn't help much.} ({Maybe} 16. Ng2 Z0
{and} 17. h4) 16... Nf4 {[21']} 17. Nf3 {[55']} h5 {[25'] Wins a Pawn.} 18.
gxh5 Rxh5 19. h4 ({If} 19. Ng1 Rh4 20. Bf1 Ng5) 19... Bg4 20. Bd1 Rah8 21. Rg1
