[1hr 33']} Rd4 {[63']} 27. b3 Kd6 28. Kc2 Ke7 29. Kc3 {[1hr 43']} ({I thought
about} 29. Bc8) 29... Rd8 {[1hr 11']} 30. Reg2 Nf7 {[1hr 13']} 31. Rg3 {
[1hr 51']} c5 {[1hr 22']} 32. a3 {[1hr 52']} Nd6 33. Bh3 Rdh8 34. Bf1 g5 35. a4
{[1hr 56']} Ne8 36. R3g2 Nc7 37. b4 {[1hr 57']} Ne6 38. bxc5 Nxc5 39. Kb4 Ne6
40. Rd2 Rh1 41. Rxh1 Rxh1 42. Rf2 Nd4 {Adjudicated win for Black. Black winf
the f-Pawn. I won't adopt this opening line again.} 0-1

