c5 6. c3 Nc6 7. Ne2 {[2']} Be7 {[19']} 8. O-O O-O 9. f4 {[6']} f5 {[26']} 10.
dxc5 $2 {A bit of a doubtful move.} Nxc5 {[30']} 11. Nf3 {[11']} Bd7 12. Kh1
Qe8 13. Be3 {[16']} b6 {[45']} 14. Re1 h6 15. Rc1 {[27'] This leads to trouble.
} Na5 {[55']} 16. Bxc5 bxc5 17. c4 {This is more or less forced but leads to a
poor position.} dxc4 ({If} 17... d4 {I intended} 18. b4) 18. Bxc4 Nxc4 19. Rxc4
Bb5 20. Rc2 Rd8 21. Qc1 Rd3 {[1hr 15']} 22. Nc3 {[53']} Bc6 {[1hr 16']} 23. Rd2
