his two Bishops are going to be very strong.} 25. Re3 g5 26. Ne2 {I now sat
and waited for 26......c4! which is murder after .......Bc5. However he
thought for a while and offered a draw. A lucky half point. I didn't play well.
} 1/2-1/2

