5. Nb3 {[14']} Bb6 6. Bd3 d5 7. N1d2 Ne7 8. O-O Nbc6 9. Qe2 Bd7 10. c3 {
[47'] To prevent 10.....Nb4} Ne5 {[26']} 11. Bc2 Qc7 12. Re1 N5g6 13. Nf3 {
[66']} O-O $5 {[17'] I was fairly happy with my position and decided to play
'safely' however......} ({....} 13... O-O-O {seems better.}) 14. e5 {Now I'm
subjected to a KS attack.} Ba4 {Really to get rid of the Bishop.} 15. h4 {
Rather awkward.} Qc4 {The best practical chance although it should lose a Pawn.
} 16. h5 {[1hr 20']} Nh4 {[52']} 17. Bd3 Qg4 18. Nxh4 $2 {Played straight off,
but I was expecting...} (18. Bxh7+) 18... Qxh4 19. h6 {[1hr 38']} Nf5 {[60']
Foolish. I knew that this wasn't objectively the best move and that 19......g6
or 19......f5 were better but I got carried away by the line 20.PxP?? Ng3!!}
20. Bxf5 (20. hxg7 $4 Ng3 $3) 20... exf5 21. hxg7 Kxg7 (21... Rfe8 {may be
better.}) 22. Nd4 Bxd4 23. cxd4 {[1hr 46']} Rfe8 {[1hr 16']} 24. Qd3 Qg4 $2 {
White was getting short of time so I played fairly quickly. I should have been
more careful.} 25. Re3 {[1hr 50']} Kh8 ({If} 25... Kf8 26. Qa3+ {but now I'm
in trouble.}) 26. Rg3 Qe4 (26... Qd1+ {Loses a piece.}) 27. Bg5 Kg7 28. Bf6+
Kf8 29. Qa3+ {Very poor. Move 19 was daft and then I underestimated his
chances and tried to rush him. A poor display.} 1-0

