{Time limit 40' each for all moves.} 1. d4 e6 2. c4 b6 3. Nc3 Bb7 4. e4 Bb4 5.
Bd3 f5 6. d5 (6. f3 {loses a pawn.}) 6... fxe4 7. Bxe4 Nf6 8. Bg5 O-O {White
is already in a bit of trouble.} 9. Qd3 h6 10. Bxf6 {[11']} Qxf6 {[2']} 11. Nf3
Na6 12. O-O {[16'] Now he loses a Pawn but in view of .....Nc5and also .....
Rae8 and .....PxP he probably does best to get his King out of the way.} Bxc3 {
[3']} 13. bxc3 Nc5 14. Qc2 Nxe4 15. Qxe4 Qxc3 16. Rac1 $5 {Loses another Pawn.}
Qa5 17. Qc2 {[24']} exd5 {[4']} 18. Nd4 {[26'] I'm not sure where this was
heading.} dxc4 {[5']} 19. Qxc4+ Kh8 20. Qxc7 $2 {[23'] Suicide although he was
lost anyway in view of my extra passed pawns. he was obviously worried about
the clock and rushed this.} Qd5 {[5']} 21. Nf3 Rxf3 {Naturally!} 22. Rcd1 Rd3
23. Qxb7 Rxd1 {[6'] Not a bad effort for six mins thought!} 0-1

