{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 d6 4. O-O Bd7 5. d4
Nf6 6. Re1 Be7 7. Nc3 exd4 8. Nxd4 O-O 9. Be3 Ng4 10. Nd5 {A minor blood bath
follows leaving me with some initiative.} Nxe3 11. Rxe3 Nxd4 12. Bxd7 Nxc2 13.
Qxc2 Qxd7 14. Qxc7 Qxc7 15. Nxc7 Rac8 16. Nd5 Rfe8 17. Rb3 {[30']} b6 {[52']}
18. Ra3 Bf6 19. Rxa7 Rxe4 {I now spent a long time trying to find a good line
here. After a while I pick the wrong line.} 20. Nxb6 $2 {Overlooking his 21st
move.} ({If} 20. Nxf6+ gxf6 {and Black can double Rooks on the 7th .}) 20...
Rce8 {[65']} 21. Ra8 {[63']} Bd8 $1 {Crunch. Black took a while to notice this.
} ({I expected} 21... Rxa8 22. Nxa8 Bd8 {when} 23. Rc1 Z0 {and} 24. f3 {
is good for me.}) 22. Rxd8 Rxd8 23. Nd5 {Black should win, but became careless
after winning the exchange. Quite quickly came.................} Rd4 $4 {
Losing a Rook.} 24. Ne7+ Kf8 25. Nc6 Rc4 26. Nxd8 Ke7 27. Nb7 {It's the last
mistake that loses.} 1-0

