{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 d6 5. c3 Nf6
{[2'] No doubt this is OK but 5.......Bd7 is more usual.} 6. O-O {[9']} Be7 {
[4']} 7. Re1 {[22']} b5 {[5']} 8. Bb3 Na5 9. Bc2 {[25']} c5 {[7']} 10. d4 cxd4
11. cxd4 Bg4 $5 {As White has omitted h3 I thought that this might be good.
However, I'm left weak on the white squares.} 12. dxe5 Bxf3 13. Qxf3 dxe5 {
[11']} 14. Nc3 {[41'] Nd5 is coming eventually.} Nc6 {[14'] I'm a bit doubtful
about this.} 15. Be3 {[44']} O-O {[23']} 16. Red1 {[50']} Qc7 {[30']} 17. Rac1
Qb7 18. Nd5 {[58']} Rfd8 {[47'] I could find nothing better, although I was in
2 minds about 18.......Bd8} 19. Bb1 {Threatening 20.RxN} Rac8 {[62']} 20. a3 {
[1hr 13']} Nd4 $5 {[68'] Maybe I should try to hold on. After 21NxB I have 2
Knights v 2 Bishops. I decided to try and force the issue but it proves fatal.}
21. Bxd4 {[1hr 14']} ({After} 21. Nxe7+ Qxe7 22. Bxd4 Rxc1 23. Rxc1 Rxd4 {
I'm OK.}) 21... exd4 {[1hr 12']} 22. Ba2 {[1hr 16']} h6 $2 {[1hr 23']} (22...
Rxc1 $142) 23. Rxc8 Rxc8 24. e5 {Help!} Nxd5 25. Bxd5 {[1hr 25']} Qc7 {[1hr
26']} 26. Qxf7+ {[1hr 30']} Kh8 {[1hr 26']} 27. Qe6 Rf8 $2 {Another doubtful
move hemming in the King.} 28. Be4 {[1hr 41']} Qc5 {[1hr 45']} 29. Qg6 Kg8 30.
e6 Rxf2 31. Qh7+ {I failed to equalise and then played some rather dubious
moves.} 1-0

