} f6 10. b5 {[18']} Na5 {[8'] These evening matches have to be played pretty
fast, so they tend to be not too accurate but often interesting.} 11. Na2 Nc4
12. a4 {[27']} a6 {[13']} 13. Bxc4 dxc4 14. Nc3 {[35'] I felt that.....} ({
