ever aquired 2 passed Pawns by move 19 before.} 19. Bb2 {[46']} f5 20. Qe2 {
[50']} b5 {[21']} 21. Nd2 Ne7 22. Nb1 {[56']} Nd5 {[23']} 23. Qd2 Qc6 24. f3
