{Time limit 36 moves in 1hr 30'} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. h3 Nf6 5. Nf3
O-O 6. Be2 e5 7. dxe5 dxe5 8. Qxd8 Rxd8 9. Bg5 Re8 10. Nd2 Be6 11. Nb5 Na6 12.
a3 Nd7 13. Be3 Nb6 14. O-O-O (14. O-O {is probably sounder.}) 14... Bf8 15. Nf3
f6 16. b3 {[40']} Rad8 {[58']} 17. Kb2 Nc8 $6 {Giving up a pawn, but getting
me some play in return.} 18. Nxa7 Nxa7 19. Bxa6 bxa6 20. Bxa7 Ra8 {[1hr 16']}
21. Be3 {[32']} c5 22. Nd2 c4 23. Nxc4 Bxc4 24. bxc4 Rec8 25. c5 Bxc5 26. Bxc5
Rxc5 27. Rd3 Rb8+ 28. Kc1 Rbc8 29. Rd2 Ra5 30. Kb2 Rb5+ 31. Ka2 (31. Ka2 Rc3 {
(=) I was thinking along the lines of} 32. Rhd1 Ra5 33. Rd8+ Kg7 34. R1d7+ Kh6
35. Rh8 {etc but it's drawn.}) 31... Rc3 {Here he offered a draw which I
accepted.} 1/2-1/2

