game very tired after a long meeting with the V.C.'s finance committee. I
decided to try for a quick draw to have a rest before the two games tomorrow.}
Bd7 10. Be2 Qa5 11. O-O Nxd4 12. Bxd4 {[3']} a6 {[13']} 13. Rfd1 Rfc8 ({Not} 
