{Time limit 50 moves in 2hrs 15'} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 c6 4. Nf3 b5 5. Bd3
d6 6. O-O {[7']} a6 {[5']} ({If} 6... Nd7 7. d5) 7. h3 Nd7 {[6']} 8. Ne2 e5 {
[12']} 9. a4 b4 {[14']} 10. Bc4 {[19']} Ngf6 {[15']} 11. dxe5 {[27'] I felt
that with my lead in development it would favour me to open it up.} dxe5 {
[16'] Offering a hot Pawn.} 12. Qd6 Qe7 13. Qxc6 $5 {I knew that this was
risky.} Rb8 14. Bxa6 $5 {[44'] Possibly this is going too far.} O-O {[22'] Now
I realised what my problems were.} 15. Bb5 {[52'] 18.Bd3 is no better.} Bb7 {
[29']} 16. Qc4 Rfc8 17. Qb3 Bxe4 18. Ne1 {[66'] I was seriosly worried now.}
Bd5 {[57']} 19. Qe3 {[69']} Nb6 {[59']} 20. b3 {[1hr 14'] I didn't like
opening the long diagonal but I had to cover c4.} Ne4 {[64']} 21. Bb2 $5 ({
As it turns out it might be better to play simply} 21. Rb1 {However, after} f5
{my Queen would be very embarassed.}) 21... Qh4 $1 {A good move threatening 22.
......Bh6 (which would not have been the case with my Bishop on c1). I thought
for a long time but could find no good move. I felt I was lost.} 22. Nf3 {
[1hr 28'] More to delay matters than anything else.} ({Fritz gives} 22. a5 {
1.63/0} Na8 23. Ba6 Rc5 24. Bd3 Qg5 25. Nf3 Qxe3 26. fxe3 f6 27. a6 Bh6 28. Bc1
Nb6 29. a7 Rd8 30. Rd1 Rcc8 31. Bxe4 Bxe4 32. c4) 22... Qh5 {[1hr 11']} 23. Qd3
{[1hr 41']} ({If} 23. Qc1 Bxb3) ({or} 23. Ng3 Nxg3 24. fxg3 e4 {etc.}) 23...
Ng5 $5 {Threatens various things including ......e5, but not as clear as 23....
...Rd8 I get some chances now.} ({I expected} 23... Rd8 24. Rad1 Bf6 {and I've
had it.}) 24. Ng3 {[1hr 55'] The best chance.} Nxf3+ 25. gxf3 {[1hr 21']} Qxf3
$5 {Now it's drawn, although still quite involved.} ({If} 25... Qxh3 {I had
intended} 26. a5 e4 27. fxe4 Bxb2 28. exd5 Bxa1 29. Rxa1 Na8 30. Bc6 {With
good chances.}) 26. Qxf3 Bxf3 {[1hr 28']} 27. Rfe1 {[1hr 59'] I now had 16
mins for 23 moves.} Rxc2 {[1hr 39']} 28. Bxe5 Bxe5 29. Rxe5 Rc3 30. a5 {
[2hr 1']} Nd5 {[1hr 43']} 31. Bc4 {[2hr 2']} Nf4 32. Kh2 {[2hr 3']} Nd3 {
[1hr 51']} ({If} 32... Rc2 33. Ne4) 33. Re7 {[2hr 4']} Nxf2 34. Rxf7 Rxc4 35.
Rxf3 {Moving like lightning, I knocked half the pieces over with this thereby
losing time while I picked them up.} Rc2 36. Nf1 {[2hr 6']} Ne4+ 37. Kg1 Rc3
38. Rxc3 {[2hr 9'] I briefly considered} (38. Rf4) (38. Re3 {but had too
little time to take risks.}) 38... bxc3 39. a6 c2 40. a7 Ra8 {[2hr 1']} 41. Ne3
{[2hr 10']} Rxa7 {He offered a draw here but I had 5 mins for the remaining 8
moves so I felt able to play on then think about it.} 42. Nxc2 Rxa1+ 43. Nxa1
Kf7 {[2hr 3']} 44. Kg2 Ke6 45. Nc2 {[2hr 11']} Kd5 46. Ne3+ Kd4 47. Ng4 Kc3 48.
h4 Kxb3 {[2hr 10']} 49. Kf3 Nd6 50. Kf4 Kc3 51. Nf6 Nf5 {An exciting game. I
should never have grabbed the hot Pawn but I then found the best chances and
played well when short of time.} 1/2-1/2

