{[16']} 14. Rc1 {[27']} Na6 {[20']} 15. Ba1 {[38'] He seemed to be having
trouble finding a plan.} Qa5 {[24']} 16. Nxf5 gxf5 17. Bxg7 {[44']} Kxg7 {[26']
} 18. Qd4+ Kg6 19. g4 Qb6 {This is the most solid.} 20. gxf5+ {[49']} Rxf5 {
[31'] He now thought for a bit, realised that he was getting short of time and
suddenly started playing very (unnecessarily) quickly.} 21. Qxb6 axb6 22. cxd5
cxd5 23. Rfd1 Nc5 {I was quite happy with this position.} 24. b4 Ne6 25. Rxd5
$4 {His rapid play leads to a colossal blunder.} Rxd5 26. Bxe4+ Rf5 27. Rc2 Kf6
28. Bxf5 Kxf5 {[33']} 29. e3 {[53']} Ke4 30. Kf1 Kf3 31. Rd2 Rc8 32. Rd1 Rc2
