10. h3 $142) 10... Bg4 11. h3 Bh5 12. Be2 {[6']} Qd6 {Terribly out of practice
and playing too quickly, I have got a poor opening.} 13. Re1 {[12']} Bc7 14. g3
{[13']} Qd7 {[20']} 15. Kg2 {[20']} b6 16. Nbd4 {[26']} Nxd4 {[27']} 17. Qxd4
f6 $2 {Creates a weakness.} 18. Bf4 {[22']} Rac8 {[44']} 19. Bxc7 Rxc7 20. Rad1
Rd8 21. Qf4 Bxf3+ $2 22. Bxf3 Rc4 $4 {An oversight which loses the game.} 23.
Bxd5+ ({No doubt he analysed....} 23. Qxc4 {decided it was O.K. and then
didn't think about any other tactical possibilities.}) 23... Nxd5 24. Qxc4 Kh8
$2 {A second hasty error quickens the end.} 25. Qxd5 {On Nov 12th I played a
simul at Skerton School. P30 W24 D2 L4} 1-0

