{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. c4 {The first time I've opened with other
than 1.e4 for a long time.} Nf6 2. Nc3 e6 3. g3 d5 {[1']} 4. d4 c5 5. cxd5 Nxd5
{[12']} 6. Bg2 $5 Nxc3 7. bxc3 cxd4 8. cxd4 Bb4+ {My lack of practice lately
becomes evident. I'd played 6.Bg2 I thought I could play 9.Bd2 here} 9. Kf1 (9.
Bd2 {forgetting that after} Qxd4 10. Qa4+ Bd7 11. Qxb4 {my Rook would be
en-prise.}) 9... O-O 10. Rb1 {[20']} Be7 {[21']} 11. Nf3 {[31']} ({Naturally
not} 11. Bxb7 $4 Bxb7 12. Rxb7 Qd5) ({If} 11. e3 e5) 11... Nc6 {[32']} 12. Bb2
Qa5 13. Qb3 {[47']} Rd8 {[25']} 14. Bc3 Qa3 {[33']} ({If} 14... Qa6 15. Qb2 {
is good.}) 15. h4 {[55']} Qxb3 {[52']} 16. axb3 ({If} 16. Rxb3 e5) 16... Bd7
17. Kg1 {[62']} Rac8 18. Kh2 Nb8 19. Rhc1 {[69']} Bc6 20. Ra1 {[1hr 12']} a6 {
[66']} 21. Ba5 Re8 22. e3 {[1hr 32']} Bd5 23. Nd2 Bxg2 24. Kxg2 Nc6 {[1hr 11']}
25. Bb6 {[1hr 34']} Nb4 26. Ne4 Nc2 $5 27. Rab1 ({Not} 27. Ra2 $4 Nxe3+) 27...
Rc6 $5 {[1hr 32']} 28. Bc5 {[1hr 45'] Awkward for Black. As I was getting
short of time |^ think that he wanted to rush me, and speeded up himself.} Nb4
29. Rc4 {[1hr 47']} Nd5 30. Bxe7 Nxe7 {[1hr 38']} 31. Rxc6 {[1hr 50']} Nxc6 32.
Nd6 Rb8 33. Rc1 Kf8 34. Nxb7 Nxd4 $4 {He had plenty of time but played this
quite quickly. It loses a piece.} 35. Nc5 {He now realised that 35......Nxb3
36.Rb1 was no good, so played instead} Nf5 {Ends it quickly} 36. Nd7+ {A good
strat to the season. The game was on Bd4 but was effectively Bd2 as the top 2
Bds were used for the N.Champs. The match was played at lancaster University}
1-0

