11. a3 Ba5 12. b4 Bb6 13. Bxb6 axb6 14. Nd5 {[21']} Bg4 {[5'] I was expecting
to beat my young opponent quite easily, hence the rather rapid play.} 15. Qd2
h6 16. b5 Na5 $5 {I realised that this was out of play but was rather
expecting to win quite quickly on the other wing.} 17. a4 {[23']} Qf7 {[8']
Taking the initiative.} 18. Ne1 Nf6 19. Ne3 Be6 {[10']} 20. Nf3 {[33']} Rhf8
21. Qe2 Ng4 22. Bh3 {Making it interesting.} Qh5 {Forcing his reply} 23. Nh4 g5
24. Bxg4 Bxg4 25. Nxg4 gxh4 26. Rae1 {I was a little unhappy here. He was
playing better than I had expected.} Qg5 27. Ne3 h5 {Else 28.Q.g4+} 28. Ng2 Rg8
29. Kh1 h3 30. Nh4 {[48']} Rde8 {[33']} 31. Qe4 Ref8 32. Kg1 $4 {A mistake at
last.} Rf4 33. Qe3 Rxh4 34. f4 Rxf4 35. Rxf4 Qxf4 36. Qxf4 exf4 37. Kf2 fxg3+
38. hxg3 h4 39. Rg1 $2 h2 40. Rh1 hxg3+ 41. Kg2 Kd7 42. Re1 c5 43. Re4 c4 44.
dxc4 Nxc4 {In the last couple of weeks I have also beaten Colin Fisher in the
Area Level and Drawn with Norman Blade in the League [Hopefully Norman has
this game]} 0-1

