13. O-O O-O-O {Threatening 14.......Nd4} 14. Bxc6 bxc6 ({I considered} 14...
Qxc6 15. Qxe5 Bd6 16. Qe2 Rde8) 15. Re1 Qc5 {Pressuring f2.} 16. d4 $5 {
After a long think,} ({If} 16. Qxe5 $4 Ne4 $1) 16... Qxd4 17. Be3 Qh4 ({
I had expected} 17... Qa4) 18. Qa6+ Kd7 19. Re2 {Trying to strengthen f2} d4
20. Rd1 Nd5 21. Ng4 Bd6 {Now the d-file is blocked and I assumed that he had
to play 22.Bc1. However, he again had another long think and........} 22. Bxd4
$5 {Hopeful but not sound.} exd4 23. Rxd4 {Threatening 24.Ne5+} Qg5 {
Threatening 24......Qc1+} 24. Red2 {[1hr 12']} Rde8 {[39'] Again attacking the
back rank.} 25. Qf1 h5 {He now virtually ran out of time and at the last
second managed to rattle off a few moves.} 26. Rxd5 ({If} 26. Nh2 Ne3) 26...
cxd5 27. Qb5+ c6 28. Qb7+ Bc7 29. Kf1 Qxd2 0-1

