{Time limit 24 moves in 1hr} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Nf3 Bg4 5. Qd3 {
A bit artificial} Nc6 {Immediately threatening 6......BxN} 6. Ne5 Bh5 7. f4 {
[19']} e6 {[9']} 8. Qb5 {[24'] he would do better to develop some pieces.} Qc7
{[12']} 9. c3 {[29']} a6 {[13']} 10. Qd3 {[34']} ({If} 10. Qb3 Nxd4) 10... Nf6
{[15']} 11. Nd2 Bd6 12. Ndf3 {[41']} Ne4 {[18']} 13. g3 {[45']} Ne7 $1 {
[21'] Threatening 14......f6} 14. Nh4 $2 {What follows is fairly violent.} (14.
Nd2 $142) 14... f6 15. Nef3 g5 $1 16. fxg5 {Leads to a quick finish.} (16. Ng2
Nf5 17. Z0 Rg8 18. Z0 gxf4 {is fairly horrible for Black}) 16... Bxg3+ {
Naturally.} 17. hxg3 Qxg3+ 18. Ke2 fxg5 19. Bxg5 ({If} 19. Ng2 Qf2+ 20. Kd1)
19... Qf2+ 20. Kd1 Qxb2 {Threatening everything. Also, White had approx zero
time left.} 21. Rh2 Qxa1+ 22. Bc1 Nxc3+ (22... Nxc3+ 23. Kc2 {[Time!] Easiest
is} Qb1+ 24. Kxc3 Rc8+ 25. Kd2 Qxc1+ 26. Ke2 Rc2+) 23. Kc2 {White lost on time.
White's position changed from 'solid' to chaotic remarkably quickly!} 0-1

