6. Nc3 {[7']} Bc5 {[7']} 7. Nf3 d6 8. Bg5 N8e7 9. Bd3 O-O 10. Qc2 h6 11. Be3 {
[17']} Bxe3 {[14']} 12. fxe3 f5 {I wasn't enourmously happy about all this.}
13. exf5 Bxf5 14. Ne4 {[20']} Bg4 {[23']} 15. Rf1 {[31'] After some thought.} (
{I was tempted by} 15. O-O-O Bxf3 16. gxf3 Rxf3 17. Qg2 Nh4 {but wasn't sure.})
15... Nf5 {[24']} 16. Qd2 {[34']} Nfh4 {[36']} 17. Nxh4 {[47'] Again, I
couldn't find a better line.} Rxf1+ 18. Kxf1 Qxh4 19. Kg1 Ne7 20. Ng3 Qg5 {
He offered a draw here.} 21. Rf1 Rf8 $4 {Possibly put off by my refusal of the
draw offer he blunders.} 22. Rxf8+ $5 {I saw imediately that I could win a
Pawn, so,being short of time I played it} (22. Bh7+ {is quicker}) 22... Kxf8
23. Ne4 Qh5 24. Qxa5 Bf5 25. Qd2 Bxe4 $5 26. Bxe4 Nc8 27. Qf2+ Ke7 28. Bf3 Qg5
29. h3 h5 30. Kh2 Nb6 31. b3 g6 32. g4 Qf6 33. Kg2 h4 34. Qc2 {Black's
position is very difficult.} Nd7 35. b4 Qg5 36. Kf2 b6 37. a4 Kd8 38. Ke2 Qf6
39. Be4 g5 40. Bf5 e4 $6 41. Qxe4 Qb2+ 42. Qc2 Qxb4 43. Bxd7 Kxd7 44. Qf5+ Ke8
45. Qc8+ Kf7 46. Qxc7+ Ke8 47. Qc8+ Ke7 48. Qe6+ Kf8 49. Qf5+ Ke8 50. Kf3 Qxc4
{Puts a quick end to it.} 51. Qe4+ Qxe4+ 52. Kxe4 1-0

