[11']} 10. bxc5 Be7 11. Bd3 O-O {[13']} 12. O-O {[5'] The whole game was
played very fast.} Re8 {[17']} 13. h3 {[6']} Nxd4 $2 {[20'] Desperation
already! he was clearly unhappy with his cramped position and hopes to "mix
it". However, this has little hope of success.} 14. Nxd4 {[7']} Bxc5 15. Nb3
Bb6 16. Bg5 {[13']} h6 17. Bh4 Rc8 18. Rc1 g5 {[24'] Another desperate sort of
move.} 19. Bg3 {[15']} e5 $4 {Playing too fast and unhappy with his position
he blunders badly.} 20. Ba6 Rc6 21. Nxd5 Rxc1 22. Nxf6+ Qxf6 23. Nxc1 Bd4 {
[30']} 24. Qe2 {[24']} Qd6 {[33']} 25. Bb5 Bxb5 26. Qxb5 Rb8 27. Qa5 {[28']}
