{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. Nf3 d5 2. g3 c5 3. c4 d4 4. e4 Nc6 5. d3 e5 6.
Bg2 h6 {I was quite happy with all this.} 7. O-O Bd6 8. a3 {[15'] White was
clearly unhappy. He had a long think about this.} Nge7 {[11']} 9. Ne1 g5 {[15']
} 10. Nc2 {[30'] Again after a long think.} (10. f4 gxf4 11. gxf4 exf4 12. Bxf4
Bxf4 13. Rxf4 Ng6 14. Rf1 Nge5 {must be good for Black.}) 10... a5 {[17']} 11.
Qh5 {[38']} Ng6 {[20']} 12. Nd2 Be6 13. Bh3 Qd7 14. Bxe6 Qxe6 15. Rb1 {[57']}
Kf8 {[27']} (15... O-O-O $142) 16. h3 {[1hr 10']} Kg7 {[28']} 17. Qg4 Qxg4 $5 {
Probably wrong. White's Knight on g4 proves stronger than I had expected.} 18.
hxg4 h5 19. Nf3 hxg4 20. Nh2 (20. Nxg5 $4 {Loses a piece.}) 20... Rh5 21. Nxg4
Rah8 {I started to "meander" here.} 22. Bd2 Nge7 (22... b6 $142) 23. Kg2 Kg6 $2
24. b4 {Suddenly he gets a lot of play.} axb4 25. axb4 b6 26. b5 Nb8 27. Ra1 {
[1hr 29']} Rh3 {[1hr 20'] Trying for active play on the lines of .....f5} 28.
Ra7 (28. Z0 f5 29. exf5+ Kxf5 30. f3 Kg6 31. Z0 e4) 28... f5 29. exf5+ Kxf5 30.
Kf3 Rh1 {Draw agreed. There's a lot of play in it.} 1/2-1/2

