{Time limit 45 moves in 2hrs then 15' for the rest of the game.} 1. e4 e5 2.
Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 d6 5. O-O Bg4 {Again I go into a line that I couldn't
remember much about.} 6. h3 Bh5 $6 {I didn't fance the alternatives. The text
is more risky.} (6... h5) (6... Bxf3 7. Qxf3 Qf6) 7. g4 {[20'] He takes up the
challenge.} Bg6 {[6']} 8. d4 b5 {[13']} 9. Bb3 h5 $5 {Turns out less well than
I had hoped.} 10. g5 {[28']} Qd7 11. Kh2 {[30']} Rd8 {[29']} 12. Re1 {[47']} f6
{[35']} ({I can't risk} 12... Nxd4 13. Nxd4 exd4 14. e5) 13. Nh4 {[62']
suddenly I'm in a lot of trouble.} Bf7 {[38']} 14. Bxf7+ {[1hr 11']} (14. d5
Nce7 {Is pretty horrendous too.}) 14... Qxf7 {[39']} 15. g6 Qd7 16. d5 Nce7 {
I can't remember being this cramped before.} 17. a4 b4 {Trying to keep the QS
closed long enough to untangle things. I felt that there wasn't much hope.} 18.
Qd3 Ra8 19. c3 {[1hr 35']} c5 {[55']} 20. cxb4 cxb4 21. Nd2 {[1hr 40']} Nh6 {
[59'] I had some hopes of forcing .....f5 but felt that I would probably be
wiped out on the QS first. However White only had 20' for 24 moves.} 22. Nc4 f5
{[61'] I didn't analyse this. I felt that it had to be my only chance.} 23. f3
{[1hr 50'] he now had 10' for 22 moves.} ({If} 23. Nb6 Qa7 {eyes f2}) 23... f4
24. Re2 Nc8 25. a5 Be7 26. Ng2 Qb5 27. b3 O-O 28. Bd2 Rb8 {He was rushing now.}
29. Ra4 Qc5 30. Be1 Rf6 31. Bf2 Qb5 32. Rc2 Rxg6 33. Nb2 Qb7 {He had no time
left now and was moving fast.} 34. Be1 Qd7 35. Qxa6 Nf7 36. Rxb4 $4 (36. Qc6 $1
{Wins}) 36... Ng5 37. Rxb8 Nxf3+ {Never Say Die!} 0-1

