but maybe he couldn't face returning another piece to the back rank.} 16. Qc4 {
[22']} a5 $2 (16... Nd5 $142) 17. Nd4 Qc8 18. a3 c5 {Loses straight off but....
....} ({........} 18... Nd5 19. Nxc6 {etc is also pretty hopeless for Black.})
19. Nb5 1-0

