3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 exd4 5. e5 Ne4 6. Qc2 d5 7. cxd4 Bb4+ 8. Nc3 {[4']} Bg4 {[12']}
9. a3 {[4']} Be7 {[17']} ({I was quite happy about} 9... Bxf3 10. gxf3) ({
or even} 9... Bxc3+ 10. bxc3 Bxf3 11. gxf3 {Giving me an open g-file}) 10. Bb5
Nxc3 11. Qxc3 Bd7 {[25']} 12. Bd3 {[8']} Qc8 $2 {He gets cramped and tied up
now.} 13. Be3 O-O {[30']} 14. Rc1 {[10']} Bd8 {[34'] His KS looks very weak}
15. Qc2 g6 $2 (15... h6 {Provides less of a target. Now I can open it up very
quickly.}) 16. Bh6 {[11']} Re8 17. h4 Ne7 18. h5 {[13']} Nf5 19. hxg6 fxg6 20.
g4 {[14']} Ng7 {[42']} 21. Bxg6 hxg6 22. Qxg6 Re7 23. Ng5 Bf5 24. gxf5 {[23']}
Qxf5 {[47']} 25. Qxf5 Nxf5 26. Nf3 {The rest followed at some speed.} Nxh6 27.
Rxh6 Kg7 28. Rh3 c6 29. Ke2 Re6 30. Rg1+ Rg6 31. Rxg6+ Kxg6 32. Rh8 Rb8 33. Nh2
Kg7 34. Rh3 Bb6 35. Rh4 Rh8 36. Rxh8 Kxh8 37. Kd3 Kg7 38. Ng4 Bd8 39. Ne3 Bg5
40. Nf5+ Kf8 41. Nd6 b5 {[1hr 13']} 42. Nc8 {[33']} a5 43. Na7 b4 44. axb4 axb4
45. Nxc6 Bc1 46. Nxb4 {Oct 25th 83- beat Clive Wilkinson in League match v
Brit Telecoms in 8 moves!} 1-0

