11... a6 12. Qb3 Rb8 13. b5 Be6 14. Bxd6 {[16']} Qxd6 {[23']} 15. Qa3 Qxa3 16.
Nxa3 Bf5 17. Rfe1 {[21']} Bxd3 $5 {[33']} (17... f6 {Is more solid. His d-Pawn
is now weak.}) 18. Rxe5 Ng6 19. Rd5 axb5 20. Rxd4 bxc4 21. Nxc4 Bf5 $5 22. Nd6
Bc8 23. f4 {I couldn't see the reason for this. Pressing my b-Pawn seems
better.} Ne7 24. Rc1 Nf5 25. Nxf5 Bxf5 {I offered a draw here. he checked the
positions on all the other boards and decided to play on.} 26. Rb4 {[41']} Rfc8
{[68']} 27. Rxc8+ Bxc8 28. a4 Kf8 29. Kf2 {[49']} Ra8 {[1hr 14']} 30. Ke3 {
