onto White squares. I was starting to feel less rusty now. In Rd4 I lost to D.
B.Lund (198), blocking the position, getting cramped and not being able to
manoeuvre. In Rd5 I lost to N.MSmith (164). I played the Greco couldn't
remember the relevant anaylsis, and ended up with my King stranded in the
middle.} 1-0

