{Time limit 36 moves in 1hr 30' + 30' forest of the game.} 1. d4 {[29'] He was
delayed on the M6 and arrived late.} f5 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. g3 Bg7 5. Bg2
O-O 6. Nf3 d6 {[2']} 7. O-O {[31']} c6 {[3']} 8. Bg5 {[41']} Nbd7 {[6'] The
object is to force ......e5} 9. Qd2 Qc7 {[17']} 10. Bh6 e5 {[25']} 11. Bxg7 {
[43']} Kxg7 12. d5 {[48']} Nc5 {I was quite happy with all this.} 13. dxc6 {
[52']} bxc6 {[34'] White decides to pressure my d-Pawn but my pieces have good
mobility.} 14. Rad1 {[57']} Nfe4 15. Nxe4 Nxe4 16. Qc2 Be6 17. Nd2 {[62']} Nf6
{[45']} 18. e4 {White tries for some play.} Qa5 {Trying to play actively.} 19.
b3 {[67']} Rac8 {[57']} ({Not} 19... d5 20. cxd5 cxd5 21. Qc6 Qb6 22. exd5) 20.
Qb2 Qc7 {Defending the e-Pawn and still trying for ....d5} 21. Rc1 Qb8 22. Rfd1
Kg8 {[68'] Taking the King off the long diagonal. White has no immediate
threat.} 23. Re1 {[1hr 16']} Rce8 $2 {Starting to hurry as time got short. I
realised my error immmediately.} 24. exf5 Bxf5 25. Bxc6 Re7 26. Ne4 Bxe4 {
Deciding that my best bet was a "heavy piece" ending where I have some
pressure on the f-file.} 27. Bxe4 Nxe4 28. Rxe4 Rf3 {Both short of time, it
started to speed up now.} 29. Qd2 Qb6 30. Rc2 Ref7 31. Re2 Kg7 ({If} 31... h5
32. Qh6) 32. Qd5 h5 {In the rush I missed his next-but is there anything
better.} 33. c5 {Wins outright.} Qa5 34. cxd6 $4 {Time trouble loses it.} ({
On playing my 34th I had slight hopes on the lines of} 34. Qxd6 Rxf2 35. Rxf2 (
{but} 35. Qxe5+ {wins}) 35... Qe1+ {etc}) 34... Qxd5 {My first game for 20
months!} 0-1

