25. Rb2 {I now manage to get my Rooks totally entangled.} Be8 26. Rc3 {I
suspect all this is wrong.} Rab8 27. Ra3 {[1hr 19']} b4 28. Ra5 Bg6 29. Ke1 {
[1hr 24']} Bd3 30. Ba7 {[1hr 25']} Rb7 31. Bd4 Rc8 32. Ra4 {[1hr 27' 30'']} b3
33. Bc3 Rc6 34. Ra3 {[1hr 28' 30'']} (34. Ra5 $142) 34... Bc2 35. Ra5 Rd7 36.
Ra3 Kf7 37. Ra5 {[1hr 30']} Ke6 {[1hr 18']} 38. Ke2 Rd5 39. Ra4 Kd7 40. Ke1 Kc7
41. Ke2 Kb6 42. Ke1 a5 43. Ke2 Ka6 44. Ke1 Rc8 45. Ke2 Rdc5 46. Ke1 Ra8 47. Bd4
Rc7 48. Bc3 Kb5 49. Ra3 a4 50. Ke2 Bd3+ 51. Ke1 Rf8 52. Kf2 g5 {[1hr 45'] I
felt that I'd had it now but try one more tactical play.} 53. Bd4 $4 Kb4 ({If} 
53... g4 54. axb3 axb3 55. Rbxb3+ cxb3 56. Rxb3+ Ka5 57. Rxd3) 0-1

