was playing fast.}) 23... Bxg5 {[60']} 24. Bxg5 {[34']} Rce8 25. Rc1 Qd4 26.
Be3 ({Mybe} 26. Ra3 {is best}) 26... Qf6 27. Qg5 {The resulting endgame isn't
as favourable as I expected.} Qxg5 28. hxg5 Rc8 29. Rbc3 Ra8 30. Rc7 Rfe8 {
He now had 18' left for the rest of the game I had 43'} 31. Bd4 Ng3 32. a3 $2 {
Expecting 32......Nxe4??} gxf5 (32... Nxe4 $4 33. Rh1+ Kg8 34. Rh8#) 33. exf5
