{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 15' allegro} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 d5
4. Qa4 dxe4 {After much thought. More usual are:} (4... Bd7) (4... Nf6) (4...
f6) 5. Nxe5 Bd7 6. Nxd7 Qxd7 7. Qxe4+ Nge7 {[6']} (7... Be7 {Looks better.}) 8.
Bc4 {Preventing QS castling.} g6 9. d4 Bg7 10. O-O O-O 11. Bf4 a6 12. Nd2 b5
13. Bb3 a5 14. a4 b4 15. Rfe1 Nf5 16. d5 Nb8 17. Rac1 {I was well up on time.}
Na6 18. Qc4 Nd6 19. Bxd6 cxd6 20. Ne4 Rfc8 21. Qd3 Nc5 22. Nxc5 Rxc5 23. cxb4
Rxc1 24. Rxc1 axb4 25. Qd2 Rc8 26. g3 Rxc1+ 27. Qxc1 Bd4 28. Qc4 Bc5 29. Qe4
Kf8 30. Kg2 Qe7 {With 15' added I now had 21' and he had 20' for the rest of
the game. He offered a draw here but I have all the chances in an allegro
finish. The rest of the game was playede at some speed.} 31. Qxe7+ Kxe7 32. Bc4
Kf6 33. f4 h6 {Black should "do nothing" but that is difficult with the time
ticking away.} 34. b3 g5 35. Kf3 Bb6 36. Kg4 gxf4 {Now he has isolated KS
Pawns. He was starting to panic.} 37. Kxf4 Ba5 {He offered another draw here.}
38. Kg4 Bb6 39. Kh5 Kg7 40. h3 Bd8 41. h4 Bb6 42. Bb5 Bd8 43. Be8 f6 {Scared
of Bxf7 he leaves an entry hole on e6.} 44. Kg4 Bb6 45. h5 Bf2 46. a5 f5+ 47.
Kxf5 Bxg3 48. a6 Bf2 {A mad scramble now.} 49. Ke6 Kf8 50. Bg6 Bc5 51. a7 Bxa7
52. Kxd6 Bb8+ 53. Kc5 Ke7 54. Kxb4 Kd6 55. Kc4 Bc7 56. Bf7 Bd8 57. Kb5 Ke7 58.
Be6 Kd6 59. b4 Kc7 60. Ka6 Kb8 61. b5 Bc7 62. b6 Bd6 63. b7 Be5 64. Kb6 Bd6 65.
Kc6 Bf8 66. Bc8 {My first game for the University (who won the match) for 22
years!} 1-0

