7. O-O b5 8. Bb3 O-O ({If} 8... b4 9. Nce2 Nxe4 10. Nxc6 Nxc6 11. Qd5) 9. a3
Bg4 10. f3 Bd7 11. Be3 a6 12. Nde2 c5 13. Bd5 Nxd5 14. Nxd5 Be6 15. Qd2 Nd7 16.
Rad1 $2 (16. Nxe7+ Qxe7 17. Rfd1 {Wins the d-Pawn. However, we were already
having to speed up.}) 16... Bxd5 17. Qxd5 Nb6 18. Qd3 Nc4 19. Bc1 Qc7 20. Nf4
Ne5 21. Qe2 Bf6 22. Nd5 Qd8 23. f4 Nc4 24. e5 Re8 25. b3 Nb6 {Playing very
fast now but Black had less time than I had.} 26. Nxf6+ Qxf6 27. exf6 Rxe2 28.
Rxd6 Rb8 29. Rfd1 gxf6 30. f5 Kg7 {To prevent 31.Bh6} 31. Bb2 Rxc2 $2 {Loses a
piece but he had to move very fast now.} 32. Bxf6+ Kh6 33. Bd8+ Kh5 34. Bxb6 {
I stopped recording here but won on time. Not high on quality but interesting
at this speed.} 1-0

