7. exd5 Qxd5 8. Nxc6 Qxc6 9. Bf3 Qc7 10. g3 Nf6 11. Bf4 {[2']} Qb6 {[3']} 12.
Nc3 Bd7 13. b3 Be7 14. Ne4 Rd8 15. Qe2 O-O 16. Rad1 Nd5 17. Be5 f5 18. Nc3 $2
Nxc3 19. Bxc3 Bb5 20. Rd3 ({If} 20. Bd4 {simply} Rxd4) 20... Bxd3 21. cxd3 Bf6
22. Bxf6 gxf6 $5 23. g4 fxg4 24. Bxg4 f5 25. Bf3 Rf6 26. Kh1 Rd7 27. Qe5 Rg6
28. Bh5 Rgg7 29. Rc1 Rd8 30. d4 h6 ({Not} 30... Qxd4 $4 {and I get mated.}) 31.
Rc5 Qd6 32. Qe3 Kh7 33. Re5 Rdg8 34. h4 Qe7 35. Qf4 Rg4 $2 {Playing too fast I
miss his 37th move.} 36. Bxg4 Rxg4 $2 (36... Qxh4+ 37. Qh2 Qxg4 38. Z0 {
threatening} Qd1+ {seems to win e.g.} 39. Re1 Qf3+) 37. Qxf5+ {Ouch!} Rg6 38.
Qe4 Qc7 $2 39. f3 $2 {we were moving like lightning.} ({Missing} 39. Rc5 $1 Z0
{threatening} 40. h5) 39... Qc3 40. Qe1 {He had expected 39......Qc1+ and
moving instantly made this predetermined reply.} Qc2 41. Qd1 $4 Qg2# 0-1

