Bg6 12. Nc3 Qd7 13. Bf4 O-O-O 14. Rc1 f5 $2 {He is too far behind in
development for this and anyway he had overlokked my 16th move.} 15. exf5 Nxf5
16. Nd5 {Now he's in serious trouble.} Kb8 17. Rxc7 Qe8 18. gxf5 Bxf5 19. Nh4
Bxh3 20. Re1 Qb5 {Loses very quickly but say..........} ({.....................
} 20... Be7 21. Qf3 {Threatens the Bishop and maybe Rook takes b7 check is not
attractive.}) 21. a4 Qa5 22. Bd2 {Probably quicker than 22.Rc5 in view of his
weakness on h8.} Qxc7 23. Nxc7 Kxc7 24. Ng6 {One of the reasons for playing 19.
Nh4, he now carried on at speed and the game ended quickly.} Rh7 25. Bxg8 d5
26. Bxh7 Bf5 27. Nxf8 Rxf8 28. Bxf5 Rxf5 29. Qc2+ Kb6 30. Qxf5 g6 31. Qxd5 g5
32. Qc5# 1-0

