10. Nd5 Qd7 11. Be3 Bxe3 12. Qxe3 Nge7 13. O-O-O O-O 14. f4 {Possibly the
start of his troubles.} f5 {Getting into the game as he can't reply 15.e5} 15.
h3 Rae8 16. Nxe7+ {[32']} Qxe7 {[31']} 17. exf5 Bxf5 18. Bc4+ Kh8 19. Qd2 Qe3
20. Rde1 Qxd2+ 21. Kxd2 Re4 ({I also considered} 21... Be4) 22. Bd5 {[58']}
Rxf4 {[65']} 23. Rhf1 Bd7 24. Rxf4 Rxf4 25. Bf3 Kg8 26. Bd5+ Kf8 27. c3 g6 28.
Re2 Rf5 29. c4 Ne5 30. Nd4 Rf6 31. b3 c6 32. Be4 Bc8 {The b-Pawn needed
support in some lines.} (32... d5 {is possible e.g.} 33. cxd5 cxd5 34. Bxd5 Rd6
{However time was short so I played it solid.}) 33. Kc3 Ke7 {All pretty fast
but I had more time than him.} 34. b4 Rf1 35. Bc2 Kf6 36. g4 h5 37. gxh5 gxh5
38. Re3 Rh1 {White lost on time.} 0-1

