{30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. c3 d6 {Rather a quiet line.}
5. d4 exd4 6. cxd4 Bb4+ 7. Bd2 Bxd2+ 8. Nbxd2 Nf6 9. h3 O-O 10. d5 Ne5 11. Nxe5
dxe5 12. O-O Qd6 13. Qe2 c6 14. dxc6 Qxc6 15. Rac1 Qb6 ({I considered} 15...
Be6 16. Bd5 Bxd5 17. Rxc6 Bxc6) 16. Bb3 Be6 17. Nc4 Qd4 18. Rfd1 Qxe4 19. Qxe4
Nxe4 20. Nxe5 Bxb3 21. axb3 f6 22. Nf3 Rac8 23. Rc4 Rxc4 24. bxc4 Nc5 (24...
Rc8 {May be better. Then if} 25. b3 Nc5 {attacks the b-Pawn and gains a tempo.}
) 25. b4 Na6 26. Rd7 Rc8 27. Rxb7 Rxc4 28. b5 Nc7 29. Nd2 Rc5 30. Ne4 Rc1+ 31.
Kh2 h6 32. Nd6 Rc5 33. Ne4 Rc4 34. Nd6 Rc5 35. Rxa7 Nxb5 {More or less forced.
We both had very little time now.} 36. Ra5 Nxd6 ({An alternative is} 36... Rd5
37. Nxb5 Kh7 {but I didn't have time to consider this.}) 37. Rxc5 Nf7 38. Rc7
Ne5 {very fast now.} 39. f4 Nf7 40. g4 Nd6 41. Kg3 Nf7 42. Kf3 Nd6 43. Ke3 h5
44. f5 hxg4 45. hxg4 Nf7 46. Kf4 Ng5 {We won the match and the trophy for the
second time.} 1/2-1/2

