{30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 e6 3. g3 d6 4. Bg2 Nc6 5. Nge2 Be7 6. d3 h6 7.
O-O Nf6 8. f4 e5 9. f5 a6 10. a4 Qb6 11. Kh1 O-O 12. h3 Bd7 13. g4 Kh7 {[11']}
14. Ng3 {[4']} g5 15. Qd2 {[10'] The first long think.} Nd4 16. Nd5 {[15']
Another 5' 16.h4was the main alternative.} Nxd5 {Leaves his other Knight in
limbo.} 17. exd5 f6 18. Ra3 {Now his Knight really is in trouble.} Rac8 {
Is there any way of saving the Knight?} 19. Qd1 Rc7 20. c3 Nb5 21. axb5 Bxb5
22. c4 Bd7 23. Qb3 Qa7 24. Bd2 Rcc8 25. Ne4 Rb8 26. Rfa1 Bc8 27. Qc2 Bd7 28. b4
cxb4 {He was getting short of time now.} 29. Bxb4 Bc8 30. Nxd6 Qa8 31. Qd2 Rd8
32. Nxc8 Bxb4 33. Qxb4 Rbxc8 34. Qe7+ Kg8 35. Qxf6 Rc7 36. d6 Rf7 37. Bd5 Rdf8
38. Bxf7+ Rxf7 39. Qxe5 b5+ {The longest check that I have received.} 40. Qd5
Qe8 41. R3a2 bxc4 42. dxc4 Qe3 43. Rh2 Qc3 {Here rushing he tried to play 43...
...Rd7. I didn't receive 2' as I wasn't down to my last '} 44. Rd1 Kf8 45. c5
Ke8 46. c6 Rf8 47. c7 Kd7 48. Qe6+ Kc6 49. c8=Q+ Rxc8 50. Qxc8+ {and his flag
fell.} 1-0

