{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qa5 4. Bc4 Nf6 5. d4 Bg4 6. f3
Bf5 7. Nge2 e6 8. Bd2 c6 9. Nd5 Qd8 {[8']} 10. Ne3 {[9']} Bg6 {[10']} 11. c3
Bd6 12. Ng3 $2 {Start of the troubles.} Qc7 13. Ngf1 Nbd7 14. Qe2 b5 {[16']}
15. Bd3 Bxd3 16. Qxd3 O-O 17. O-O-O $5 a5 18. Be1 {[27']} b4 {[18']} 19. c4 c5
20. d5 {[32']} Ne5 21. Qc2 exd5 22. Nxd5 Nxd5 23. Rxd5 a4 {[24']} 24. Qe2 {
[44']} Nc6 25. Bf2 Rfe8 26. Qd1 Rad8 27. Nd2 {[53']} Bf4 {[37']} 28. g3 Rxd5
29. cxd5 Ne5 30. Kb1 Bxd2 31. Qxd2 a3 32. Rc1 $1 c4 33. d6 {Active measures
are required.} Qb7 34. d7 Rd8 {[51']} 35. Qe2 {[1hr 16']} axb2 36. Rxc4 Qxd7
37. Rd4 Qf5+ 38. Qe4 Qxe4+ 39. fxe4 Rb8 40. Kxb2 Nf3 41. Rc4 Nd2 42. Rd4 Nf3
43. Rc4 Nxh2 44. Kb3 Nf3 45. Be3 Ne1 46. Bf4 Re8 47. Kxb4 Nd3+ 48. Kb5 g5 49.
Bxg5 $4 {Horrific! With hardly any time left I was rushing.} (49. Be3 {is good.
}) 49... Re5+ 50. Kb6 Rxg5 51. a4 Nb2 52. Rc8+ Kg7 53. a5 Na4+ 54. Ka6 h5 55.
Rc4 Nc5+ 56. Ka7 Kg6 57. a6 Nxa6 58. Rc6+ Kg7 59. Kxa6 Rxg3 60. Rc5 h4 {
I had to stop recording moves as I had virtually no time left but I couldn't
stop the h-Pawn.} 0-1

