Rad1 Na5 20. Qe2 Nxc4 21. bxc4 Rg8 22. h5 Qf7 23. b4 Qe8 24. a5 {With Black
reduced to passivity I simply improve the position of my pieces.} Qf7 25. Rc1
Qe8 26. Rfd1 Qf8 27. Kg2 Qe8 {[21']} 28. Kg3 {[13']} Qf7 29. Bf2 Qe8 30. Qd3
Qf8 31. Ne3 Be7 32. Qd5 Rc7 33. Ng2 Qc8 34. Nh4 Nf8 35. Ng6+ Nxg6 36. hxg6 h6
37. Be3 Re8 38. Rh1 Bf8 39. Bb6 Rd7 40. Qd2 Ree7 41. Be3 Re8 42. Rh2 Ree7 43.
Qd5 Qc6 {He offered a draw here. However, he was desperately short of time.}
44. b5 Qxd5 45. exd5 Rc7 46. Rhc2 Re8 47. b6 Rcc8 48. Kf3 {We were both short
of time and I had to stop recording the moves here. The remaining moves are
"roughly" correct.} Be7 49. Ke4 Kg8 50. c5 dxc5 51. Bxc5 Bxc5 52. Rxc5 Rxc5 53.
Rxc5 Rb8 54. Rc7 Rd8 55. Rxb7 Rc8 56. Rc7 Rb8 57. b7 1-0

