{30' each/game} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 4. Nxe4 Bf5 5. Ng3 Bg6 6. Nf3 Nf6
7. Bd3 e6 8. Bf4 Nd5 9. Bxb8 Rxb8 10. Bxg6 hxg6 11. Ne5 Bd6 12. Qf3 Qc7 13. Nc4
Be7 14. O-O-O b5 15. Ne5 Bf6 16. Nd3 $2 {Already rushing a bit.} Bxd4 17. h3
Bf6 18. Rhe1 Kf8 19. Ne4 Be7 20. g3 a5 (20... Rxh3 {Looks too risky.}) 21. h4
a4 22. Ng5 Bf6 23. Rxe6 {Looks neat but Black is making progress on the QS.} a3
24. b3 Nc3 25. Rxc6 Nxa2+ 26. Kb1 Nc3+ 27. Kc1 Qe7 28. Re1 Bxg5+ ({I wanted to
play something like} 28... Qxe1+ 29. Nxe1 a2 30. Ra6 (30. Kb2 Nd1+ 31. Kxa2
Ra8+ 32. Kb1 Ra1# {but I was short of time and couldn't risk it.}) 30... Na4
31. Rxa4 bxa4 32. Qxf6 {Spoils it but Black comes out ahead.}) 29. hxg5 Qxg5+
30. Qf4 Qxf4+ 31. Nxf4 b4 32. Rd6 Rh2 {The rest was a mad scramble} 33. Nd3 Rh5
34. Rd4 Rf5 (34... f6 {Might be better, preventing} 35. Nxb4) 35. f4 ({If} 35.
Nxb4 Rxf2 ({Not} 35... Rxb4 $4 36. Rd8#)) 35... Rd5 36. Rxb4 $4 {With almost
no time left he blunders.} Na2+ 37. Kb1 Nxb4 38. Ne5 Re8 39. c4 Rd2 40. Rc1
Rb2+ 41. Ka1 Nc2+ 42. Rxc2 Rxc2 43. Nd3 Rd8 44. Kb1 Rg2 45. Nc1 Rd1 46. c5 a2+
47. Ka1 Rxc1# {28 A pity about not having time to work out the .......Qxe1+
variation on move} 0-1

