{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 f5 2. c4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. g3 O-O 6. Bg2 d6
7. O-O c6 8. d5 {[12']} e5 {[3']} 9. dxe6 Bxe6 10. Nd2 Na6 11. Rb1 Qe7 12. b3
Rad8 13. Bb2 {[27']} (13. Ba3 {is more aggressive.}) 13... Nc7 {[15']} 14. Qe1
{[30']} Rfe8 15. e3 ({I was expecting.} 15. e4) 15... d5 16. cxd5 Nfxd5 17.
Nxd5 Nxd5 18. Nf3 f4 $1 {[43'] The most promising.} 19. Nd4 {[56']} ({If} 19.
exf4 {or 19.gxf4 then} Bf5) 19... Bc8 {[51']} 20. Nc2 $2 {[70']} ({Something
like} 20. Qc1 {looks best.}) 20... Bxb2 21. Rxb2 Qf6 22. Qc1 f3 23. Bh1 c5 $2 {
I played this to prevent 24.Nd4 but it's a bit slow.} ({I wanted to play} 23...
Nc3 {I wasn't clear about} 24. Nd4 ({Threatening} 24. Z0 Ne2#) 24... Rxd4 ({
Fritz gives} 24... c5 25. Nxf3 b5 26. Bg2 Bg4 27. h3 Bf5 28. Re1 b4 29. Rd2 Kg7
30. Nh4 Be4 {-0.11/0}) 25. exd4 Ne2+ 26. Rxe2 fxe2 27. Re1 {probably wins after
} Qxd4) ({The solid line was} 23... g5 24. Z0 {followed by} g4 25. Z0 {and} h5)
24. Ne1 Bh3 25. Bxf3 Bxf1 26. Kxf1 Kg7 {Worried about 27.Rd2 & 28.Qc4} 27. Rd2
Qc3 $2 {Hurrying as my time was short.} ({Simply} 27... b6 {is O.K.}) 28. Qd1
$4 {Fortunately, he was shorter than me for time.} ({Correct is} 28. Rc2) 28...
Nxe3+ 29. fxe3 Rxd2 {0 Lancaster A won 4 -} 0-1

