{1hr each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5
7. Bb3 d6 8. c3 O-O 9. h3 Na5 10. Bc2 c5 11. d4 Qc7 12. Nbd2 Bd7 {20 years
since I played this and I couldn't remember what to do now.} (12... cxd4 $142)
13. Nf1 Rac8 14. dxc5 dxc5 15. Bg5 Be6 16. Ne3 Rfd8 17. Qe2 Bc4 18. Nxc4 Nxc4
19. b3 Nb6 20. Rad1 h6 21. Bh4 Ne8 22. Bg3 f6 {Leaves a hole on the White
squares} (22... Bf6 $142) 23. Nh2 Rxd1 24. Rxd1 {[10']} Rd8 {[18']} 25. Nf1
Rxd1 26. Bxd1 Qd7 27. Ne3 Nc7 28. Nf5 Bf8 29. Qg4 Kh7 30. Qf3 {[15']} Qd2 {
[30']} 31. Nh4 Qd7 32. Qh5 Qe8 {[38']} 33. Qf5+ Kg8 34. Bh5 Qe6 35. Qg6 {[19']}
Kh8 {[45']} 36. Nf5 Nc8 37. Bg4 Ne7 {[51'] I was already rushing and thought
that timewise I had little hope.} 38. Nxe7 Qxe7 39. Bf5 Kg8 40. f4 Qd6 41. Qh7+
Kf7 42. Bg6+ Ke7 {Rushing like mad now.} 43. fxe5 fxe5 44. Bf5 Qf6 45. a4 Kd6
46. Qg8 Ke7 47. axb5 axb5 48. Bf2 Kd6 {Having to move almost instantaneously
now.} 49. b4 cxb4 50. cxb4 Kc6 51. Qb3 Qd6 52. Qc2+ Kb7 53. Bc5 Qf6 54. Bd7
Bxc5+ 55. bxc5 Qh4 56. c6+ Kb8 57. Qc5 Qe1+ 58. Kh2 Qa5 59. Qxe5 Qb6 60. Qxg7
b4 61. Qh8+ Ka7 62. Qa1+ Kb8 63. e5 b3 64. e6 b2 65. Qb1 Nd5 66. Kh1 Nc3 67. e7
Nxb1 68. e8=Q+ Ka7 69. Bf5 Nc3 70. Qe7+ Ka6 ({Is} 70... Kb8 {better?}) 71. Qa3+
Kb5 72. Qxb2+ Kxc6 73. Qxc3+ Kd6 74. Qf6+ {Black lost on time. I was amazed to
have kept going so long, having played 30+ moves at lightning speed. 
[Lancaster A were the Champions 2002/03]} 1-0

