Nge7 7. e5 O-O 8. Kh1 a6 9. a4 d5 10. exd6 Nf5 11. d3 Qxd6 12. Bb3 ({trying to
win a Pawn by} 12. g4 Nfe7 13. Ne4 Qc7 {may cause problems after} 14. Nxc5 f5 {
or 14.Na5}) 12... Re8 13. Ne4 Qe7 14. c3 Bh6 $2 {I don't see any point in this.
