lines for me.} 18. g4 Ng7 {Losing it completely but even after............} ({
................} 18... Nd6 19. fxe5 Bxd2 20. exd6 {Is horrific for Black.}) ({
Maybe} 18... c4 {was possible but Black is still in trouble.}) 19. g5 Bxg5 20.
