1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. f4 e6 4. Nf3 Be7 5. Bc4 a6 6. a4 d6 7. O-O Bd7 8. Kh1
Nd4 9. d3 b5 $2 {Loses a Pawn and leaves him 1v3 on the QS. The problem is
that his King is still in the middle.} 10. axb5 axb5 (10... Nxb5 {Saves the
Pawn, but the a-pawn is left weak.}) 11. Rxa8 Qxa8 12. Nxd4 bxc4 13. Ndb5 {
The threat to c7 wins a tempo.} Bxb5 14. Nxb5 Qc6 15. dxc4 Nf6 16. e5 Ne4 17.
exd6 Nxd6 18. Nxd6+ Bxd6 {If all the pieces go I win easily.} 19. Qf3 Qc8 20.
Rd1 Be7 21. b3 O-O 22. Bb2 Rd8 {He should try to keep pieces on.} 23. Qg4 Rxd1+
24. Qxd1 Qc7 25. Be5 Qc6 26. Qd3 f6 {He should sit tight and wait for me to
try to force matters. However, he was behind on time.} 27. Bc3 Bd6 28. Qe3 Qe8
29. h3 Kf7 30. Qe4 f5 31. Qf3 Bf8 32. Kg1 {More solid than 32.Qh5+} (32. Qh5+
Ke7 33. Qxh7 (33. Qxe8+)) 32... g6 33. Kf2 Bd6 34. Qb7+ Be7 35. Be5 Qd8 36. Ke2
Kg8 37. c3 Bf6 38. Bxf6 Qxf6 39. Qc8+ Kg7 $2 {Loses the c-Pawn.} (39... Kf7
$142) 40. Qxc5 Qxc3 $2 {Rushing now, he misses my reply.} 41. Qe5+ 1-0

