{30' each game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 e6 3. Bc4 a6 4. a4 Nc6 5. Nf3 Qc7 6. O-O Nf6 7.
Re1 d6 8. d3 Be7 9. Bf4 Nd4 10. e5 Nxf3+ 11. Qxf3 dxe5 12. Bxe5 Qd8 13. Rad1
O-O 14. d4 Qa5 15. d5 exd5 16. Bxf6 (16. Bxd5 {is also good}) 16... Bxf6 17.
Nxd5 Qxa4 ({If say} 17... Bxb2 {then} 18. Nb6 Z0 {threatens} 19. Qxf7+ Rxf7 20.
Re8#) 18. Nb6 $2 {getting a bit short of time, this very messy} (18. Nxf6+ gxf6
19. Re4 Qc6 20. Bd5 {Leaves him in a terrible mess.}) 18... Qxc2 19. Bxf7+ ({
Probably better is} 19. Bb3 Qxb2 20. Nxa8 {after the texy he wriggles out.})
19... Kxf7 20. Qd5+ Kg6 21. Nxa8 {Short of time I grab the Rook.} (21. Rd3 $142
) 21... Bd4 {The pressure on f2 saves it for him} 22. Qd6+ ({I considered} 22.
Rxd4 cxd4 23. Qxd4 {but was short of time}) 22... Rf6 23. Qg3+ Kh6 24. Qh4+ Kg6
25. Qg3+ Kh6 {I lost the second game after an oversight (again short of time)
in a winning position.} 1/2-1/2

