{Time control 40 moves in 2hrs then 30' allegro} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. Nc3 Bb4
4. Nd5 Nxd5 5. exd5 e4 6. Ng1 ({If} 6. Nd4 Qf6 7. c3 Bc5 {Is not good for White
}) 6... O-O {[20']} 7. c3 {[11']} Bc5 8. d4 {[14']} exd3 {[31']} 9. Bxd3 Re8+
10. Ne2 d6 11. O-O {[18']} Bg4 12. Qc2 {[19']} Qh4 {[62'] He thought for about
20' about this.} 13. Ng3 {[22']} Nd7 14. Ne4 {[28']} Bb6 15. Bg5 {[35']} Qh5
16. Bf4 $5 Qxd5 {I wasn't too concerned about the Pawn.} 17. Ng3 Nf6 18. h3 $2
{Leads to all sorts of trouble.} Bxh3 $1 {I hadn't considered this.} 19. gxh3 {
No choice!} Qf3 20. Qd2 {Forced.} g5 21. Bxd6 {Again there is little choice.}
cxd6 22. Kh2 {[1hr 14']} (22. Qxg5+ {Isn't playable.}) 22... Re5 {[1hr 21'] A
good move now I was stuck.} 23. Qd1 {[1hr 28']} Qf4 24. Qc1 Qh4 25. Nf5 {
I thought that I was OK here however......} Rxf5 $1 26. Bxf5 Bxf2 27. Qd2 Qg3+
28. Kh1 Qf3+ 29. Kh2 {Again I thought I was OK.} Ne4 $1 {I hadn't seen this
which effectively ins outright.} 30. Qd1 {[1hr 55']} ({I had simply assumed
that I could play} 30. Bxe4 {however} Qg3+ 31. Kh1 Qxh3#) ({If} 30. Rxf2 Qg3+
31. Kh1 Nxf2+) ({If} 30. Qd5 Bg3+ 31. Kg1 Qe2) 30... Qxf5 {With very little
time each, it is now a rush to move 40.} 31. Qg4 Qxg4 32. hxg4 Bg3+ 33. Kg2 Bf4
34. Rad1 Nf6 35. Kf3 $2 Re8 36. Rg1 Re3+ 37. Kf2 Ne4+ 38. Kf1 Ng3+ 39. Kf2 Ne4+
40. Kf1 Rf3+ 41. Ke2 Rf2+ 42. Kd3 Nc5+ {We won the match 3.5 - 0.5} 0-1

