{1 hr 30' for all moves} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 b6 4. Nc3 Bb7 5. g3 d5 6.
Bg2 Be7 7. cxd5 Nxd5 8. O-O O-O 9. Qc2 {[8']} Na6 {[4']} 10. a3 c5 11. e4 {
Gives me the c-file.} Nxc3 12. bxc3 cxd4 13. cxd4 Rc8 14. Qb1 Qc7 15. Bf4 Qc2
16. Qxc2 Rxc2 17. Ne5 Rc3 18. Bc1 Nc7 19. Rd1 Rd8 20. a4 Na6 21. d5 $2 {
Gives me a Pawn.} f6 22. Nd3 exd5 23. e5 fxe5 24. Nxe5 Nc5 25. Bb2 Rc2 26. Bd4
Nb3 27. Rab1 Nxd4 28. Rxd4 Bc5 29. Rf4 Re8 ({I had originally intended.} 29...
Bd6 30. Re1 ({However, White has} 30. Nf7 $1) 30... Re8 31. Rf5 Bxe5 32. Rfxe5
Rxe5 33. Rxe5 Rc1+ {winning a piece.}) 30. Nd3 Rf8 31. Rxf8+ Kxf8 32. Nxc5 Rxc5
33. Bf3 Ke7 34. Rb4 Kd6 35. Be2 Ke5 36. f4+ Kd6 37. Kf2 Rc3 {Time was getting
short and I didn't have enough to think about it so a number of these moves
are inaccurate.} 38. a5 Kc7 39. axb6+ axb6 40. Rd4 Ra3 41. Rd2 {[88']} (41. f5
$142) 41... Ra8 {[1hr 8']} 42. Bd3 h6 43. Ke3 Kd6 44. Kd4 Bc6 45. Rb2 Rb8 46.
Bb5 Ra8 ({I didn't have time to think about} 46... Bxb5 47. Rxb5 Kc6 48. Rxd5
b5 {etc}) 47. Bd3 Ra4+ 48. Ke3 Kc7 49. h4 $2 {Gives me a target on g3} Ra5 50.
Kd2 Ra1 51. Be2 Rg1 52. g4 Rg2 53. Ke3 b5 54. Rb4 ({Not} 54. Kf3 $4 d4#) 54...
Kb6 55. Bd1 Kc5 56. Rb1 d4+ 57. Kd3 Rg3+ 58. Kd2 Be4 59. Rc1+ Kb4 60. Rc7 Bf3
61. Bxf3 Rxf3 62. Rxg7 Rxf4 63. h5 Kb3 {All this was in a rush.} 64. g5 hxg5
65. Rxg5 b4 $2 {For some reason I didn't put the Rook behind the h-Pawn. 65....
..b4? shouldn't win but it was all very rapid now.} (65... Rh4 {Wins. [Dick
did not have 6-Piece Tablebases]}) 66. Rg3+ Kb2 67. Rh3 Rf7 68. h6 Rh7 69. Rh2
(69. Rh5 {Seems to draw.}) 69... b3 70. Kd3+ Kb1 71. Rh1+ Ka2 72. Kxd4 b2 73.
Rh2 Ka1 0-1

