{1hr 30' all moves} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 Bf5 4. Bd3 Bg6 5. Nf3 e6 6. a3 c5
7. c3 Nc6 8. O-O Qb6 (8... a5 {Might be better.}) 9. Bxg6 hxg6 10. Re1 {[6']}
Nh6 {[4']} 11. b4 cxd4 12. cxd4 Nf5 13. Be3 Be7 14. Nc3 O-O 15. Na4 {I wasn't
happy here.} Qb5 16. Nc5 ({Since White would have been happy with a draw} 16.
Nc3 {might have been better.}) 16... Bxc5 17. bxc5 Nxe3 18. Rxe3 Na5 19. Rb1
Qc6 20. Qe1 (20. Nd2 {Keeping my Knight out of c4 looks better.}) 20... Nc4 21.
Reb3 b6 22. cxb6 axb6 {I was much happier now with the better Knight and
pressure on his a-Pawn.} 23. Qc3 Rfc8 24. Rc1 Qa4 25. Qb4 {Loses the a-pawn.} (
{If} 25. Ra1 Nxe5) 25... Nxa3 26. Rxc8+ Rxc8 27. h3 Qxb4 28. Rxb4 Nc4 29. Ra4
Rb8 30. Ng5 {With thoughts of 31.Ra7 but it simply puts the Knight out of play.
} b5 31. Rb4 Na5 32. Nf3 Nc6 33. Rb3 f6 34. exf6 gxf6 35. Kf1 Kf7 36. Ke2 e5
37. dxe5 fxe5 38. Ke3 Kf6 39. Rb2 b4 40. Rc2 Na5 41. Rc1 Nc4+ 42. Ke2 b3 43.
Rb1 b2 44. Nd2 Na3 45. Rd1 b1=Q 46. Nxb1 Nxb1 47. Ke3 Rb3+ 0-1

