({If} 12. cxd4 Nb4) 12... Bd6 13. Ne5 Qe7 14. f4 {[14']} Rfe8 {[38'] I wasn't
happy here and used up a lot of time.} 15. Rae1 Nd7 16. Qh5 Rad8 {This doesn't
help.} (16... Nf6 $142) 17. Bg3 {[25']} Nf6 {[56']} 18. Qf3 Qc7 19. Ng4 Nh7 {
maybe I should hope for freedom by giving up a Pawn, when he pushes forward.}
20. Bh4 Be7 21. Bxe7 Rxe7 22. Qg3 Kh8 23. Nf3 Nf8 24. Nge5 {[45']} Ree8 {[68']}
25. Qh4 Qe7 26. Qh5 {[50']} Kg8 {[1hr 15']} 27. g4 {[55']} Qf6 {[1hr 17']} ({Is
} 27... f6 28. Ng6 Qf7 {playable?}) ({possibly} 27... Nxe5 {first.}) 28. Nxc6
Bxc6 29. Ne5 Rc8 {Immediately loses the exchange or worse.} (29... Bd7 {
isn't much better.}) 30. g5 g6 31. Qxh6 Qh8 32. Qxh8+ Kxh8 33. Nxf7+ Kg7 34.
Nd6 1-0

