{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. e4 dxe4 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. f3 exf3 5. Nxf3 h6 {
A developing move would be better.} 6. Bc4 Bg4 $4 {Played quite quickly and
automatically.} 7. Ne5 ({I preffered the text to} 7. Bxf7+ Kxf7 8. Ne5+ Ke8 9.
Nxg4) 7... e6 $2 {Looking a bit shell-shocked, he gives a piece away} ({However
} 7... Be6 8. Bxe6 fxe6 9. Qf3 {is prerrt horrid for Black.}) 8. Nxg4 Nxg4 {
He carried on bashing moves out, as nobody likes resigning that quickly.} 9.
Qxg4 c6 10. Be3 {[5']} Qf6 11. Rf1 Qe7 12. O-O-O b5 13. Be2 Nd7 14. Qf3 Rc8 15.
Ne4 {[10']} Nf6 {Hammering his Pawns down the QS seemed the best bet.} 16.
Nxf6+ gxf6 17. Qxf6 Qxf6 18. Rxf6 Bg7 19. Rf3 a6 20. Rdf1 Rf8 21. Rg3 Rg8 22.
Bh5 Rc7 23. Kb1 {Threatening 24.Bxh6} Kf8 24. Bf4 ({If} 24. Rg6 Ke7) 24... Rd7
25. Bd6+ Rxd6 {Ending it more quickly than.....} ({............} 25... Ke8 26.
Be5 Kf8 27. Rxg7) 26. Rxf7+ Ke8 27. Rfxg7+ Kd8 28. Rxg8+ Kc7 29. R3g7+ Kb6 30.
b4 a5 31. Rb8+ Ka6 32. Ra8+ Kb6 33. bxa5# 1-0

