{30' each/game} 1. d4 f5 2. e3 Nf6 3. Bd3 d6 4. f4 g6 5. Nf3 Bg7 6. O-O c5 7.
c3 b6 8. Qb3 e6 9. Nbd2 Qe7 $2 10. dxc5 bxc5 11. Re1 {[4']} Nc6 12. e4 Rb8 13.
Qc2 fxe4 {I knew by now that I had gone wrong.} 14. Nxe4 O-O 15. Neg5 Nd8 16.
f5 {Help. I felt that I was lost.} e5 17. fxg6 h6 18. Nh7 Nxh7 19. gxh7+ Kh8
20. Bd2 $2 Bb7 21. Bf5 $2 Qf6 22. Be4 $2 d5 {I cheered up a bit now.} 23. Bg6
e4 24. Be3 Qxg6 25. Nh4 Qg4 26. Bxc5 Rf7 27. Bd6 Rc8 28. g3 Ne6 29. Rf1 Rxf1+
30. Rxf1 Ng5 31. Be7 Nh3+ 32. Kg2 e3 $4 {With very little time left I push the
wrong pawn.} (32... d4 {33.Resigns}) 33. Ng6+ Kxh7 34. Nf8+ {Horrific!} 1-0

