{Time control 40 moves in 2hrs then 30' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 b6 3. e3 Bb7
4. Bd3 e6 5. O-O c5 6. c4 d5 7. Nc3 Be7 8. b3 O-O 9. Bb2 dxc4 {Probably wrong.
he gets a central Pawn majority and a semi-open b-file.} 10. bxc4 Na6 {I was
already concerned about d5.} 11. Ne5 Nb4 12. Bb1 {[29']} Rc8 {[29']} 13. Qe2
Nc6 14. Nxc6 Bxc6 15. Rd1 Qc7 {After this I am in trouble.} ({Maybe...} 15...
cxd4 16. exd4 Re8 17. Z0 Bd6 {might be the best.}) 16. d5 Bd7 17. e4 e5 ({Maybe
} 17... exd5 18. cxd5 Bd6 {is better.}) 18. Bc2 Ne8 19. Ba4 {[63']} Bxa4 {[62']
} ({Possibly} 19... f5 {but it's very risky.}) 20. Nxa4 Bd6 (20... f5 {May
still be possible.}) 21. Nc3 Qd7 22. Re1 f6 23. a4 a5 24. Ra3 Nc7 25. Rb3 Rb8
26. Nb5 Nxb5 27. Rxb5 Bc7 {It's back to the wall time.} 28. Bc3 Rfe8 29. Rd1
Qd6 30. Qg4 Rbd8 31. h4 {[1hr 34']} Qd7 {[1hr 40'] I was taking too long!} 32.
Qh5 Qe7 33. Rd3 Rd7 34. Qd1 Red8 35. Qg4 Qf7 36. Bd2 Qg6 37. Qe2 Qf7 38. g4 {
[1hr 47']} Kh8 {[1hr 57']} 39. Rg3 Rf8 40. Kg2 Kg8 41. Rb1 Qe8 42. Be3 Qd8 43.
Rh1 Qe8 44. Qc2 {[2hr]} Qf7 {[2hr 14'] I was taking too long!} 45. Kf1 Kh8 46.
Ke1 Kg8 47. Kd2 Kh8 48. Kc3 Kg8 49. Kb3 Kh8 50. Ka3 Kg8 51. Qe2 Kh8 52. Qf3 Kg8
53. Qg2 Kh8 54. Rf3 Qe7 {I was moving like lightning now. He had about 10 mins.
} 55. Rf5 Kg8 56. g5 g6 $2 {Disaster. After all my defending I make a silly
error as I had to move so quickly.} 57. gxf6 Rxf6 58. Bg5 Rdd6 {Don't resign
in a time rush.} 59. Rxf6 Rxf6 60. Qg4 Qf7 61. Bxf6 Qxf6 62. Rh3 h5 ({I had
time to see} 62... Qxf2 63. Rf3 Qe1 64. Qc8+ Kg7 65. Qf8#) 63. Qc8+ Bd8 64.
Qe6+ Qxe6 65. dxe6 Kf8 66. Rg3 Bxh4 67. Rxg6 Bxf2 $4 {I realised as I played
it.} 68. Rf6+ {Simply taking too long early on leaving me rushing at the end.}
1-0

