Be7 7. Re1 O-O 8. a4 {Avoiding the Marshall} Bb7 9. c3 d6 10. d3 Na5 11. Bc2 c5
12. axb5 axb5 13. Nbd2 Nc6 14. Rxa8 Qxa8 15. Nf1 b4 {[14']} 16. Ne3 {[6']} bxc3
17. bxc3 Rb8 18. Nf5 {[7']} Bf8 19. Bb3 Bc8 20. Bg5 Be6 21. Bxe6 fxe6 22. Ne3
Be7 23. Nd2 Qa3 24. Bxf6 Bxf6 25. Qa1 Qxa1 {Probably wrong} ({Either} 25... Qb2
) ({or} 25... Ra8 {look better with pressure on his c-Pawn}) 26. Rxa1 Be7 {
My Bishop is weaker than his Knights.} ({Maybe} 26... Bg5 {to exchange it
would be better.}) 27. Ra6 {[27']} Nd8 {[55'] I was a long way down on time.}
28. g3 Nf7 29. Nec4 g6 30. h4 h5 {I wasn't sure about this but couldn't spend
too long on it.} 31. Na5 Bf8 32. Kf1 Kg7 33. Ke1 Kf6 34. Kd1 Nd8 35. Kc2 Nf7
36. Nac4 Kg7 37. Ne3 g5 {Probably better to sit tight.} 38. hxg5 Nxg5 39. f4
exf4 40. gxf4 Nf7 {I now knew that I was clearly worse.} 41. Nf3 Be7 42. Ra7
Bd8 $2 {This could be the final error. Now the Knight is pinned. I was having
to move quickly as the clock ran down.} (42... Kf8 {May hold}) 43. e5 Kg8 44.
exd6 Nxd6 45. Ne5 Rc8 46. Rd7 Nf5 {I was rushing now. I roll off a lot of
moves quickly now - "Never resign in a time scramble"} 47. Nxf5 exf5 48. Rf7
Rc7 49. Rxf5 Rh7 50. Nf3 h4 51. Rxc5 h3 52. Rc8 Rd7 53. Kd2 Kf7 54. Rc5 Bc7 55.
Ne5+ Bxe5 56. Rxe5 Ra7 57. Rh5 h2 58. Ke3 Ra2 59. f5 Kf6 60. Kd4 Rf2 61. c4 Rc2
62. c5 Rf2 63. c6 Rf4+ 64. Ke3 Rxf5 65. Rh7 Rc5 66. Kd4 1-0

