{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O b5 6. Bb3
Bc5 {After some thought.} 7. Nxe5 Nxe5 8. d4 Qe7 9. dxc5 Bb7 {Black said
afterwards that he had been confident that he would regain the Pawn.} 10. Nc3
O-O 11. Bg5 {Awkward for Black.} h6 12. Bxf6 Qxf6 13. f4 {[12']} Nc4 {[33']}
14. Bxc4 bxc4 15. Qxd7 Rfd8 16. Qxc7 {Now he is three Pawns adrift.} Qd4+ 17.
Kh1 Bxe4 $2 {After a long think.} ({I was expecting} 17... Rd7 {and then} 18.
Qe5) 18. Rad1 {I expected him to resign now but he battles on.} Bd3 19. cxd3
cxd3 20. Qe5 Rac8 21. Rf3 Rxc5 22. Qxd4 Rxd4 23. Rdxd3 Rb4 24. Rd8+ {To push
his King away from the QS.} Kh7 25. Rd2 a5 26. g3 Kg6 {He was getting short on
time and plays on rapidly.} 27. Re3 Kf5 28. Kg2 h5 29. Nd5 Rbb5 ({Not} 29...
Rb7 {(say) as} 30. Re5+ Kg6 31. Ne7+) 30. Re5+ Kg6 31. Ne7+ Kh6 ({Despite
having to hurry he avoids} 31... Kf6 32. Rd6#) 32. Nf5+ Kh7 33. Rxc5 Rxc5 34.
Nd6 Kg6 35. f5+ Kh7 36. Kf3 g5 37. Ke4 f6 38. Kd4 Re5 39. a3 Kg8 40. b4 axb4
41. axb4 Kf8 42. Rc2 Ke7 43. Ne4 Rxf5 44. Rf2 Rb5 45. Kc4 Rb6 46. Nxf6 Rc6+ 47.
Kb5 Rxf6 48. Rxf6 Kxf6 49. Kc6 Kf5 50. b5 h4 51. gxh4 gxh4 52. b6 1-0

