7. Nf3 Bg7 8. Be2 O-O 9. O-O Bg4 10. Nd2 Bxe2 11. Qxe2 a6 12. a4 Nbd7 13. Nc4 {
[4']} Nb6 {[6'] I was fairly happy with all this.} 14. Bf4 Nxc4 15. Qxc4 Nh5
16. Be3 {[20']} f5 {[11']} 17. exf5 {[32']} gxf5 {[12']} 18. f3 f4 19. Bf2 Be5
20. Rae1 Rf7 21. Ne4 {[61']} Rg7 {[27']} 22. Re2 b6 {I was concerned about 23.
Nxc5} 23. b4 {[1hr 10']} Raa7 $2 {Not a good idea. It leaves the back rank
weak.} (23... Qc8 $142) (23... Kh8 $142) 24. bxc5 bxc5 25. Rb1 Qc8 26. Rb6 {
[1hr 17']} Qh3 $2 {Too impetuous. ......Kh8 or ......h6 is needed first.} 27.
Rb8+ Kf7 28. Bxc5 dxc5 {Played quite quickly, still failing to realise the
problem. I had assumed that Bxc5 was desperation on his part.} 29. d6+ Qe6 30.
Rf8+ Kxf8 31. Qxe6 Bd4+ 32. Kf1 Rgf7 33. Ng5 Rf6 34. Qe8+ Kg7 35. Qxh5 {
Very frustrating. Rushing the attack and not taking sufficient care} 1-0

