{30' each/game} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 Qd7 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 b6
7. f4 Ba6 8. Bxa6 Nxa6 9. Qd3 Nb8 10. Nf3 Ne7 11. O-O Nbc6 12. Bd2 Na5 13. Be1
Nc4 14. Bh4 Nf5 15. Bf2 h6 16. Nd2 Nxd2 17. Qxd2 Qa4 {This simply leaves the
Queen outof play.} 18. g4 Ne7 19. Bh4 Nc6 {Now both Knight and Queen have
deserted the KS} 20. f5 {He's in trouble now. He can't castle QS and I
threaten to open up the KS.} O-O {Horrible. But is there anything better? 20...
...Rf8} 21. f6 Nxe5 {Desperation.} ({If} 21... g5 22. Bxg5) 22. fxg7 Ng6 ({
I had expected} 22... Rfc8 23. dxe5 Qxg4+ 24. Bg3 Qxg7 25. Rf6 {etc.}) 23.
gxf8=Q+ Rxf8 24. Bf6 Kh7 25. g5 Rg8 26. Qd3 Qd7 27. Rf3 1-0

