{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs then 30'} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 Nc6 3. Bg2 Bc5 4. Nc3 d6
5. a3 a5 6. e3 {[15']} Nge7 {[7'] d4 is coming so ......Ne7---f5 prevents this.
However, f5 is not a good square for the Knight.} 7. Nge2 Nf5 {I wasn't happy
with this and was already wishing I hadn't put my Bishop on c5.} 8. Rb1 O-O 9.
O-O Re8 {I wasn't too happy here. 9......Re8 is a solid waiting move. I
assumed he would want to "do something" so I await events.} ({I want to play} 
9... Nce7 {and then 10......c6 blocking the long diagonal. However, he would
reply} 10. d4 ({or} 10. b4)) 10. Nd5 {There we go. I can play 10.......
Nce7without having the Bishop pushed out of the game.} Nce7 11. b4 {[35']} axb4
{[25']} 12. axb4 Nxd5 13. bxc5 Nf6 14. cxd6 {[50']} (14. c6 {looks better.})
14... Nxd6 15. c5 {[1hr 10']} Nde4 {[35']} 16. c6 $5 {Big surprise.} ({I had
expected} 16. Qc2 {when I can try the risky} Bf5 ({or better} 16... Ng5 {
when he can't risk} 17. Bxb7 {as his KS white squaresare left too weak. The
reasoning behind 16.c6!? is that he just has to push my Knight away after 16...
....bxc6})) 16... bxc6 $1 {[43']} 17. Qc2 {[1hr 20']} ({The alternative is} 17.
d3 {but} Ba6 18. dxe4 Qxd1 19. Rxd1 Bxe2 {is good for Black.}) 17... Ba6 {
[47'] This is awful for White.} 18. d4 {[1hr 24'] There was no way to save the
exchange.} exd4 $1 {[56'] Even better than............} ({....................
} 18... Bxe2 19. Qxe2 Nc3 {After the text Black now threatens .....d3 as well
as ......Bxe2 & ....Nc3 and the e4 Knight has abn extra defender.}) 19. Nxd4 ({
If} 19. Rd1 d3 20. Qb2 dxe2 21. Rxd8 e1=Q+ 22. Bf1 Qxf1#) 19... Bxf1 20. Kxf1
c5 21. Ne2 Rb8 22. Ra1 Qd6 23. f3 Ng5 24. e4 {White, who was down on time and
having to move faster, tries to create some play. However, his g2 Bishop is
now a spectator.} Ne6 25. Nc3 {[1hr 38']} Red8 {[1hr 15']} 26. Be3 {Trying to
discourage ......Nd4 but to no avail.} Qd3+ 27. Qxd3 Rxd3 28. Nd1 Nd4 29. Rc1 {
Moving fast now he plays what looks like a reasonable move at first sight.
However............} (29. Rc1 Nb3 {The rook has nowhere to go. If} 30. Rb1 Rxe3
31. Nxe3 Nd2+ 32. Ke1 Nxb1) 29... Nb3 {We won the Match 3 - 2 Rac-----------1
A.Fawcett--0.5 C.Fisher----0.5 B.Cornish---0.5 B.Standen--0.5} 0-1

