{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Bc4 Bxc3 5. dxc3 Nxe4 $2
{For the third time this season he grabs my e-Pawn.} 6. Bxf7+ ({Apparently he
was expecting.} 6. Qd5 Nd6) 6... Kf8 7. O-O Nc6 8. Re1 Nf6 9. Bb3 d6 10. Bg5 ({
Not} 10. Nxe5 $2 Nxe5 11. Rxe5 Bg4) 10... Bf5 $2 11. Nh4 Qd7 {Now he is in
trouble.} 12. Bxf6 gxf6 13. Qh5 Be6 14. Ng6+ Kg7 15. Nxh8 Kxh8 16. Qh6 Qf7 17.
Bxe6 Qxe6 18. Re3 Ne7 19. Rf3 Nd5 20. Qh3 Qxh3 {Surely it is better to keep
the Queens on.} 21. Rxh3 Nf4 22. Rf3 Rg8 23. g3 Rg6 24. Kf1 Nh3 25. Rd1 Ng5 26.
Re3 Rh6 27. h4 Ne6 28. c4 f5 29. b4 b6 30. Ra3 f4 31. Rxa7 fxg3 32. fxg3 Rg6
33. Kf2 Rg4 34. c5 bxc5 35. bxc5 Nxc5 36. Rxc7 Ra4 37. Kg2 {Threatening the
d-Pawn.} (37. Rxd6 $4 Ne4+) 37... Ne4 38. Rb1 Ra8 39. Rbb7 Nf6 40. Rf7 Nd5 41.
Rxh7+ Kg8 42. Rbg7+ Kf8 43. Rh8+ Kxg7 44. Rxa8 Ne3+ 45. Kf3 Nxc2 46. Rd8 Nd4+
47. Ke4 Nb5 48. g4 Nc3+ 49. Kf5 1-0

