{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. f4 {I was not happy here. It must be 30 years
since I faced the King's Gambit and I could remember very little about it.}
exf4 3. Nf3 Nc6 4. Bc4 d6 5. O-O Be6 6. Qe2 {He thought about this for a long
time and afterwards said he thought this was a mistake.} Nf6 ({He suggested} 
6... Bg4) 7. d4 Bxc4 8. Qxc4 Qd7 $2 ({Simply} 8... Be7 9. Z0 O-O {seems best.})
9. Bxf4 h6 ({If} 9... O-O-O 10. Ng5) 10. Nc3 g5 {Trying to get a bit of room.}
11. Bg3 Bg7 $2 {Now I am really in troubleas he crashes through the centre.} ({
Probably} 11... O-O-O {should be risked.}) ({Fritz gives} 11... Nh5 12. d5 Na5
13. Qd3 c5 14. e5 Nxg3 15. hxg3 O-O-O 16. Rae1 Re8 17. g4 a6 18. Re4 Bg7 19.
Ra4 c4 20. Qe3 $16 {1.41/0}) 12. d5 Nd8 13. e5 Nh5 14. e6 fxe6 15. dxe6 Qc6 16.
Qd3 {The threat of Qg6 is impossible to meet.} Qc5+ 17. Rf2 ({If} 17. Bf2 Nf4)
17... g4 {Desperation. The Queen now defends the Knight but it leaves a hole
on h4.} 18. Qg6+ Ke7 19. Bh4+ 1-0

