{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs then 30'} 1. e4 d6 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. Bc4 Bg7
5. Nge2 c6 6. a4 O-O 7. O-O d5 8. Bd3 dxe4 9. Nxe4 Nxe4 10. Bxe4 Nd7 11. c3 Nf6
12. Bf3 Bg4 13. Bxg4 Nxg4 14. Nf4 Nf6 15. Nd3 {[15']} e6 {[36']} 16. Bf4 {[24']
} Nd5 17. Bg3 Rc8 18. Qb3 b6 19. Rfd1 {Discouraging .....c5} Qe7 20. a5 {[43']}
b5 {[63'] Leaves a hole on c5} 21. Re1 Rfd8 22. Nc5 h5 23. h3 Nc7 24. Qc2 (24.
Nb7 Rd5 {Gets nowhere}) 24... Rd5 {[1hr 13']} 25. Nd3 {[66'] Threat 26.Nb4} Ne8
{[1hr 15']} 26. Qe2 Kh7 27. Qf3 Nf6 28. b4 {[1hr 30']} ({If} 28. Nb4 Rf5) 28...
Rf5 {[1hr 24']} 29. Qe2 Rd5 30. Be5 Ne8 31. Nf4 Rd7 32. Qf3 $5 {He now looked
at this for quite a while seemingly worried, should he play 32......f6?} Bxe5 {
He decides to get rid of his bad Bishop.} (32... f6 33. Qe4 Qf7 $3 {Looks like
a win for Black! e.g.} (33... fxe5 34. Nxg6 Nf6 {or 34.....Nd6 don't work} (
34... Qf6 {or 34......Qg5} 35. Nxe5+ Kg8 36. Nxd7 $18) (34... Qd6 35. Nxe5+ Kg8
36. Nxd7 Qxd7 37. Qxe6+ Qxe6 38. Rxe6 {The weak a-Pawn is a factor which may
favour White.})) 34. Nxh5 fxe5 35. Nxg7 Qxg7 36. Qxe5 Qxe5 37. Rxe5 Ng7) 33.
Rxe5 Ng7 34. Qd3 Kg8 35. Rae1 g5 {maybe Black should just sit tight.} 36. Ne2
f6 37. Re3 a6 $2 {Possibly the losing move! He can't keep my Knight out of c5
and in the endgame that could tie a Rook to the defence of a6.} 38. Ng3 Qf7 39.
Qe2 f5 $2 {Holes on e5 & c5} 40. Re5 {[1hr 50']} h4 {[1hr 55']} 41. Nf1 Rd5 42.
Nd2 Qf6 43. Qf3 $1 (43. Z0 {If I allow} Rxe5 44. Qxe5 Qxe5 45. Rxe5 {I will
have trouble breaking through.}) 43... Kf7 44. Nb3 Rxe5 45. Rxe5 {[1hr 15']} g4
{[2hr 17'] Feeling that he must create some play. however, the Pawns are left
weak.} 46. hxg4 fxg4 47. Qxf6+ {Clearer than 47.Qxg4. Pawns must fall.} Kxf6
48. Nc5 {[2hr]} g3 (48... Z0 {White threatened} 49. Ne4+ Kg6 (49... Kf7 $4 50.
Nd6+) 50. Rg5+) 49. fxg3 hxg3 50. Ne4+ Ke7 51. Nxg3 Rf8 52. Ne4 Nf5 {Big rush
now for Black. I had 20'} 53. Nc5 Kd6 {Trying to get his King to a stalemate
position on c4.} 54. Nxa6 Ng3 55. Nc5 Rf1+ 56. Kh2 Nf5 57. Rxe6+ Kd5 58. Re5+
Kc4 59. Ne4 Kd3 60. a6 Ne3 61. Kg3 Rg1 62. Kf3 Rxg2 63. Nf2+ Kc4 64. Rxe3 {
He resigned with seconds left. Result RAC-------1 Andrew F 0.5 Colin F----0.5
Barry S ---0 Andrew H 0.5 2.5 - 2.5 Lancaster won on board count.} 1-0

