{30' each/game} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 Bd7 5. Qg4 g6 6. a3 Be7 7.
Be3 Nc6 8. Bd3 h5 {Black is already cramped.} 9. Qd1 Bg5 10. f4 Bh4+ 11. g3 Be7
12. Nf3 Nh6 13. Qe2 a6 14. h3 Na7 15. g4 h4 16. g5 Ng8 (16... Nf5 17. Bxf5 gxf5
{White wins the h-Pawn and penetrates on the KS.}) 17. Qf2 c6 18. Nxh4 Qb6 19.
b4 O-O-O 20. Nf3 Kb8 21. Na4 Qc7 22. h4 Rc8 23. Rb1 Nb5 24. Rb3 Ka8 25. Nc5
Bxc5 26. bxc5 Qa5+ 27. Bd2 Qc7 28. O-O Ne7 29. Rfb1 Nf5 30. a4 Rb8 $5 ({
Now short of time Black decides that} 30... Na7 {is too risky. However} 31.
Rxb7 Qxb7 32. Rxb7 Kxb7 {gives 2 Rooks for the Queen so I would not have
played that.}) 31. axb5 cxb5 32. Bxf5 exf5 33. Ra1 Ka7 {Black was very short
of time (~1') so had to move more or less instantaneously. I had 12'} 34. Ba5
Qc6 35. Kg2 Rhe8 36. Ne1 Rh8 37. Nd3 Qe6 38. Kg3 Bc6 39. Bb6+ Ka8 40. Nb4 Rhe8
41. Nxa6 bxa6 42. Rxa6+ Kb7 43. Ra7+ Kc8 44. Rc7+ Kd8 45. Rxc6+ Kd7 (45... Rxb6
46. Rxb6) 46. Rxe6 Kxe6 47. Rxb5 Ke7 48. Qf3 Ke6 49. Qb3 Ra8 50. c6 Rec8 51.
Qxd5+ Ke7 52. Bc5+ Ke8 53. Qd7# 1-0

