{2hr each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. c3 {I couldn't remember anything about this.} Nc6 {
Not a main line.} ({MCO gives} 2... Nf6) (2... d5) (2... e6) 3. d4 cxd4 4. cxd4
d5 5. exd5 Qxd5 6. Nf3 e6 7. Nc3 Bb4 8. Bd2 Qd8 9. Bb5 Nge7 10. O-O O-O 11. a3
Bxc3 12. bxc3 Bd7 13. Re1 Ng6 14. Bd3 {White has got the better out of the
opening with good attacking prospects.} Qc7 ({I had momentarily considered.} 
14... Qf6 $4) 15. Ng5 {[44']} Nce7 {[37']} 16. Qh5 {[68'] After 24' thought.}
h6 {[37']} 17. Ne4 {[1hr 18']} ({If} 17. Nxf7 Rxf7 18. Bxh6 gxh6 19. Qxh6 Qf4)
17... f5 {[26']After 19' thought. White threatened 18.Nf6+} 18. Nc5 {[1hr 20']}
