{2hr each/game} 1. c4 e5 2. Nc3 d6 3. g3 g6 4. Bg2 Bg7 5. d3 f5 6. f4 {I was a
bit doubtful about this.} Nf6 7. Nf3 Nc6 8. O-O O-O 9. Rb1 a5 10. Bd2 Bd7 11.
a3 Re8 {Threatening 12.....e4} 12. fxe5 {[23']} dxe5 {[19']} 13. Bg5 h6 14.
Bxf6 Bxf6 15. Qd2 Kh7 16. Rbd1 Be6 17. Qc1 Nd4 18. e3 {[57']} Nxf3+ {[40']} 19.
Bxf3 c6 20. Qc2 Qc7 21. e4 {[1hr 10']} f4 {[48']} 22. Qe2 Qd7 23. Na4 {[1hr
23']} Bh3 {[66']} 24. Nb6 $2 {[1hr 29'] A miscalculation} (24. Bg2 {is O.K.})
24... Qd4+ 25. Qf2 Ra6 {My intended Nd7 doesn't work as after the exchange of
Queens the Bishop is still on h3} ({I expected} 25... Bxf1 26. Qxd4 exd4 27.
Nxa8 Bxd3 28. Rxd3 Rxa8 29. gxf4) 26. Qxd4 exd4 27. c5 Bxf1 {[1hr 16']} 28.
Rxf1 {[1hr 37']} fxg3 29. hxg3 Be5 30. Kg2 Kg7 31. Bd1 Bc7 32. Nc4 Raa8 33. Bb3
Rf8 {[1hr 31']} 34. Re1 {[1hr 43']} Rae8 35. Nd6 Re5 36. Nc4 Rxc5 37. e5 {
[1hr 50']} Re8 38. Nd6 $5 {It might have worked in a time scramble. Black has
plaenty of time and avoids 38......Bxd6} Rexe5 (38... Bxd6 39. exd6 Rxe1 $2 40.
d7 $1) 39. Ne8+ Kf8 40. Rxe5 Bxe5 0-1

