{Time limit 40 moves in 2hr then 30' for the rest.} 1. d4 Nf6 2. Nc3 d5 3. Bg5
e6 4. e4 Be7 5. Bxf6 Bxf6 6. e5 {[1']} Be7 {[5']} 7. Qg4 {[1']} g6 8. O-O-O {
[15']} c5 9. dxc5 {[27']} Bxc5 {[8']} 10. h4 {[40']} h5 {[12']} 11. Qh3 {
[61'] After engineering a French position playing the first 7 moves very
quickly, he had taken an age over the next 4 moves.} Nc6 {[14'] Taking the
f-Pawn was too risky.} 12. f4 {[62']} Bd7 13. Be2 {[1hr 15']} Qe7 {[19']} 14.
g4 {[1hr 19']} hxg4 {[22']} 15. Bxg4 O-O-O 16. Nge2 Kb8 17. Rh2 {[1hr 27']} Na5
{[32']} 18. h5 gxh5 19. Bxh5 Nc4 20. Nd4 Rdg8 {[38'] Threat 21......Bxd4 and
22......Qb4} 21. Qd3 {[1hr 44']} Ba3 $1 22. Na4 $8 Bxa4 23. bxa3 {[1hr 50']} f5
$1 {The a-Pawn won't run away and .....f5 consolidates my position.} 24. Rdh1 (
24. exf6 Qxf6 {would be good for me.}) 24... Be8 25. Bd1 ({THe threat was} 25.
Z0 Bxh5 26. Rxh5 Rxh5 27. Rxh5 Rg1+) 25... Rxh2 26. Rxh2 Bd7 27. Rh6 Rg1 28.
Rh8+ Kc7 29. Qc3 Qg7 30. Qh3 $2 {Allowing me a won ending.} (30. Rh3 $142 {
but after} Qg4 {he's struggling.}) 30... Rxd1+ 31. Kxd1 Qg1+ 32. Ke2 Qxd4 33.
Rh4 {he has to lose Pawns.} Qd2+ 34. Kf3 Qxc2 35. Rh7 {To add to his troubles
he was short of time.} Qe4+ 36. Kg3 Qe3+ 37. Kg2 Qxf4 38. Qb3 {With the
possible threat of 39.Rxd7 and chances of a perpetual.} Qg5+ 39. Kf2 Qd2+ 40.
Kg1 {Now I can force the exchange of Queens.} ({If} 40. Kf3 Nxe5+ 41. Kg3 Qd3+)
40... Qc1+ 41. Kf2 Qb2+ 42. Qxb2 Nxb2 43. Ke3 Nc4+ 44. Kd4 Nxa3 {It is
hopeless for White. he explained afterwards that he had only played on as they
neede a draw and his captain told him to continue.} 45. Rf7 Kc6 46. Rh7 Nc4 47.
Rh6 b5 48. Rh1 a5 49. Rh2 b4 50. Rh8 Nb6 51. Rh1 Na8 52. Rc1+ Kb6 53. Rh1 Nc7
54. Rh7 Bb5 55. Rh2 Bc4 56. Rb2 Nb5+ 57. Ke3 d4+ 58. Kf4 Kc5 59. Rh2 Nc3 60.
Rh8 Bxa2 61. Rc8+ Kb5 62. Kf3 Bd5+ 63. Kf2 Ka4 64. Ke1 b3 65. Kd2 b2 66. Rc5
Ne4+ ({If} 66... b1=Q 67. Rxa5+ {is a nuisance. However I had plenty of time
to notice 66.......Ne4+}) 67. Kc2 Nxc5 {His match captain now gave him
permission to resign! This was the thirrd match in a row in this comptition
where I have had to win the last game to finish for us to win on board count.
1R.A.C. ---- 1 2.A.Fawcett 1 3.C.Fisher---0 4.B.Standen 0 5.B.cornish 0.5} 0-1

