{Time limit 40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20'} 1. Nf3 c5 {Might be better to keep
the long diagonal closed.} 2. g3 d5 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. O-O g6 5. c4 d4 6. e3 Nc6 7.
exd4 cxd4 8. d3 Bg7 9. Na3 ({Possible is} 9. b4 {e.g.} Nxb4 10. Qa4+ Nc6 11.
Nxd4) 9... O-O 10. Rb1 Bg4 11. Nc2 a5 12. h3 Bxf3 13. Qxf3 Qd6 14. Bd2 a4 ({
I spent a long time considering lines like.} 14... Rfd8 15. b4 Ne5 16. Qe2 ({
However, White can play} 16. Qxb7 {and I can't play} Rdb8 {because of} 17. Qxa8
) 16... Nxc4 17. dxc4 d3 18. Qd1 dxc2 {etc.}) 15. b4 axb3 16. axb3 Ra2 $2 {
This seemed good but the Rook is simply left exposed.} 17. Qd1 Nd7 18. b4 b6 {
[60']} 19. Re1 {[48']} ({I had been worried about} 19. b5 Nd8 20. Bb4 Qf6 21.
Ba3 {trapping the Rook.}) 19... e5 20. Rb3 {[60']} Ra7 21. Qb1 Ne7 22. Na3 Qb8
{[1hr 19']} 23. Nb5 {[1hr 15']} Ra6 24. Qc2 Rc8 25. Ra3 Rxa3 26. Nxa3 Qd6 27.
Nb5 Qf6 28. Qa4 Rd8 {I suddenly realised I had 4' 30' for 13 moves. He had 20'}
29. Qa7 Qf5 {This and the remaining moves were made pretty quickly.} 30. Qa3
Nc8 31. Nc7 Bf8 32. g4 Qf6 33. Nd5 Qd6 34. Qc1 Ne7 35. Bg5 f6 36. Bd2 Kh8 37.
Nxe7 Bxe7 38. Qc2 Nf8 {I offered a draw. I had 2'30' left he had 3'. Cumbria
lost the match} 1/2-1/2

