{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 d5 3. Nc3 c6 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. e3 e6 6. Nf3 h6
7. Bh4 Be7 8. Bd3 a6 9. a4 a5 10. Rc1 {[5']} O-O {[10']} 11. O-O Re8 (11... Ne8
{Might be better.}) 12. Bg3 b6 $2 {Failing to realise the problems on the
Black squares. The text loses a Pawn.} 13. cxd5 exd5 $2 (13... Nxd5 $142 14.
Nxd5 exd5 15. Rxc6 {Which loses only a Pawn.}) 14. Nb5 {Wins the exchange.} Bb7
({or} 14... Rf8 15. Bc7 Qe8 16. Nd6 Bxd6 17. Bxd6 Z0 18. Bxf8) 15. Nc7 {[10']}
Nh5 {[23']} 16. Nxe8 Nxg3 17. hxg3 Qxe8 18. Nh4 Nf6 19. Nf5 Bc8 $2 {Loses a
Pawn. He looked resigned and was just going through the motions now.} 20. Nxe7+
Qxe7 21. Rxc6 Rb8 22. Qb3 Nd7 {[33']} 23. Rfc1 {[17']} Qf8 24. Qxd5 Nf6 ({If} 
24... Bb7 25. Qf5 g6 26. Qxd7) 25. Qe5 Bb7 26. R6c4 Rc8 27. Rxc8 Bxc8 28. Bf5
Bxf5 29. Qxf5 Qe7 30. Rc8+ Ne8 31. Qb5 Kf8 32. Qxb6 f6 33. Qxa5 Kf7 34. Qh5+
Kf8 35. Rxe8+ Qxe8 36. Qxe8+ 1-0

