{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3
Bc5 7. Bc4 d6 ({Maybe} 7... Nc6 {is better as I can possibly play .....b5 and
answer Bd5 with ......Bd7} 8. Z0 b5 9. Bd5 Bb7) 8. O-O Nc6 9. h3 Be6 {9.......
b5 would give me some space.} 10. Qe2 Bxc4 11. Qxc4 h6 12. Rd1 Qe7 13. Nd5 Nxd5
14. Qxd5 O-O 15. c3 {Now I am in some bother with b5 coming.} Rfd8 16. b4 Bb6
17. a4 Qe6 18. a5 Bc7 19. Qd3 {[25']} Ne7 {[38']} ({Maybe} 19... b5 {is better.
}) 20. c4 f5 21. exf5 Nxf5 (21... Qxf5 {is more promising}) 22. Bb2 {[29']} Ne7
{[47']} 23. Qe4 {[34']} Nc6 24. Bc3 Rf8 25. Rac1 Rad8 26. Qd5 Qf7 27. Be1 Kh8
$2 {Getting short of time and playing a "safe" move.} (27... Rd7 {Protecting
the Bishop and getting the Rook off a Black square.}) 28. b5 axb5 29. Qxf7 Rxf7
30. cxb5 Nd4 ({I suddenly realised that my intended} 30... Nxa5 {is met by} 31.
Rxc7 $1 {I was now short of time.}) 31. Nxd4 exd4 32. Rxd4 d5 33. Rcd1 Rfd7 34.
f4 Re7 $2 {Rushing. I realised as soon as I let it go.} ({The best chance
might be} 34... Bd6 {activating the Bishop}) 35. Bh4 1-0

