the first few moves quickly without gibing them much thought. The rest is
rather a horror scenario for Black.} 5. Bxf7+ Kxf7 6. Ng5+ Ke8 7. Qxg4 Nf6 8.
Qe6 Qc8 9. Qf7+ Kd7 10. e5 dxe5 11. fxe5 Ng4 12. e6+ Kc7 ({Not} 12... Kd8 13.
