piece.........} ({......but} 14... Kb6 15. Bxe5 Nxe5 16. Qf4 {isn't a whole
lot better for Black.}) 15. Bxe5+ Nxe5 16. Qf4 Qb5 (16... Kd6 17. Nf7+ {
is pointless for Black.}) 17. Qxe5+ Kc8 18. Na3 Qb4+ 19. c3 $1 Qb6 ({Not liking
} 19... Qxb2 20. Qxc5+ Kb8 21. O-O) 20. Nc4 Qc7 21. O-O Qxe5 22. Nxe5 Kc7 {
[46']} 23. Ne4 {[20']} b6 24. Rf7 Rd8 25. Raf1 g6 26. Nd7 Bh6 27. Rxe7 Kc6 28.
Ne5+ (28. Ne5+ {[1-0] If} Kd5 29. Nf7 Be3+ 30. Kh1 Rhf8 31. Nf6+ Kc6 32. Nxd8+
Rxd8 33. Rd7 {and if} Rxd7 34. exd7 Kc7 35. Nd5+) 1-0

