{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 b6 {Not good against 3.Nc3.
Black gets a cramped position.} 4. e4 d6 5. Nf3 Be7 6. Bd3 Bb7 7. O-O Nbd7 8.
d5 ({If} 8. e5 dxe5 9. dxe5 Ng4 {is good forBlack.}) 8... e5 9. b4 $2 {Gives
away his initiative.} a5 10. bxa5 Rxa5 {Things have improved for Black with c5
for the Knight and the half open a-file} 11. Nd2 Nc5 12. Nb3 Nxb3 13. Qxb3 Nd7
14. Qc2 Nc5 15. Be3 Nxd3 16. Qxd3 Bg5 {I felt that it was at least equal now.}
17. a4 Bxe3 18. Qxe3 Qe7 19. Rfb1 O-O 20. Rb4 Rfa8 {Lancaster won 2.5 - 1.5
despite defaulting on Bd2} 1/2-1/2

