{1hr 30' each game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3
Bb4 7. Bd2 O-O (7... Bxc3 8. Bxc3 Nxe4 9. Bxe5 Qe7 10. Qe2 d5 $13) 8. a3 (8.
Bd3 $142) 8... Bxc3 9. Bxc3 Nxe4 10. Bxe5 $2 {Now he's in trouble} Re8 11. Qd3
({I had expected} 11. Qd5 {but then} Nf6 12. Qd4 Nc6 {leaves him in a mess})
11... d5 ({I preffered the text to} 11... Rxe5 12. Nxe5 Qa5+) 12. g4 $2 {
A desperation move.} (12. Be2 {looks O.K. then} Nc6 13. Bd4 {with 13......Bf5
in the offing keeps the initiative for Black.}) 12... Nc6 {He could resign now
but bashes out a few more moves.} 13. Bc3 Nc5+ 14. Kd2 Nxd3 15. cxd3 d4 16. Bb4
Nxb4 17. axb4 Bxg4 18. Bg2 Rc8 19. h3 Qe7 20. Rhe1 Qxb4+ 0-1

