{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3
Bb4 7. Bd2 O-O 8. Bd3 d5 $2 {2 days late (whilst fishing!) I realised this is
a blunder.} (8... Bxc3 9. Bxc3 d5 {may be possible e.g.} 10. Bxe5 (10. exd5 {
leads to the game.}) 10... dxe4 11. Bxf6 Qxf6 12. Bxe4 Re8) 9. exd5 $5 {
Loses a piece for 2 pawns.} ({I had expected} 9. Nxd5 Bxd2+ 10. Qxd2 Nxd5 11.
exd5 Qxd5 {However,} 12. Bxh7+ $1) 9... Bxc3 10. Bxc3 e4 11. Bxf6 Qxf6 12. Bxe4
Re8 13. Qd3 Qg6 ({If} 13... Bf5 14. Nd2 Qg6 15. f3) 14. Nd2 f5 15. f3 fxe4 16.
fxe4 Bf5 17. O-O-O Bxe4 18. Nxe4 Qxe4 19. Qxe4 Rxe4 20. Rhe1 Rxe1 21. Rxe1 Nd7
22. Re7 Rd8 23. c4 Kf8 24. d6 b5 25. cxb5 ({If} 25. b3 bxc4 26. bxc4 Nc5 27.
Rc7 Nd3+ 28. Kc2 Rxd6) 25... axb5 26. b4 {[29']} Nb6 {[30']} 27. Re5 Rxd6 28.
Rxb5 Ke7 29. Kc2 Kd7 30. Rf5 Rf6 (30... Ke6 {Looks better but White has good
play.}) 31. Rxf6 $2 {Probably the losing move.} gxf6 32. Kd3 Ke6 33. g4 Ke5 34.
Ke3 {Loses the b-Pawn.} ({If} 34. a3 {the Black King invades the KS. e.g.} Kf4
35. h3 Kg3 36. Ke4 Kxh3 37. Kf5 Nd5 38. Ke6 $1 ({However} 38. b5 {looks better.
e.g.} Nb6 39. Kf4 Kh4 40. Kf3 Kg5 41. Kg3 f5 {seems to win [as in the note to
move43]}) 38... Nc3 39. Kxf6 Kxg4 $19) 34... Nd5+ 35. Kf3 Nxb4 36. a4 Nc6 37.
h4 {Maybe he should leave this for now.} h6 38. Ke3 Na5 39. Kf3 Nc4 40. h5 ({If
} 40. Kg3 f5 41. gxf5 Kxf5 42. Kh3 Kf4 43. Kh2 Kg4) 40... Na5 41. Ke3 (41. Kg3
f5) 41... f5 42. gxf5 (42. g5 hxg5 43. h6 Kf6) 42... Kxf5 43. Kd4 Kg5 44. Kc5
Kxh5 45. Kb5 Kg5 46. Kxa5 h5 47. Kb6 h4 48. a5 h3 49. a6 h2 50. a7 h1=Q 51. Kc7
Qa8 52. Kb6 Kf6 53. Ka6 Ke6 0-1

