{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3
Bb4 7. Bd3 {Varying form the 7.......Bd2 from the last game but Black can
still play ......d5} d5 8. Bd2 $2 {Loses a piece as last time.} Bxc3 9. Bxc3 {
[7']} dxe4 {[4']} 10. Bxa6 Qxd1+ 11. Rxd1 Rxa6 ({Not} 11... exf3 $2 12. Bb5+)
12. Nxe5 O-O ({Not} 12... Rxa2 13. Nc4 {Threatening 14.Nd6+ & 14.Na3}) 13. a3
Nc6 14. O-O Nxe5 15. Bxe5 Re8 16. Bc7 {As good as anything. Trying to trap my
Rook.} Rc6 17. Ba5 Rxc2 18. Bc3 Bg4 19. Rd6 Be2 20. Re1 h5 {Preventing back
rank mating problems.} 21. Rd2 (21. Rb6 Ba6 {Keeps the Rook on the board.})
21... Rxd2 22. Bxd2 Bd3 {It's easy now.} 23. h3 b5 24. Bc3 {[22']} Nd5 {[23']}
25. Bd4 Rc8 26. Rd1 Rc4 27. Be5 f6 28. Bd6 Rc2 29. b4 Ra2 30. f3 f5 31. fxe4
fxe4 32. Bc5 Rxa3 33. Rd2 Rb3 34. Rf2 e3 35. Rf8+ Kh7 36. Re8 Rb1+ 37. Kh2 e2
38. Bf2 Nxb4 0-1

