{30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. f4 g6 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. Bc4 e6 6. O-O Nge7
7. e5 O-O 8. d4 cxd4 9. Nxd4 Qb6 10. Nce2 Nf5 11. c3 Qc5 12. Bb3 b6 13. Kh1
Nfxd4 14. Nxd4 Ba6 15. Rf3 Bb7 16. Be3 {This leads to wholesale exchanges
which leave Black a Pawn up but with opposite coloured Bishops in a dead drawn
position.} (16. Rd3 $142) 16... Nxd4 17. Bxd4 Bxf3 18. Bxc5 Bxd1 19. Bxf8 Bxb3
20. Bxg7 Bxa2 {[10']} 21. Bf6 {[6']} Bd5 22. Be7 a5 23. Kg1 a4 24. g3 b5 25.
