{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs then 30' for the rest.} 1. d4 Nf6 {[17'] He
arrived late.} 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7. d5 e6 8. Be2
exd5 9. exd5 Bf5 10. O-O Na6 11. a3 (11. Nh4 $142 {e.g.} Ne4 12. Nxf5 Nxc3 13.
bxc3 Bxc3 14. Rb1 {etc.}) 11... Nc7 12. Bd3 (12. Nh4 {Still looks good.}) 12...
Qd7 13. Qc2 Rfe8 14. Bd2 $2 b5 {[25'] I had not expected this and was now in a
quandry.} 15. Bxf5 {[38']} ({If} 15. b3 b4 16. Nh4 {just leaves my Knight
stranded after} Bxd3) 15... gxf5 {[26']} 16. Qd3 {[47']} bxc4 {[43']} 17. Qxc4
Ne4 18. Rad1 {[56']} Re7 {[65']} 19. Be1 $1 {Neatly preventing 19......Rad8 by
20.Bh4 which forces 20......f6 killing his Bishop.} Nxc3 (19... Rae8 20. Bh4 f6
) 20. Bxc3 {I offered a draw here, expecting him to refuse as we had drawn Bd2
were winning on Bd3 and losing on Bd4. He decided to wait and see how Bd3 & 4
went so I gained 20' on the clock!} Re4 {[1hr 30']} 21. Qd3 {[67']} Rae8 {
[1hr 41']} (21... Rxf4 {Simply gives up the e-file.}) 22. Bxg7 Kxg7 ({Maybe} 
22... Re3 {isbetter e.g.} 23. Ne5 $5 Rxd3 24. Nxd7 Rxd1 25. Rxd1 Kxg7 {and the
Knight on d7 is stuck.}) 23. Nh4 {I suddenly felt that I was winning. The
other games were finished and I just neede to draw to win the match.} f6 24.
Qh3 Re2 25. Qxf5 Qxf5 $2 (25... Qf7 {Seems better but he was getting short of
time.}) 26. Nxf5+ Kg6 27. Nxd6 Rd8 28. Nb7 Rxd5 29. Rxd5 Nxd5 30. Nxc5 Ne3 31.
f5+ Kf7 ({If} 31... Nxf5 32. Nd3 Rd2 33. Rf3 {is good for White.}) 32. Rf3 Nxg2
(32... Rxg2+ $142 33. Kh1 Re2 {White is threatened with mate.}) 33. Rh3 Rxb2
34. Rxh7+ Ke8 35. Rxa7 Nh4 {He was very short of time now and moving fast.} 36.
Ne4 Nf3+ 37. Kf1 Nxh2+ 38. Ke1 Nf3+ 39. Kd1 Nd4 40. Nxf6+ Kd8 $2 {Just making
the time control but losing the Knight. Black resigned} 1-0

