{2hr each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7.
d5 e6 8. Be2 exd5 9. exd5 Na6 10. O-O Nc7 11. Bd3 a6 12. a4 Rb8 13. a5 b5 14.
axb6 Rxb6 15. Qc2 (15. h3 $142) 15... Re8 {[23']} 16. f5 {[19'] Probably
premature. Again 16.h3 limits Black's options.} Ng4 {[28']} 17. Nd1 {[22']} Ne5
{[35']} 18. Nxe5 dxe5 19. Nc3 ({Possibly} 19. Be4 {is more solid. Now Black
gets the initiative.}) 19... e4 {I hadn't expected this.} 20. fxg6 $5 ({Now} 
20. Nxe4 Bxf5 {and I can't play} 21. Nxc5) ({and if} 20. Bxe4 Bxc3 21. bxc3 Qh4
{Gives Black good play. I should probably have gone for the 20.Bxe4 line.})
20... f5 $1 {Very strong.} 21. gxh7+ Kh8 22. Be2 {[50']} e3 {[66']} 23. Nd1 {
[61']} Bd4 {I'm in trouble now.} 24. Ra3 Qg5 25. g3 {Else 25......f4} Rh6 26.
Kg2 {[1hr 34'] After much thought.} ({I had intended} 26. Rf4 {but became
worried about} Rh3 {threatening 27.Rxg3+ and if} 27. Kg2 Qh6) 26... Re4 {
[1hr 33']} 27. Nxe3 {A touch of desperation here as 27......R4h4 is threatened.
} Bxe3 ({I had hoped for} 27... Bxe3 28. Rxe3 Rxe3 29. Qd2 Rxe2+ 30. Qxe2 Qg6
31. Bxh6 {etc. However, there is a flaw in this.}) 28. Rxe3 Rxe3 29. Qd2 Rxh2+
$1 {Short of time I had missed this.} 30. Kxh2 Qxg3+ 31. Kh1 Qh4+ 32. Kg2 Rg3+
33. Kf2 Rh3+ 0-1

