13. Nf4 {[46']} Re8 $2 {[28'] Doesn't turn out too well.} 14. Rd1 {[47'] Now
15.dxc5 leaves the d7Knight pinned and there is nowhere to put the Queen in
view of Nd5 and a possible fork on c7} b6 {[46'] After 18' thought. If he lets
me play .....Bb7 then I'm covering d5} 15. h4 Bb7 16. Bf1 Qe7 17. Be2 Qf7 18.
Bb2 {[55']} Red8 {[59']} 19. d5 {It is getting hopelessly jammed up.} Ne5 20.
