g5 8. Ng3 {He started off playing very quickly.} Be6 9. Be2 Bf7 {I had got
drawn inti rapid-play as well. This gives the f-Pawn away although opening the
f-file might be dangerous, especially in a quickplay game.} 10. Nh5 Nbd7 11. g4
{Aggresive play is appropriate for quickplay games but this loses a pawn.} Nxh5
12. gxh5 g4 13. h3 {[6']} Qh4 {[5']} 14. Kd2 gxh3 15. Qf1 h2 16. b4 Bxh5 17.
Bxh5+ Qxh5 18. Ne2 Nf6 19. Qg2 Ng4 20. Bb2 O-O-O 21. Ng3 Qg5 22. Nf1 f4 23. Re1
