1. d4 f5 2. Bg5 g6 3. c4 Bg7 4. Nc3 Nf6 5. g3 O-O 6. Bxf6 Bxf6 7. Nf3 d6 {[1']}
8. Bg2 {[5']} e5 $2 {[6'] Played after 5' thought.} 9. dxe5 dxe5 10. Qxd8 Rxd8
11. Nd5 Kg7 12. Nxc7 e4 {He gets some play for the exchange.} 13. Nd2 Bxb2 14.
Rd1 Bc3 15. e3 Na6 16. Nxa8 Bd7 $2 {probably with the threat of 17......Ba4
but it just wants a move.} (16... Be6 {Looks much better.}) 17. Ke2 Be6 18. f3
Rxa8 19. Nb1 $5 (19. Rc1 $142) 19... Bxc4+ 20. Kf2 Bf6 21. Rd7+ Kh6 22. Rxb7 $2
{This really messes it up.} ({Correct is} 22. Rc1 {then if} Bxa2 23. Rxb7)
22... Nc5 23. Rc7 Nd3+ 24. Kg1 Bxa2 25. Na3 {Better than 25.Nd2 or 25.Nc3} exf3
26. Bxf3 Re8 27. Kg2 Rxe3 28. Nc2 {This gaurds various squares but allows a
combination leading to a draw.} Rxf3 29. Kxf3 Bd5+ 30. Ke3 Bxh1 31. Kxd3 Be4+
32. Kd2 Bxc2 33. Rxc2 Bd4 34. Ke2 Bb6 {Here he offered a draw which I accepted.
We won the match} 1/2-1/2

