e3 d5 8. c5 b6 9. b4 bxc5 10. Bxf6 ({If} 10. bxc5 Ne4) 10... Bxf6 11. bxc5 Qa5
12. Qd2 Nd7 13. Be2 $2 {Playing quickly I miss the threat.} Nxc5 14. Ne4 Qxd2+
15. Nexd2 Nd7 16. O-O $2 {Still playing quickly. 16.Rb1 is better.} c5 17. Rab1
c4 {The c-Pawn looks like a match winner. I felt that I had to create some
complications which would give me a chance - especially in a quickplay.} 18.
Ne1 {Intending g4 and Bf3.} e5 {This helps me by opening things up.} 19. dxe5
Nxe5 20. f4 Ng4 21. Nc2 Re8 22. Bf3 Be6 23. h3 c3 $5 {Again helping me to mix
it.} 24. Nc4 {I have suddenly got some play.} Nh6 25. Nd6 Red8 26. Nb5 {
We were playing fast now.} Rab8 27. Nc7 Bf7 28. Rxb8 Rxb8 29. Nxd5 Bxd5 30.
Bxd5+ Nf7 31. Rc1 Rd8 32. Bxf7+ Kxf7 33. Nd4 Bxd4 34. exd4 Rxd4 35. Rxc3 Rxf4
36. Rc7+ 1/2-1/2

