{30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3 Bb4
7. Bd3 $2 d5 8. exd5 e4 9. Qe2 Qe7 $2 {I knew that 9......0-0 was correct but
started thinking about other lines including 9......Qe7. I suddely realised
that time was getting on and played a "rushed" 9......Qe7?} 10. d6 Qxd6 11.
Bxe4 O-O 12. O-O Re8 13. Qd3 Nxe4 14. Nxe4 Qg6 15. Ng3 Nc6 16. Bf4 Be6 17. c3
$4 {Our Bd1 also left his Queen en prise a couple of minutes later.} Qxd3 {
After 2 rounds the score was 4 - 4.We then played a 10' game each. I had Black
against Carl and won. However the score was 2 - 2 so we had to play a 5' game.
I got in a mess and was completely lost. His flag fell and I pointed to it as
he mated me. Technically I feel that I won but we agreed on a draw and
Morecambe won the match.} 0-1

