{1hr 30' each/game.} 1. d4 c5 2. d5 g6 3. c4 b5 4. cxb5 a6 5. bxa6 Bg7 6. Nc3
Nf6 7. e4 d6 8. Bb5+ Nbd7 9. Nf3 O-O 10. O-O {[5']} Bxa6 {[1'] He was moving
instantaneously. Apparently he plays this line all the time.} 11. Be3 $2 {
I started playing faster as well. This is awful, especially as I had
considered 11......Nxe4 briefly.} Nxe4 12. Bxa6 $2 {The 12.Nxe4 line below
looks better for White.} ({I thought that} 12. Nxe4 Bxb5 13. Re1 Bxb2 14. Rb1 {
was O.K.}) 12... Nxc3 13. bxc3 Rxa6 14. Qc2 Qa8 15. Bg5 $2 {I can't remember
when I last played so badly. This simply gives the d-Pawn away, after which I
am completely lost.} f6 16. Bd2 Qxd5 17. Rfe1 e5 {[6']} 18. Red1 {[28']} Qf7
19. Qd3 Rfa8 20. a4 {The a-Pawn stays en prise for most of the rest of the
game.} d5 ({If} 20... Rxa4 21. Rxa4 Rxa4 22. Qxd6 {Gives White a chance.}) 21.
Ne1 c4 22. Qh3 Nc5 23. Be3 Ne4 24. Rdc1 g5 25. f3 Nd6 26. Bc5 Nb7 27. Be3 Na5
28. Ra2 Nb3 29. Rd1 h6 30. Nc2 f5 {This is becoming horrific.} 31. Nb4 Rd6 32.
g4 f4 33. Bf2 d4 34. Qf1 d3 35. Qe1 Qb7 36. Kg2 Ra5 37. h4 Qa8 38. Ra3 Nc5 39.
Rda1 e4 40. Bxc5 exf3+ 41. Kf2 Rxc5 42. Qe7 Bf8 43. Qe1 d2 44. Qd1 Re5 45. Nc2
Re2+ 46. Kf1 Rde6 47. R3a2 Bc5 {A total disaster!} 0-1

