{Time limit 40 moves in 2hr then 30' for the rest.} 1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 g6 3. Bg5
Bg7 4. e3 O-O 5. Bd3 d6 6. Nbd2 Bg4 7. h3 Bxf3 8. Nxf3 Nbd7 9. c3 {It was
already very clear that White was goiung to plaay very conservatively.} Re8 10.
Rc1 c5 11. O-O Qa5 12. Bb1 Rac8 {Maybe I should have gone for 12.....b5 and
play on the QS.} 13. Re1 cxd4 {Probably not best.} 14. cxd4 d5 15. Re2 Nb6 16.
Rec2 Rxc2 17. Rxc2 {[34']} Rc8 {[59']} 18. Bf4 {[38']} Ne8 {[1hr 10']} 19. Rxc8
Nxc8 20. Qc2 Ncd6 21. b3 e6 22. g4 Bf8 23. Kg2 Qb5 24. Ne5 Be7 25. Bh6 {[60']}
Qa5 {[1hr 34']} 26. f3 Qd8 {[1hr 40'] Time was getting on.} (26... Qe1 {
doesn't seem to offer much} 27. Z0 {although} Bh4 {might then be good.}) 27. e4
$5 {Now I get some play.} dxe4 28. fxe4 Nb5 29. Qf2 {[1hr 17']} Bf6 30. Be3 {
v[1hr 31']} Nc3 31. Bc2 Nd6 {I was having to move fairly quickly.} ({I didn't
like} 31... Nxa2 {because of} 32. Bd2 {trapping the Knight. However,} a5 {
is O.K. or even 32......Qc7} (32... Qc7)) 32. Qf3 Ne8 {[1hr 52']} 33. a4 {
Now my Knight could get trapped.} Qc7 {Threat 34......Nxa4} 34. Bd3 Na2 $5 {
I realised as soon as I moved that 35.Bb5 is difficult to meet} (34... a6 {
May be better.}) 35. Nc4 $2 {Played quickly} ({After} 35. Bb5 {I am forced to
play} Bxe5 36. dxe5 {When I am in trouble.}) 35... Nb4 36. Be2 Nc2 37. Qf2
Nxe3+ 38. Qxe3 Qd8 {Just trying to hold it together till move 40.} 39. e5 Bg5
40. Qe4 Qd7 41. Bf3 Kg7 42. d5 {Here he offered a draw. The match was lost
even if I won and it was a 3+ hour long journey home with the others waiting
so I accepted.} ({I had been hoping for} 42. Qxb7 Qxd4 43. Qb8 $4 Bh4 $19)
1/2-1/2

