7. Be2 a5 {Possibly to prevent 8.b4} 8. O-O Na6 9. h3 Bd7 10. g4 c5 11. d5 a4
12. a3 Nc7 13. Kg2 Qc8 14. Rh1 ({If, say} 14. Be3 {then the possibility of}
Bxg4 {arises. e.g.} 15. hxg4 Qxg4+ 16. Kf2 Qh3 17. Z0 {with} Ng4+ {coming})
14... Qe8 $2 {Trying to force ......b5 but forgetting about the Knight on f6.}
