{30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d3 Nc6 4. Be3 d6 5. Nc3 g6 6. Qd2 Bg7 7.
h3 b5 8. d4 c4 {I wasn't sure about this as I have to keep considering e5 & d5
now. However, in a quick play you need to get on with it.} 9. Be2 e6 10. O-O h5
{To prevent Bh6 after the Knight moves.} 11. Rad1 Nge7 12. Bg5 f6 {I wasn't
willing to spend too long on this.} 13. Be3 {[10']} d5 {[8'] Else he plays d5
and I get a weak d6} 14. exd5 exd5 15. Bf4 g5 16. Be3 Bf5 17. a4 {He is
getting cramped and feels the need to "expand". However, a3 looks better.} (17.
a3 $142) 17... b4 18. Nb1 a5 19. c3 Qd7 {With thoughts of ......g4} 20. Rde1
Kf7 21. Bd1 $4 {With time getting on he moves quickly and blunders.} Bxb1 22.
Nxg5+ {Do or die stuff now but this is doomed to failure.} fxg5 23. Bxg5 Bd3
24. Qf4+ Qf5 25. Qxf5+ Nxf5 26. Be2 Bxe2 27. Rxe2 Rhe8 28. Rfe1 Rxe2 29. Rxe2
Re8 30. Kf1 Rxe2 31. Kxe2 Bh6 32. Be3 {For the 4th time!} Nxe3 33. fxe3 bxc3
34. bxc3 Ke6 35. Kf3 Bf8 36. g4 hxg4+ 37. hxg4 Ne7 38. e4 dxe4+ 39. Kxe4 Nd5
40. g5 Nxc3+ 41. Kf4 Bg7 42. d5+ Kxd5 43. Kf5 Nxa4 44. Kg6 Bd4 45. Kf7 c3 46.
g6 c2 47. g7 Bxg7 0-1

