{Time limit 40 moves in1hr 40' + 20' allegro} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4.
Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3 Bb4 {He now had a long think realising 7.Bd3 d5 is
bad} 7. Qd3 (7. Bd3 d5) 7... d5 8. Bd2 d4 {Releasing the tension but securing
the better game. He now gets very cramped.} 9. Nd1 Bxd2+ 10. Nxd2 Nc6 11. a3
O-O 12. Be2 Be6 13. O-O Qc7 {Preventing 14.f4} 14. b3 Rac8 15. Qg3 Ne7 {
Attacking c2 and bringing the Knight to the KS.} 16. Bd3 Ng6 17. f3 {His Queen
could get trapped so he creates an escape route.} Nh5 18. Qf2 Nhf4 19. Ra2 Nxd3
20. cxd3 Nf4 {He's in big trouble now with no good move.} 21. Nb2 {[64']} Qc2 {
[41']} 22. Rfa1 ({If} 22. Ndc4 Qxb3 23. Raa1 Nxd3) 22... Bxb3 23. Nxb3 Qxb3 24.
Qf1 Rc2 0-1

