Nc3 d6 8. e4 Bg7 9. Be2 O-O 10. Nd2 Nbd7 11. O-O a5 12. Qc2 Ba6 13. Nc4 Qc7 14.
Re1 Nb6 15. Nxb6 Qxb6 16. Bd2 {[23']} Nd7 {[23']} 17. Qa4 $4 {An outright
blunder which loses straight off.} Qxb2 18. Rab1 Qxd2 19. Red1 Qxc3 20. Bxa6
Rxa6 21. Qxd7 {Not being one of the first to resign at the congress he carries
on for a bit.} Qe5 22. f3 Raa8 23. Qa4 Qf4 {Threat 24......Be5} 24. Rb3 Rab8
