{2hr each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 b5 4. cxb5 a6 5. e3 {This line
ensures that he will be able to castle.} axb5 (5... Bb7 {is an alternative.})
6. Bxb5 Qa5+ 7. Nc3 Ne4 8. Nge2 g6 9. Bd3 Nf6 (9... Nxc3 {Looks O.K.}) 10. O-O
Bg7 11. e4 d6 12. h3 O-O 13. Be3 Ba6 14. Bxa6 Nxa6 15. Qd2 Rfb8 16. f3 Nd7 17.
Bf4 Nc7 18. Rab1 Nb6 19. b3 Nb5 20. Nxb5 Qxb5 21. Qc2 {[45']} Qa6 {[51']} 22.
Nc1 {He offered a draw here} Qa3 23. Kh1 Na4 24. Bd2 Nb6 1/2-1/2

