9... O-O 10. Nd2 ({If} 10. Ng5 h6) 10... Nxd5 11. Nxd5 Qxd5 $17) 10. bxc3 Qxd5
(10... O-O 11. Nd4 Nxd5 12. Qg3 Qa5 (12... Qe7)) 11. Ba3 Ng4 12. Qe2 (12. Qg5
Qxg5 13. Nxg5 Bf5 14. Bc4 Ne5 15. Bd5 Nbc6 16. Rb1 h6) 12... Be6 13. Nd2 f5 {
is intersting. e.g.} 14. Rd1 Qxa2 15. Bb4 Nc6) 9. Bd2 Qxd3 (9... Ng8) 10. cxd3
({If} 10. Bxd3 Bxc3 (10... Nc6 11. O-O Bg4 {looks O.K.}) 11. Bxc3 e4 12. Bxf6
exd3 13. Bxg7 Rg8 14. Bc3 dxc2 {is good for Black with g2 threatened.} 15. O-O
Bf5 16. Nd4 {is good for White}) 10... Nc6 11. Be2 Bf5 12. Rd1 {[41']} O-O {
[23']} 13. O-O h6 14. h3 {[50']} Rfe8 {[29'] Now 15......Nd4 is a threat.} 15.
Rfe1 {[60']} Rad8 {[33']} 16. a3 Bc5 {[41']} 17. Bc1 {[68']} ({I was expecting.
} 17. Be3) 17... b5 18. Bf1 g5 19. g4 Bg6 20. Be3 {[1hr 42']} Bxe3 {[66']} 21.
fxe3 e4 {If he can play d4 he gets a passed Pawn.} 22. dxe4 Nxe4 23. Nxe4 Bxe4
24. Kf2 {Here he offered a draw which I accepted.} 1/2-1/2

