{Time limit 40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. d4 g6 2. c4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6
4. e4 Nf6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7. d5 e6 8. Be2 exd5 9. exd5 Re8 10. O-O Na6 11.
h3 Nc7 12. a4 {This is probably premature as the Knight can come back to b4. I
should wait till he has played .....a6.} Na6 13. Bd3 Nb4 14. Bb1 b6 {Now ......
Ba6 will be a problem.} 15. Ra3 a6 16. Re1 Bd7 17. Na2 Nxa2 18. Rxa2 b5 19.
axb5 axb5 20. Rxe8+ ({Maybe} 20. Rxa8 Qxa8 21. Rxe8+ {is better.}) 20... Qxe8
21. Rxa8 Qxa8 22. b3 {[42']} Qa1 {[31']} 23. Bc2 Qa2 24. Nd2 {It is all
starting to get very cramped.} Nh5 25. f5 {[1hr 11'] I couldn't find a good
continuation here. Also I was using up a lot of time.} Ng3 {[53']} 26. fxg6
hxg6 27. Bd3 Qa1 28. Nf1 bxc4 {[63'] To my horror, I suddenly realised that I
had been taking much too long over my moves and I now had only 4' to reach
move 40 so I now had to move quickly.} 29. Bxc4 ({I was worried that} 29. bxc4
{could be met by either} Qd4+ (29... Ba4) ({or} 29... Bh6 {However these might
be O.K. I just didn't have time to sort it out.})) 29... Nf5 30. Qc2 {Moving
fast this can't be best. However, good moves are in short supply.} (30. Qe1 {
aiming for} Z0 31. Bd2 {might be O.K.}) 30... Nd4 31. Qd2 Bxh3 {Pawns start to
drop off.} 32. Qe3 Bd7 33. Qg5 Bf6 34. Qf4 Nf5 35. g3 Bd4+ 36. Kh1 Qb1 37. g4
Be5 38. Qd2 Nh4 39. Bd3 {Preventing 39......Qe4+ but more Pawns go.} Qxb3 40.
Qe2 Qxd5+ 41. Be4 {I have made the time control but it has all fallen apart.}
Qb3 {It might have held together if I had not got so short of time.} 0-1

