{Time limit 40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro [Dick took a bye in rd4]} 1.
d4 d5 2. Bf4 Nf6 3. Nf3 e6 4. e3 Bd6 5. Bxd6 Qxd6 6. Bd3 Qb4+ 7. Nbd2 Qxb2 {
He seemed very pleased to have got this Pawn. However, I get a big lead in
development and would play this line again.} 8. O-O {[5']} Qa3 {[3']} 9. e4
dxe4 10. Nxe4 Nxe4 11. Bxe4 Nd7 12. Re1 {[12']} Nf6 {[6']} 13. Bd3 O-O 14. Re3
Qd6 15. Ne5 {I try to work up a direct attack but maybe I should play 15.Rb1
or 15.c3 followed by 16.Qc2.} Rd8 16. c3 Bd7 17. Rh3 h6 18. Qf3 Qd5 19. Qf4 {
[46']} Bc6 {[27']} 20. f3 Qd6 21. g4 Qe7 22. Qd2 ({maybe} 22. c4 {threatening}
Z0 23. g5 {would be better.}) 22... Nd5 {[37']} 23. Re1 $2 {[68']} (23. Rf1
$142) (23. f4 $142) 23... Qg5 {Black suddenly has some play.} 24. Qc2 $2 {
Compounding the error. I was hoping to keep my attack going but I really need
to change tack.} (24. Qxg5 hxg5 25. Nxc6 {isn't good but is better than the
line I played}) 24... Nf4 25. Rg3 Nxd3 {[42']} 26. Qxd3 {[78']} Be8 27. Rg2 c5
28. Qe4 cxd4 29. cxd4 Rd5 30. f4 {I was getting short of time (again!)} Qd8 {
[57']} 31. g5 {[1hr 30'] Playing fast I hoped to resurect my attack.} (31. Rb1
$142) 31... Rxd4 32. Qxb7 hxg5 33. fxg5 Rd1 34. Kf1 Rb8 35. Qxa7 {[1hr 37']}
Rxe1+ 36. Kxe1 Rb1+ 37. Kf2 Rb2+ 38. Kf3 Qd5+ 0-1

