{Time limit 40 moves in 1hr 40' + 20' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 e6 4.
Nc3 exd5 5. cxd5 d6 6. e4 g6 7. f4 Bg7 8. Bb5+ Nfd7 9. Bd3 O-O 10. Nf3 a6 11.
a4 Nf6 12. O-O Bg4 13. Qc2 {[8']} Bxf3 {[20']} 14. Rxf3 Nbd7 15. a5 Re8 16. Ra2
$2 {After much thought. I want to play 16.Nd1-e3-d4 but want the Rook off the
long diagonal. I should have played what I originally intended i.e.16.h3} Ng4 {
A surprise.} 17. Ne2 ({I realsised that} 17. h3 Bd4+ 18. Kh1 {mrrts} Qh4 {
and White has to go through contortions.}) 17... b5 $1 {Picking the right
moment to advance.} 18. axb6 $2 {I played this almost automatically and
completely overlooked his reply. I have to play 18.b3 but Black is on top.} (
18. b3 $142) 18... c4 $1 {Ouch! Now I realised that ......Qxb6+ is coming. I
thought I would lose the exchange by} 19. Bxc4 (19. b7 {isn't good enough.})
19... Qxb6+ 20. Kh1 Nf2+ 21. Kg1 {I realised that I can give him a discovered
Check but that he can't do much with it (apart from force a draw!)} ({I
initially thought I had to play} 21. Rxf2 {losing the exchange.}) 21... Ng4+
22. Kh1 (22. Kh1 Nf2+ {[Draw agreed]} 23. Kg1 {To make progress Black has to
play.} Nxe4+ 24. Be3 {and after (say)} Ndc5 {both sides have chances.}) 22...
Nf2+ {Here he offered a draw which I had to accept.} 1/2-1/2

