{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 e5 6. Nf3
Bb4 7. Bd2 O-O 8. Bd3 Bxc3 ({And not} 8... d5 $2 {[Wood - Collins League 20/11/
07]}) 9. Bxc3 d5 10. Qe2 {After a long think.} d4 11. Bd2 Nc6 12. h3 h6 13. g4
Nh7 {White gets a much bigger attack than I expected} ({Maybe} 13... g5 14. h4
Nh7 15. hxg5 hxg5 16. Bc4 Kg7 {followed by ......f6 might be safest.}) 14. Rg1
Re8 ({Maybe} 14... Be6 {to contest the a2-g8 diagonal is best.}) 15. g5 hxg5 ({
If} 15... h5 {then} 16. g6 {is bad for Black.}) 16. Nxg5 Nxg5 17. Bxg5 Qd6 {
If I had played 14.......Be6 I could now play 17......e6 18.Bh6 Rf7} 18. a3 {
[25'] Wottied about 18......Qb4+} b5 {[37'] To prevent 19.Bc4} ({I considered} 
18... Qg6 {but after} 19. O-O-O f6 20. Bd2 Qh7 {The Queen is cut out of play
and} 21. Bc4+ {is awful.}) 19. h4 Nd8 20. h5 Ne6 21. Bd2 Kh8 ({Not} 21... Kh7
22. f4 {and} exf4 23. e5+) 22. Qf3 Ra7 {I felt that I was just hanging on here.
} 23. h6 {[38']} f5 {[59] I now felt that it was lost. 23.....f5 seemed the
best chance. I couldn't find anything else.} 24. Qh5 ({I had expected
something like} 24. Qxf5 Nf4 25. hxg7+ Kg8 26. Qg5 Ree7 {with some hope for
Black.}) 24... g6 25. Qxg6 Qf8 {I was resigned to defeat now. Also I was
getting short of time.} 26. O-O-O f4 27. Bb4 Qf7 28. Bd6 Qxg6 29. Rxg6 Nf8 30.
Rg5 Nd7 {Horrid, blocking the Bishop and the Rook, but if the e-Pawn goes so
do the d & f Pawns} 31. Rdg1 Rb7 {Threatening 32......Rb6} 32. h7 Re6 33. Rh1
Re8 34. Rhg1 Re6 {I offered a draw here as he repeated moves. he looked
flustered,said "No I have a plan" and quickly made his next move.} 35. Bf8 $2 {
Simply loses the h-Pawn.} Nxf8 36. Rg8+ Kxh7 37. Rxf8 Rc7 {Short of time I
play "safe" moves.} 38. Be2 Ree7 39. Rh1+ Kg7 40. Rhh8 Be6 41. Ra8 Red7 {
Threat 42......d3} 42. Kd2 Ra7 43. Rxa7 Rxa7 44. Rh1 Rd7 45. Rg1+ Kf6 46. Bh5
1/2-1/2

