{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 c5 2. d5 g6 3. e4 Bg7 4. c4 b5 5. cxb5 d6 6. Nc3 Nf6
7. Bd3 O-O 8. Nge2 Nbd7 9. O-O a6 10. h3 axb5 11. Bxb5 Ba6 12. Bxa6 Rxa6 13.
Qc2 Qa8 14. a3 ({Better seems} 14. b3 {intending} Z0 15. Bb2) 14... Rb8 15. Rb1
Rab6 16. Be3 {Maybe better to leave th Bishop defending b2.} Rb3 17. Nc1 R3b7
18. Nd3 Nb6 19. f3 {After this I am in trouble. maybe 19.b3 is playable or 19.
Rfe1} Nc4 20. Bf2 (20. Bc1 $142) 20... Nd7 {[15'] Suddenly I knew that I was
in trouble and I couldn't find a good move.} 21. a4 {[48'] After much thought.
Hoping to be able to play 22.Nb5} Rb3 {Threat 22......Bxc3} 22. Nc1 {[60']}
Rxb2 23. Rxb2 Rxb2 24. Qd3 Nde5 {[29']} 25. Qd1 {[63']} Qa5 26. N1e2 {[67']}
Nd2 27. Be1 {[1hr 14']} (27. Re1 Nd3) 27... Nxf1 28. Kxf1 Qa6 29. Nb5 Nc4 30.
Kg1 Ne3 {[46']} 31. Qd3 {[1hr 18']} Qxa4 32. Nbc3 Qa1 33. Qxe3 (33. Kf2 Bd4)
33... Qxe1+ 34. Kh2 Bxc3 0-1

