{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 d6 2. d4 g6 3. c4 Bg7 4. Nc3 Nf6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3
Nbd7 {The Knight just gets in the way here.} 7. Be2 c5 8. d5 Ne8 9. O-O e5 {
This leaves weak Pawns on d6 & e6.} 10. dxe6 fxe6 11. Nb5 Qe7 12. Rb1 a6 13.
Nc3 Nb6 {The Knight serves no useful purpose here.} 14. a4 Bd7 15. Qb3 Qd8 16.
Ra1 Bc6 $2 {The Bishop is needed to support e6. Now he is in trouble as he
can't play ......Nc7} 17. Ng5 Bd7 18. Bg4 Rf6 ({If} 18... Bxc3 19. Qxc3 Ng7 20.
a5 Nc8 21. Qh3) 19. e5 dxe5 20. Nce4 Rxf4 21. Bxf4 exf4 22. Bxe6+ Bxe6 23. Nxe6
Qe7 {A piece has to go.} 24. Qxb6 Bd4+ 25. Nxd4 cxd4 26. Rfe1 ({Not} 26. Qxd4
$2 Rd8) 26... Qg7 27. Qe6+ Kh8 28. Ng5 h6 29. Qxe8+ 1-0

