{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 d5 $5 4. dxe5 dxe4 5. Qxd8+ Nxd8
({Not liking} 5... Kxd8 6. Ng5 {etc.}) 6. Nd4 f6 7. Bf4 Ne6 {Loses a Pawn.} (
7... c6 $142) 8. Nxe6 Bxe6 9. exf6 Nxf6 10. Bxc7 Rc8 11. Ba5 Rxc2 $2 {The Rook
will never get out.} 12. Bc3 Bc5 ({If} 12... Nd5 13. Bb5+ Kf7 14. Ba4) 13. Nd2
e3 14. fxe3 Bxe3 15. Kd1 Rxc3 16. bxc3 O-O 17. Bc4 Bxc4 18. Nxc4 Rd8+ 19. Kc2
Bf4 20. g3 Bc7 21. Rad1 Re8 22. Rhe1 Rf8 23. Re7 Ne8 {Hastens the end.} 24.
Rde1 Rf2+ {Like many local players Black choses to play on to the bitter end
rather than resign.} 25. Kb3 h6 26. Rxe8+ Kh7 27. R1e2 Rf7 28. R8e7 Rxe7 29.
Rxe7 Bd8 30. Rxb7 a6 31. h4 Bf6 32. h5 Bg5 33. Ne5 Be3 34. Ng6 Bc5 35. Rb8 Bd6
36. Rh8# 1-0

