{40 in 2hrs then 30' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 b5 4. Nf3 bxc4 5. Nc3 g6
6. e4 d6 7. Bxc4 Bg7 8. O-O O-O 9. Bf4 Ba6 10. Bxa6 Nxa6 11. Qe2 Nc7 12. Rad1 {
[15']} Rb8 {[15']} 13. Rfe1 {[31']} Nd7 14. Qd2 f6 15. b3 Qc8 16. Na4 Qa6 17.
Rc1 Nb6 $2 {Carelessness. After this I am struggling.} 18. Nxc5 Qa3 19. Nd3 Nb5
20. Nb4 Rb7 21. Nc6 Re8 22. Nfd4 Nxd4 23. Nxd4 Nd7 24. Ne6 Nf8 25. Nxf8 Kxf8
26. Rc4 Qa6 27. Rec1 Qb5 28. Qc2 Rbb8 29. h3 Qa6 30. a4 Qb7 31. b4 a6 32. Bd2
Kf7 33. Rc7 Qb6 {I was getting short of time.} 34. Qc4 Ra8 35. Rc6 Qb7 36. Be3
Reb8 {With little time left Rb6 is coming which wins a Pawn, so I decided to
answer it with .......Qxb6.} 37. Bb6 (37. Rb6 {Looks better.}) 37... Bh6 38.
Rc2 Bf4 39. a5 Qd7 40. Qe2 h5 {Despite the time rush I realised he is
threatening 41.Qg4 , forcing the Queens off.} 41. g3 Bh6 42. Kg2 Qe8 43. Qc4
Qd7 44. f4 h4 {Hoping to create something.} 45. e5 Qf5 46. exd6 exd6 47. Rxd6
Rc8 {I was rushing again now and the rest of the game was played very quickly.}
48. Rc6 Bf8 49. g4 (49. Rxc8 {probably allows a perpetual.}) 49... Rxc6 50.
dxc6+ Qe6 51. c7 Rc8 52. Kf3 Bd6 53. Qxe6+ Kxe6 54. Rc4 Kd5 55. Rd4+ Kc6 56.
Ke4 Re8+ {I was having to move like lightning now.} 57. Kd3 Rc8 58. f5 g5 59.
Re4 Be5 60. Bd4 Bxc7 {With no time left it now falls apart.} 61. Bxf6 Rb8 62.
Rc4+ Kd5 63. Rxc7 1-0

