{2hr each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O b5 6. Bb3 Be7
7. Re1 O-O 8. d4 {Once again I can't play the Marshall.} d6 ({Gurevich - Nunn
Hastings 92/93 went} 8... Nxd4 9. Nxd4 exd4 10. e5 Ne8) 9. c3 Bg4 10. Be3 Na5 (
{Not} 10... Nxe4 $4 11. Bd5) 11. Bc2 Nc4 12. Bc1 c5 13. b3 Bxf3 ({If} 13... Nb6
14. dxc5 dxc5 15. Qxd8 Raxd8 16. Nxe5) 14. Qxf3 Nb6 15. dxe5 dxe5 16. Qg3 Qd6 {
Preventing Bh6 which loses a piece} 17. Nd2 {[26']} Nh5 {[44']} 18. Qg4 Nf6 19.
Qe2 Rfd8 20. Nf3 Ne8 21. Bb2 c4 22. Red1 Qc7 23. Qe3 {[39']} f6 {[59']} 24. Nh4
Bc5 {[66']} 25. Qg3 Rxd1+ 26. Rxd1 Rd8 27. Qf3 {[44']} Rxd1+ {[1hr 11'] I
offered a draw here.} 28. Qxd1 Bf8 29. Nf5 Bc5 30. b4 Bf8 31. Ne3 Qb7 32. Qd8
Nc7 33. Qd1 Qc6 34. Qg4 Kh8 35. Qh4 {Threatening 36.Nd5 when I can't capture
because of mate on h7.} Qd7 36. Qg4 Qc6 37. Bc1 Qa8 {If I am to get any play
it will be by ......a5} 38. Nf5 a5 39. Be3 Na4 40. Bxa4 bxa4 41. Bc5 axb4 42.
Bxb4 g6 43. Nd6 Bxd6 44. Bxd6 Qd8 45. Bb4 Kg7 46. h4 Na6 47. Qe2 {He offered a
draw here which I accepted.} 1/2-1/2

