{2hr each/game} 1. d4 f5 2. Bg5 Nf6 3. c4 g6 $2 (3... e6 $142) 4. Bxf6 exf6 5.
Nc3 b6 6. e3 Bb7 7. Nf3 d6 {He now gets very cramped.} (7... Bb4 $142) 8. Bd3
Nd7 9. h4 Bg7 10. h5 {[10']} Qe7 {[29'] He is already short of good moves.} 11.
Nd5 Bxd5 12. cxd5 f4 {Trying to get some play but this opens up the diagonal
for my Bishop.} 13. hxg6 fxe3 14. gxh7 {A protected passed Pawn on h7 on move
14!} exf2+ 15. Kxf2 O-O-O ({Probably} 15... Kd8 {lasts longer}) 16. Qa4 {
With simple threats of 17.Ba5+ and 18.Qc6} Nb8 17. Qxa7 Qd7 {To prevent 18.Bf5+
} 18. Rh5 Qf7 19. Bf5+ Rd7 20. Rc1 {Threat 21.Qxc7#} c5 21. dxc6 1-0

