{2hr each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. g3 c6 4. Bg2 dxc4 5. a4 Be7 6. Nf3 Nf6 7.
O-O O-O 8. Ne5 {I'm not sure about this.} Nbd7 9. Nxc4 c5 10. Nba3 {After much
thought.} ({If} 10. Nc3 cxd4 11. Qxd4 Nc5 {Threatens ......Nb3 which is a
nuisance.}) 10... cxd4 11. Qxd4 Nc5 12. Qxd8 Rxd8 13. Nb5 Bd7 14. Nc3 Nb3 15.
Rb1 Nxc1 16. Rbxc1 Rab8 17. Ne5 ({I also considered} 17. Na5 b6 18. Nc6 {
but for some reason which I can't remember preffered Ne5}) 17... Be8 18. Rfd1
Rdc8 19. b3 a6 20. h3 $2 {[61'] Simply overlooking the threat.} Ba3 {[62']} 21.
Rc2 {I thought I must be losing a piece, or at least a passed Pawn.} b5 22.
axb5 {[62']} axb5 23. Rd3 {[1hr 23'] After 20' thought. 23.Rd3 protects the
Knight so the cR can move and I thought 23......b5 could be answered by 24.Nc4
However......} ({If} 23. Ra2 {simply} Rxc3 24. Rxa3 b4 25. Raa1 Rxb3 {Must win
for Black.}) 23... Rc5 (23... b4 24. Nc4) (23... Rc4 {The wrong plan but he
can still win.}) 24. f4 Rbc8 $2 {Huge relief.} ({I had seen that} 24... b4 25.
Nc4 bxc3 26. Nxa3 Rxb3 {and I lose the Knight!}) 25. Ra2 Bb4 26. Ne4 Rc1+ {
[1hr 10']} 27. Kh2 {[1hr 30'] I was in 2 minds about this and 27.Kf2 (which
would have prevented 29......Ne3)} Nd5 28. Rd4 Bf8 29. Rdd2 Ne3 30. Nd6 Bxd6
31. Rxd6 Nxg2 32. Kxg2 h6 33. Rad2 {here I offered a draw which he accepted.}
1/2-1/2

