{40 in 1hr 40' then20' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 b5 4. a4 bxc4 5. Nc3
g6 $2 {Totally careless! I had even considered his reply.} 6. d6 exd6 {After
much thought. There is no good move.} (6... Bg7 7. dxe7 Qxe7 8. Nb5 Na6 9. Nd6+
{is pretty terrible.}) 7. e4 Nc6 8. Bxc4 Bg7 ({If} 8... Be7 9. Bh6) 9. Qxd6 Qe7
10. Bf4 {[6']} Nd4 {[33'] Amongst other things he was threatening 11.Nb5} 11.
O-O-O Bb7 12. Nf3 {[16']} Ne6 {[52']} 13. Qxe7+ Kxe7 14. Bd6+ Ke8 15. Bd5 Nxd5
16. exd5 Nd4 17. Rhe1+ Kd8 18. Ne5 ({If} 18. Ng5 Bh6) 18... Bxe5 19. Bxe5 Rg8
20. Ne4 {[27']} g5 {[1hr 12'] Loses immediately but I didn't have a move.
White threatens 21.Nf6 or 21.d6 or 21.Nxc5 as well as 21.Bxd4} 21. Nxc5 ({
With 20......g5 I hoped to get the Rook out if he plays} 21. Bxd4 cxd4 22. Rxd4
{However, he can simply take the c-Pawn 21.Nxc5}) 1-0

