{40 in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 5. a3
Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 Ne7 7. Qg4 O-O 8. Nf3 cxd4 {This is premature} (8... f5 $142) (
8... Nbc6 $142) 9. cxd4 Qc7 {This turns out badly.} (9... Nbc6 $142) (9... Qa5+
$142 10. Bd2 Qa4) 10. Bd3 f5 {More or less forced. Had I not played 8......
cxd4 I could have played .....c4} 11. exf6 Rxf6 12. O-O {[25']} Nbc6 {[24']
The problem with 9......Q7 is now apparent. After................} (12... e5
13. Qg3 {the e-pawn is pinned.}) 13. Qh5 g6 14. Qg5 Rf8 15. h4 {I knew that I
was in trouble now.} Nd8 16. h5 Nf7 17. Qg4 e5 $5 ({maybe the desperate} 17...
Nh8 {is the best move.}) 18. Qg3 Nf5 {I offered a draw here as I felt that he
didn't have a good continuation. As he sat thinking about it I noticed 19.Qh2 .
Unfortunately so did he.} 19. Qh2 Bd7 {There is no good move a Pawn must go}
20. dxe5 Rac8 21. Bf4 Qd8 22. Rfe1 Re8 23. g4 Ng7 24. hxg6 hxg6 25. Bxg6 Bxg4
26. Qh7+ Kf8 27. Ng5 Be6 28. Nxf7 Bxf7 29. Bh6 Re6 30. Qxg7+ 1-0

