{40 in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro [Dick took a bye in rd4]} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3.
g3 d5 4. Bg2 Be7 5. Nf3 O-O 6. O-O Nbd7 7. c5 $2 {I don't know why I played
this. I knew it wasn't best.} Ne4 8. Qc2 f5 9. Nc3 c6 10. b4 Bf6 11. e3 e5 12.
dxe5 Nxe5 13. Nxe5 Bxe5 14. Bb2 Qf6 15. Na4 Be6 16. Bxe5 Qxe5 17. Qb2 $2 {
Leads to problems.} (17. Rfd1 $142) 17... Qxb2 18. Nxb2 a5 19. Nd3 $2 ({
I simply assumed that I would play} 19. a3 {here. I now realised that} Nd2 20.
Rfd1 Nb3 21. Rab1 axb4 22. axb4 Ra2 {and Black will play Rfd8 and infiltrate
the a-file. I spent a long time trying to find something to avoid this.
However, it maight not be too bad as the Black Knight is stuck and after} 23.
Nd3 Ra3 {White is probably better.}) 19... axb4 20. Bxe4 dxe4 21. Nxb4 Ra4 22.
Rab1 Rfa8 23. Rfc1 Kf7 24. Rb2 R8a5 25. Rc3 Ke7 26. Nc2 {[1hr 20']} Ra7 {[60']}
27. Nb4 (27. Nd4 $142) 27... Bxa2 28. Nxa2 Rxa2 29. Rb6 Rd2 {[65']} 30. Rcb3 {
[1hr 30']} Rd7 31. Kg2 Kd8 32. R6b4 {[1hr 34']} Kc8 33. Rb2 {[1hr 35']} Rd5 34.
Rc2 Ra5 35. Rbc4 ({I was rushing here maybe} 35. Rcb2 {was better.}) 35... Kc7
36. R4c3 Rb5 {[1hr 12']} 37. Rc4 {[1hr 36']} Kd7 38. f3 exf3+ 39. Kxf3 Ke6 40.
e4 fxe4+ 41. Rxe4+ Re5 42. Rec4 Rb3+ 43. Kf2 Kd7 44. Rg4 g6 45. Rh4 Re7 46.
Rd4+ Kc7 47. Rdc4 {I offered a draw here - as much to gain some time while he
thought about it as in the hope that he would accept.} b6 48. cxb6+ Rxb6 49.
Kf3 Re5 50. Rf4 Kd6 51. Rf6+ {[1hr 49']} Re6 52. Rf7 h5 53. Rf4 Rb3+ 54. Kf2
Rb5 55. Rd4+ Rd5 56. Ra4 c5 57. Ra6+ Ke7 58. Ra7+ Kf6 59. Rc7 Ree5 60. Kg2 Kf5
61. Rc4 g5 62. Rf7+ Ke6 63. Rf2 Rd4 64. Rcc2 Kd5 65. Rf8 c4 66. Rd8+ Kc5 67.
Rc8+ Kb4 68. Rb8+ Kc5 69. Rc8+ Kd5 70. Rd8+ Ke4 71. Rf8 Kd3 72. Rcf2 Re2 73.
R8f3+ Kd2 {I stopped scoring here but resigned after another dozen moves or so.
} 0-1

