{I played the Alekhine-Chatard attack against his French. We reached the
following position. Initially I missed the correct line and played.} 1. Kh1
Qh4+ 2. Kg1 ({Not} 2. Rh3 $2 Qe1+ 3. Kh2 Qxe5+) 2... Qd4+ 3. Re3 {and he tried}
Qxe3+ 4. Nxe3 Bc6 5. Ncd5 {0 and he resigned a couple of moves later. There
were 5 players entry of £1 half to the winner so I won £2.50! RAC 4 C.Fisher
3 L.Bland 3 L. Ba-thein 1 N.Jameson} 1-0

