{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 b5 4. cxb5 a6 5. b6 Qxb6 6. Nc3 d6
7. e4 Nbd7 8. Nf3 g6 9. Be2 Bg7 10. O-O O-O 11. h3 Rb8 12. Qc2 Ne8 13. Rb1 Nc7
14. b3 Nb5 15. Na4 Qc7 16. Bb2 Bb7 17. Bxg7 Kxg7 18. Rbc1 Rfc8 19. Qb2+ Kg8 20.
Nc3 Ba8 21. Qd2 Qa5 22. Rc2 Qb4 23. Nb1 $2 {[45'] Ridiculous, especially as I
had rejected this move when first considering it.} (23. Ne1 Z0 24. Nd3 {
looks OK.}) 23... Qxe4 {[29']} 24. Bc4 Ne5 25. Nxe5 Qxe5 26. Re1 Qf6 {[40']}
27. Nc3 {[39']} Qd4 28. Bxb5 {[66']} axb5 29. Rxe7 Kf8 30. Qe1 {Already
deciding to go for the sacrificial line.} (30. Rd7 $142) 30... b4 31. Rce2 $2 {
Going for broke but it's no good.} ({I had to play} 31. Na4) 31... bxc3 32.
Rxf7+ Kxf7 33. Re7+ Kf6 34. Qe6+ {No good but there was nothing else.} Kg5 35.
Rxh7 ({Maybe} 35. g3 {offers a bit of hope.}) 35... Re8 36. Qf7 Re1+ 37. Kh2
Qf4+ 0-1

