{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Be7 5. e5 Nfd7 6. h4 a6
{MCO 14 states that this gives White an advantage.} 7. Qg4 Bxg5 8. hxg5 Nf8 ({
MCO 14 gives} 8... c5 9. dxc5 Nxe5 10. Qg3 Nbc6 11. O-O-O $16) 9. f4 Nc6 10.
Nf3 Nb4 {This just wastes time.} 11. O-O-O b6 {[9']} 12. a3 {[4']} Nc6 13. Bd3
Ne7 14. Ne2 {......c5 is coming.14.Ne2 allows c3 etc.} c5 15. c3 c4 16. Bc2 b5
17. Kd2 a5 18. Ra1 Qb6 19. Qh3 Neg6 {[17']} 20. g4 {[16']} h6 21. Qg2 Bd7 22.
f5 exf5 23. gxf5 Ne7 24. gxh6 gxh6 25. Rh5 O-O-O 26. Rah1 Be8 27. Qh3 b4 28.
axb4 axb4 29. f6+ Bd7 30. Qf1 Neg6 31. Rxh6 Rg8 32. Rg1 Be6 33. Nh4 Qb7 34. Qa1
b3 35. Nxg6 Nxg6 36. Bxg6 fxg6 37. Rhxg6 Rgf8 38. Rg7 Rf7 39. Rxf7 Bxf7 40. Rg7
Rd7 41. Qa3 {Threatening 42.Qf8+} Kb8 42. Nf4 Qc6 {With e6 threatened Black
has no move.} 43. Qf8+ Qc8 44. Rxf7 1-0

