{30'each/game} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. c4 d6 4. Nc3 c5 5. d5 e6 6. f4 e5 $5 7.
fxe5 dxe5 8. Nf3 Nd7 9. Bd3 Ne7 10. O-O O-O 11. Bg5 f6 12. Be3 a6 13. a4 b6 14.
Qd2 Re8 15. g4 Nf8 16. Qg2 Kh8 17. h4 Ng8 18. Nh2 Bd7 19. Qf2 {Intending a5
but Black decides he has to break on the KS.} Qc8 20. g5 f5 $5 {Giving up a
Pawn and doesn't ease the pressure.} (20... Bh3 {Looks better as the Rook has
to leave the f-file}) 21. exf5 Bxf5 22. Bxf5 Qxf5 23. Qxf5 gxf5 24. Rxf5 Ng6
25. h5 N6e7 26. Rf7 Nc8 27. Ne4 Re7 28. Raf1 Raa7 {Loses a piece but it may
not be salvageable anyway.} 29. Rxe7 Rxe7 30. h6 Re8 31. hxg7+ Kxg7 32. Ng4
Nge7 33. Nxe5 {Seems the quickest way to win.} Nxd5 34. Rf7+ Kg8 35. cxd5 Rxe5
36. Rc7 Rxe4 37. Rxc8+ Kg7 38. Kf2 Rxa4 39. d6 1-0

