{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 exd4 5. cxd4 (5. e5
$142) 5... Bb4+ 6. Bd2 Nxe4 7. Bxb4 Nxb4 8. a3 Qe7 9. Be2 Nd5 10. O-O O-O 11.
Re1 Qf6 12. Bc4 Nb6 ({If} 12... Qc6 13. Ne5) 13. Bxf7+ Qxf7 14. Rxe4 d6 15.
Nbd2 h6 16. Qe2 {I wasn't happy about my position.} Bd7 17. Rc1 Bc6 18. Re7
Rae8 19. Re1 Rxe7 20. Qxe7 Re8 {Big surprise. Black is playing for a draw.} (
20... Qxe7 {leaves White less chances.}) 21. Qh4 Rxe1+ 22. Nxe1 Qe8 23. Nef3
Bd5 24. h3 Nc4 25. Nxc4 Bxc4 26. Kh2 b5 27. Nd2 Bd5 28. Nf1 Qe4 29. Qd8+ Kh7
30. Ne3 Qf4+ 31. Kg1 Qxd4 32. Nxd5 Qxd5 33. Qxc7 Qd4 34. Qc2+ g6 35. Qc7+ Qg7
36. Qxd6 Qxb2 37. Qd7+ Qg7 38. Qxb5 Qa1+ 39. Kh2 Qxa3 40. h4 {Hoping to
generate something.} Qe7 41. g3 h5 42. f4 Qf7 43. Qa5 Qd7 44. Kg2 Qc6+ 45. Kh2
Qb6 46. Qd2 a5 47. Kh3 Qc6 48. Kh2 a4 49. Qe2 Qd6 50. f5 gxf5 $2 {A mistake at
last. He was getting short of time and moving quickly.} 51. Qxh5+ Kg7 52. Qxf5
a3 53. Qg4+ Kf7 54. Qf3+ Ke7 55. Qe3+ Kd7 56. h5 Qe7 57. Qa7+ Ke6 58. h6 $4 {
Trying to rush him I blunder horribly. Stupid, as I had plenty of time.} Qxa7
0-1

