{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. d3 b5 6. Bb3
Be7 7. a3 O-O 8. Bg5 h6 9. Bh4 d6 10. h3 Bd7 11. O-O g5 12. Bg3 g4 $5 {
Premature. My usual problem of trying to push a weak opponent off the board.} (
12... Kh8 $142 13. Z0 Nh7 14. Z0 f5) 13. Nh4 gxh3 $5 (13... Kh8 $142) 14. Ng6
hxg2 $5 {Three dodgy moves in a row 14.......Re8 keeps the h-file closed.} (
14... Re8) 15. Kxg2 Re8 16. Rh1 Kg7 17. Qd2 Ng8 18. Nxe7 Qxe7 {I am in trouble.
} 19. Bh4 Qf8 20. Nc3 ({If} 20. Bg5 Kg6 ({If} 20... Kh7 21. Rxh6+)) 20... Be6
21. Nd5 Rac8 (21... Rec8 $142 {The Rook is "forkable" on e8.}) 22. Bg5 Kg6 23.
Bh4 f5 24. Rag1 f4 25. Kf1+ Kh7 (25... Kf7 {May offer the only hope.}) 26. c3
Nd8 $2 {Missing the threat} ({Maybe} 26... Qf7 {offers hope.}) 27. f3 c6 $2 (
27... Qf7 $142) 28. Rxg8 $1 Bxg8 {Completely lost.} 29. Nf6+ Kh8 30. Bxg8 Re7
31. Bg5 Nf7 32. Bxf7 Rxf7 33. Rxh6+ Kg7 34. Qh2 1-0

