{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 a6 3. a4 {After losing 5 times in a row in
this opening he tries a different tack.} Nc6 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4 Nf6 6. Nc3 e5
7. Nxc6 bxc6 8. Bd3 Be7 9. h3 d5 10. Bd2 O-O 11. O-O Be6 12. Qf3 (12. f4 $142)
12... d4 ({Fritz gives} 12... Rb8 {then} 13. b3 Bb4 14. a5 Qd6 15. Bxa6 dxe4
16. Qe3 Nd5 17. Nxd5 cxd5 {but I didn't like it.}) 13. Ne2 c5 14. b3 {[12']} h6
{[9']} ({Fritz gives} 14... g6 {which looks better.}) 15. Ng3 Nh7 ({Fritz gives
} 15... Nd7) 16. Nf5 Bg5 17. Bxg5 Nxg5 18. Qg3 (18. Qe2 $142) 18... Bxf5 19.
exf5 f6 $2 ({Now Fritz gives} 19... e4 20. Bc4 Re8 21. Rfe1 $14) 20. f3 (20.
Bc4+ $142) 20... Nf7 21. Rfe1 Nd6 22. Re2 ({Fritz still prefers White (0.71)
with} 22. f4 Qc8 23. Qf3 Nf7 24. Bc4 Qxf5 25. fxe5 Qxf3 26. gxf3 fxe5 27. Rxe5
Kh7) 22... Qc8 23. Qg4 ({He should play} 23. f4) 23... c4 24. bxc4 Nxc4 25.
Bxc4+ Qxc4 26. Qe4 Rab8 27. Qd3 $2 {Leaves him with a difficult endgame with a
weak d-Pawn.} Qxd3 28. cxd3 Rb3 29. Rd2 Rc8 30. Kf1 Rcc3 31. Ke2 Kf7 32. g3 g6
33. fxg6+ Kxg6 34. h4 Kh5 35. Raa2 f5 ({Fritz prefers} 35... Rc1) 36. Ra1 {
[37']} e4 {[34']} 37. fxe4 fxe4 38. dxe4 Re3+ 39. Kf2 $2 ({Correct is} 39. Kf1)
39... Rf3+ 40. Kg2 Rxg3+ 41. Kf2 Rbf3+ 42. Ke2 d3+ 0-1

