6. Nc3 {(0.87)}) 6... d6 {I was already unhappy.} ({Fritz prefers} 6... O-O {
but my KS is bare.}) 7. exd6 Qxd6 8. Qxd6 cxd6 ({Not} 8... Bxd6 $2 9. Re1+ Ne6
10. Ng5) 9. Re1 Be6 10. Bb5+ Bd7 {(0.84)} (10... Nc6 11. Nc3 a6 {(0.27)}) 11.
