and he thought for a long time about his move.} 19. Na7 {This is odd but is
Fritz's recommendation.} Nxa7 20. Bxa7 {[48']} Kf7 {[56'] I felt that I had to
speed up a bit so played a "safe" move. I missed his reply.} 21. c4 {I think
he felt that this was winning and I was concerned having missed it.} Bc6 {[68']
} ({My first thought was that a Pawn goes as} 21... dxc4 22. Rxd7 {lets him on
the 7th rank} ({Fritz is 0.01 for 21.c4 with 21......dxc4} 22. Bxc4 Rxc4 23.
Rxd7 b5 24. Be3 Rc2)) 22. cxd5 Bxd5 23. Bxd5 (23. Rxd5 $142 exd5 24. Bxd5+ Kf8
25. Bd4 Rd8 26. Re5 Rd7) 23... exd5 24. Rxd5 Rhd8 25. Rf5+ (25. Rxd8 $142)
25... Bf6 26. g4 {(-0.01) I'm winning!} h6 (26... Rc2 $142) 27. Re2 Rc4 28. h3
Rd7 29. Be3 Kg8 $2 {Another quick "safe" move} (29... Rc6 $142) 30. Bxh6 Bxb2
31. Rxb2 gxh6 32. Rf6 h5 (32... Kg7 $142) 33. g5 (33. gxh5 Rc5 34. Rg6+ {
However, a human player won't like 33.gxh5 and his eply was very quick.}) 33...
