{30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 Qe7 5. Bg2 O-O 6. e3 Nc6
7. Ne2 Bxd2+ 8. Qxd2 d6 9. O-O Bd7 10. Nbc3 a5 11. Rac1 Rab8 12. Nb5 Rfc8 13.
a3 (13. Nf4 Ra8 14. a4 {(0.69)}) 13... e5 $2 {Loses the echnage} (13... a4 $142
14. Nf4 Ra8 15. Nc3) 14. d5 Nd8 15. Na7 b6 16. Nxc8 Bxc8 17. b4 Nb7 18. Rfe1
Bf5 19. Nc3 Ra8 20. e4 Bd7 21. Ra1 Ne8 22. Ne2 {My object is to get the Knight
to d3 to support the push c5} f6 23. Qc3 (23. Qe3 $142) 23... g6 24. Nc1 f5 25.
Nd3 Nf6 26. f3 g5 27. Rec1 f4 28. c5 Bb5 29. cxd6 Nxd6 {Now his e-Pawn goes.}
30. Bf1 {With time passing I make a "safe" move. Both 30.Nxe5 and 30.Qxe5 are
playable.} Nfe8 31. Qxe5 Qf7 32. Qxg5+ 1-0

