{1hr 30' each/game.} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. e3 e6 5. Nf3 Be7 6. g4 Qc7
(6... O-O $142) 7. g5 Nfd7 8. Bd2 g6 (8... Na6 $142) 9. Rc1 Nb6 10. a4 $2 {
This is too casual. As usual against an opponent that I expect to beat easily
I had trouble motivating myself and played the whole game quickly and casually.
} (10. c5 $2) 10... Nxc4 11. Bxc4 dxc4 12. Qe2 Bd7 13. Qxc4 O-O 14. h4 Rc8 15.
Ne4 (15. h5 c5 16. hxg6 fxg6 17. dxc5 Qxc5 18. Qh4 h5 19. Qe4 {(1.58)}) 15...
Qd8 16. Bc3 b5 17. Qb3 a5 18. O-O b4 19. Bd2 Na6 20. Nc5 Nxc5 21. dxc5 Be8 22.
e4 Qc7 23. Be3 Bf8 24. Nd2 (24. Bd4 {Fritz}) 24... Rd8 25. Rfd1 Bg7 26. Nc4
Rxd1+ 27. Rxd1 Rd8 28. f4 Rxd1+ 29. Qxd1 Bf8 {Else 30.Qd6} 30. Kf2 Be7 ({
Fritz goes for} 30... Bxc5 31. Bxc5 Qxf4+ 32. Ke2 Qg4+ 33. Kd2) 31. Qd4 Bf8 32.
b3 Bg7 33. Qd6 Qa7 34. Qd8 Kf8 35. Nd6 Qd7 36. Qxd7 Bxd7 37. e5 {Blockong out
his King's Bishop. He can't save his QS Pawns.} Ke7 38. Nb7 Bc8 39. Nxa5 Kd7
40. Bd2 Ba6 41. Bxb4 Bf8 42. Ke3 Be7 43. Kd4 Bd8 44. Nc4 Bc7 45. Nd6 Ke7 46.
Ne4 Kf8 47. Nf6 Be2 48. Nxh7+ Kg7 49. Nf6 Bb8 50. Ba5 Bd1 51. Kc3 Kh8 52. Nd7
Ba7 53. Bb6 1-0

