{1hr 40' for 40 moves then 20' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. cxd5
Nxd5 5. e4 Nxc3 6. bxc3 c5 7. Bb5+ {Assuming that he knew more about the
Grunfeld than I did I decided to go for a less common line.} (7. Rb1) (7. Nf3)
7... Bd7 8. Qa4 (8. Be2 {Fritz}) 8... Bg7 9. Ne2 O-O 10. Bxd7 Nxd7 11. O-O a6 (
{I had been much more worried about} 11... cxd4 12. cxd4 Nc5 {Fritz has this
as 0.00 and Plays} 13. Qc2 Ne6 (13... Rc8 14. Be3 Ne6 15. Qa4) 14. Be3) 12. Be3
b5 13. Qa3 cxd4 14. cxd4 Nb6 15. Rfd1 Nc4 16. Qb3 Nxe3 17. Qxe3 Rc8 18. Rac1
Qb6 19. g3 Rfd8 20. Rxc8 Rxc8 21. Rc1 Rxc1+ 22. Qxc1 Bxd4 23. Nxd4 Qxd4 24.
Qc8+ Kg7 25. Qxa6 b4 26. Qe2 {5 Lancashire 7 Cumbria} 1/2-1/2

