{40 moves in 2hr then 30' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e5 3. dxe5 Ng4 4. Bf4 Bc5 $2
{This is playable after 4.Nf3 but not after 4.Bf4 as the Knight is inder
attack after e3.} 5. e3 h5 $2 ({he has to play} 5... d6 6. exd6 cxd6 7. Nc3) 6.
h3 Nh6 7. Qxh5 Nc6 8. a3 g6 9. Qd1 g5 10. Bh2 a5 {As it turns out it is rather
ironic that this was played to prevent b4.} ({If} 10... g4 11. Bf4) (10... Bf8
{Fritz}) 11. Nc3 b6 12. Nd5 d6 13. exd6 {This offers the chance of the wrong
recapture.} cxd6 {and here it is. This loses a piece.} (13... Bxd6) 14. b4 axb4
15. axb4 Rxa1 16. Qxa1 {1 Note that my KS pieces have not moved. We lost the
match 3 -} 1-0

