{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. e3 Nf6 4. Nc3 Bf5 5. Nf3 e6 6. Be2 Be7
7. Bd2 Nbd7 8. Rc1 Rc8 9. O-O O-O 10. Nh4 Ne4 $2 {Now he has big problems (1.
03)} (10... dxc4 11. Nxf5 exf5 12. Bxc4 {(0.47)}) 11. Nxf5 exf5 12. cxd5 Nxc3
13. Bxc3 cxd5 14. Qb3 (14. Qa4) 14... Nb6 15. Ba5 Qd6 16. Bxb6 Qxb6 (16... axb6
) 17. Qxb6 axb6 18. Bf3 {[9']} Rxc1 {[12']} 19. Rxc1 Rd8 20. Rc7 Kf8 21. g3 (
21. Rxb7 Rd6 22. g3) 21... b5 22. Rxb7 b4 23. Rb5 g6 24. Bxd5 Rc8 25. Rb7 {
Tying his Bishop down.} Rd8 26. Bb3 Rc8 27. a3 {I was in two minds about this
or 27.a4.} ({According to Fritz} 27. Kg2 {and 27.a4 are better.}) 27... bxa3
28. bxa3 Ra8 (28... Rc6 $142) 29. a4 Rc8 (29... Ra6 $142) 30. Kg2 Ra8 31. h4
Re8 32. d5 (32. Ra7 $142) 32... Rd8 33. a5 Rd6 (33... Ra8 $142) 34. Bc4 Rd8 35.
a6 Bd6 36. Bb5 Ra8 37. Rb6 Rd8 38. a7 Bc5 39. Rb8 {Bare played double points
games at home this season.} 1-0

