{30' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 Nf6 3. cxd5 e6 {Possibly worth a try in a
quickplay game.} 4. dxe6 Bxe6 5. Nf3 Bd6 6. Nc3 O-O 7. e3 {7.e4 is more
aggressive but I am a Pawn up and play it more solidly.} c6 8. Be2 Qc7 9. e4
Bb4 10. Qc2 Nbd7 11. O-O h6 {Best} 12. Bd2 Nh7 13. Bd3 Nhf6 14. Rfe1 Rad8 ({Not
} 14... Rfe8 $2 15. Nb5 Qa5 16. Bxb4 Qxb4 17. Nc7) 15. e5 Bxc3 16. bxc3 Nd5 17.
Nh4 c5 18. c4 Nb4 19. Bxb4 cxb4 20. h3 {Threatening to win the Bishop.} Nb6 21.
d5 Bc8 22. Rac1 Qe7 23. Nf3 ({Alternatively} 23. e6 Qxh4 24. e7) 23... Bd7 24.
Nd4 Rc8 25. Qd2 Qh4 26. Re4 Qg5 27. f4 Qg3 28. f5 Nxd5 {Running short of time
and in a terrible position this is worth a try.} 29. Ne2 Qg5 30. Qxg5 hxg5 31.
cxd5 Bxf5 32. Rd4 Bxd3 33. Rxd3 Rxc1+ 34. Nxc1 Re8 35. d6 Kf8 36. Re3 Rd8 37.
Rd3 Ke8 {All a bit of a rush now.} 38. Rd5 Kd7 39. Nd3 b6 40. Nxb4 Rc8 41. Rd2
Rc5 42. Re2 a5 43. Na6 Rc8 44. Kf2 b5 45. Ke3 Rc4 46. Nc7 b4 47. Nd5 a4 48.
Nb6+ 1-0

