{30' each/game} 1. e4 d6 2. d4 g6 3. Nf3 Bg7 4. Nc3 Bg4 5. Be2 Nd7 6. h3 Bxf3
7. Bxf3 e5 8. d5 Ne7 9. Be3 O-O 10. O-O h6 11. Qd2 Kh7 12. Be2 f5 13. f3 f4 14.
Bf2 g5 15. a3 {All played very fast. I had used 3' here.} Ng6 16. Qe1 a6 17. g4
fxg3 18. Bxg3 h5 19. Rf2 {[7']} h4 {[4']} 20. Bh2 Nf6 21. Rg2 Nh5 {Fritz makes
this only a quarter of a Pawn better for Black, but White's position is harder
to play especially in a quickplay game.} 22. Nd1 Bh6 23. Ne3 Qd7 24. Ng4 (24.
Nf5 {Would give me the option of .......Rxf5 at some stage.}) 24... Rf7 25. Qd2
Nhf4 26. Bxf4 Nxf4 27. Rh2 {[10']} Raf8 {[10']} 28. Rf1 Qa4 29. c3 Nh5 30. Bd1
Qb5 31. Rg2 Ng3 32. Rff2 Qb6 33. Kh2 Qb5 {Fritz makes this 0.00 but I'd rather
be Black.} 34. Rg1 Kg7 35. Nxh6 Kxh6 36. Qe3 Rf4 37. a4 Qd7 38. b3 $2 {Missing
the reply.} Nxe4 39. Rfg2 Ng3 40. Rxg3 $2 {A degree of panic.} ({If} 40. Qd3 e4
41. fxe4 Nf1+ $19) 40... hxg3+ 41. Rxg3 Qf5 42. c4 Rd4 43. Be2 Qf4 44. Qg1 Rd2
45. Qf1 e4 46. Qg2 exf3 47. Qxf3 Qxf3 48. Rxf3 Rxf3 49. Kg2 Re3 0-1

