1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Bc5 3. Nf3 Nc6 4. Bb5 d6 5. d4 exd4 6. Nxd4 Bd7 7. Bxc6 Bxc6 8.
Be3 Qd7 9. Qd2 Ne7 10. O-O-O O-O-O 11. Nb3 Bb6 12. Rhe1 Rhe8 13. Bd4 f6 (13...
f5 {Fritz}) 14. f4 Qg4 (14... f5) 15. Bxb6 axb6 16. h3 Qg6 17. Nd5 Qf7 18. Nc3
Bd7 (18... f5) 19. Kb1 Nc6 20. Nd5 Ne7 21. g4 Nxd5 22. Qxd5 Be6 23. Qd4 Qd7 24.
Qc3 Bxb3 25. Qxb3 Qe6 26. Qd5 Re7 27. f5 Qxd5 28. exd5 Rde8 29. Re6 {I thought
that I had gone wrong here but it is OK.} Rxe6 ({Fritz likes} 29... Kd7 {
or 29.......Kd8}) 30. dxe6 Kd8 31. c4 Ke7 32. b4 {I was concerned that the
protected passed e-Pawn was going to be a problem. Fritz evaluates -0.08!} g6 {
Best} 33. Rd3 gxf5 34. gxf5 Rg8 35. Kb2 Rg5 36. Rf3 h5 37. a4 h4 38. Rf4 Rg2+
39. Kc1 Rg5 40. Kd2 c6 41. Ke3 Rg3+ 42. Rf3 Rg1 43. Rf4 Rg3+ 44. Kf2 Rxh3 45.
Kg2 ({If} 45. Rg4 Ra3 46. Rg7+ Ke8 47. Rf7 Rc3 48. Rxb7 Rxc4 49. Rxb6 Rf4+ 50.
Ke3 Rxf5 51. Rxc6 Re5+ 52. Kf3 Ke7) 45... Rg3+ 46. Kh2 Rg5 47. Kh3 d5 48. cxd5
cxd5 49. b5 d4 50. Rxd4 Rxf5 51. Rd7+ Kxe6 52. Rxb7 Rf3+ 53. Kxh4 Rf4+ 54. Kg3
Rxa4 55. Rxb6+ Kf5 56. Rb8 Rb4 57. b6 Rb3+ 58. Kf2 Kf4 59. b7 f5 60. Ke2 Rb2+
61. Kd3 Kf3 62. Kc3 Rb6 63. Kd4 f4 64. Kc5 Rb1 65. Kd6 Rd1+ 66. Ke7 Re1+
1/2-1/2

