{2hr each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5
7. Bb3 O-O 8. c3 d5 9. d4 {I wasn't familiar with this.} dxe4 ({Normal is} 9...
exd4 10. e5 Ne4 11. cxd4 Bg4 $11) 10. Nxe5 Nxe5 11. dxe5 Qxd1 12. Bxd1 {
White had taken 5' here.} Nd7 13. Rxe4 {He thought for a long time over this.
It amazing how much play I get for the Pawn.} ({Fritz gives} 13. Bc2 Bb7 14.
Nd2 Nxe5 15. Nxe4) 13... Nc5 14. Re2 ({He can't play} 14. Re1) ({Slightly
better is} 14. Rd4 Ne6 15. Rd2 Bb7) 14... Rd8 15. Nd2 (15. Bc2 $142) 15... Bf5
{[36'] Best. White can't move Rook, Knight or Queen's Bishop.} 16. Bb3 {
He was now on 80' having taken 75' over 4 moves.} (16. f3 $142) 16... Nd3 {
[55']} (16... a5 {Fritz}) 17. Nf3 Bg4 18. e6 {Leads to a draw.} (18. h3 {Fritz}
) 18... fxe6 19. Bxe6+ Bxe6 20. Rxe6 Bc5 21. Be3 Bxe3 22. Rxe3 Nxb2 (22... Nxb2
23. Re7 Na4 24. Rxc7 Rdc8 25. Rb7 Nxc3 26. Nd4 Rf8 27. Ne6 Rf7) 1/2-1/2

