Nge2 h5 8. Qa4 a6 9. f3 h4 10. b4 cxb4 11. Qxb4 Nc5 12. Bc2 Nfd7 13. Nd1 Bg5
14. Bxg5 Qxg5 15. O-O Rh6 16. Rb1 Kf8 17. Qc3 Kg8 18. Qe3 Qe7 19. Ndc3 Rg6 20.
Na4 {Doubtful} Nxa4 21. Bxa4 Nc5 22. Bc2 Bd7 23. Nc3 Rf8 24. Qe2 Rg5 25. Rb6 g6
26. Kh1 f5 {We were both getting short of time here and the remaining moves
were played very quickly.} 27. exf5 gxf5 28. f4 Rg4 29. h3 Rg3 30. Rf3 Rxf3 31.
gxf3 Rf7 32. fxe5 Qxe5 33. Qxe5 dxe5 34. Rh6 Rh7 35. Rf6 Kg7 36. Bxf5 Kxf6 37.
Bxh7 Bxh3 38. Ne4+ Nxe4 39. Bxe4 b6 40. Bd3 a5 41. Kh2 Bd7 42. Bf1 e4 43. fxe4
Ke5 {Dick's score book gives 44.Kh3 Kxe4 45.Kxh4 Ke5 46.Kg3 Drawn White can't
play 44.Kh3 as he moves into check. This was either a missed by both players
in the time scramble or a mistake made by Dick copying the game from his
originaal score sheet to his book.} 1/2-1/2

