{40 moves in 2hr then 30' allegro} 1. d4 f5 2. Bg5 g6 3. e3 Bg7 4. Nd2 Nf6 5.
Ngf3 c6 6. c4 O-O 7. Bd3 d6 8. O-O Nbd7 {[3']} 9. Qc2 {[34']} Qe8 {[5']} 10.
Rfe1 h6 {[16']} 11. Bh4 e5 12. Bxf6 Bxf6 13. e4 f4 14. d5 {Blocks the centre
and leaves me free to attack the KS.} c5 15. a3 g5 16. h3 Qg6 17. Nh2 h5 18.
Be2 Rf7 19. b4 Rh7 20. Qd1 Bd8 {reposting the bishop on the b6-g1 diagonal.}
21. Rc1 {[1hr 12']} Bb6 {[46']} 22. Nb3 Qh6 23. Bd3 {[1hr 26']} Kh8 {[52']} 24.
Kf1 a5 {An unecessary diversion although it doesn't really affect the
situation.} ({I wanted to play} 24... Nf6 {without} 25. bxc5 Bxc5 26. Nxc5 dxc5
{leaving him a passed d-Pawn.}) 25. bxa5 Bxa5 26. Nxa5 Rxa5 27. Rc3 Nf6 28. Qc1
{[1hr 36']} Qg7 {[1hr 12']} ({As it turns out} 28... Rg7 {would have been
better.}) 29. Qb1 Ra6 {To prevent 30.Qb6} 30. Ke2 {[1hr 45']} g4 {[1hr 26']}
31. Bc2 gxh3 {Overlooking just one thing.} 32. gxh3 Qg2 33. Rg1 {The move that
I'd missed.} Qxh2 34. Rh1 (34. Rh1 {Draw agreed. Had it have been a tournament
game I might have carried on.} Qg2 35. Rg1 Bxh3 {However he was short of time.
Fritz gives} 36. Rxg2 Bxg2 37. Rb3 Ra7 38. Qg1 f3+ 39. Ke1 Ra4 40. Rc3 Ra8 41.
Bd1 Nxe4 42. Rb3 Rg8 43. Bc2 Bh3 44. Qh1 Rhg7) 1/2-1/2

