{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro.} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. g3 b6
5. Bg2 Bb7 6. Nge2 Nd7 7. Be3 e6 8. O-O Ne7 9. a4 a6 {To answer a5 with .....b5
} 10. h3 O-O 11. Qd2 f5 $2 {Ridiculous! Played without consideration - the
sort of simple tactical oversight which has blighted my play lately and which
I have been trying to avoid.} 12. Nf4 Kf7 $2 {Compounding the crime. I knew
that I should simply acceptthat I had lost a Pawn and play 12......Qe8.
However, I recklessly launch into what I knew would be trouble} 13. exf5 (13.
Nxe6 $142 Kxe6 14. exf5+ Rxf5 15. Bxb7) 13... Bxg2 14. Nxe6 Qc8 15. Kxg2 Rh8
16. Nxg7 Kxg7 17. Bh6+ Kf7 18. fxg6+ hxg6 19. g4 Qb7+ 20. f3 Rh7 {I had given
up now and was playing quickly.} 21. Qf4+ Kg8 22. Rae1 Rf7 23. Qg5 Nf6 24. Rxe7
Rxe7 25. Qxg6+ 1-0

