{40 moves in 2hr then 30' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 Nc6 3. Nf3 e6 4. e3 Bb4+ 5.
Bd2 Qe7 6. Be2 O-O 7. O-O Bxd2 8. Nbxd2 d6 9. a3 a5 10. Qc2 e5 11. d5 Nb8 12.
b4 Bg4 13. h3 Bh5 14. Bd3 axb4 ({Fritz prefers} 14... Bxf3 15. gxf3 g6 {
However, a human player would be less keen on this.}) 15. axb4 Rxa1 16. Rxa1
Na6 17. Qb1 (17. Ra4 $142) (17. Rb1 $142) 17... Re8 18. e4 Bxf3 19. Nxf3 Nh5
20. g3 f5 21. Nh4 {Starting to go wrong.} (21. Qb3 $142) 21... f4 22. Qd1 $2
Qg5 (22... Nxb4 $142) 23. Qg4 $2 {Losing it completely around here.} (23. Nf3
$142 Qg6 24. g4 Nxb4 25. Nh4 Qf6 26. Qa4) 23... Qxg4 24. hxg4 Nf6 25. g5 {
Missing his reply.} (25. Rb1 $142 Nxg4 26. gxf4 exf4 27. c5 dxc5 28. Bxa6 bxa6
29. bxc5) 25... Nxb4 26. Bb1 Nd7 27. Ra4 $2 {Again not good.} (27. gxf4 $142)
27... Na6 28. Ra3 fxg3 29. Rxg3 g6 30. Rc3 Nac5 31. Nf3 Nb6 32. Nd2 Ra8 33. f3
Ra1 34. Kg2 Nba4 35. Re3 Nb2 36. Rc3 Kg7 37. Kg3 b6 38. f4 $2 {Played quickly
and throwing it away. This is "active play" but I should just sit tight. I
missed the reply not giving my move much consideration.} Rxb1 39. Nxb1 Nxe4+
40. Kf3 Nxc3 41. Nxc3 exf4 42. Nb5 Nxc4 43. Nxc7 h6 44. gxh6+ Kxh6 45. Kxf4 g5+
46. Kg4 Kg6 47. Nb5 Kf6 48. Nc3 Ne5+ 49. Kh5 Kf5 50. Nb5 Nf7 51. Nc3 g4 52. Kh4
Ng5 53. Nb5 Ne4 54. Nc7 g3 55. Kh3 Kf4 56. Ne6+ Kf3 57. Nd4+ Kf2 0-1

