{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. Be3 b6
5. Qd2 Bb7 6. O-O-O Nd7 7. f3 a6 8. h4 h5 ({If} 8... c5 9. h5 cxd4 10. Bxd4
Bxd4 11. Qxd4 Ngf6 12. hxg6 fxg6 13. f4 Qc7) (8... h6 9. h5 g5 10. Nge2 Ngf6)
9. Nh3 Ngf6 10. Ng5 c6 $2 {The losing move. I should have given more thought
to why he had played 10.Ng5} ({Correct is} 10... O-O) 11. e5 {Now it hit me
straight away.} dxe5 12. dxe5 Nh7 {After much thought.} ({Correct is} 12...
Nxe5 13. Qxd8+ {and there is a fork on f7. If I don't play 12......Nxe5 then
e6 is coming. I considered resigning.} Rxd8 14. Rxd8+ Kxd8 15. f4 Neg4 16.
Nxf7+ Kc7 17. Nxh8 Bxh8 18. Bd2 c5 19. Rg1 Ne4) 13. e6 Ne5 14. exf7+ Nxf7 15.
Qf2 Qc8 16. Nxf7 Kxf7 17. Bc4+ Ke8 18. Qg3 Nf8 19. Rhe1 Qb8 20. Bg5 e5 21. Ne4
Nd7 22. Qh3 {David Coates ELO 2047 [Dick took a bye in Rd2]} 1-0

