{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. d4 f5 2. g4 fxg4 3. h3 d6 (3... g3
$142) (3... d5 $142) 4. hxg4 Bxg4 5. Qd3 Qd7 (5... Nf6 $142) 6. f3 Bf5 7. e4
Bg6 8. Bh3 Qc6 {I felt that I was in big trouble.} 9. d5 Qb6 10. Be3 c5 (10...
Qxb2 $142) 11. Nd2 Nd7 12. b4 Ngf6 (12... Ne5 $142 13. Qe2 Qxb4 14. Rb1 Qa4 15.
Rxb7 Nf6 16. Qb5+ Qxb5 17. Rxb5 Bh5 18. Be6 h6 19. Rb7 g5) 13. Rb1 Qc7 14. bxc5
dxc5 {I knew this was risky.} 15. Ne2 Nb6 16. Qb5+ Kd8 17. Nf4 (17. Bf4 e5 18.
dxe6 Bd6) 17... Bf7 18. Ne6+ Bxe6 19. Bxe6 Nfd7 20. f4 g6 21. Qb2 Nf6 22. c4
Bg7 23. Qb5 Nh5 24. Rxh5 ({If} 24. e5 {I intended} Bxe5) 24... gxh5 25. Bxc5
Bc3 26. e5 Rf8 27. d6 exd6 28. exd6 Qc6 29. Qxc6 bxc6 30. Bxb6+ {I'm winning!}
axb6 31. f5 Bxd2+ {However, I was getting short of time.} 32. Kxd2 Rxa2+ 33.
Kd3 Ra6 34. c5 b5 35. Rg1 Ra7 (35... Ra3+ $142 36. Kd4 Ra4+ 37. Ke5 Rg4 38. Ra1
Ra4) 36. Ke4 Ke8 $2 {Throwing it away but I was having to play fast.} 37. Ke5
Ra3 38. Rg7 {Black lost on time} 1-0

