{60' each/game} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nf3 d6 4. Be3 b6 5. c3 Bb7 6. Nbd2 Nd7 7.
Bd3 e6 8. Qc2 Ne7 9. O-O O-O 10. c4 f5 $2 {Simply too casual. I expected to
win easily but should have taken more care.} 11. exf5 (11. Ng5 $142 Rf6 12. d5)
11... exf5 12. Bf4 h6 13. d5 Ne5 14. Nd4 Bc8 15. N2f3 g5 16. Nxg5 $5 {If one
is going to sacrifice a piece for pawns then 16.Bxg5!? looks better.} (16. Bxg5
$5) 16... hxg5 17. Bxg5 Qe8 18. Bxe7 Qxe7 19. Nxf5 Bxf5 20. Bxf5 Qg5 21. Bh3 $2
(21. Be4 $142) 21... Nf3+ 22. Kh1 Nd4 23. Qd3 Rae8 24. b3 $2 {Much too risky.}
Qh4 25. f3 Nxf3 26. Rad1 Ne5 27. Rxf8+ Rxf8 28. Be6+ Kh8 29. Qh3 Qxh3 30. Bxh3
Rf2 31. g3 {He was getting shotr of time now.} Rxa2 32. g4 Rb2 33. g5 Nf3 34.
Bf5 {Playing quickly he hastens the end.} Rxh2# 0-1

