{90' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. f3 a6 6. c4 e6 7.
Nc3 Nc6 8. Be3 Nxd4 9. Bxd4 Be7 10. Be2 O-O 11. O-O d5 $2 {Not good.} 12. e5
Ne8 13. cxd5 exd5 14. Qb3 Be6 {Leads to the loss of 2 Pawns. The d-Pawn looks
doomed so he may as well accept that and not give away the b-Pawn as well.} 15.
Qxb7 g6 ({If} 15... Rb8 16. Qxa6 Rxb2 17. Nxd5) 16. b3 Ng7 17. Rfd1 Re8 18. Bf2
Qb8 19. Qxb8 Rexb8 20. Nxd5 Bd8 21. Rac1 a5 22. Bc4 Nf5 23. Ne3 Nxe3 {Black
now makes life easy for me by swopping off most of the pieces.} 24. Bxe3 Bxc4
25. Rxc4 Rc8 26. Rdc1 Rxc4 27. Rxc4 h5 28. f4 Be7 29. Kf2 Bb4 30. Bc5 Bxc5+ 31.
Rxc5 Kf8 32. Ke3 Ra7 33. g3 Ke7 34. h3 Ra6 35. g4 hxg4 36. hxg4 Ke6 37. Ke4 f5+
38. exf6 Kxf6 39. Kd5 g5 40. f5 {This seemed an easy win so I didn't spend
time looking for more.} ({However} 40. Rc6+ Rxc6 41. fxg5+ Kxg5 42. Kxc6) 40...
Ke7 41. Rc7+ Kf6 42. Rc6+ Rxc6 43. Kxc6 Ke5 44. Kb5 1-0

