{30' each/game} 1. d4 f5 2. g4 {2nd time in 4 games that CF has played this
against me.} fxg4 3. h3 gxh3 {Varying from the game against Bob Newton [3rd
Leyland FIDE Open Rd6 31/8/09]} ({I think I will play} 3... d5 {next time} 4.
hxg4 Bxg4 5. Nf3 Nc6) 4. Nxh3 Nf6 5. Qd3 d5 6. Ng5 Qd6 7. Nc3 g6 ({Slightly
better is} 7... Na6) 8. Nb5 Qb6 9. Bf4 Na6 10. e4 dxe4 11. Nxe4 ({Fritz gives} 
11. Qb3 Bd7 12. O-O-O O-O-O 13. Nf7 Bg7 14. Be5 Kb8 15. Bc4 Bg4 {It is
difficult to imagine a human player playing this.}) 11... Bg7 12. Nxf6+ Bxf6
13. O-O-O Bf5 14. Qc4 c6 15. Nd6+ $5 {A moment of panic.} exd6 16. Re1+ Kd8 17.
Qf7 $2 {Short of time this is immediately fatal.} ({Correct is} 17. Rxh7 d5 18.
Rxh8+ Bxh8 19. Bg5+ Kc7 20. Re7+ Bd7 21. Qe2) 17... Qxd4 {Now he can resign}
18. Qb3 {Effectively resigning.} ({fritz suggests} 18. Qc4 {but} Qxb2+ 19. Kd1
Qd4+ {leaves him a piece and three Pawns down.}) 18... Qxf4+ 0-1

