7. Qc2 h6 8. Bf4 c5 9. dxc5 Bxc5 10. a3 Nh5 $5 {Puts the Knight offside.} 11.
Bd2 Bd6 12. cxd5 exd5 13. Nc3 Nb6 14. Rfd1 Nf6 15. Rac1 Qe7 16. Be3 Nc4 17. Bd4
Be6 18. Bxf6 Qxf6 19. Nxd5 Bxd5 (19... Qxb2 20. Qxb2 Nxb2 21. Nf6+ gxf6 22.
Rxd6 {Fritz}) 20. Rxd5 Ne5 ({If} 20... Nxb2 {I was intending} 21. Rxd6 ({
Fritz gives} 21. Rb1 Bxa3 22. Qb3 Qa6 23. Ne5 Rac8 24. Ra1 Rfe8 25. Bf3 Nc4 26.
Nxc4 Qxc4 27. Qxa3)) 21. Nxe5 Bxe5 22. b3 g6 ({If} 22... Bb2 23. Rb1 Bxa3 24.
b4 Rac8 25. Qa2 Rc3 26. Ra5 Bc1 27. Rxa7) 23. a4 b6 {This looks very risky.}
24. Qd2 Rad8 {A Pawn must go.} ({e.g.} 24... Kg7 25. Rd7) 25. Qxh6 Rxd5 (25...
Rd6 {is an alternative.}) 26. Bxd5 Bd4 27. e3 Bc5 28. Rc2 {After a lot of
thought.} ({I wanted to play} 28. b4 {but} Bxb4 29. Rc6 Bd6 {looked OK for
Black. However} 30. e4 Rd8 31. e5) 28... Re8 29. Qf4 Qg7 30. b4 Bf8 31. Rc7 Re7
32. Rxe7 Bxe7 33. Qb8+ Kh7 34. Qxa7 Bxb4 35. Qxb6 Qa1+ 36. Kg2 Qxa4 37. Qf6 1-0

