{75' each/game} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nf3 d6 4. Nc3 e6 5. Bd3 Nd7 6. O-O b6 7.
Qe2 Bb7 8. Be3 Ne7 9. Rad1 h6 10. Bb5 O-O 11. Qd2 Kh7 12. Bxd7 Qxd7 13. h3 f5
14. e5 Bxf3 15. gxf3 dxe5 16. dxe5 Qxd2 17. Rxd2 (17. Bxd2 $142 Bxe5 18. Rfe1
Nc6 19. f4 Bd6 20. Nb5 Rfe8) 17... Bxe5 18. Rd7 Rf7 19. f4 Bxc3 20. bxc3 c5 21.
c4 Kg7 22. Rfd1 Nc6 23. Rxf7+ Kxf7 24. Rd7+ Kf8 25. Rh7 Kg8 26. Rc7 ({Clearly} 
26. Rxh6 $2 Kg7 27. Rh4 Nd4 {is an easy win for Black.}) 26... Nb4 27. Re7 Nxa2
28. Rxe6 Kf7 29. Rd6 Re8 30. Kf1 Nb4 31. Bd2 Nxc2 32. Bc3 Nd4 33. Bxd4 cxd4 34.
Rxd4 Ke7 35. Rd5 Rd8 ({Afterwards I felt that I should have played.} 35... Rc8)
36. Re5+ Kf7 $2 {This is the main error.} (36... Kd7) (36... Kd6) 37. c5 bxc5
38. Rxc5 Re8 39. Ra5 {This seems drawn. Fritz gives -0.75 but there is no
clear winning method.} Re7 40. Ra6 h5 {The only thing that I can try.} 41. f3
h4 42. Kf2 Kg7 43. Kf1 Kh6 44. Kf2 Kh5 45. Kf1 g5 $5 {Very risky but I had to
try something if I was going to win.} (45... Rf7 {first then .....g5 might be
good.}) 46. Rf6 a5 {The only chance for a win.} 47. Rxf5 Ra7 48. Rxg5+ Kh6 49.
Rg2 $2 (49. Rg4 $142) 49... a4 50. Ra2 a3 51. Kf2 Kg6 52. f5+ Kxf5 53. Ke3 Ra4
54. Kf2 {he offered a draw here.} Kf4 55. Ke2 Kg3 56. Ke3 Rf4 57. Rf2 Rf8 58.
Rf1 Re8+ 59. Kd4 a2 60. f4 Ra8 61. Ra1 Kxf4 62. Rf1+ Kg3 63. Ra1 Kxh3 64. Ke3
Kg3 0-1

