{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 Nbd7 6. Nf3 e5
$2 7. fxe5 dxe5 8. dxe5 Ng4 9. Bg5 f6 10. exf6 Bxf6 11. Bxf6 (11. Qd5 Bxg5 12.
Nxg5 Qe7 13. Qe6 Ndf6 14. Qxe7+ Kxe7 15. Nd5+ {1.13/0}) 11... Qxf6 12. Qd2 c6
13. Be2 Nde5 14. O-O Nxf3+ 15. Rxf3 Qe5 16. Qf4 Qxf4 17. Rxf4 Ne5 {A problem
now is his Knight is better placed than mine.} 18. Rd1 Bd7 19. Na4 b6 20. c5 b5
21. Nc3 O-O-O 22. a3 a5 23. Rf6 Kc7 24. Kf2 Rhf8 25. Rxf8 Rxf8+ {He offered a
draw here.} 26. Kg3 Be6 27. Rd4 Rd8 28. Rxd8 Kxd8 29. Kf4 Nd7 30. b4 axb4 31.
axb4 h6 32. h4 Ke7 33. e5 g5+ 34. hxg5 hxg5+ 35. Kxg5 Nxe5 36. Ne4 Bd5 37. Kf5
Nd7 38. g4 Nb8 39. g5 Na6 40. Nc3 {It's a dead draw but I keep trying.} Be6+
41. Kg6 Nxb4 42. Nxb5 cxb5 43. Bxb5 Nd5 {He offered a draw here.} 44. Kg7 Nc7
45. Bd3 Bd5 46. Bf5 Ne6+ {He again offered a draw which I could hardly decline
now.} 1/2-1/2

