{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 d6 4. Nc3 g6 5. e4 Bg7 6. f4 O-O
7. Nf3 Nbd7 8. Be2 a6 9. a4 b6 10. O-O Bb7 {[17']} 11. Qc2 {[2']} Rc8 12. Bd3
Ne8 13. g4 Nc7 14. Bd2 b5 $5 {Black feels that he has to get some play even at
the cost of a Pawn.} 15. axb5 Nb6 16. bxa6 Nxa6 17. Nb5 Qd7 18. h3 e6 19. Ba5 (
19. Qb3 {prevents 19......Nb4}) 19... Nb4 20. Bxb4 cxb4 21. Qb3 f5 {A touch of
desperation. White threatens the b-Pawn and then the d-Pawn.} 22. dxe6 Qe7 ({If
} 22... Qxe6 {I intended} 23. Ng5 Qe7 24. c5+ {winning the Knight}) 23. exf5
gxf5 24. gxf5 d5 25. cxd5 Bxd5 26. Qd1 Qc5+ 27. Kh2 ({Fritz prefers} 27. Rf2 {
but most human players would not want to pin the Rook.}) 27... Qe3 28. Qd2
Qxd2+ 29. Nxd2 Bxb2 30. Rab1 {I started playing too quickly around here. I had
plenty of time so should have taken more care.} (30. Ra6 $142) 30... Bc3 {
[1hr 17']} (30... Bf6 $142 {is what I expected.}) 31. Ne4 {[46']} Bxe4 32. Bxe4
Nc4 33. Nxc3 bxc3 34. Rb7 {Still playing too quickly.} (34. Rg1+ $142 Kh8 35.
e7 Rf6 36. Bd5 Nd6 37. Be6) 34... Nd6 35. Bd5 $2 {Big mistake.} ({Correct is} 
35. Rg1+ Kh8 36. e7 Rfe8 37. f6 c2 38. Rc1 Nxe4 39. f7 Rxe7 40. Rxe7 Nd6 41.
Re8+ {and he has to play} Rxe8) 35... Nxb7 $2 {Short of time (he was no longer
recording) he misses 35......Rxf5! A lucky escape!} (35... Rxf5 $1) 36. e7+ Rf7
37. Rg1+ Kh8 38. Bxf7 Nd6 39. Be6 Rb8 40. f6 Rb2+ 41. Kg3 Ne4+ 42. Kh4 Nxf6 43.
e8=Q+ 1-0

