7. O-O Na6 8. Re1 d6 9. e4 fxe4 10. Nxe4 Nxe4 11. Rxe4 Bf5 12. Re1 Qc7 {
I spent time considering 12......Nb4 which is best.} (12... Nb4 13. Re2 Bd3 14.
a3 ({I had been concerned about} 14. Rd2 Bxc4 15. Qa4) 14... Bxe2) 13. a3 e5
14. Be3 Bg4 15. dxe5 Bxe5 16. Ra2 Bg7 17. h3 Bxf3 18. Bxf3 Qf7 19. Be2 Rad8 20.
