24. Bxc5 (24. Ree2 $142 Bxd2 25. Rxd2 Qf8 26. Rd4 Re5 27. b4 Ne6 {all a bit
odd!}) 24... Bxd2 25. Rxe8+ Qxe8 $2 {Ludicrous! My usual problem of getting
complacent and playing too quickly. I need more self discipline (0.00)} (25...
Rxe8 {(-2.39)}) 26. Bb6 Bg5 27. Bxd8 1/2-1/2

