1. b4 d6 2. Bb2 e5 3. e3 Nf6 4. c4 Be7 5. g3 O-O 6. Bg2 Na6 7. a3 c6 8. Qc2 Bd7
9. Ne2 Rc8 10. O-O b5 11. d3 Qc7 12. Nbc3 Qb8 13. Qd2 Be6 14. cxb5 cxb5 15. f4
Bd7 16. Rac1 {Preventing 16......Bc6?} Rfe8 (16... Bc6 17. Bxc6 Rxc6 18. Nd5)
17. h3 {With thoughts of f5, g4, g5} Bd8 18. Kh2 Bc6 19. e4 Nc7 20. Nd1 Qb7 21.
Ne3 exf4 22. Nxf4 Ne6 23. Nf5 Nxf4 (23... Qb8 $142 {(defending d6)} 24. Nxe6
Rxe6 25. Nd4 Bd7 26. Nxe6 Rxc1 27. Qxc1 Bxe6) 24. Nxd6 Qd7 25. Nxe8 Nxe4 $5 {
A good try in the circumstances and making it interesting.} 26. Qxf4 Qxd3 $4 ({
I was pondering} 26... Bg5 27. Qxf7+ ({Better is} 27. Qe5 f6 28. Qd4 Bxc1 29.
Rxc1 Qxe8 30. dxe4 {However he blundered so it didn't matter.}) 27... Qxf7 28.
Rxf7 Kxf7 29. Bxe4 Bxc1 30. Nd6+ Ke6 31. Nxc8 Bxb2 32. Bxc6) 27. Qxf7+ 1-0

