{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 15' allegro} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. Be3 Nd7
5. Bc4 e6 6. Nge2 Ne7 7. Qd2 h6 8. O-O a6 9. a4 b6 10. f4 Bb7 11. Ng3 d5 12.
exd5 exd5 13. Bb3 f5 14. Bf2 O-O 15. Qe2 Nf6 16. Rfe1 Re8 17. Qe6+ {I wasn't
sure why he played this.} Kh7 18. Qf7 {I thought that this was very risky, but
Fritz thinks it's OK.} Ne4 19. Ngxe4 fxe4 20. Bh4 Qd6 21. Ne2 $4 {Loses a
piece.} ({Correct is} 21. g4 Kh8 22. Rad1 Qd7 23. f5 gxf5 24. Re2) 21... Nf5 {
He now thought for ages and I assumed that he would resign. However, it was
the first round and hardly anyone had finished so he decided to play on for a
while.} 22. Bf6 Qxf6 23. Qxf6 Bxf6 24. c3 a5 25. g4 Nh4 26. Kf2 c6 27. Rg1 Nf3
28. Rg2 Rf8 29. Ke3 Be7 30. Rf1 Ba6 31. Bd1 h5 0-1

