{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. d4 c5 2. d5 e5 3. c4 Nf6 4. Nc3 d6 5.
e4 Be7 6. Bd3 O-O 7. Nge2 Ne8 8. Qc2 Bg5 9. O-O Nd7 10. Bxg5 Qxg5 11. Qc1 Qe7
12. Qe3 g6 13. g4 $5 Qh4 14. Qg3 Qxg3+ 15. Nxg3 Ndf6 16. f3 Kh8 17. Kf2 Ng8 18.
Rg1 Ne7 19. Ke2 g5 {This was a surprise, leaving a hole on f5.} 20. Nf5 Ng6 21.
Kd2 Nf4 22. Rh1 a6 23. a4 b6 24. h4 {I offered a draw here but he was
desperate to win.} gxh4 25. Rxh4 f6 26. Rah1 Ra7 27. R4h2 Rg8 28. Kc2 Rg5 29.
Rh6 Rf7 30. b3 Rg6 31. R6h2 Ra7 32. Ra1 Kg8 33. Kd2 Kf8 34. Rah1 Kg8 35. Ra1 {
I offered a draw here.} Rd7 36. Rah1 h5 $2 {Desperate towin he plays this to
create some play (1.97)} 37. gxh5 (37. Ne2 $142) 37... Rg5 38. Ne2 Nxe2 39.
Bxe2 Rh7 40. Ne3 Rh6 41. Ng2 f5 42. exf5 Bxf5 43. Ne3 Ng7 44. Ng4 Rh8 45. Kc3 (
45. h6 $142 Ne8 46. Rf1 Bxg4 47. fxg4 Rg6 48. g5 Rxg5 49. Bd3) 45... Kf7 46. h6
Ne8 47. Ne3 Bg6 48. Bd3 Rg3 49. Rh3 Rxh3 50. Rxh3 Bxd3 51. Kxd3 Kg6 52. Ng4 Rh7
53. Ke4 Nf6+ 54. Nxf6 Kxf6 55. f4 exf4 56. Kxf4 Kg6 57. Rg3+ Kf6 {Disaster! I
agreed a draw without really thinking about it! 58.Re3 wins easily.} 1/2-1/2

