{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 Nf6 3. Bg2 g6 4. Nc3 Bg7
5. e4 O-O 6. Nge2 d6 7. O-O Nc6 8. f4 Bg4 9. h3 Bxe2 10. Nxe2 exf4 11. gxf4 Nd7
12. d4 Na5 {I was concerned that I was in trouble here.} 13. Qd3 {I was sure
that I had gone wrong.} Nb6 14. b3 c5 15. Be3 Qe7 16. Rad1 Nc6 17. dxc5 dxc5
18. e5 Rfd8 19. Qe4 Bf8 20. Nc3 Rac8 21. Nd5 Qe6 22. Kh2 Kh8 23. Qc2 Nd7 24.
Qf2 b6 25. Bf3 h5 26. Qg2 Ne7 27. Nxe7 Bxe7 $2 {Now I am in big trouble. After
much thought earlier in the game I had played this quite quickly.} ({Correct is
} 27... Qxe7 28. Bb7 Rb8 29. Bd5 Bg7 30. Qe4 Rbc8) 28. Bd5 Qf5 29. Be4 Qe6 30.
Bc1 Bf8 31. Bb2 Bg7 32. Kh1 Nf8 (32... Qe7 $142) 33. Rd5 Qe8 34. f5 Kh7 35. e6
fxe6 36. fxg6+ Kg8 37. Rf7 Bd4 38. Bxd4 cxd4 39. Rxh5 d3 40. Rh8+ ({Not} 40.
Rhh7 $2 Nxh7 41. gxh7+ Kxf7) 40... Kxh8 41. g7+ 1-0

