{40 moves in 1hr 40' then 20' allegro} 1. d4 g6 2. e4 Bg7 3. c4 d6 4. Nc3 Nd7
5. f4 e6 (5... e5 6. dxe5 dxe5 7. Nf3 Ne7 8. Nxe5 Nxe5 9. Qxd8+ Kxd8 10. fxe5
Bxe5 11. Be3 Bd7 $14) 6. Nf3 Ne7 7. Be3 b6 8. h4 h5 (8... Nf6 9. Qd2 Bb7 10.
Bd3 Qd7 11. O-O-O Ng4 12. Kb1 O-O-O $14) 9. Bd3 Bb7 10. d5 Nc5 11. Bc2 a5 {
I was worried about a4 but after ......Na6 I have .....Nb4} 12. Bd4 Bxd4 13.
Qxd4 Rg8 $2 ({Correct is} 13... O-O 14. O-O Qd7 15. Rae1 Rad8) 14. Ng5 {
Now I'm in trouble.} Nc8 (14... exd5 15. cxd5 f5 16. O-O-O Kd7 17. e5 Kc8 18.
Rhe1 Kb8 $18) 15. Nh7 Ke7 {After much thought and as good as resigning (I felt)
} (15... Ne7 16. O-O a4 17. Rae1 Ra5 18. Nf6+ Kf8 19. Nxg8 Kxg8 20. f5 e5 21.
Qe3 f6 22. fxg6 Nxg6 23. Qg3 Kh7 $16) 16. O-O-O Nd7 17. e5 dxe5 18. fxe5 Nc5
19. Qf4 Nd7 20. Rhf1 {Average grade for the tournament was 178} 1-0

