7. Bg5 h6 8. Bd2 e6 {I am playing the Hippo too carefully} 9. h4 Ngf6 10. Qe2
O-O (10... Qe7 $142 11. Z0 O-O-O) 11. O-O-O ({Fritz prefers} 11. h5 Nxh5 12. g4
Nhf6 13. g5 hxg5 14. Bxg5 e5 15. O-O-O) 11... Qe7 12. Kb1 a5 13. e5 Nd5 14. Ne4
dxe5 15. Nxe5 Nxe5 16. dxe5 Ba6 17. Qe1 Rad8 18. f4 {Fritz prefers 18.h5. I
now felt that I had to do something about the coming KS Pawn storm.} f5 19.
exf6 Nxf6 20. Nxf6+ Qxf6 21. Bc3 Rxd1+ 22. Qxd1 Qd8 {I offered a draw here.}
23. Bxg7 Kxg7 24. Qg4 Qf6 25. Re1 Rd8 26. Kc1 $2 (26. h5 $142 Rd2 27. Be4 Be2
28. Qxg6+ Qxg6 29. Bxg6 Bg4 30. Kc1 Rg2) 26... Qd4 27. Qd1 Qf2 28. Qxd8 Qxe1+
29. Qd1 Qxg3 30. Qd7+ Kf6 31. Qd4+ Kf7 ({Naturally not} 31... Kf5 32. Qe4+ Kg4
$4 33. Qxg6+ Kxh4 34. Qxh6+ Kg4 35. Qg5#) 1/2-1/2

