{30' each game} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. Be3 Nd7 5. Qd2 e6 6. O-O-O b6
7. f4 Bb7 8. Nf3 Ne7 9. Bd3 c5 {This is not a good opening to play in a
quickplay as Black must consider so many options. Certainly 9......c5 is not
good.} (9... O-O $142) 10. dxc5 dxc5 {Clearly wrong. I played this immediately.
} (10... Nxc5 11. Bb5+ Kf8 12. Bxc5 bxc5) 11. Bb5 Bc6 $2 {This simply loses.} (
11... Nc6 $142 12. Qd6 Rc8 13. Ng5 a6 14. Nxf7 Kxf7 15. Qxd7+ Qe7) 12. e5 $2 ({
Correct is} 12. Bxc6 Nxc6 13. Nb5 h6 14. Nd6+ Kf8 15. Nb7 Qf6 16. e5) 12... Qc7
13. Ng5 Rd8 14. Qd6 {I felt that I was completely lost.} Qc8 $2 ({Correct is} 
14... Qxd6 15. exd6 Nd5 16. Bxc6 Nxe3 17. Rd3 Nf5 18. Re1 Nd4 19. Bb5 O-O) 15.
Rd2 a6 16. Bxc6 Qxc6 17. Qxc6 Nxc6 18. Rhd1 Ke7 $2 {This finally loses it.} (
18... Ndb8 $142) 19. Nxf7 Kxf7 20. Rxd7+ Rxd7 21. Rxd7+ Ne7 {One carries on 
(at speed) in a quickplay.} 22. Ne4 Rb8 23. Ng5+ Ke8 24. Ra7 Bh6 25. Nxe6 a5
26. g4 Bf8 27. c4 h5 28. gxh5 gxh5 29. Kd2 Bh6 30. Kd3 Rc8 31. Ke4 Rc6 32. Ra8+
Kd7 33. Nf8+ Kc7 34. Re8 Bxf8 35. Rxf8 Rg6 36. Rf7 Kd8 37. f5 Rg4+ 38. Bf4 Rg2
39. e6 Ke8 40. Bd6 Rg4+ 41. Kf3 1-0

