{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5
7. d5 e6 8. Be2 exd5 9. exd5 Re8 10. O-O Nbd7 11. Bd3 Nb6 12. h3 Bd7 13. a4 Nc8
14. Kh2 Ne7 15. g4 h5 (15... a6 $142) (15... Qc7 $142) 16. g5 Nh7 17. Nh4 Qc8
18. Qf3 {(0.04) I spent a while considering 18.Ne4} (18. Ne4 {I was unclear
about} Bxh3 19. Nxd6 Qd7 20. Nxe8 Bxf1 21. Qxf1 Rxe8 {(0.44)}) 18... Nf5 19.
Nxf5 Bxf5 20. Bd2 Qd7 21. b3 $5 {I wasn't too confident about this.} ({I was
concerned about} 21. Rae1 Rxe1 22. Rxe1 Bxc3 23. Bxc3 Qxa4 {However, I missed
a crucial line.}) 21... Re7 {He misses it as well.} (21... Bxh3 $142 22. Qxh3
Qxh3+ 23. Kxh3 Bxc3 24. Bxc3 Re3+) 22. Rae1 Rae8 23. Rxe7 Rxe7 24. Re1 Rxe1 25.
Bxe1 Qe7 {He offered a draw here. I felt his Knight was so poor I might have
chances.[Fritz 0.36]} 26. Bd2 Bxd3 27. Qxd3 a6 28. Qe4 Kf8 ({If} 28... Qxe4 29.
Nxe4 Bf8 30. Ba5 Z0 31. Bc7) 29. Qxe7+ Kxe7 30. Ne2 Nf8 (30... f5 {Fritz}) 31.
Bc3 Bxc3 32. Nxc3 f5 33. gxf6+ {I felt that I had to play this if I was going
to win.} Kxf6 34. Ne4+ Ke7 35. Kg3 Nd7 {Now it starts to go wrong for Black.} (
35... Nh7 $142) 36. Kh4 Nf6 37. Ng3 Kf7 38. f5 Kg7 {Now it's lost as he has
two weak Pawns to defend.} 39. Kg5 {A false start} Nh7+ 40. Kh4 {Now I saw
what to do.} Nf6 41. fxg6 Kxg6 42. a5 {Zugzwang! 1-0} (42. a5 {1-0 The best
that Fritz can come up with at the end is} Ne8 43. Nxh5 Kf5 44. Kg3 Kg5 45. Nf4
Nf6 46. Ne6+ Kf5 47. Kf3 Nd7 48. Nd8 b6 49. Nf7 bxa5 50. Nxd6+ Ke5 51. Ne4 a4
52. bxa4 Nb6 53. h4 Nxa4 54. h5 Kf5 55. d6 Nb6 56. h6 Kg6 57. h7 Kxh7 58. Nf6+
Kg6 59. d7 {(7.62)}) 1-0

