{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 d5 4. Bg2 dxc4 5. Qa4+ Bd7 6. Qxc4
Bc6 7. Nf3 Nbd7 8. Bg5 {The advantage of 8.Bg5 in the catalan is one can't
answer 8......h6 with 9.Bh4. However I was playing quickly.} (8. Nc3 $142) (8.
O-O $142) 8... h6 9. Bxf6 Nxf6 10. O-O Bd6 11. Nc3 O-O 12. Rfd1 (12. Rad1 {
Fritz}) 12... Qe7 {I entered this game under the impression that we were
playing a quickplay (30' each/game) match. I had only taken a couple of
minutes so far SJT had taken 20' and now wandered off. I now started to wonder
if it was a normal game so I checked the score sheets of adjacent players.
They said "Lansil Cup" so I realised that I had got it wrong, and slowed up.}
13. a3 a5 14. Rac1 Rfd8 15. Re1 {Threatening e4.} Ne4 16. Nb5 Ng5 17. Nxg5 Bxb5
18. Qxb5 {The Trophy was shared after this replay ended in a tie.} (18. Qxb5 {
0.12/0 Drawn} c6 19. Qd3 hxg5 20. h3 a4 21. Be4 f5 22. Bg2 Ra5) 1/2-1/2

