{1hr 45' each all moves} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 d6 3. Nc3 g6 4. e4 Bg7 5. f4 c5 6. d5
O-O 7. Nf3 b5 8. cxb5 a6 9. bxa6 (9. Bd2 Nbd7 10. bxa6 {Fritz}) 9... Bxa6 10.
Bxa6 Nxa6 11. O-O Qb6 12. Kh1 Nd7 13. Nd2 ({Fritz prefers} 13. a4) ({or} 13.
Qe2) 13... Rfb8 14. Rf3 Nc7 15. Rb1 ({Fritz prefers} 15. b3) 15... Nb5 16. Nxb5
Qxb5 17. Rb3 Qa6 18. Rxb8+ ({Fritz prefers} 18. Ra3) 18... Rxb8 19. a3 Qd3 20.
Qf1 Qe3 21. Qf3 Qd4 22. b3 c4 23. Nxc4 $2 {Foolish, especially as I had
considered his reply, then forgot about it!} (23. bxc4 Rxb1 24. Nxb1 Qxc4)
23... Qxc4 24. h4 $2 {I assumed that I was lost and just pushed out another
move. However I should not have resigned.} (24. bxc4 Rxb1 25. Qe3 Bb2 26. g3
Bxc1 27. Qe1 Nc5 28. e5 Ra1 29. exd6 exd6 30. Kg2 Ra2+ 31. Kh3 Bxa3 32. Qe8+
Kg7 33. Qb8 Bb2 34. Qxd6 {-0.50/0}) 24... Qc2 0-1

