{1hr 45' each all moves} 1. e4 e5 2. Bc4 {2nd time today!} Bc5 ({Not} 2... Nf6
{after this morning}) 3. Nf3 Nc6 4. O-O Nf6 5. d3 h6 6. c3 Be7 {Unnecessarily
conservative} (6... d6 {is OK}) 7. b4 d6 8. h3 O-O 9. Be3 Kh8 10. Re1 Nh7 11.
Nbd2 Ng5 12. Nxg5 Bxg5 13. Nf3 Bxe3 14. Rxe3 f5 15. exf5 Bxf5 16. Bd5 Qf6 17.
Qd2 Nd8 (17... Be6 $142) (17... a5 $142) 18. d4 exd4 (18... c6 $142) (18... e4
$142) 19. Nxd4 c6 $2 {Today was a bad day. This simply loses.} ({Correct is} 
19... Nc6 20. Nxc6 bxc6 21. Bxc6 Rad8) 20. Nxf5 Qxf5 $2 ({I must have been
asleep. The only hope is} 20... cxd5) 21. Rf3 1-0

[Event "Cumbria Open"]
[Site "Grange-Over-Sands"]
