{35 moves in 1hr 45' then15' allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5.
f4 O-O 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. Be2 Nbd7 8. O-O Bxf3 9. Bxf3 e5 10. fxe5 dxe5 11. d5 Ne8 (
{Fritz prefers} 11... Qe7) ({or} 11... a5) 12. Bg4 {To prevent 12......f5} (12.
Be3 $142 {then if} f5 13. c5 f4 14. Bf2) 12... a5 13. b3 Nc5 14. Ba3 b6 15. Qd2
{This is Fritz's 2nd best move} (15. Na4 $142) 15... Nd6 16. Bxc5 bxc5 17. Rae1
{Playing it carefully (I was also playing with a heavy cold and I was
concerned that I wasn't thinking clearly.} Qe7 ({Fritz prefers} 17... f5 18.
Bh3 Qh4 19. Qf2 Qxf2+) 18. Bh3 {Again playing safely.} Kh8 19. Qe3 f5 ({
Better is} 19... Nb7 $142 {but it looks passive and Black tries for some play})
20. Qxc5 f4 21. Nb5 Qh4 $2 {This loses it. Black tries to work up an attack
based on ......f3} ({Correct is} 21... Rf7 22. Be6 Nxb5 23. Qc6 Rff8 24. cxb5)
22. Nxc7 Rac8 ({He is lost anyway but better is} 22... Nb7 23. Qb6 Rab8 24. Na6
) 23. Bxc8 Rxc8 24. Qxd6 f3 25. Qd7 Rf8 26. g3 Qf6 27. Rf2 Rf7 28. Qc8+ Rf8 29.
Qa6 {The Match was played at Bradford City F.C.} 1-0

