{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Bxc6 dxc6 5. O-O Bg4 6. h3
h5 7. d3 Bc5 $5 {A bit risky} 8. Be3 ({If} 8. hxg4 hxg4 9. Ng5 ({However White
plays} 9. Bg5 f6 10. Nxe5 Qd6 11. Qxg4 fxg5 $16)) 8... Bxf3 9. Qxf3 Qe7 10. Nd2
Bxe3 11. Qxe3 Nf6 12. Nc4 Nd7 13. f4 b6 14. a4 f6 15. fxe5 fxe5 16. a5 b5 17.
Nd2 O-O-O {Again a bit risky.} 18. Rf5 (18. Qa7 $142 Qc5+ 19. Qxc5 Nxc5 20. Rf5
$16) 18... Kb7 19. Raf1 Rdf8 20. d4 g6 21. Rxf8 Rxf8 22. Rxf8 Qxf8 (22... Nxf8
{Fritz}) 23. dxe5 Nxe5 24. Nb3 {A bit awkward now with Nc5+ coming} Nc4 25.
Nc5+ Ka8 26. Qd4 Qf4 {I wanted to keep Queens on so rejected 26......Qd6} 27.
Nd3 ({Fritz prefers} 27. Nxa6 Nxa5 28. b3 Nb7 29. Qa1 Nd8 30. b4) 27... Qg5 28.
b4 ({Correct is} 28. e5 Kb7 29. e6 Ne3 30. Qe4 Nf5 31. b4) 28... Ne3 29. Ne1
Qg3 30. Qd2 Nc4 31. Qf2 Qc3 (31... Qxf2+ 32. Kxf2 c5 33. bxc5 Kb7 34. Nd3 Kc6
35. Kg3 Nxa5 $11) 32. Nd3 (32. Nd3 Nd2 {Draw agreed. However} 33. Kh2 Qxc2 34.
Qf8+ Ka7 35. Qd8 Nf1+ 36. Kg1 Nd2 37. Qxc7+ Ka8 38. Qd8+ Ka7 39. Qe7+ Kb8 40.
Nc5 $18 h4) 32... Nd2 {With both of us down to minutes he offered a draw which
I accepted.} 1/2-1/2

