{2hr each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7.
d5 e6 8. Be2 exd5 9. exd5 Na6 10. O-O Nc7 11. a4 $2 {This is wrong as it gives
him b4 for the Knight.} (11. Bd3 $142) (11. Qb3 $142) 11... Na6 12. Bd2 Re8 13.
Re1 (13. Rc1 $142) 13... Nb4 14. Na2 (14. Qb3 $142) (14. Bf1 $142) 14... a5 15.
Nxb4 axb4 16. Bd3 Bd7 17. Ra2 {I wasn't happy here.} (17. Qc2 $142) 17... Qb6
18. Kf1 ({If} 18. b3 {as I had intended} Nxd5) ({If} 18. Bc2 Nxd5 19. cxd5 c4+
20. Kh1 b3) 18... Rxe1+ 19. Bxe1 Ng4 20. Qb1 (20. Bd2 $142) 20... Rxa4 21. Rxa4
Bxa4 22. b3 ({Fritz prefers} 22. Qa2 Qa6 23. b3) 22... Bd7 23. Qc1 Qd8 24. h3
Nf6 25. g4 Qe8 26. f5 Ne4 27. fxg6 hxg6 28. Qf4 f5 29. gxf5 Bxf5 30. Ng5 {Risky
} (30. Kg2 $142) 30... Bh6 31. h4 $2 {Missing his reply} Bh3+ 32. Kg1 Nxg5 33.
hxg5 Qxe1+ 34. Kh2 Bg7 35. Kxh3 Be5 {We were both short of time now and moving
quickly.} 36. Qf3 Kg7 {This is 0.00! but I have to see the reply. Unlikely now
that we were moving at speed.} 37. Bf1 $2 (37. Bxg6 $1 Kxg6 38. Qe4+ {is a
draw!}) 37... Qd2 38. Kg4 Qh2 39. Bh3 Qd2 {very quick stuff now.} 40. Bf1 Qd4+
41. Kh3 Qg1 42. Qg2 Qe3+ 43. Kg4 Qxb3 44. Be2 Qe3 45. Bf3 b3 46. Qh1 b2 47. Be4
Qf4+ 48. Kh3 Qg3# 0-1

