32. h4 Qb2 33. Qa4 Re2 34. Rf4 {Desperation now.} Rxf2+ 35. Kh3 Qa1 36. Qe8+
Kg7 37. Rxf6 {A last forlorn hope that he might simply take the Rook with the
King.} Qxf6 0-1

