Rb1 Re8 13. Re1 {[4']} h6 {[25']} 14. Bf4 e5 {[34'] Overambitious} (14... Bb7
$142) 15. dxe6 fxe6 (15... Rxe6 $142 16. Bc4 Ne5 17. Bxe6 Bxe6) 16. Bc4 (16.
Bxd6 $142 Qxd6 17. e5 Qc7 18. exf6 Nxf6 19. Bxg6) 16... Ne5 17. Nxe5 dxe5 18.
Be3 Bb7 19. f3 Kh7 20. Qe2 {[14']} Rad8 {Giving up the a-Pawn in the hope of
gaining control of the d-file.} 21. Bxa6 Bxa6 22. Qxa6 Rd6 23. Nb5 {He looked
at this and immediately realised that 23......Rxa6 24.Nxc7 forks the Rooks and
resigned. However he could have battled on with 23......Qc6} (23. Qc4 $142 {
However, 23.Nb5 forces the Queens off which makes it easier for White.}) 1-0

