{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. cxd5 Nxd5 5. e4 Nxc3 6.
bxc3 c5 7. Be3 Bg7 8. Rb1 O-O 9. Nf3 b6 (9... Nc6 $142) (9... Qa5) (9... cxd4)
10. Bd3 (10. Bc4 $142) 10... cxd4 11. cxd4 Nc6 12. Qa4 Bb7 13. O-O Ne5 {
I was thinking about this when he played it.} (13... Nxd4 $142 14. Nxd4 e5 15.
Rb4 exd4 16. Bxd4 Qe7) 14. Nxe5 Bxe5 15. Rfd1 Bf6 16. Rbc1 a6 17. f3 e6 18. Rc2
b5 19. Qb4 Be7 20. Qb2 Bf6 ({With ideas of} 20... Z0 21. Bh6 Re8 22. d5 Bf6 23.
e5) 21. a4 Rb8 22. axb5 axb5 23. Be2 (23. Rc5 $142 b4 24. Rb5) 23... Qb6 24.
Qb3 Qd8 {Black was using up a lot of time} 25. Qd3 Qd7 {Loses a Pawn} (25... b4
$142) 26. Bf4 Rbc8 {More or less forced but he spent ages on this.} 27. Rxc8
Rxc8 28. e5 Be7 29. Qxb5 Qxb5 30. Bxb5 {This is probably drawn but he was
short of time so I hoped for a mistake.} Kg7 31. Bd3 ({Fritz prefers} 31. Rc1
$1 {I felt that I couldn't win a double Bishop endgame.}) 31... Bd5 32. Be4
Bxe4 33. fxe4 Rd8 34. d5 exd5 35. exd5 g5 36. Bc1 (36. Be3 $142) 36... Rc8 37.
d6 Bd8 38. Kf2 Kg6 39. Be3 (39. Ke3 $142) 39... Kf5 40. Bd4 Rc2+ {He offered a
draw here.} 41. Kg3 h5 42. h3 Rc4 43. Rf1+ {I was playing too quickly here as
he was now very short of time.} (43. Kf3 $142) 43... Ke6 44. Ba1 Bb6 $2 {
Now, short of time and moving fast, he makes the mistake (Removing the cover
of f6)} (44... h4+ $142) (44... g4 $142) 45. Rf6+ Kd7 ({If} 45... Kd5 46. d7
h4+ 47. Kf3 Rf4+ 48. Rxf4 gxf4 $18) 46. Rxf7+ Ke8 $2 {Ending it very quickly} (
46... Kc6 47. Rf8 $16) 47. e6 h4+ 48. Kf3 Rf4+ 49. Rxf4 gxf4 50. Kxf4 Bc5 51.
Be5 Kd8 52. Bf6+ Kc8 53. d7+ Kb7 54. d8=Q 1-0

