{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 d5 {He plays this all the time. It is the
3rd time against me.} 3. cxd5 Qxd5 4. Nc3 Qd8 5. e4 Nc6 $2 {5 Pretty much
losing the game on move} (5... e5 $142) 6. d5 Ne5 7. f4 Bg4 {Not good.} 8. Qa4+
Bd7 9. Qb3 Ng6 10. f5 Ne5 11. Bf4 Neg4 12. Nb5 Bxb5 13. Bxb5+ Nd7 14. Bxd7+ {
I was keeping it simple.} ({Fritz prefers} 14. Rc1 Rc8 15. Nf3 a6 16. Bxd7+
Qxd7 17. Qxb7) 14... Qxd7 15. Qxb7 Rc8 16. Rc1 Kd8 17. Nf3 f6 18. h3 ({No doubt
} 18. Qxa7 {wins but active play must be better}) 18... g5 19. Bg3 {There were
so many options.} (19. Rxc7) (19. Bxc7+) (19. Bxg5) (19. hxg4) 19... Ne3 20.
Kf2 Bh6 21. Nd4 g4 22. Ne6+ (22. Rxc7 $142 Rxc7 23. Bxc7+ Ke8 24. Qb8+ Kf7 25.
Qxh8 {I was keeping it simple.}) 22... Ke8 23. Bf4 Bxf4 24. Nxf4 Nxf5 25. exf5
gxh3 26. Qc6 {Still playing solid simple stuff.} (26. Rxh3 $142 Qxf5 27. Qc6+
Kf8 28. Qc4) 26... Qxc6 27. Rxc6 Kd7 28. Ne6 Rhg8 29. Kf3 Rh8 30. Rhc1 h5 31.
Rxc7+ 1-0

