{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Bc4 Nf6 5. e5 d5 6. Bb5
Ne4 7. Nxd4 Bd7 8. Bxc6 Bxc6 9. O-O Qd7 10. c3 Be7 11. Be3 Bb5 12. Re1 Ba6 13.
f3 Nc5 14. f4 Nd3 15. Re2 Qg4 (15... g5 {Fritz}) 16. Qa4+ Kf8 {After much
thought.} (16... c6 17. h3 Qg6) ({I had briefly looked at} 16... c6 {but
ignoreded it because of} 17. Nxc6 Qxe2 (17... Qd7 $142) 18. Nd4+) 17. h3 Qh5
18. Rd2 Nc5 19. Qc2 Qg6 (19... c6 $142) (19... Ne4 $142) 20. f5 Qh5 21. Rd1 Ne4
22. Nd2 Ng3 {is risky. I became overoptimistic here.} (22... c5 $142) 23. Kh2
Bh4 $2 {Going off the rails.} (23... Bh4 $2 {What I'd missed was that} 24. Bf4
{can't be answered by} Ne2 {as} 25. g4 {wins the Queen.}) 24. Bf4 c5 25. Bxg3
Bxg3+ 26. Kxg3 cxd4 {Short of time with my King bdly placed, I was suere that
there was little hope now.} 27. cxd4 Qg5+ 28. Kh2 Qf4+ 29. Kh1 Qxd4 30. Nf3 Qe4
31. Qc5+ Kg8 32. Qxd5 Qxd5 33. Rxd5 h6 34. Rd7 Rc8 (34... Kh7) 35. Nd4 Kf8 36.
e6 fxe6 37. Nxe6+ Ke8 38. Rad1 Rg8 39. Nxg7+ Kf8 40. Ne6+ Ke8 41. f6 0-1

