{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 Qe7 5. Bg2 Nc6 6. e3
O-O 7. Ne2 Bxd2+ 8. Nxd2 d6 9. O-O e5 {[3']} 10. d5 Nb8 11. Nc3 a5 {he clearly
knew the opening} 12. a3 Na6 {[7']} 13. Qc2 ({Fritz prefers} 13. b4 Bf5 14. e4)
13... Bd7 14. Rfb1 {I wasn't sure about this and after playing it wishe I had
played the other Rook to b1.} Rfc8 15. Qd1 ({Fritz prefers} 15. Ra2 Z0 16. b4 {
I had considered this.}) 15... c6 (15... Bf5 {fritz}) (15... Bg4 {Fritz}) 16.
dxc6 ({I spent some time considering} 16. Na4 {but could not see a good
continuation after} Qd8) 16... Bxc6 17. Bxc6 ({Fritz suggests} 17. Bh3 Rd8 18.
b4) 17... bxc6 18. e4 ({Fritz has a slight preference for} 18. b4 axb4 19. axb4
d5 20. b5) 18... Qb7 19. b3 d5 20. cxd5 ({Fritz prefers} 20. exd5 cxd5 21. Qf3)
20... cxd5 21. Nxd5 Nxd5 22. exd5 Qxd5 {He offered a draw and being 30' down I
accepted. Possibly this was a hasty decision.} (22... Qxd5 {However, after} 23.
Nc4 Qe6 24. Nxa5 Nc5 25. b4 Rd8 26. Qe2 Nd3 27. Nc6 Rd6 28. b5 e4 {White must
have good chances.}) 1/2-1/2

