{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. g3 Bc5 5. Bg2 O-O 6. O-O
d6 7. h3 a6 8. d3 h6 9. Kh2 Be6 10. Qe2 Re8 11. Nd1 d5 {I was feeling unwell
and had walked to the grammar school through snow and ice in sub-zero
temperatures (abour a 30' walk). The School gates were all locked and I had to
climb in (and out). The temperature was dropping and I faced the walk back. I
didn't really feel like playing. After 11 moves I noticed that we had already
won on Bd4 and had a solid position on Bd2 & Bd3. Nick I suspected would be
happy with a draw so I offered one which he accepted.} 1/2-1/2

