{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 d6 5. h3 Bd7 6. c3 Nf6
7. Bc2 g6 8. O-O Bg7 9. Re1 O-O 10. d4 h6 11. Nbd2 exd4 12. cxd4 Re8 13. Nf1 b5
{Trying for play on the QS.} 14. Ng3 Nb4 15. Bb3 c5 16. dxc5 dxc5 17. a3 Nc6
18. Rb1 (18. e5 $142) 18... Qc7 19. Bc2 Rad8 20. Qe2 Nd5 (20... Be6 $142) 21.
Qf1 Nf4 22. Bxf4 (22. Ne2 $142) 22... Qxf4 23. Ne2 Qf6 24. Nc3 Ne5 $2 {I was
overly worried about Nd5} ({Correct is} 24... Bxh3 25. Nd5 Qxf3) 25. Nxe5 Qxe5
26. Re3 (26. f4 $142) 26... h5 {A nothing move.} (26... Be6 $142) 27. f4 Qe6 (
27... Qd4 $142 {then if} 28. Qf2 $2 Qxe3 $1) 28. Kh1 Bd4 29. Rg3 Bc6 {I spent
ages on this. f5 is coming and I couldn't find a good move.} (29... Kf8 $142)
30. Re1 (30. f5 $142 Qf6 31. fxg6) 30... b4 31. axb4 cxb4 32. Nd1 Bb5 33. Qf3
Rf8 $2 {Again after a lot of thought, leaving myself short of time.} (33... Qc6
$142) (33... Kf8 $142) 34. Qxh5 (34. Bb3 $142) 34... Bg7 {I was having to move
fairly quickly now and felt that I was in trouble.} 35. Qf3 Qc6 36. Bb3 Rd3 37.
Re3 Rxe3 {Moving quickly} (37... Rfd8 $142) 38. Nxe3 Re8 (38... Kh8 $142) 39.
Bd5 Qc1+ {Worried, and short of time, I decided to take my chances with the
Pawn grab.} 40. Kh2 Qxb2 {This should lose.} (40... Kf8 $142) 41. Rxg6 Be2 {
With very little time I just had to find a move.} (41... Kf8 $142) 42. Qg3 Kf8
(42... Bh5 $142) 43. Rc6 (43. e5 {is better but White was getting short of
time.}) 43... Bb5 44. Rc2 (44. Rc7 $142) 44... Qf6 45. Rc7 Re7 46. Rc2 (46. e5
$142) 46... Bh6 $5 {To win the club championship I had to win. I played this
after a few seconds thought.} (46... Bd7 $142) 47. Nf5 Re8 {At this point John,
who talks a lot, commented that he didn't know what to do. I offered a draw,
knowing what was coming, but he played on.} (47... Bd7) 48. Rc7 Re6 {The only
move. I knew I was lost.} 49. Bxe6 fxe6 50. Nxh6 Qxh6 {He was very short of
time but didn't seem to notice.} 51. Qe3 (51. f5 $142) 51... Qf6 {Moving very
fast now.} 52. Qc5+ Kg8 53. Rc8+ Kg7 54. f5 exf5 55. exf5 (55. exf5 b3 {TIME!}
56. Qc7+ Kh6 57. Rg8 Z0 {Threat} 58. Rg6+ {and Black can resign.}) 55... b3 {
He had almost no time left I had 2'. White then lost on time.} 0-1

