{1hr 30' each/game} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 Nc6 3. Bg2 Nf6 4. Nc3 Bc5 5. a3 a5 6. d3 d6
7. e3 O-O 8. Nge2 Ne7 9. O-O c6 10. e4 (10. d4 {Fritz}) 10... Be6 11. Bg5 Ng6
12. Kh1 h6 13. Bxf6 Qxf6 14. f4 {Fritz prefers the alternatives} (14. Qd2) (14.
Na4) (14. Qc1) 14... exf4 15. Nxf4 (15. gxf4 $142 Nh4 16. d4 Bb6 17. Qd3 Nxg2
18. Kxg2 Qg6+ 19. Kh1 f5 20. e5) 15... Qe5 16. Nxg6 (16. Nxe6 {Fritz}) 16...
fxg6 17. Qd2 Bd4 18. Ne2 g5 19. Nxd4 Qxd4 20. Qc3 Rxf1+ 21. Rxf1 Qxc3 22. bxc3
Rf8 23. Rb1 {After playing this I decided that it was a big mistake.} (23. Kg1
$11) (23. Rxf8+ $11) 23... Rf2 (23... Rf7 {Fritz}) 24. Ra1 $2 {After much
thought. I felt that I was in trouble and only briefly considered the correct
line which is............} (24. e5 dxe5 25. Rxb7 Rc2 ({If} 25... Ra2 {then} 26.
Bxc6 Rxa3 27. Re7 Bh3 28. Kg1 Rxc3 29. Rxe5 Rxd3 30. Rxa5) 26. Bxc6) 24... Rc2
25. Bf1 Rxc3 26. Kg1 d5 $2 ({After} 26... Rc2 {White is probably lost.}) 27.
exd5 cxd5 28. Re1 Kf7 29. cxd5 Bxd5 30. Re5 Bc6 31. Rxa5 Rc2 32. Rf5+ Ke6 33.
Rf2 Rxf2 {He offered a draw here.} 34. Kxf2 Ke5 35. Ke3 h5 36. d4+ Kd6 37. Bd3
Be8 38. Bc4 b6 39. Bb3 (39. h4 gxh4 40. gxh4 Ke7 41. Kf4) 39... g6 40. Ke4 Bd7
41. d5 Bf5+ 42. Kd4 g4 43. Bc4 g5 44. Bb5 Bg6 45. Bc6 h4 46. Kc4 Kc7 47. Kb4
Bd3 48. Bb5 Be4 49. Bc4 Bf5 50. Kb5 Bd7+ 51. Ka6 Bc8+ 52. Ka7 Bd7 53. Bb3 hxg3
54. hxg3 b5 55. Ka6 Be8 56. Bd1 Kd6 57. Kb6 Kxd5 58. Be2 Ke4 59. Bxg4 ({If} 59.
Bxb5 Bxb5 60. Kxb5 Kf3 61. a4 Kxg3 62. a5 Kh2 63. a6 g3 64. a7 g2 65. a8=Q g1=Q
$11) 59... Ke3 60. Be6 1/2-1/2

