{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. e3 e6 4. Bd3 Be7 5. O-O h6 6. Ne5
O-O 7. Nd2 c5 8. b3 cxd4 9. exd4 Qc7 10. Bb2 Nc6 11. a3 Bd6 12. f4 b6 13. Qe2
Bb7 14. Ndf3 Nd7 {Black is leaving his KS rather weak.} 15. g3 Ncxe5 16. Nxe5
Nxe5 17. fxe5 Be7 18. Qg4 Qd7 {To protect the c-Pawn allowing ......f5} ({If} 
18... g6 {then} 19. Bxg6 fxg6 20. Qxg6+ Kh8 21. Qxh6+ Kg8 22. Qxe6+ Kh7 23.
Qh3+ Kg7 24. Qg4+) 19. Rae1 $16 {Again preventing ....f5} ({Fritz prefers} 19.
Bc1 f5 20. exf6 Rxf6 21. Rxf6 Bxf6 22. Bxh6 $18) 19... Rae8 (19... g6) 20. Bc1
Kh8 $2 (20... f5 $142) 21. c3 $2 {Unnecessarily conservative} (21. Qh5 $142 f5
22. exf6 Rxf6 23. Rxf6 Bxf6 24. Bxh6 gxh6 25. Qxh6+) 21... a5 $2 {Black can't
find a move but this loses quickly.} (21... Rc8 $142 22. Bd2 Qd8 23. h4 Qc7)
22. Qh5 Bd8 23. Bxh6 (23. Rf6) 23... g6 24. Qh3 f5 (24... Kg8 25. Rf6 Bxf6 26.
exf6) 25. Bxf8+ Kg8 26. Bd6 Be7 27. Bxe7 Rxe7 28. Qh6 Rg7 29. Qg5 Qe8 30. Rf4
Rh7 31. Rh4 Rxh4 32. Qxh4 Qf7 33. g4 Bc8 34. gxf5 exf5 35. Qd8+ {This result
meant that I had won the club championship} 1-0

