Bxc5 11. a3 (11. Ne5) 11... Nxd3 12. cxd3 Qd8 {Not wanting his Bishop to be
pinned. However......} (12... O-O $142) (12... Qb6 $142) 13. b4 Bd6 14. Nb3 $2
{Playing quickly, as it's a quickplay, I regretted this as soon as I had
played it.} b6 ({I had expected.} 14... Ba4) 15. Nfd2 e5 16. g4 {One needs to
