Qe2) 21. g5 hxg5 22. fxg5 Nh7 $2 ({Amazingly there is an equalising move, but
effectively "unfindable" with minutes left.} 22... Re5 $3 23. gxf6 Rg5+ 24. Kf2
Bg3+ 25. Qxg3 Rxg3 26. Kxg3) 23. Qxf7+ Kh8 24. Ne6 {Crunch!} Rxe6 25. Bxg7# 1-0

