bxc4 14. bxc4 Rb8 15. Qc2 (15. Rb1 $142 Qa5 16. Qc1 Qxa2 17. Rf2 {However, I
didn't like this.}) 15... dxc4 16. Bxc4 Nb6 17. Be2 Bxf3 ({Aftewards John
suggested that} 17... Nd5 {would win as} 18. Bc1 Nxf4 $19 {wins}) (17... Nd5
18. Kf2 Qa5 19. Rfd1 cxd4 20. Nxd4 Ba4 21. Qd2 $17) 18. Bxf3 cxd4 19. Rfd1 Qd6
20. Bxd4 Rfc8 21. Qe2 Bxd4 22. Rxd4 Qf6 23. Rad1 (23. Rad1 e5 24. Re4 exf4 25.
exf4 Rd8 26. g3 $11) 1/2-1/2

