{1hr 30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. c3 Nf6 5. d4 exd4 6. cxd4
Bb4+ 7. Nc3 Nxe4 8. O-O Bxc3 9. bxc3 (9. d5 Ne5 10. Qe2 O-O 11. bxc3) 9... d5
10. Bd3 O-O 11. Bxe4 dxe4 12. Ng5 Qd5 13. Qb3 Qxb3 14. axb3 Re8 15. d5 Ne7 16.
c4 Ng6 (16... Nf5 $142 {However I was worried about my c-Pawn. But Black is oK
after} 17. Bf4 f6 18. Nh3 Nd6) 17. Re1 Bf5 18. f3 exf3 19. Nxf3 Rxe1+ 20. Nxe1
Re8 21. Kf2 a6 22. Be3 f6 23. Rd1 Ne5 24. h3 Kf7 25. Bf4 g5 26. Bxe5 Rxe5 27.
d6 (27. Nd3 $142) 27... cxd6 28. Rxd6 (28. g4 $142) 28... Re6 29. Rd7+ Re7 30.
Rd6 Rd7 31. Rb6 Be4 32. Nf3 (32. g4 $142 {so the g-Pawn is no longer a target.}
) 32... Bc6 33. b4 {With his Rook "stuck" he tries to open up the QS.} (33. Ke3
$142) 33... Rd3 34. b5 axb5 35. cxb5 Rb3 36. Nd4 Rb2+ 37. Ke3 Bxg2 38. Rd6 $2 {
He seemed stuck for a move and decides to activate his Rook.} (38. Nf5 $142 h5
39. Nd6+ Kg6 40. Nxb7 Bxh3 41. Nc5 Bf1 42. Ne4) 38... Bxh3 39. Rb6 Bg2 40. Nf5
h5 41. Nd6+ Ke7 42. Nxb7 h4 43. Nc5 h3 44. Ne4 h2 45. Rb7+ Kd8 46. b6 Bxe4 0-1

