{90' each/game} 1. d4 f5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. h3 d6 4. Bf4 g6 5. e3 Bg7 6. Bc4 e6 7.
O-O O-O 8. Nbd2 Kh8 9. c3 Qe7 10. Qb3 Nc6 11. Qc2 e5 12. dxe5 dxe5 13. Bg5 e4
14. Nd4 Ne5 15. b4 {Leaves the c-Pawn weak.} Nxc4 16. Nxc4 c5 17. bxc5 Qxc5 18.
Nd2 Nd5 19. Rfc1 ({Fritz prefers} 19. c4 Nb6 20. Rfc1) 19... b6 20. Rab1 Bd7 {
Best. Covering b5.} 21. N2b3 Qd6 {Fritz prefers 21......Qc7 or 21......Qc4.
However I was considering an eventual f4 push.} 22. Nd2 (22. c4 $142 Rac8 23.
Qd2 Nb4 24. c5 bxc5 25. Bf4) 22... Rac8 23. Qb3 f4 {This works out OK. Fritz
gives............} (23... Rfe8 24. c4 Nc7 25. Rd1 Qc5 26. Qc2 Ne6) 24. Nxe4 Qe5
25. f3 ({Correct is} 25. exf4 Nxf4 ({If} 25... Qxe4 $2 26. Re1 Qd3 27. Qxd5)
26. Bxf4 Qxf4 27. Ng3) 25... Nxe3 26. Nb5 $2 (26. Re1 $142) 26... Be6 (26...
Rf5 $142 27. Nbd6 (27. Qa3 Rxg5 28. Nxg5 Qxg5 {-4.09/0}) 27... Be6 28. Nxf5
Bxb3 29. Nxg7 Rc6 {-2.01/0}) 27. Qa3 Nc4 (27... h6 28. Be7 Rf7 29. Bd6 Qd5 30.
Qb3 Qf5) 28. Qe7 $2 ({Not keen on} 28. Qxa7 {in view of} Ra8 $2 29. Qc7 Rxa2
30. Qxe5 Bxe5 31. Ra1 {but it's better}) 28... Rf7 29. Qb4 Bf8 30. Qa4 Bf5 {
Threatening 31......Bxe4} 31. Bf6+ $2 {Short of time now this is -3.57.} ({
I had expected} 31. Bh4 Bxe4 32. fxe4 Bc5+ 33. Kh1) 31... Rxf6 32. Nxf6 Bxb1
33. Rxb1 {He had almost no time left but 33.Qxa7 (threatening mate!) was worth
a try.} Qxf6 34. Qxa7 {Rushing now he keeps going for a few moves.} Bc5+ 35.
Kh1 Ne3 36. a4 Qf5 37. Nd4 {Missing the threat in the time rush.} Qxb1+ 38. Kh2
Nf1+ 0-1

