{90' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. e3 e6 4. Bd3 c5 5. b3 Nc6 6. O-O cxd4 7.
exd4 Be7 8. Bb2 (8. Ba3 {Fritz}) 8... O-O 9. a3 b6 10. Nbd2 Bb7 11. Qe2 Rc8 12.
Ng5 {Fritz prefers 12.Rac1, c4, Ne5} h6 13. Nh3 Qc7 14. f4 Bd6 15. g3 ({
I considered} 15. Nf3 {but it was unclear. However} Bxf4 16. Nxf4 Qxf4 17. Ne5
Qg5 18. Nxc6 Rxc6 19. Rac1 Qh4 20. Rf4 Qh5 21. Qxh5 Nxh5 22. Rf3 {-0.02/0 is})
15... Ne7 16. Nf3 {Equal best with 16.Nf2 and 16.Rfe1. However the text lets
his Knight into e4.} ({I would play} 16. Nf2 {now.}) 16... Ne4 17. Nf2 f5 18.
Rac1 Ng6 19. c4 {Fritz likes 19.Nd1-e3} Qe7 20. a4 Rc7 21. Rfd1 {Doesn't
achieve much.} Rfc8 22. Qe1 Bb4 23. Qe2 Ba6 24. cxd5 Bxd3 25. Qxd3 (25. Nxd3
exd5 26. Rxc7 Rxc7 27. Nfe5 Nxe5 28. fxe5 {0.00/0}) 25... exd5 26. Rxc7 ({
When playing 24.cxd5 I had intended} 26. Qb5 {here. I now realised it loses a
piece to} Nxf2 27. Kxf2 (27. Re1 Bxe1 28. Rxe1 Nh3+) (27. Rf1 Nh3+ 28. Kg2 Rc2+
) 27... Rc2+ 28. Rxc2 Rxc2+ 29. Nd2 Bxd2) 26... Rxc7 1/2-1/2

