Nc3 Na6 8. a3 Nc7 9. Qc2 d6 10. b4 Rb8 (10... Be6 11. Qb3 b5 {Fritz}) 11. a4 b6
12. e4 Nxe4 13. Nxe4 fxe4 14. Qxe4 Bf5 (14... c5 $142) 15. Qh4 (15. Qxc6 $142 {
He clearly thought this risky in a Quickplay.}) 15... e6 (15... c5) 16. Bg5 Qd7
17. Rfe1 Bd3 18. Rac1 b5 (18... d5 $142 {However, I was already short of time
and starting to move quickly.}) 19. axb5 cxb5 20. c5 dxc5 21. dxc5 Be4 {
Best, but I was now having to move fast.} 22. Rcd1 Bd5 (22... Nd5 $142) 23. Bf4
Rbc8 24. Bh3 Bf6 {All my moves now had to be very fast.} 25. Ng5 Qe7 (25... Qg7
$142) 26. Rxd5 {Crunch!} Nxd5 27. Rxe6 ({Correct is} 27. Bxe6+) 27... Bxg5 28.
Bxg5 Qf7 29. Re2 $2 {This would lose if I had more time.} ({Correct is.} 29.
Qd4) 29... Rce8 30. Qg4 Rxe2 ({Moving quickly I miss} 30... Nc3) 31. Qxe2 Re8 {
I now couldn't keep score and lost on time a few moves later. I simply used up
too much time early in the game.} 1-0

