{2hr each/game.} 1. d4 c6 2. c4 f6 3. Nc3 e5 4. Nf3 Bb4 5. Qb3 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 d6
7. e4 c5 {[14']} 8. Be2 {[22']} Ne7 {[21']} 9. Be3 b6 10. Nd2 O-O 11. f4 (11.
O-O {Fritz}) 11... exf4 12. Bxf4 Nbc6 13. Be3 Kh8 {[56']} 14. O-O Ng6 15. Rad1
(15. Bd3 $142) 15... Bd7 16. Qb1 Qc7 17. Bh5 Nce7 18. Rf2 a6 19. Nb3 Rfd8 20.
Bf3 Rab8 21. Be2 Be6 22. Rc1 Rf8 23. Nd2 b5 24. cxb5 axb5 25. dxc5 ({I
considered} 25. Bxb5 Bxa2 26. Qxa2 Rxb5 27. Nc4) 25... dxc5 26. Nb3 Bxb3 27.
axb3 Rfd8 28. Bf1 (28. Rd1 $142) (28. Rff1 $142) 28... Ne5 29. h3 Qc6 {After
much thought.} 30. Rd1 h6 31. Rfd2 Rxd2 32. Rxd2 c4 33. b4 Ra8 34. Bd4 N7g6 35.
Be2 {I was getting short of time now.} Ra3 36. g3 Qa8 37. Qc2 Nc6 38. Kg2 {
Short of time I was having to find "safe" moves.} (38. Bf2 $142) 38... Nge5 39.
Bf2 Ra1 40. Bf1 $2 {A serious mistake.} Qa3 41. Be3 Kh7 42. Rf2 $2 {Now it is
compleyely lost. In the rush I overlooked the threat.} Nxb4 43. cxb4 Qxe3 44.
Be2 {With almost no time left I thrash out a few more moves.} Ra3 45. Bf3 Nxf3
46. e5+ Rd3 47. Qb2 fxe5 0-1

