{2hr each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O b5 6. Bb3 Be7
7. Re1 O-O 8. h3 d6 9. c3 Na5 10. Bc2 c5 11. d4 Qc7 12. d5 Nc4 (12... Bd7 {
is more usual}) 13. a4 Bb7 (13... Bd7 $142) 14. Bd3 Rfb8 15. Bxc4 bxc4 16. Na3
a5 17. Nxc4 Ba6 18. Ne3 g6 $2 ({There is no reason not to play} 18... Nxe4) 19.
Nf1 Bf8 20. Ng3 Bg7 21. Nh2 Bc4 22. Ra3 Ra7 23. Ngf1 Ba6 24. b3 c4 25. bxc4
Bxc4 26. Nd2 Ba6 27. Rb3 Rab7 28. Rxb7 Rxb7 29. Qc2 Nd7 30. Ba3 Nc5 31. c4 Nd7
32. Ng4 Bf8 33. Rc1 Kg7 (33... h5 $142) 34. Qc3 Nc5 35. Bxc5 Qxc5 36. Nb3 Qb4
37. Nxa5 Qxc3 38. Rxc3 Rb4 39. Ra3 Bxc4 $2 {Losing. After this I can't easily
stop the a-Pawn.} ({Correct is} 39... Rb1+ 40. Kh2 f5) 40. Nxc4 Rxc4 41. a5
Rc1+ 42. Kh2 Rc7 43. a6 Ra7 {I felt that it was all over now, but surprisingly
I get some play.} 44. Ne3 Be7 45. Nc4 Kf6 46. Ra4 Kg5 47. Na3 f5 48. f3 fxe4
49. fxe4 Kf4 50. Nb5 Ra8 51. a7 Bd8 52. Nxd6 Bb6 53. g3+ Kf3 54. Ra3+ Ke2 55.
Nb5 Bc5 56. Nc7 Rxa7 57. Rxa7 Bxa7 58. d6 Bb6 59. Ne6 Ke3 60. d7 Kxe4 61. Kg2
Kd3 62. d8=Q+ Bxd8 63. Nxd8 e4 64. Ne6 e3 65. Nf4+ Ke4 66. Ne2 h5 67. Nc3+ Kd3
68. Kf3 Kd2 69. h4 Kd3 70. Ne2 Kd2 71. Nf4 1-0

