7. Nxd5 Qxd5 8. Bxc7 Na6 9. Bxa6 bxa6 {I have not met this before.} (9... Qxg2)
10. f3 (10. Nf3 $142) 10... Qb7 11. Rc1 Qxb2 12. Qd2 Qb5 (12... Qb7 $142) 13.
Ne2 Be6 14. O-O (14. Kf2 {Fritz}) 14... Bc4 15. Rfe1 Rac8 16. Bg3 Bxe2 17. Rxc8
