Kf2 e5 (20... Bf6 {Fritz}) 21. Qa5 ({If I had been desperate to win I might
have tried.} 21. d5 Bf6 22. Qb4 Qf5 23. e4 Qc8 24. d6 {However, I want to play
solidly after 2 losses.}) 21... Qb6 22. dxe5 1/2-1/2

