Rxe6 {but then thought that} fxe6 17. Qxe6+ Kh8 18. Qxf5 Bxb2 {is OK}) (15...
g6 $142) (15... Kh8 $142) 16. Rxe6 fxe6 17. Qxf5 {The move I overlooked in
calculating the above variation.} Kh8 {Now it is just lost. I hang on for some
time.} 18. Qxe6 Qb6 19. Rb1 Rac8 20. Be3 Qb4 21. Bb3 Rfe8 22. Qd5 a6 23. h3 a5
24. Bd2 Qc5 25. Qxc5 Rxc5 26. Be3 Rcc8 27. Ng5 Bxg5 28. Bxg5 b5 29. Be3 a4 30.
