{90' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 dxc4 3. e4 e5 4. d5 Nf6 5. Nc3 Bd6 6. Bxc4 a6 7.
a3 O-O 8. Nge2 Nbd7 9. O-O Nc5 {The Knight will be hit by b4. Better 9......
Nb6 or 9.......h6} 10. Qc2 b5 11. Ba2 Bd7 12. b4 Nb7 13. Bg5 Be7 14. f4 h6 15.
Bxf6 ({I didn't play} 15. Bh4 {because of} exf4 16. Nxf4 g5) 15... Bxf6 16. f5
{To limit the scope of his d7 Bishop} Nd6 {[19']} 17. Nc1 {[13']} Bg5 18. Qe2
Bxc1 (18... Qb8 {Fritz}) 19. Raxc1 Qf6 {Leaves the Queen out of play.} (19...
a5 $142) 20. Qe3 Rac8 21. Rfd1 Nc4 22. Bxc4 bxc4 23. d6 (23. Rd2 Rfd8 24. Qc5
Qb6 25. Nd1) 23... Bc6 (23... cxd6 24. Nd5 Qd8 25. f6 {1.10/0} (25. Nb6 Rc6 26.
Nxc4 {-0.10/0})) 24. Qc5 ({Correct is} 24. d7 Rcd8 25. Nd5 Qd6 26. Rxc4 Rxd7
27. Nc3 Qf6 28. Rxd7 Bxd7 29. Nd5) 24... cxd6 25. Rxd6 Bb5 {He played this
very quickly} (25... Qg5 $142 26. Re1 ({Not} 26. Rcd1 $4 Ba4) 26... Bb7 27.
Qxe5) 26. Rxf6 Rxc5 27. Rb6 ({I realised immediately I should have played.} 27.
Rd6) ({However, best is} 27. bxc5 gxf6 28. a4 Bc6 29. Nd5 Kg7 30. Rxc4) 27...
Rc6 28. Rb7 Rd6 29. Nxb5 axb5 30. Rxb5 Ra8 31. Rxe5 (31. Ra5 Rxa5 32. bxa5 Ra6
33. Rxc4 Rxa5 34. a4 {1.02/0}) 31... Rxa3 32. Rd5 Rxd5 33. exd5 Rd3 {He played
this immediately} ({I was more concerned about} 33... c3 {then} 34. d6 Kf8 35.
Re1 Ra7 36. b5 Rb7 37. Rc1 Rxb5 38. Rxc3) 34. Rxc4 Rxd5 35. g4 (35. Rc8+ $142
Kh7 36. Rc5 Rd2 37. Rc7 Kg8 38. b5 Rb2 39. Rb7) 35... Kf8 36. Kf2 Ke7 37. Ke3
Kd6 $2 {Ending it quickly} (37... Rd1 $142) 38. Rd4 1-0

