{1hr 30' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 Qe7 5. Bg2 d5 6. e3
O-O 7. c5 (7. Nf3 $142 {I was playing in rather cavalier fashion. Danny is a
new member and is in the C-team. I expected an easy win. However, he proves to
be much better than the c-team.}) 7... Bxd2+ 8. Nxd2 e5 9. dxe5 Qxe5 10. Qc2 {
Still too casual.} (10. Qc1 $142) (10. Qb3 $142) 10... Bf5 11. Qb3 Nbd7 12.
Ngf3 Qe7 13. Nd4 Bg6 {I now realised that I had been too casual and had gone
wrong.} 14. c6 bxc6 15. O-O {I am going gradually downhill.} (15. Nxc6 Qd6 16.
Qc3 Nc5 {seemed bad but I can then play} 17. O-O {since} Qxc6 {is answered by}
18. Rac1) 15... c5 16. Qa3 Rfe8 17. Nb5 Ne5 18. Qa5 Rec8 (18... Rab8 $142 19.
b3 c6) 19. Nc3 c6 20. b3 Rab8 21. Nf3 (21. e4 $142 d4 22. Ne2 Rd8 23. f4 {
but Black has a passed pawn}) 21... Nxf3+ 22. Bxf3 d4 23. Na4 (23. exd4 cxd4
24. Rfe1 Qd8 25. Qxd8+ {is not quite as good}) 23... dxe3 (23... Be4 $142) 24.
Qxc5 exf2+ 25. Qxf2 {I felt happier now.} (25. Rxf2 Re8 26. Bxc6) 25... Qc7 26.
Rac1 Bd3 27. Rfd1 ({I didn't like} 27. Rxc6 Qxc6 28. Bxc6 Bxf1 29. Qxa7) 27...
Bb5 28. Nc3 Ba6 29. Nd5 Nxd5 30. Bxd5 c5 31. Bc4 Bb7 32. Bd5 Rd8 33. Bxb7 Rxd1+
34. Rxd1 Rxb7 35. Rd5 Rb5 36. Qe2 Rb8 37. Qc4 Rc8 38. b4 g6 39. bxc5 (39. Rxc5
Qb6) 39... Re8 40. Qd4 Qe7 41. Qd2 Rc8 42. Qc3 Qe6 43. Qd2 Qe7 1/2-1/2

