5... Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 Nxe4 7. Bb2 (7. Nxe5 d5 $11) 7... exd4 8. cxd4 d5 9. h3 O-O
10. Be2 Re8 11. O-O Re6 12. Ne5 Nxe5 13. dxe5 Qg5 $2 $16 {Unbelieveable!! How
could I play this?} (13... Rg6 $17) 14. Qxd5 Nf6 (14... Rb6 $142) 15. Qd3 Ne8
16. f4 Qe7 17. Rad1 b6 {I was stuck for a move here.} (17... g6 $142) 18. Bf3 (
18. Qf3) 18... Rb8 19. Qd8 Kf8 (19... g6 $142) (19... Qf8) 20. Kh1 (20. f5 $142
) 20... Qxd8 21. Rxd8 Ba6 {5.57/0 I felt better now but this is} (21... f5 $142
) (21... Ke7 $142) 22. Rxb8 Bxf1 23. Be4 (23. f5 $142 Rh6 24. a4 Ke7 25. Bc1
Bc4 26. Bxh6) 23... g6 24. Kh2 Bb5 25. g4 Re7 26. f5 Rd7 27. f6 (27. Bc3 $142)
27... Rd2+ 28. Kg3 Rd1 (28... Re2 $142 29. Kf3 Rh2) 29. c4 Bd7 30. Bc3 Rc1 (
30... Ba4 31. Bb4+ c5) 31. Bd2 (31. Bb4+ $142) 31... Rxc4 $2 {3.3} (31... Rg1+
32. Kh4 Kg8 {2.21/0}) 32. Kf3 $2 (32. Bd5 Rc6 (32... Rc2 33. Bh6+ Kg8 34. e6
Rc3+ (34... fxe6 35. Bxe6+ Bxe6 36. Rxe8+ Kf7 37. Rf8#) 35. Kh4 g5+ 36. Kxg5
fxe6 37. Bxe6+ Bxe6 38. Rxe8+ Kf7 39. Rf8#) 33. Rd8 Rxf6 34. Rxd7 {wins easily}
) 32... Ra4 $2 (32... Rd4 $142) 33. Bc1 (33. Bh6+ $142 Kg8 34. Bd5) 33... Ra5
