{90' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nd4 {The Blackburne-Schilling Gambit
} 4. c3 ({Avoiding} 4. Nxe5 $2 Qg5) 4... Nxf3+ 5. Qxf3 Qf6 6. Qxf6 Nxf6 7. d3
Bc5 8. h3 d6 9. Nd2 Bd7 10. Nf3 a5 (10... b5 $142 11. Bb3 b4) 11. a4 {[7']} h6
{[5']} 12. Bd2 O-O 13. O-O Kh8 {With thoughts (after the Knight moves) of .....
.f5} 14. Be3 Bb6 {For practical purposes I get a semi-open file.} (14... Bxe3 {
Fritz}) (14... Ba7 {Fritz}) 15. Bxb6 cxb6 16. Rfe1 Bc6 17. Nh4 g6 18. Re3 Rac8
19. Rf3 Kg7 20. g4 $2 {Possibly because I have just played a defensive move he
misses the threat.} Bxe4 ({Not} 20... Nxe4 $2 21. dxe4 Bxe4 22. Re3 Rxc4 23. b3
Rcc8 24. Rxe4) 21. Re3 Bd5 22. Bxd5 Nxd5 23. Rf3 Rfe8 24. Re1 Nf6 25. Rfe3 Nd5
26. Rf3 f6 27. Ng2 Red8 28. Ne3 Nf4 29. Ng2 ({Not} 29. Nc4 d5 {when} 30. Nxb6
$2 {loses the Knight.}) 29... Ne6 30. Kf1 Nc5 31. Ra1 Nb3 32. Rd1 d5 33. Ne1 (
33. d4 $142 e4 34. Re3 Rc4 35. f3 f5 36. gxf5) 33... Nc5 34. Ra1 Rc7 35. Kg2
Ne6 (35... d4 {is quicker}) 36. Kf1 d4 37. c4 Nc5 38. Rg3 e4 39. dxe4 (39. Ra3
exd3 40. Nxd3 Ne4 41. Rg1 Rxc4 42. Kg2 $19) 39... Nxe4 40. Rd3 Rxc4 41. Kg2 Nc5
(41... Nc5 {[0-1] Best for White is} 42. b3 Rb4 43. Rb1 b5 ({Not} 43... Nxd3
44. Nxd3 {and the Rook is trapped.}) 44. Rdd1 Rxb3 45. Rxb3 Nxb3 46. axb5 a4
47. Nc2 d3 48. Na3 d2 49. Kf1 Rd3 50. h4 Rd4 51. f3 Rd3 52. Kf2 Nd4) 0-1

