Bg7 8. Be2 O-O 9. a4 axb5 10. Bxb5 Ba6 11. Nge2 Nbd7 12. O-O Qc7 13. Bc6 Rac8 (
13... Rab8 {I was worried about} 14. Nb5 {Fritz gives} Qc8 15. Na7 Qc7 {Drawn})
14. Re1 Ne5 15. Bb5 Bxb5 16. axb5 {Surprise.} (16. Nxb5 {Fritz}) 16... Ra8 17.
