{90' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Nbd7 5. cxd5 exd5 6. e3 Be7
7. Bd3 O-O 8. Qc2 h6 9. Bh4 c6 10. Nf3 Ne8 11. Bxe7 Qxe7 12. O-O Nd6 13. b4 Nb6
14. a4 Bd7 15. Rfb1 a6 16. Ne5 Rfe8 17. Ne2 Qf6 $4 {Unbelieveable! Why do I
keep doing this? As I let go of the piece I saw a5.} 18. Qc5 Qg5 {I decided to
just fling everything into an attack.} 19. Qxd6 Bh3 20. Ng3 Be6 21. b5 Rad8 22.
Qc5 Nd7 23. Nxd7 Bxd7 24. bxa6 bxa6 25. Bxa6 h5 26. Bf1 h4 27. Ne2 Bf5 28. Rb3
Be4 29. Nf4 Qh6 30. Rb6 Rd6 31. a5 g5 32. Ne2 h3 33. gxh3 Qf6 34. Ng3 Ree6 35.
a6 g4 36. hxg4 Qf3 37. a7 Rh6 38. a8=Q+ Kh7 39. Nxe4 Qxg4+ 40. Ng3 Qh4 41. Qc2+
Rdg6 42. h3 Kg7 43. Kh2 Qg4 44. Rb8 {My new years resolution has to be to be
more careful to avoid these ridiculous errors.} 1-0

