{90' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. d3 b5 6. Bb3 Bc5 7.
O-O O-O 8. Nc3 d6 9. Bg5 h6 10. Bh4 Be6 11. Nd5 Na5 $2 {Simply overlooking a
tactical point, and should lose the game.} (11... a5 $142 12. Qd2 Kh7 13. c3
Rg8) 12. Nxf6+ gxf6 13. Bxe6 (13. Qd2 $142 {after 14.Qxh6 I can't defend f6.})
13... fxe6 14. Qd2 Nc6 15. Qxh6 Kf7 {I felt that I was lost but might get an
attack on the g & h files if I can keep the Queens on} (15... Qe7 $142) 16.
Qh7+ Ke8 17. c3 Rf7 18. Qg8+ (18. Qg6 $142 Bb6 19. Rad1 Qe7 20. d4 Kf8 21. dxe5
dxe5) 18... Ke7 19. Qxd8+ Rxd8 20. b4 Bb6 21. a4 d5 22. axb5 axb5 23. exd5 exd5
24. Rfe1 Kf8 25. Ra2 ({I had been concerned about} 25. Nxe5 {but} fxe5 26. Bxd8
Bxf2+ 27. Kf1 Bxe1+ 28. Kxe1 Nxd8 $19) 25... d4 26. Nxe5 Nxe5 27. Rxe5 dxc3 28.
Kf1 Rxd3 29. Ke2 $2 {Losing} ({Correct is} 29. Re4) 29... Rd4 30. Ra8+ {
Losing quickly} Kg7 31. Ree8 Kg6 {Playing it carefully} (31... Kg6 {0-1} 32.
Rg8+ Kf5 33. g4+ (33. Bg3 Re7+ 34. Be5 Rxe5+ 35. Kf1 Rd1#) 33... Rxg4 34. Rxg4
Kxg4 35. Bg3 Rd7 36. Ra2 Rd4 37. Rc2 Rxb4 38. Rxc3 Rb2+ 39. Kd3 c5 40. Ra3 f5 {
etc}) 0-1

