{35 in 75' + 15'} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. c3 Nf6 5. d3 d6 6. b4 Bb6
7. O-O h6 8. Qb3 O-O 9. Nh4 Ne7 10. Be3 g5 11. Bxb6 axb6 12. Nf3 Ng6 $2 {Silly}
(12... b5 {Wins the Bishop}) 13. Nbd2 $2 Qd7 $2 (13... b5 {Still wins the
Bishop.}) 14. d4 Kg7 15. Rad1 Qe7 16. a4 c6 17. dxe5 dxe5 18. b5 Bd7 19. bxc6
Bxc6 20. Bb5 Bxe4 21. Nxe4 Nxe4 22. Rd7 Qc5 23. Rxb7 {Loses the exchange} g4
24. Ne1 Nd2 25. Qe6 Qxc3 (25... Rab8 $142 {We were both playing quickly now.})
26. Bd3 Kg8 (26... e4 $142 27. Bxe4 Ne5) 27. Qf6 $17 (27. Rxf7 Rxf7 28. Bxg6
Raf8 $14) 27... Nf4 $2 {Played quickly.} (27... Qc8 $142 28. Rxf7 Rxf7 29.
Qxg6+ Rg7 30. Qxb6) 28. Bf5 $2 ({Correct is} 28. Qxh6 e4 29. Qxf4 Nxf1 30. Qxe4
) 28... Qc4 $2 {Played very quickly} (28... Ne2+ 29. Kh1 Nxf1 30. Nc2 Qb2 31.
Bh7+ Kxh7 32. Rxf7+ Rxf7 33. Qxf7+ $19) 29. Nd3 {I now lost on time (he had
~30' left) having somehow got it into my head that I would "get another 15'"
but forgetting that I had to get to 35 moves. I have never done this before!} (
29. Nd3 {0-1 Time} Qd5 30. Nxf4 exf4 31. Rd7 Ne4 $14) 1-0

