{30' each/game} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Be7 5. e5 Nfd7 6. h4 Bxg5
7. hxg5 Qxg5 8. Nh3 Qe7 9. Bd3 c5 {Lets my Knight in on d6} 10. Nb5 Nb6 $2 {
Sereves no purpose} 11. Nd6+ Kd8 12. dxc5 N6d7 13. Ng5 Nxe5 14. f4 Nxd3+ 15.
Qxd3 Rf8 16. Qc3 {Trying to be too clever.} (16. Nxh7 {I was concerned about.}
Rh8 17. O-O-O f6 {but this is OK for White}) 16... h6 17. Nf3 f6 18. O-O-O Nc6
19. f5 e5 20. Rxd5 Bd7 21. Nxb7+ Kc7 22. Rhd1 Nb8 $2 (22... Bxf5 $145) 23. Nd6
Nc6 24. b4 (24. Nb5+ $145 Kc8 25. Rxd7) 24... a6 25. Nd2 (25. b5 {is quicker})
25... Rab8 26. a3 Nd4 27. Qe3 Bc6 $2 {Played quickly he misses the threat.} 28.
Rxd4 Bxg2 29. Rg4 Bc6 30. N2c4 Rbd8 31. Qg3 Rg8 32. Rg1 Rd7 33. Nb6 Rdd8 34.
Rxg7 Qxg7 35. Qxg7+ Rxg7 36. Rxg7+ Kb8 37. Rh7 Rf8 38. Rxh6 Bf3 39. Nd7+ 1-0

