{90' each/game} 1. f4 e5 2. e4 exf4 3. Nf3 d5 4. exd5 Nf6 5. Bc4 Nxd5 6. Bxd5 (
{Normal is} 6. Nc3) 6... Qxd5 7. Nc3 Qe6+ 8. Qe2 Bd6 9. Ng5 (9. d4 $142) 9...
Qxe2+ 10. Nxe2 Bf5 11. d3 f6 12. Nd4 Bd7 (12... fxg5 13. Nxf5 Bc5 14. d4 (14.
Nxg7+ {Loses the Knight.}) 14... O-O) 13. Ne4 Be5 14. Ne2 f5 15. Ng5 h6 {
A waste of a move} 16. Nf3 Bf6 17. Nxf4 Bc6 18. Ng6 Rg8 19. c3 Bxf3 20. gxf3
Kf7 21. Rg1 {is OK but ties the Rook down.} Re8+ 22. Kf2 Nd7 23. d4 (23. Bf4
$142) 23... c5 24. Be3 cxd4 25. Bxd4 Bxd4+ 26. cxd4 Rac8 27. Rac1 $2 {He
groaned as he let go of the piece.} (27. f4 $142 Rc2+ 28. Kf3 Ree2 29. Nh4 Rf2+
30. Ke3 Rxh2) 27... Rxc1 28. Rxc1 Kxg6 29. Rc7 Nb8 30. Rxb7 Nc6 31. Rd7 Rd8 32.
Rxd8 (32. Rc7 $142 Nxd4 33. Rxa7) 32... Nxd8 33. Ke3 Kf6 34. a3 Ke6 35. Kf4 g5+
36. Ke3 Kd5 37. b4 Nc6 38. f4 g4 39. Kf2 Kxd4 0-1

