{90' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 e6 3. e3 Nf6 4. Bd3 b6 5. O-O Bd6 6. Nbd2 Nbd7
7. b3 Bb7 8. Bb2 Ne4 9. Ne5 O-O 10. Rc1 Nxe5 11. dxe5 Nxd2 12. Qxd2 Be7 13. Qe2
g6 14. Rcd1 c6 15. Qg4 Qc8 16. e4 f5 (16... Ba6 $142) 17. exf6 Bxf6 18. e5 Bg7
19. h4 Qe8 20. f4 Kh8 21. Qh3 Qe7 22. Bc1 ({Correct is} 22. h5 Bh6 23. hxg6
Bxf4 24. Rf2 Bg5 25. Rf6) 22... Rf7 (22... Qe8 $142) 23. h5 Rf5 $2 {Panic} (
23... gxh5 $142 24. Qxh5 h6) 24. hxg6 h6 25. Bxf5 exf5 26. Qxf5 Qc5+ 27. Kh1
Rf8 28. Qd3 {I was now getting short of time. He was playing very fast.} Qe7
29. Qg3 {Not a particularyly good move. I was trying to find solid moves
quickly.} Bc8 {Played instantly.} 30. Qc3 Qe8 31. Ba3 c5 32. b4 Qxg6 33. bxc5
Bf5 {With me very short of time he was moving quickly to rush me.} (33... Rxf4
$142 34. Rxf4 Qh5+) 34. cxb6 {I was having to make moves without having time
to really anaylse them.} (34. c6 {Fritz}) 34... Rc8 35. Qe3 Rxc2 36. Rd2 Rxd2
37. Qxd2 axb6 38. Qxd5 Be4 39. Qd2 Qg3 40. Bd6 h5 41. Qf2 Qg4 42. Re1 $2 {
Playing moves very quickly this gives it away.} (42. f5 $142) 42... Bf5 $2 {
Fortunately he was moving quickly as well (although he had plenty of time)} ({
Correct is} 42... Bxg2+ 43. Kg1 Be4+ 44. Kh2 Qf5) 43. Be7 Kh7 44. Qh4 Qg6 45.
Qg5 Qf7 46. g3 $2 {Now having to move very quickly I give it away. The
alternatives win easily.} (46. Bf6) (46. Rc1) 46... Qd5+ 47. Kg1 Qd4+ 48. Kf1
Qd3+ 49. Kf2 Qd4+ {I now gave up recording the moves. We agreed a draw after
another 4 or 5 moves. I had <60'' left.} 1/2-1/2

