{90' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. Nc3 d6 5. h3 a6 6. a3 Nf6 7.
d3 h6 8. Bd2 Ne7 9. Qc1 c6 10. Be3 {I felt that he had now prefaced Be3 with
Qc1 he would automatically answer 10.......Bxe3 with 11.Qxe3} Bxe3 11. Qxe3 $2
{Loses a piece for 2 Pawns} d5 12. exd5 cxd5 13. Nxd5 Nexd5 14. Qxe5+ Qe7 15.
Qxe7+ Nxe7 16. O-O O-O 17. Rfe1 Nc6 18. Re2 {Doubling Rooks only helps me
exchange them} b5 19. Bb3 Bb7 20. Rae1 Na5 21. Nd4 (21. Nd2 $142) 21... Nxb3
22. Nxb3 Rfe8 23. c3 Rxe2 24. Rxe2 Nd5 25. f3 Nf4 26. Re3 Ne6 27. d4 Bd5 28.
Nc1 Kf8 29. Kf2 Re8 30. Re5 Nc7 31. f4 f6 32. Rxe8+ Kxe8 33. g3 Ke7 34. Nd3 Kd6
35. Nb4 a5 36. Nc2 Be4 37. Ne3 Nd5 38. Nf1 Nb6 39. Nd2 Kd5 40. h4 Nc4 41. Nb3
a4 42. Nc1 Nxb2 0-1

