{TC 35 in 75-15min allegro} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Qc2 d5 5. e3 c5 6.
Nf3 Nc6 7. dxc5 O-O 8. Bd2 Bxc5 9. a3 a5 10. Be2 dxc4 11. Bxc4 e5 12. h3 {
Not really necessary. Fritz prefers 12.Rc1 or 12.0-0} Qe7 13. Nd5 (13. Rc1 {
Fritz}) (13. Ng5 {Fritz}) 13... Nxd5 14. Bxd5 Rd8 15. e4 {This allows ......Nd4
} (15. Be4 $142 g6 16. Rc1) 15... Nd4 16. Nxd4 Bxd4 17. O-O Be6 18. Bxe6 Qxe6
19. Rab1 (19. Rfd1 $142) (19. Bc3 $142) 19... Rac8 20. Qa4 {I wasn't happy here
} (20. Bc3 $142) 20... b6 21. b4 {Trying for some activity. However, I had
missed his reply.} (21. Be3 $142 Bxe3 22. fxe3 Rd2 23. Rf2) 21... Qa2 {I
hadn't considered this. I felt that I was now lost.} 22. Bg5 $19 {Played on
the basis that I tought that I was lost. Also, time was running out.} (22. Rbd1
axb4 23. Bxb4 Rc2 24. Kh2 Rxf2 25. Rxf2 Qxf2 26. Be7 $17) 22... f6 23. Bh4 axb4
(23... h5) ({I had expected} 23... g5 24. Bg3 Rc3 {which threatens both ......
Rxg3 and .....Rxa3}) 24. Qxb4 Bc5 25. Qb3+ (25. Rb2 {25.Ra1, 25.Qb5 probably
offered more hope.}) 25... Qxb3 26. Rxb3 Rd4 27. Re1 Ra8 28. Kf1 Rxa3 29. Rxa3
Bxa3 30. f3 b5 31. Bf2 Rc4 32. Be3 b4 33. Rb1 Kf7 34. Bd2 Ke6 35. Ke2 {I was
having to move fast now.} Kd6 {TC} 36. Kd3 Kc5 37. g4 Rd4+ 38. Kc2 Kc4 39. Rb3
{Playing fast I ended it quickly. However 39.Be1 is clearly lost.} 0-1

