{30' each/game} 1. Nf3 d5 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nc3 g6 4. h3 Bg7 5. Bg5 O-O 6. e3 Ne4 $5
7. Nxe4 dxe4 8. Nd2 c5 9. c3 (9. Nxe4 cxd4 10. exd4 Bf5 11. Ng3) 9... Qb6 $2 {
Too gung-ho! After the last game I was playing too fast.} 10. Rb1 $2 {To
conservative.} (10. Bxe7) 10... cxd4 11. exd4 f6 12. Be3 f5 13. g3 Bd7 {
Playing fast, I picked up the Bishop to move it to e6, noticed d5 so had to
put the Bishop on d7.} (13... Be6 $4 14. d5) 14. Nc4 Qf6 15. Qb3 Kh8 {Fritz
prefers 15......Qf7 but in a quickplay it is better to play safe.} 16. Qxb7 {
This is "best" but dangerous in a quickplay.} Bc6 17. Qc7 {Also best but risky.
} Nd7 18. Ne5 (18. Qa5 $142) 18... Nxe5 19. dxe5 (19. Qxe5 $142) 19... Qe6 20.
f4 $2 {Playing fast he simply overlooks I can take it e.p.} exf3 21. Bf4 (21.
Kf2 $142) 21... f2+ ({Best is} 21... g5 {then} 22. Kf2 ({If} 22. Bxg5 Bxe5)
22... gxf4 {etc}) 0-1

