{30' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. e3 Bf5 4. Bd3 Bxd3 5. cxd3 c6 6. O-O e6
7. Nc3 Be7 8. Ne5 O-O 9. f4 Nfd7 10. a3 f6 11. Nf3 a5 12. Bd2 Qb6 13. Rb1 Na6
14. Re1 c5 15. Qa4 Rfd8 16. Qb5 Nc7 17. Qxb6 Nxb6 18. Kf1 (18. dxc5 $142) 18...
a4 19. e4 (19. b3 $142) 19... Bf8 20. Ne2 (20. dxc5 $142) 20... c4 21. dxc4 $2
{Playing quickly this is a mistake.} Nxc4 $2 (21... dxc4 $142) 22. exd5 {
I was behind on time and had to move quickly.} (22. e5 $142) 22... exd5 23. Bc3
{I was not happy here my pieces are badly placed.} (23. Nc3 $142) 23... Nb5 24.
Kf2 Kf7 25. Rbc1 {I felt that I was in trouble.} Re8 26. Rb1 (26. Rc2 $142)
26... Nbd6 27. Kf1 Rac8 28. Nd2 (28. Kg1 $142) 28... Nxd2+ 29. Bxd2 Ne4 (29...
Rc2 $142) 30. Bc3 Bd6 31. g3 g5 32. fxg5 fxg5 33. Rbd1 (33. Rbc1 $142) 33...
Kg6 34. Kg2 h5 35. Ba5 $2 {I was getting short of time and trying to find
'safe' moves.} (35. Rc1 $142) 35... Rc2 36. Bc3 $2 (36. Kg1 $142) 36... Rf8 $2
{I now felt that I was lost. After 37.......Rf2+ it falls apart. I was going
to resign when I saw the only hope.} (36... Nxc3 $142) 37. Kg1 {The only hope.}
Rf2 38. Rd2 Nxd2 {He was alsio moving fast.} (38... Rxd2 $142 39. Bxd2 h4) 39.
Kxf2 Ne4+ 40. Kf1 (40. Ke3 $142 {I was having to move fast.}) 40... h4 41. gxh4
gxh4 42. h3 Kf5 43. Rd1 (43. Ra1 $142) 43... Ng5 $2 ({Correct is} 43... Bxa3)
44. Rd3 {Played instantaneously} ({Correct is} 44. Rd2 Rxd2 45. Bxd2 Nxh3 46.
Nc3) 44... Ne4 (44... Ke4 $142) 45. Rf3+ 1/2-1/2

