(18. gxf5 $142 gxf5 19. d5 exd5 20. Qxf5+) 18... Qb5 19. Kg1 Bf6 20. Re1 bxc3
21. bxc3 Rab8 {Time was getting on and I was considering 21......Nxd4 but felt
that I idn't have time to check it.} ({In fact it is best} 21... Nxd4 22. Bxb7
