Just trying to find a move} ({Correct is} 29... Bxc4 30. Bxc4 Rxb1 31. Rxb1
Qxf4) (29... Qxf4 {Was just too risky in time shortage.}) 30. Qe3 (30. Rxb8
$142) 30... Bxc4 $2 {This finally loses it.} (30... Rxb1 $142 31. Rxb1 Nb4) 31.
Bxc4 e5 {I don't have a move} 32. dxe5 Nb4 33. Be6 Bc5 34. Qd2+ Ke7 35. Bxc5+
Qxc5 36. Qd7+ 1-0

