{90' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Nf3 c6 5. e3 Bd6 6. c5 {
Frits prefers 6.Bd3 or 6.Be2} Be7 7. b4 O-O 8. Bd3 b6 9. Bb2 a5 10. a3 b5 ({
Fritz prefers} 10... Ba6 {I considered this but didn't like} 11. Bxa6 Nxa6 12.
Qa4) 11. O-O Nbd7 12. Qc2 a4 {I was concerned about being left with a weak
c-Pawn if the a & b Pawns go.} 13. e4 dxe4 14. Nxe4 Qc7 15. Ne5 g6 16. Ng5 Nd5
17. Nxh7 $2 {This was a surprise} (17. Nexf7 $142 Rxf7 18. Nxe6 Qb7 19. Bxg6)
17... Nxe5 18. Nxf8 Nxd3 (18... Ng4 $142) 19. Nxg6 Nxb2 20. Nxe7+ Qxe7 21. Qxb2
Qg5 22. Qe2 Bd7 23. Qe5 Qg7 24. Qxg7+ Kxg7 25. g3 Rg8 26. Rac1 Kf6 27. Rfe1 Rg4
28. Rcd1 Rg5 {Intending ......e5} 29. h4 Rg8 30. Rd3 Ke7 31. Rf3 f5 $2 {
Starting to play quickly} 32. Rxf5 Rg4 $2 (32... Be8 {Fritz}) 33. Rfe5 $2 {
He was also speeding up now.} (33. Rg5 $142) 33... Rxd4 34. h5 Kf6 35. R5e4
Rxe4 (35... e5 36. Rxe5 Rd3 37. Kg2 Bg4 38. Kh2 Rd2 $16) 36. Rxe4 e5 37. f3 Bf5
38. Re2 Bd3 39. Rd2 Bh7 (39... e4 $142 40. h6 Kg6 41. Rh2 Nf6) 40. g4 Bg8 41.
Kf2 Kg5 42. Kg3 Be6 43. Re2 Kf6 44. Kh4 Nf4 45. Re4 $2 {We were now in a time
rush now with moves being made quickly big errors are made.} (45. Rh2 $142)
45... Bd5 46. g5+ Kf5 47. g6 $2 Kf6 {It works! With very little time left I
"play it safe"} ({of course} 47... Bxe4 {is perfectley playable.}) (47... Kf6 {
Correct is} 48. g7 {then} (48. Re3 $4 {Resigns 0-1}) (48. Rxf4+ exf4 49. Kg4
Bg8 50. Kxf4 Be6 $19) 48... Bg8 49. h6 Kg6 50. Rxe5 Kxh6 $11) 48. Re3 $4 {
Having to move instantaneously he blunders.} 0-1

