b3 Be7 8. Nd2 O-O 9. Bb2 Nbd7 10. Rc1 (10. f4 {Fritz}) 10... a6 11. Ndf3 {
Best according to fritz but 11.a4 would slow up his QS advance.} b5 12. c4 bxc4
13. bxc4 dxc4 14. Bxc4 cxd4 15. Bxd4 Nxe5 16. Nxe5 Qa5 17. Bc3 Qb6 18. Rb1 (18.
Qa4 {Fritz}) ({I wanted to play} 18. Ng4 {but} Qc6 {prevents this.}) 18... Qc7
19. Qa4 (19. Bd4 $142) 19... a5 (19... Be4 $142) 20. Rfc1 Bd6 21. f4 Bc5 22.
Bd4 Bxd4 23. exd4 Qe7 24. Bb5 (24. Bd3 $142 {followed by} Z0 25. f5) 24... Nd5
25. g3 g5 {I hadn't expected this} 26. fxg5 Qxg5 27. Qa3 Qe3+ 28. Qxe3 (28.
Qxe3 {Draw. A continuation} Nxe3 29. Kf2 Nd5 30. Be2 Ba6 31. Bf3) 1/2-1/2

