e5 16. dxe6 fxe6 (16... Bxe6 {Fritz}) 17. Bg4 Rac8 18. Rxc8 Rxc8 19. Rc1 Rc5
20. b4 Rxc1+ 21. Qxc1 h5 22. Be2 Qc6 23. Qxc6 Bxc6 {I assumed that he was
playing for a draw and I offered a draw here. He instantly turned the offer
down.} 24. f4 Kf7 25. g4 hxg4 26. hxg4 e5 27. f5 d5 28. Bf3 dxe4 29. dxe4 {
Now I have a protected passed Pawn.} (29. Bxe4 $142) 29... gxf5 30. gxf5 Bf6
31. Bd2 Kg7 32. Kg2 Kh7 33. Kg3 Kg7 34. Kg4 Kh7 35. Bg5 Kg7 36. Kh5 Be8+ ({
