Kf8 39. Be2 Bc2 40. Bf3 d3 41. Kf5 d2 42. Kxe5 d1=Q 43. Bxd1 Bxd1 {This might
have been a better chance for me.}) 37. Kg4 Ba4 38. Bd2 Bc2 39. Kg3 Kf7 40. Kf2
