{30' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 e5 3. dxe5 d4 4. Nf3 Nc6 5. g3 {He played all
this quite quickly and seemed familiar with the Albin.} Be6 6. b3 Qd7 7. Bg2
O-O-O 8. O-O Nge7 9. Bb2 Ng6 10. Nbd2 Ngxe5 11. Nxe5 Nxe5 12. Nf3 Nc6 13. Qd3 (
13. Qd2 $142 Bb4 14. Qf4) 13... Bc5 {[3']} 14. Rfd1 Bf5 15. e4 $5 {Mixing it,
but he didn't fancy......} ({.....} 15. Qd2 Bb4 16. Qc1) 15... dxe3 16. Qxd7+
Rxd7 17. Rxd7 exf2+ 18. Kh1 $2 {The King has problems in the corner.} Bxd7 19.
Ng5 {Surprisingly, this is best.} (19. Bxg7 $143 Re8 20. Rf1 Bf5) 19... f6 (
19... Bf5 $142 20. Bh3 Bxh3 21. Nxh3 Re8 22. Rf1 Re2) 20. Ne4 Be3 ({I wanted
to play} 20... Re8 21. Nxc5 Re1+ 22. Bf1 Bh3 {but then} 23. Nd3 {looked OK for
him. However, then} Bxf1 24. Nxf2 (24. Nxe1 Bxc4 25. Nf3 f1=Q+ 26. Rxf1 Bxf1
$17) 24... Re2 25. Kg1 Rxb2 $19) 21. Rf1 Re8 22. Nxf2 Bxf2 23. Rxf2 Re1+ 24.
Rf1 Re2 {He now thought for quite a long time and started to run short of time.
} 25. Bc3 ({I had expected a "desperate"} 25. Bxf6) (25. Ba3 $142 Rxa2 26. Bf8)
25... Rxa2 26. b4 {He went into "rapid" play mode now.} (26. Be4 $142) 26...
Rc2 27. Bxf6 {About the only hope.} gxf6 28. h4 (28. Rxf6 Rc1+ 29. Bf1 Bh3)
28... f5 29. g4 {Again thr best chance.} Rxc4 (29... fxg4 {is playable but I
play it "safe" with the text.}) 30. gxf5 Rxh4+ 31. Kg1 Nd8 (31... Bxf5 {
Would also win.}) 32. f6 Nf7 33. Bd5 Rg4+ 34. Bg2 {Moving quickly he ends it
quickly.} Bc6 35. Rf2 Rxg2+ 36. Rxg2 Bxg2 37. Kxg2 Kd7 0-1

