23. Qxe4 Rfd8 (23... g6 $142) 24. Rde1 Bf6 (24... Bd6 $142) 25. f5 {[20']} exf5
26. Qxf5 Qd6 27. Kh1 {Unnecessarily cautious.} ({I wanted to play} 27. Bxh6 {
but was concerned that} Bxd4+ 28. cxd4 Qxh6 29. Qxf7+ {Leaves me with an
isolated passed Pawn.} Kh8 30. Qxc4) 27... Rac8 28. Bxh6 gxh6 29. Qxf6 Qxf6 30.
Rxf6 Kg7 31. Rxa6 {He could resign now.} Rd7 32. h3 Rb7 33. Re2 f6 34. Ree6 Rf7
35. Rac6 Rb8 36. Rb6 Rd8 37. b4 cxb3 38. axb3 1-0

