O-O h6 (7... c6 $142) 8. d4 Qe7 9. Re1 ({Slightly better} 9. dxe5 dxe5 10. Nd5
Qd6 11. Qc2) 9... c6 10. c5 dxc5 11. dxe5 Nfd7 12. Bf4 ({I was more concerned
about.} 12. Qd6 Re8 13. Rd1) 12... g5 13. Be3 Nxe5 (13... g4 {Fritz}) 14. Nxe5
Bxe5 15. Rc1 Rd8 16. Qh5 Kg7 17. Bf1 (17. h4 $142 f6 18. Rcd1) 17... Be6 18. b3
(18. f4 $142) 18... Nd7 19. Qe2 (19. h4 $142) 19... Bd4 20. Red1 (20. Bg2 $142)
20... Ne5 {Threat 21.......Bg4} 21. h3 Qf6 22. Bg2 $2 {Worried about the f3
square, he misses the threat.} Bxc3 23. Rxc3 Rxd1+ 24. Qxd1 Nf3+ 25. Qxf3 Qxc3
26. Qd1 Qa5 {I wasn't confident about this.} (26... b6) 27. Qa1+ Kh7 28. e5 $2
{Blocking the long diagonal 28......h4 is best.} Kg8 29. h4 Qd8 $2 (29... gxh4
30. Bxh6 (30. gxh4 Bxb3) 30... hxg3) 30. hxg5 hxg5 31. Bxc5 (31. Qc1 $142 Qc7
32. Qxc5) 31... Bd5 32. Bh3 Be6 33. Bg2 Qd3 34. Be3 g4 35. Qc1 Rd8 36. Kh2 Bd5
37. Bh6 Qg6 38. Bg5 Rd7 39. Qf4 Qh5+ 40. Bh4 {Forced} Bxg2 41. Kxg2 Rd5 42. e6
fxe6 43. Qb8+ Kg7 44. Qxb7+ Qf7 {He can't take on c6 and ......Qf3+ is
threatened.} 0-1

