is an alternative.}) 9... Bb7 $2 10. Nf4 Qe8 (10... Kf7 11. d5 Nc5 12. dxe6+)
11. Nxe6 Qg6 12. d5 ({Now} 12. Nxf8 $2 Qxg5 {threatens mate}) ({However,} 12.
Qc2 Nh5 13. Nxf8 Rxf8 14. f4 {2.65/0 is}) 12... Ne5 ({If} 12... Rfc8 13. Qc2)
13. Nxf8 Qxg5 {Anything takes on f8 is better.} 14. f4 (14. Ne6 $142 Qg6 15.
Nxc7) 14... Qh6 15. fxe5 $2 {I was unsure here} ({Correct is} 15. Bxf5 Rxf8 16.
fxe5 Qxe3+ 17. Kh1 dxe5 18. Qc2) 15... Ng4 16. h3 Qxe3+ $2 (16... Nxe3 $142 17.
Qf3 Rxf8 18. exd6 Bxd6 19. Rfe1 f4) 17. Kh1 Nf2+ $2 (17... Nxe5 $142) (17...
Rxf8 $142) 18. Rxf2 Qxf2 19. Ne6 {The smoke clears and I am simply a piece up.}
dxe5 20. Rc2 Qh4 21. Bxf5 Qxc4 $2 (21... g6 $142) 22. Qh5 (22. Ne4 $142 Qb4 (
22... Bxd5 23. Rxc4) 23. Qg4 Bf8 24. Bxh7+) 22... h6 (22... Qh4 $142) 23. Rf2 (
23. Qg6 {is mate in 8!}) 23... Qh4 24. Qxh4 Bxh4 25. Re2 Bf6 26. Nxc7 Rd8 27.
Ne4 Be7 28. Rd2 Rf8 29. Ng3 Bd6 30. Nb5 Bb4 31. Nc3 Bd6 32. Rf2 Rd8 33. Be6+
Kh7 34. Rf7 Rb8 35. Nb5 Bc5 36. Ne4 Be3 37. Nbd6 Ba6 38. Rxa7 Be2 39. Nf5 Bf4
40. Rxg7+ {[Dick did not play in Rd 2 Lancaster A v Bare 15/11/12]} 1-0

