{90' each/game} 1. d4 g6 2. c4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. e4 Nd7 5. Be2 e6 6. Nf3 Ne7 7.
O-O O-O 8. Bg5 c6 9. Qd2 a6 10. d5 {I felt that if I didn't play this he would
play ......d5} (10. c5 $142 d5 $16) 10... Nc5 (10... exd5 {Fritz}) 11. e5 exd5
12. cxd5 f6 $2 13. exf6 Bxf6 14. Bxf6 Rxf6 15. b4 cxd5 $2 {After a long think.}
16. Nxd5 $5 {I didn't like facing the passed Pawns.} (16. bxc5 dxc5 17. Ne4 Rc6
18. Ne5 Re6 19. f4 c4 20. Ng5 {3.37/0}) 16... Nxd5 17. Qxd5+ Be6 18. Qd4 Nd7
19. Ng5 Ne5 20. Nxe6 Rxe6 21. Qd5 Qe7 22. f4 Nf7 23. Bc4 (23. Bf3 $142) 23...
Re4 24. a3 (24. f5 {which I considered is slightly better.}) 24... Rc8 25. Rac1
(25. Bd3 $142 Re3 26. f5) 25... Rc7 {26.Qxf7+ was threatened} 26. Qd3 Kf8 27.
Rc2 {Realising that my position is a little shaky.} (27. Bb3 $2 Rxc1 28. Rxc1
Re1+ 29. Rxe1 Qxe1+ 30. Qf1 Qe3+ 31. Kh1 (31. Qf2 Qxb3) 31... Qxb3) 27... b5
28. Bd5 Rxc2 29. Qxc2 Re2 {He was now very short of time: I had a little more.
The rest of the game was played rather quickly.} 30. Qc8+ Kg7 31. Qc3+ Kf8 32.
Qc8+ Nd8 (32... Kg7 $142) 33. Qxa6 {Short of time I wasn't sure about this.} (
33. h3) 33... Qe3+ 34. Kh1 Nf7 $2 35. Qxb5 Re1 36. Bxf7 (36. h3 $142) 36...
Kxf7 37. a4 $2 {Playing fast now.} (37. f5 $142) (37. h3 $142) 37... Qf2 {
Now it's a draw. However, he was very short of time now and was having to move
almost instantly. Also the match position was such that he had to try and win.}
38. Qd7+ Kg8 39. Qd8+ Kg7 40. Qd7+ Kh6 $2 41. Qh3+ Kg7 42. Qd7+ $2 ({In the
rush missing} 42. Qc3+) 42... Kf6 43. Qxd6+ Kf5 $2 44. Qd3+ $2 ({Again, missing
} 44. Qf8+ Ke4 45. Qe8+) 44... Kf6 $2 45. Qc3+ {Spotting it, at last.} Kf7 46.
Rxe1 1-0

