7. h3 Re8 8. Nc3 Nbd7 9. Bd2 e5 10. dxe5 Nxe5 11. Nxe5 Rxe5 12. Ne2 {After a
long think} Re8 ({I was expecting} 12... Ne4) 13. Bc3 Qc7 14. Rc1 c5 15. Qb3
dxc4 16. Bxc4 b6 17. Rcd1 Bb7 18. Nf4 Rad8 19. Bb5 Rxd1 20. Rxd1 Rd8 21. Rxd8+
Qxd8 22. Bc4 {I offered a draw here.} Qd7 23. f3 h6 $2 24. Nxg6 Nh5 {Hoping
for a KS attack.} 25. Bxg7 (25. Be5 $142) (25. Ne5 $142) (25. a3 $142) 25...
Kxg7 26. Ne5 Qf5 27. Ng4 ({I didn't think I could safely take the f-Pawn but} 
27. Nxf7 Qf6 28. Qd1 b5 29. Nd6) 27... Ng3 28. Kh2 Nh5 29. Qc3+ f6 30. Qd2 a6 {
He has no move. Best is 30........b5} 31. Qd6 Bxf3 {Desperation.} 32. Bd3 Be4
33. Qe7+ 1-0

