{30' each/game} 1. c4 c6 2. Nc3 d5 3. e3 Nf6 4. b3 Bf5 5. Nf3 e6 6. Be2 h6 7.
O-O Be7 8. Bb2 O-O 9. d3 Nbd7 10. Nh4 Bh7 11. f4 {One needs to be active in
the quickplay games.} Ne8 ({I had expected.} 11... Ng4) 12. Nf3 Qb6 13. Qd2 Bc5
14. d4 Bb4 15. c5 (15. Ne5 {Fritz}) 15... Qc7 16. a3 Bxc3 17. Bxc3 Nef6 18. Qb2
Ne4 19. Nd2 Ndf6 20. Nxe4 Bxe4 21. Be1 Nh7 {Black intends a KS advance.} 22.
Qd2 f5 23. Bd3 Bxd3 24. Qxd3 Qe7 25. Rf3 {A couple of moves later I decide
that this is the wrong plan, Fritz gives it as best.} Qd7 26. b4 (26. Bh4 $142)
26... Nf6 27. Rf2 g5 28. fxg5 (28. Rb2 {Fritz}) 28... hxg5 29. Rb2 a6 30. a4
Kf7 31. Rab1 Rh8 32. b5 Qc7 {Threatening h2.} (32... axb5 $142 33. axb5 Ra7)
33. g3 $2 (33. Bg3 $142) 33... Rab8 $2 (33... axb5 $142) 34. bxa6 b5 $2 {
Suicide.} (34... bxa6) 35. axb5 (35. cxb6 $142 {but we were moving quickly now.
}) 35... cxb5 36. Rxb5 Rxb5 37. Rxb5 Qc6 38. Rb7+ Kg6 39. Qb5 1-0

