Bg2 h6 8. O-O Be6 9. b3 Qd7 10. Rb1 {Playing too fast (as with many Quickplay
players) he gives away a Pawn.} Bxh3 11. Nh2 Bxg2 12. Kxg2 Bd4 13. a3 Bxc3 14.
dxc3 Nxe4 15. Qe1 Nf6 16. Be3 Ne7 17. Rd1 O-O 18. Nf3 Qc6 19. Qe2 Nf5 20. Rh1
Rfe8 21. b4 Nxe3+ 22. fxe3 Ne4 23. Qc2 Ng5 24. Rd5 Nxf3 25. Kxf3 Re6 26. Rh4 b5
27. Qd3 Rae8 28. e4 bxc4 29. Qe3 Qb6 30. Qxb6 cxb6 31. Rh2 Rf6+ 32. Ke2 Rg6 33.
