think.} 5. Nxc6 Qxe4+ 6. Qe2 (6. Be2 $142) 6... Qxe2+ 7. Bxe2 dxc6 8. O-O Be6
9. Nc3 O-O-O 10. Be3 Bb4 11. Ne4 h6 (11... Bd5 $142) (11... Bf5 $142) 12. a3 ({
