{90' each/game} 1. Nf3 d5 2. d4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. Bf4 c6 5. e3 Nf6 6. Be2 O-O 7.
O-O Nbd7 8. Ne5 Ne8 9. Nxd7 Bxd7 10. h3 f6 11. Bg3 e5 12. dxe5 fxe5 13. Bg4 (
13. Nxd5 cxd5 14. Qxd5+ Kh8 15. Rad1 Nf6) 13... Kh8 14. Bxd7 Qxd7 15. Qd2 Nd6
16. Rad1 Qe7 17. Qc1 (17. Qe2 $142) 17... Rf7 18. Rd2 Raf8 19. Re2 Bh6 (19...
b5 {Fritz}) 20. Qe1 Kg8 21. f4 {Attempting to break out.} (21. Bh2 $142) 21...
Nf5 22. Bf2 (22. fxe5 {Loses immediately}) 22... e4 23. g4 Nd6 24. Nd1 Bg7 25.
Bh4 Qd7 26. Kh2 Nc4 27. b3 ({Fritz prefers} 27. Ref2 {but human players don't
like giving up Pawns.}) 27... Ne5 28. Qf2 Nf3+ (28... g5 29. Bg3 h5) 29. Kg2 d4
30. Bg3 dxe3 $2 {I had the feeling that this was premature but played it anyway
} ({Correct is} 30... h5 {then if} 31. gxh5 gxh5 32. h4 Kh7 33. Ree1 Rg8) 31.
Qxe3 Bh6 32. Qxe4 $2 (32. g5 Bg7 33. Nf2 Bd4 34. Qxe4 Nh4+ 35. Bxh4 Rxf4 {
-0.55/0}) ({If} 32. Nc3 {I was considering something like.} Bxf4 33. Bxf4 Rxf4
34. Nxe4 Rxg4+) 32... Nd2 33. Rxd2 Qxd2+ 34. Kg1 Bg7 ({I was concerned about
my King in the open after} 34... Bxf4 {but} 35. Bxf4 Rxf4 36. Rxf4 Rxf4 37.
Qe8+ Kg7 38. Qe7+ Rf7 39. Qe5+ Kh6) 35. Qc4 Qd4+ {Resigns. I felt that he
could have played on for a bit.} 0-1

