f5 {Fritz prefers 14.b3 but in quickplay games it pays to be aggressive} bxc4
15. dxc4 Qb6 16. g4 {As in the last note this creates more problems for him
thanFritz's preffered 16.Rf3-c3} Qb4 {He also tries to be positive but.......}
({.......} 16... h6 {is safer.}) 17. g5 Nh5 $2 {Still trying to be active he
loses it.} ({Correct is} 17... Nd7) 18. Nc3 Nf4 19. f6 gxf6 20. gxf6 Bxf6 21.
