{30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. f3 Qc7 6. c4 a6 7.
Nc3 Nc6 8. Be3 e6 9. Be2 Be7 10. O-O O-O 11. Kh1 e5 12. Nc2 Be6 13. b3 Rfd8 14.
Rc1 Rac8 15. g4 h6 (15... Qa5 $142) 16. Qd2 {For about 7 or 8 moves around
here, Fritz wants to play Nd5. I was simply playing non-commital moves (except
g4) quickckly} Bf8 (16... b5 {Fritz}) 17. h4 Nd7 18. g5 h5 {[8']} 19. f4 {[5']}
g6 $2 {Playing too fast he blunders. Now he is annihilated.} 20. f5 Bxf5 $2 21.
exf5 Bg7 22. fxg6 fxg6 23. Qd5+ Kh8 24. Qf7 Rf8 25. Qxg6 {[8']} Rxf1+ 26. Rxf1
Rf8 27. Qxh5+ Kg8 28. Rxf8+ Nxf8 29. c5 d5 30. Nxd5 Qd7 31. Bc4 Qh3+ {There is
a forced mate in 16 or less in all lines now} 32. Kg1 Qg3+ 33. Kf1 Qh3+ 34. Ke1
{[11']} Ne6 ({I was hoping for} 34... Qg3+ 35. Kd2 Qg2+ 36. Kc3 e4+ 37. Nf6#)
35. Qe8+ Kh7 36. Bd3+ {I immediately realised that 36.g6+ was mate.} (36. g6#)
1-0

