7. Bb3 O-O 8. h3 Bb7 9. c3 Re8 10. d4 d6 11. Ng5 Rf8 12. f4 {An aggressive
policy works against this opponent.} h6 13. Nf3 exf4 14. Bxf4 Na5 15. Bc2 Nh5 (
15... c5 $142) 16. Bh2 Nf6 17. Nbd2 Re8 (17... c5) 18. b4 Nc6 19. Qe2 Nh7 (
19... Qd7 $142) 20. a4 bxa4 $2 {Loses a Pawn.} 21. Bxa4 Rf8 22. Bxc6 {Wins a
Pawn} ({Fritz prefers} 22. Bc2 Z0 23. Qd3) 22... Bxc6 23. Rxa6 Qd7 24. Raa1 Ng5
25. e5 {Missing his possible reply on move 30.} Nxf3+ 26. Nxf3 Bxf3 27. Qxf3
Rxa1 28. Rxa1 dxe5 29. Bxe5 f6 30. Bf4 Bd6 $2 (30... Bxb4 31. Ra6 (31. cxb4
Qxd4+) 31... Be7) 31. Qd5+ Kh8 32. Ra7 Qe7 33. Bxd6 Qe1+ 34. Kh2 cxd6 35. Qxd6
Re8 36. Qd7 Rg8 37. Qc7 Qe4 38. b5 Qe8 39. b6 Kh7 40. c4 Qb8 41. c5 Qxc7+ 42.
Rxc7 Rb8 43. b7 Kg6 44. c6 1-0

