Rb6 42. g5 Rb5 43. h7 $4 {Awful! As always I immediately realised what I had
done.} (43. Re7 Kg8 44. Kg6 Rb6+ 45. Kf5) 43... Rxg5+ $3 44. Kh4 Rg7 45. Rxg7
Kxg7 46. h8=B+ Kxh8 1/2-1/2

