{90' each/game} 1. d4 c5 2. d5 Nf6 3. c4 a6 4. a4 e6 5. Nc3 exd5 6. cxd5 Bd6 7.
Nf3 O-O 8. g3 Qe7 9. Bg2 Bc7 10. O-O d6 11. Nd2 Nbd7 12. Qc2 Ne5 13. b3 Bd7 14.
Bb2 b5 15. e4 Rab8 16. axb5 axb5 17. Nd1 Rfc8 18. Ne3 {Too conservative} (18.
f4 Ng6 19. Ne3) 18... Bb6 19. Rfe1 {is left weak.} Nfg4 20. Nxg4 Nxg4 21. h3
Ne5 22. Bxe5 (22. Rec1 {Fritz}) 22... Qxe5 23. Kh2 {Leaving f2 ungaurded} (23.
Nf3 $142 Qe7 24. e5 {Which I condidered.}) 23... c4 24. bxc4 $4 {Ludicrous! I
had intended 24.f4 Qmoves then bxc4 and somehow missed out f4.} Bxf2 {Crunch!
Should I resign?} 25. Rf1 {Best, but I am completely lost.} Qxg3+ 26. Kh1 Bxh3
$6 {Giving me a flicker of hope.} (26... Bd4 $142) 27. Rxf2 Qxf2 28. Bxh3 Rxc4
29. Qd3 Rd4 30. Qxb5 Qe1+ $2 {Throwing it away.} (30... Rf8 31. Nf1 Rxe4 32.
Qd3 Rh4) 31. Rxe1 Rxb5 32. Nf3 Rd3 $2 {We were both getting short of time now
so the mistakes continue.} 33. Bf1 Rbb3 34. Bxd3 Rxd3 35. Kg2 Kf8 36. Kf2 ({
With neither of us havin much time it was unlikely to prove an accurate
endgame.} 36. Rf1 {is slightly better.}) 36... f6 (36... f5 $142) 37. Ke2 Ra3
38. Nd4 Ra4 39. Ke3 g6 40. Rf1 (40. Rc1 {intending} Z0 41. Rc6 {is slightly
better.}) 40... Kf7 41. Nb5 Ra6 42. Nc7 {This is the wron plan but I was
rushing.} (42. Rc1) 42... Ra3+ 43. Kf4 h5 44. Ne6 (44. Nb5 $142) 44... Rb3 45.
Ra1 {Now it.s a draw.} g5+ 46. Nxg5+ fxg5+ 47. Kxg5 Re3 48. Ra7+ Ke8 49. Ra8+
Ke7 50. Ra7+ 1/2-1/2

