{30 in 75' +15'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Bf4 Bg7 5. e3 O-O 6. cxd5 Nxd5
7. Nxd5 Qxd5 8. Bxc7 Nc6 9. Ne2 Bg4 10. h3 {After much thought} (10. f3 $142 {
Which I considered, but as worried about} Bxf3 11. gxf3 Qxf3 12. Rg1 Qxe3 13.
Bf4 {however, it is very risky.}) 10... Bxe2 11. Bxe2 (11. Qxe2 Rac8 12. Bg3
Nb4 {is not nice.}) 11... Qxg2 12. Bf3 Qg5 13. Qa4 (13. h4 Qf5 14. O-O {Fritz})
13... Rac8 14. Bf4 Qf5 15. Bg4 Qd5 16. O-O e6 17. Rac1 h5 18. Be2 e5 19. dxe5
Bxe5 20. Qc4 {I was already getting short of time and was looking for safe,
solid moves.} Qd7 21. Bxe5 Nxe5 22. Qe4 Rce8 23. Kg2 Re6 24. Rfd1 Qe7 25. Qf4
Rf6 26. Qe4 $4 {I was playing quickly now and miss the tactic, although I
briefly considered it.} Rf5 $2 {He misses it as well.} ({I simply considered
that} 26... Rxf2+ 27. Kxf2 Ng4+ 28. Kf3 {was O.K.}) (26... Rxf2+ 27. Kxf2 Ng4+
{and best is} 28. hxg4 (28. Qxg4 hxg4 29. Bxg4) ({If} 28. Kf3 Nh2+ 29. Kf4 (29.
Kg3 Qxe4) (29. Kf2 Qxe4) 29... Qh4+ 30. Ke5 Re8+) 28... Qxe4 29. Bf3 Qe5 30.
gxh5 Qxb2+) 27. Rd4 Qf6 28. f4 {I was having to move quickly but this is best.}
Nc6 29. Rd2 {Moving quickly but again best.} Rd8 30. Rxd8+ Qxd8 31. Rd1 Qb6 32.
b3 Qa5 33. a4 Qc3 34. Qd3 (34. Qd3 {[Draw] He considered} Qc5 {When I can't
reply} 35. Kf2 ({or} 35. Kf3) (35. Bf3 {is OK for White})) 1/2-1/2

