{90' each/game} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. f4 O-O 6. Nf3 c5 7.
d5 Bd7 {The Bishop simply gets in the way here.} 8. Be2 a6 {How is he going to
develop his b8 Knight?} 9. a4 Ne8 (9... a5 $142) (9... Bg4 $142) 10. O-O Nc7
11. Qb3 Qc8 12. a5 Bg4 13. h3 Bxf3 {He thought about this for ages.} 14. Bxf3
Nd7 15. Be3 {I had forgotten to bring my glasses and it was a bit of a blur,
so I was playing it solid.} h6 {He seemed stuck for ideas. Fritz likes 15......
Bd4 but humman players don't play that sort of move.} 16. Na4 Ne8 (16... h5
$142) 17. Bg4 f5 18. Bf3 Nef6 $2 {Behind on time he played this move very
quickly but it loses the exchange.} (18... Qc7 $142) 19. e5 {Winning the
exchange.} dxe5 20. fxe5 Nxe5 21. Nb6 Nxf3+ (21... Qc7 $142) 22. Rxf3 Qc7 23.
Nxa8 Rxa8 24. Bf4 Qd7 25. Qb6 Ne4 $2 {His body language suggested that he had
given up and he played this move without much thought.} (25... Kf7 $142) 26.
Qxg6 e6 27. Bxh6 exd5 28. cxd5 Rf8 29. Bxg7 Qxg7 30. Qe6+ Kh8 31. Rxf5 Qd4+ 32.
Kh2 Rxf5 33. Qxf5 Qe3 34. Qe5+ Kg8 35. Rf1 Qd4 36. Qe8+ Kg7 37. Rf7+ Kh6 38.
Qe6+ {The Lansil Cup for 2012/13 was between Lancaster A & Morecambe A but the
match never got played.} 1-0

