{120' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. cxd5 cxd5 4. Nf3 Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Bf4 e6
7. e3 Bd6 8. Bxd6 Qxd6 9. Bd3 O-O 10. O-O Bd7 11. a3 Rfc8 12. Nb5 (12. Rc1 {
Fritz}) 12... Qe7 13. Qd2 a6 14. Nc3 Ne8 15. b4 Nd6 16. e4 {He controls c4 so
I felt that I had to do something active.} dxe4 17. Nxe4 Nxe4 18. Bxe4 f5 {
This surprised me as it leaves the e-Pawn weak. However, Fritz gives it as
best.} 19. Bc2 Qd6 20. Rfe1 (20. Bb3 {Fritz}) 20... Ne7 21. Bb3 Nd5 22. Rac1 {
Fritz likes.....} (22. Ne5) (22. Re5) 22... Rxc1 23. Rxc1 Bc6 24. Ne5 Rc8 25.
h3 Rc7 26. Qg5 Kf8 27. Qh5 (27. Qg3 $142) 27... Nf6 (27... Nf4 $142 28. Qxh7
Ne2+ 29. Kh2 Nxc1 30. Qh8+ Ke7 31. Qxg7+) 28. Qh4 h6 29. Qf4 Ke8 30. Qe3 (30.
Bxe6 $142 Qxe6 31. Nxc6 Nd5 ({Not} 31... Rxc6 32. Qb8+) 32. Qd2 Qc8 33. Re1+)
30... Bd5 31. Rxc7 1/2-1/2

