{120' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. d3 h6 5. c3 Nf6 6. b4 Bd6 {
A bit of panic here. I thought that I was in trouble.} (6... Bb6) 7. O-O O-O 8.
Qb3 a6 (8... b6 {Fritz}) 9. a4 Ne7 10. Re1 c6 11. Nh4 $5 {This prevents 11.....
.Ng6 but his Kight is left on a limb} (11. d4 $142) 11... Bc7 12. d4 $2 (12.
Qc2 $142) 12... d5 {I was happier now.} 13. exd5 cxd5 14. Bd3 $2 {Played quite
quickly this loses a piece.} e4 15. Bf1 g5 16. g3 gxh4 17. Bxh6 Re8 18. Nd2
hxg3 19. hxg3 Nh7 20. Bg2 Nf5 21. Be3 Nxe3 22. Rxe3 Be6 {A piece down, White
carried on at high speed. I started to get behind on time.} 23. Kh2 Qh4+ 24.
Kg1 Qh5 25. Rc1 Nf6 26. Nf1 Rac8 27. b5 Ng4 28. Ree1 Qh6 29. bxa6 bxa6 30. Qb7
a5 31. c4 Qf6 32. Re2 Qxd4 33. cxd5 Bxd5 (33... Bxg3 $142 {I considered this
but I was around an hour behind on time so didn't spend long on it.}) 34. Qb5
Rb8 $2 (34... Bxg3 $142 {Short of time I was having to play quickly.}) 35. Qd7
Nxf2 36. Rxc7 Nd3+ ({Moving quickly I miss} 36... Nh3+ 37. Kh2 Qg1+ 38. Kxh3
Be6+) 37. Kh2 Qh8+ 38. Kg1 Qh5 39. Re3 Red8 40. Qe7 Qf5 41. Re2 Re8 42. Qh4 (
42. Qd6 {is safer}) 42... Qg6 {Threat 43........Qb6+} 43. Rd7 Bc6 44. Rd4 f5
45. Bh3 Kf7 46. g4 $2 Rh8 47. Qg3 f4 48. Qh2 Qh6 49. Rxd3 exd3 50. Rf2 Rb4 0-1

