{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 Qe7 5. Bxb4 {
Offering a pawn for a lead in development but 5.Nf3 or 6.Bg2 is better.} Qxb4+
6. Qd2 Qxd2+ {After a very long think.} (6... Qxc4 $142 7. Nc3 O-O 8. Nf3 Qb4
9. a3 Qb3 10. e3 Nc6 11. Bd3) 7. Nxd2 d5 8. e3 O-O 9. Rc1 c6 10. Ngf3 Nbd7 11.
Be2 Re8 12. O-O e5 13. dxe5 Nxe5 14. Nxe5 Rxe5 15. Nf3 Re7 (15... Rh5 {Fritz})
16. c5 (16. cxd5 Nxd5 17. Rfd1 {[Fritz] This is very drawish. 16.c5 offers
hope of generating something.}) 16... h6 17. Nd4 Bh3 18. Rfd1 g6 19. b4 a6 20.
a4 Rc8 21. Rd2 Ne4 22. Rb2 Ng5 23. Bf1 (23. b5 axb5 24. axb5 cxb5 25. Nxb5 Rd7
{is an alternative}) 23... Bxf1 24. Kxf1 Ne6 25. Nb3 1/2-1/2

