{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 g6 3. Bg2 Bg7 4. Nc3 Nf6 5. e4 O-O 6. Nge2
d6 7. O-O c6 8. d3 Nh5 9. Be3 f5 {Premature} 10. exf5 Bxf5 11. d4 Nf6 12. h3 (
12. Qb3 $142 Qe7 13. c5+ d5 14. dxe5) 12... Na6 13. Qd2 Qe8 (13... Qe7 {Fritz})
14. Rae1 Qf7 15. d5 c5 $2 (15... cxd5 $142 16. Nxd5 Nxd5 17. Bxd5 Be6) 16. g4
Nxg4 {After a long think.} ({After} 16... Bd7 17. f4 {My position is very poor.
I was pretty sure that I was lost.}) 17. hxg4 Bxg4 18. Ne4 Rad8 19. Ng5 Qe7 20.
Ng3 {The g-file seems popular!} Nc7 21. N5e4 Qd7 22. Bg5 Rde8 23. f3 Bf5 24.
Kh2 a6 (24... b5 $142 {which I considered.}) 25. Rg1 Rf7 {With a view to
playing .......h6, since he then cannot play Bxh6. I was now very short of
time and moving quickly.} 26. Nxf5 gxf5 27. Bh3 Kh8 28. Re2 Ref8 29. Reg2 Ne8
30. Bh6 Qe7 31. Bg5 Qc7 32. Ng3 Rg8 33. Nxf5 {I had 18 secods left when I
resigned.} 1-0

