{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. c4 Nf6 2. d4 c6 3. Nc3 d5 4. cxd5 cxd5 5. Nf3 g6 6.
Bf4 Bg7 7. e3 O-O 8. Bd3 Nc6 9. O-O Nh5 10. Bg3 Nxg3 11. hxg3 Bg4 $5 (11... e5)
12. Qb3 Qc8 (12... e5 $142 13. Nxe5 Nxe5 14. dxe5 Be6 15. Qxb7 Bxe5 16. f4 Bf6)
13. Qxd5 (13. Nxd5 Be6 14. Qb5 {I didn't like having the Knight pinned.}) 13...
Rd8 (13... e5 $142 14. Be2 Rd8 15. Qb3 exd4) 14. Qc4 (14. Qb3 {Fritz}) 14...
Bxf3 15. gxf3 Qh3 (15... Bxd4 16. Rfd1 (16. exd4 Rxd4) 16... Bxc3) 16. Rfd1
Rac8 17. Qb5 Rxd4 $6 {Big surprise!} ({He said that he also considered} 17...
Nxd4 18. exd4 Bxd4 19. Qg5 Rc5 20. Qg4) 18. exd4 Bxd4 (18... Nxd4 19. Qxb7) 19.
Ne2 Ne5 20. Be4 ({of course I can play} 20. Nxd4 {but I was being "extra safe"
After 20.Be4 he has no move.#}) 20... Bxf2+ 21. Kxf2 Qh2+ 22. Kf1 Nc4 23. Rd3 {
Again, the safest.} Qh1+ 24. Ng1 Qh2 25. Rad1 Nd6 26. Rxd6 exd6 27. Qxb7 Rc5
28. Bd5 1-0

