25. d4 e4 (25... Bc4 $142) 26. Ba3 Bc4 27. Rf2 (27. Rxf6 $142 gxf6 28. Bxe4)
27... Bd3 28. Qb3+ Qd5 {I now had a bit of panic} 29. c4 {After much thought.}
(29. Qxd5+ Nxd5 {leaves the e & c Pawns en prise.}) 29... Qh5 {I hadn't
expected this.} 30. Kh1 $2 {This loses it} (30. c5+ $142 Kh8 31. Rxf6 gxf6 32.
Rc1) 30... Bxb1 31. Qxb1 Qg5 32. Bc1 {I carried on playing fast.} Qxg3 33. Qb5
Qd6 34. Qf5 Qd7 35. Qg6 Qf7 36. Qf5 Qxc4 37. Bd2 Qd5 38. Qg6 Qg5 39. Qxg5 hxg5
40. Rf5 Rd5 41. Rf1 b5 42. axb5 Rxb5 43. Ra1 Ra8 44. Bf1 Rf5 45. Rc1 Nd5 46.
Rc5 a4 47. Bc4 c6 48. Rxc6 Kh7 49. Rc5 Ne7 50. Rc7 a3 51. Bc3 $2 {Playing too
fast.} (51. Rxe7 $142) 51... Nd5 52. Bxd5 Rxd5 53. Ba1 Rb5 54. Rc1 a2 0-1

