{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. c4 e6 2. g3 d5 3. Bg2 c6 4. Qc2 Nf6 5. Nf3 g6 6. b3
Bg7 7. Bb2 O-O 8. O-O Nbd7 9. d4 Ne4 10. Nbd2 Nxd2 11. Qxd2 dxc4 {Opening up
the position despite being behind in development. 11......b6 is better.} 12.
bxc4 c5 (12... e5 $142) 13. Rfd1 cxd4 (13... Qe7 $142) 14. Bxd4 e5 $2 {Losing
it.} (14... Qc7 $142) 15. Bxe5 Qe7 (15... Re8 $142) ({I half expected} 15...
Nxe5 16. Qxd8 Nxf3+ 17. Bxf3 Bxa1 18. Qc7 Bg7 19. Bxb7 Bxb7 20. Qxb7) 16. Bd6
Qe6 17. Ng5 Bh6 {He had no good move.} ({Relatively best is.} 17... Qe8 18.
Rab1 Nb6) 18. Nxe6 (18. Nxe6 {[1-0] After} Bxd2 {I have the choice of} 19. Nxf8
(19. Nc7 {When he has two Rooks and a Bishop en prise.})) 1-0

