{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O b5 6. Bb3
d6 7. Re1 Be7 8. c3 Na5 9. Bc2 c5 10. h3 O-O 11. d4 Qc7 12. Nbd2 Re8 13. Nf1 g6
14. Bg5 Nh5 (14... Nc4) 15. Bxe7 Qxe7 16. Ne3 Nf4 (16... Bb7 {Fritz}) 17. Kh2
Bb7 (17... Be6 {Fritz}) (17... cxd4 {Fritz}) 18. g3 Nh5 19. Nh4 Ng7 20. Neg2
Rad8 21. a4 Nc4 22. b3 Nb6 23. axb5 axb5 24. Qd3 c4 25. Qe2 Qc7 26. Qd2 Ra8 27.
Ne3 exd4 28. cxd4 Rxa1 29. Rxa1 cxb3 30. Bxb3 Bxe4 31. Ng4 Nh5 32. Nh6+ Kg7 33.
Nxf7 ({White can draw with.} 33. N4f5+) 33... Nc4 34. Bxc4 bxc4 35. Ng5 Bd3 36.
d5 Kg8 37. Ne6 Qf7 38. Ng2 Nf6 39. Ngf4 Nxd5 40. Nxd5 Qxe6 41. Ra7 Qxd5 $5 {
Making it interesting.} 42. Qh6 Qf7 43. Rxf7 Kxf7 44. Qxh7+ Ke6 {I harboured
ideas of winning but White is better.} 45. Qg7 d5 46. Qd4 Rf8 {We were both
getting short of time.} 47. Qb6+ Ke5 $2 {Short of time I go wrong.} 48. Qc7+ $2
({Also short of time he misses.} 48. f4+ Ke4 49. Qxg6+) 48... Ke6 49. Qc6+ Ke5
$2 50. Qc7+ $2 Ke6 51. f4 Be4 52. g4 Rf7 {We were moving fast now and I have
had to reconstruct the last few moves of the game.} 53. Qc6+ Ke7 54. Kg3 Kf8
55. h4 Kg7 56. Qe8 Bd3 $2 (56... Rb7 $142) 57. Qe5+ Kh7 58. Qxd5 Rg7 59. Qd4
Rf7 60. Qc5 Kg7 61. f5 gxf5 62. Qe5+ Kg8 63. g5 f4+ 64. Kf3 Bc2 65. g6 $2 {
Having to move fast he gives the Pawn away.} Bxg6 66. h5 Bd3 67. h6 Kh7 68. Qe8
Bg6 69. Qc6 Bd3 70. Qe6 Bg6 71. Qxc4 Kxh6 72. Qe6 Kh7 1/2-1/2

