{90' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. Bb5 Nd4 4. Bc4 a6 5. d3 e6 6. Nge2 b5 7.
Bb3 Nxb3 8. axb3 Bb7 9. O-O g6 10. f4 Ne7 11. Qe1 f5 12. Be3 Rc8 13. d4 c4 14.
d5 fxe4 15. Bd4 Rg8 16. Nxe4 Nxd5 17. N2c3 Be7 18. Qe2 Rf8 (18... cxb3 {Fritz})
19. Nxd5 Bxd5 20. Rxa6 Qc7 21. Nc3 Bc5 22. Nxd5 (22. Qe3 $142 Bxd4 23. Qxd4 Qc5
) 22... Bxd4+ 23. Kh1 Qb7 $2 {I assumed that his reply wouldn't work and that
this wins.} (23... Qc5 $142) 24. Rxe6+ $1 {He said afterwards that he thought
he was lost and this was a desperate last throw of the dice, it wins.} Kd8 $2 {
I still felt that I was winning.} (24... dxe6 {I didn't play this as I thought
he could draw by perpetual Qe6+-Qd6+} 25. Qxe6+ Kd8 26. Qd6+ Ke8 27. Re1+ Kf7
28. Re7+ Qxe7) 25. Rd6 Re8 26. Qg4 {I now realised that I was in trouble with
26.Qg5+ threatened.} Rc5 (26... Rc6) 27. Qh4+ Kc8 28. Nb6+ Kb8 29. Nxd7+ Kc8
30. Rxd4 Re2 31. Qg4 1-0

