11... Rc8 12. Ne5 Be8 13. Ng4 Nbd7 14. Kh1 Nc5 15. Ba3 (15. Na4 {Fritz}) (15.
Nxf6+ {F}) 15... Qc7 16. Bxc5 Qxc5 17. f5 exf5 18. Bxf5 Bd7 $4 {Moving quickly
he blunders} (18... Rd8 $142) 19. Nxf6+ Bxf6 20. Bxd7 Rc7 21. Bf5 (21. Rxf6
gxf6 22. b6 Qxb6 23. Nxd5 {is better. However, a piece up I keep it simple.})
21... Qd6 22. Bd3 (22. b6 {is better but I am playing simple solid stuff.})
22... Qe6 23. Qf3 Bxc3 24. dxc3 Rxc3 25. Qf5 Qxf5 26. Rxf5 Rc7 27. b6 Re7 28.
bxa7 Rxe3 29. Rxd5 Re7 30. h3 ({I thought about.} 30. Rd8+ Rxd8 31. a8=Q Ree8 (
31... Rxa8 32. Rxa8+ Re8 33. Rxe8#) 32. Qxb7 {but short of time I again played
it simple.}) 30... g6 31. Rb5 Kg7 32. Rb6 Kh7 33. Ra4 Kg7 34. Be4 1-0

