{35 in 1hr 15'+ 15'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Bg5 Be7 5. e3 O-O 6. Nf3
b6 7. Be2 Bb7 8. O-O Nbd7 9. cxd5 exd5 10. Rc1 Ne4 11. Bf4 Nxc3 (11... c5 {
Fritz}) 12. Rxc3 c6 (12... c5) 13. a3 Bf6 14. b4 (14. Qa4 {Fritz}) 14... Re8
15. Qb3 b5 16. Rc2 (16. a4 $142 {then if} a6 17. a5) 16... Nb6 17. Ne1 a6 ({Not
} 17... a5 18. Bxb5 cxb5 19. Bc7) 18. Nd3 Nc4 19. Nc5 Bc8 20. Qc3 Bf5 21. Ra2
Qc8 22. Bd3 (22. a4 $142) (22. Rfa1 $142) 22... Bxd3 23. Qxd3 a5 24. Qc2 axb4
25. axb4 Rxa2 26. Qxa2 Qa8 27. Ra1 $2 {Too casual I.didn't give this much
thought.} (27. Qa1 $142) (27. Qc2 $142) 27... Qxa2 28. Rxa2 Be7 ({Immediately
I saw.} 28... Bxd4 {Howevr, he was short of time and replied almost instantly.}
) 29. h3 Bxc5 30. dxc5 g6 (30... f6 $142) 31. Ra6 Re6 (31... Rc8 $142 {as he
has given up the back rank.}) 32. Bh6 f5 33. Ra8+ Kf7 34. Rf8+ Ke7 35. Rh8 Kf6
{Making the time control.} ({Fritz gives} 35... Na3 36. Rxh7+ Ke8 37. Bg7 Re4
38. Rh8+ Kf7 39. Bc3 Rc4 40. Rh7+ Ke8 {but he was looking for a quick "safe"
move}) 36. Rxh7 g5 (36... Re4 37. Bg7+ Kf7 38. Bc3+ Ke8 39. Rc7) 37. Rg7 (37.
Bg7+ Kf7 38. Bc3+ Kg6 39. Rg7+ Kh6 40. Rf7 Kg6 41. Rf8 Ne5 42. Kf1 {Fritz})
37... f4 38. exf4 gxf4 39. Rg4 {I felt that I was winning here.} (39. Rg8 $142
Re1+ 40. Kh2 Re2 41. Bxf4 Rxf2 42. Bg5+) 39... Re1+ (39... d4 $142 40. Bxf4
Re1+ 41. Kh2 d3 42. Rh4 Rb1 43. g4 d2 44. Rh6+ Kf7 45. Bxd2 Nxd2 46. Rxc6 Rxb4
47. Kg2) 40. Kh2 Rb1 ({I had expected} 40... f3) 41. Bxf4 (41. h4 $142) 41...
Rxb4 42. h4 Rb2 ({He was short of time now, best is} 42... Ra4 43. h5 Ra8 44.
Be3 b4 45. Bd4+ Kf5 46. Rg3 Nd2) 43. h5 Rxf2 (43... Ra2 44. h6 Ra7 45. Rg8 Rh7
46. Kg3 Kf5 47. Rg7 Rh8 48. Rf7+ Ke6 49. Rc7) 44. h6 Ra2 45. h7 1-0

