{90' each/game} 1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. c4 e6 4. Nc3 Be7 5. cxd5 exd5 6. Bg5 O-O
7. e3 c6 8. Qc2 h6 9. Bh4 Nh7 (9... Ne4 {Fritz}) 10. Bg3 Bd6 11. Bd3 Nf6 12.
Bxd6 Qxd6 13. O-O Be6 14. Rfb1 Nbd7 15. b4 b5 (15... Nb6 {Fritz}) (15... Rfb8)
16. a4 a6 (16... a5 {Fritz}) 17. axb5 axb5 18. Ra5 Nb6 (18... Rxa5 19. bxa5 {
I was unsure about giving him a passed Pawn.#}) 19. Qa2 Ne4 (19... Nc4 {Fritz})
20. Qc2 Nxc3 21. Qxc3 Na4 (21... Nc4 $142) 22. Qd2 f6 {To keep his Knight out
of e4.} 23. Nh4 Nb6 (23... Rxa5 $142) 24. Ng6 Rfe8 (24... Rfd8 {or 24.......
Rb8 [Fritz]}) 25. Nf4 Nc4 26. Bxc4 {He took this instantly.} dxc4 $5 {I felt
that the chance of getting 2 connected passed Pawns might give me chances.} (
26... bxc4 $142) 27. Nxe6 Qxe6 28. Rba1 Rxa5 29. bxa5 Qd6 {Preventing 30.Qb4
and preparing 30......b4} 30. a6 b4 31. a7 Ra8 32. h3 c3 33. Qc2 Kh8 34. Qb3
Qe7 35. Ra4 ({If} 35. Qa4 {or 35.Qa2 then} Qxa7 36. Qxa7 Rxa7 37. Rxa7 b3 $19)
35... c5 36. dxc5 Rxa7 37. Rxb4 Qxc5 38. Rc4 Ra1+ 39. Kh2 Qe5+ 40. f4 Qxe3 41.
Qxc3 Qxc3 1/2-1/2

