{35 in 1hr 15'+ 15'} 1. c4 {I'd had food poisoning for two days and felt ill.
I didn't want to play and would have accepted a draw on move 1!} e5 2. Nc3 Nf6
3. g3 c6 4. Bg2 d5 5. cxd5 cxd5 6. d4 (6. d3 d4 7. Ne4 {Fritz}) 6... exd4 7.
Qxd4 Nc6 8. Qd1 (8. Qa4 d4 9. Nb5 Bb4+ 10. Kf1 O-O 11. Bxc6 {Fritz}) 8... Be6 {
He thought for 15' about this.} 9. e3 Qb6 10. Nge2 Be7 {Following another long
think.} 11. O-O Rd8 12. b3 O-O 13. Bb2 a6 (13... Bg4 14. Na4 Qa6 15. f3 Bf5 {
Fritz}) 14. Na4 Qa7 15. Nd4 Bg4 16. Qe1 Ne5 17. h3 Bd7 18. Nc3 Nd3 {Here he
ofered a drae. Feeling ill, I accepted.} 1/2-1/2

