1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. c3 Nf6 4. d4 exd4 5. e5 Nd5 6. Qb3 Nb6 7. cxd4 d5 {
5 All as v Bob Taylor Leyland Open Rd 26/8/13} (7... d6 {Fritz}) 8. Nc3 Bb4 $2
{I wasn't sure about this 8......Bf5 is better.} 9. Bb5 Bd7 10. O-O Bxc3 11.
bxc3 Ne7 (11... Na5 {Fritz}) 12. Ba3 Bxb5 13. Qxb5+ Qd7 14. Qxd7+ Kxd7 15. Bxe7
{This surprised me.} Kxe7 16. Nd2 Rhd8 {I was unsure about this.} (16... Rac8 {
followed by 17.......c5 is slightly better}) 17. f4 f5 {I didn't want to let
him push 18.f5} 18. exf6+ {Again a surprise. He gaves up the protected passed
Pawn on e5. I began to wonder if he was playing for a draw.} Kxf6 19. Rae1 Nd7
20. Re3 Re8 {3 Morecambe lost the match 3.5 - 4.5 Preston won the cup beating
Poulton in the final 5 -} 1/2-1/2

