{30' each/game} 1. c4 Nf6 2. d4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Bf4 Bg7 5. e3 O-O 6. cxd5 Nxd5
7. Nxd5 Qxd5 8. Bxc7 Na6 9. Bxa6 Qxg2 10. Qf3 Qxf3 11. Nxf3 bxa6 12. Rc1 (12.
Ke2 {allows the hRook to move.}) 12... Bb7 13. Ke2 e5 $2 {Attempting to get
some play for his pieces, but not best.} 14. dxe5 Rfe8 15. Rhd1 (15. Rc5 {
is slightly better}) 15... Bxf3+ 16. Kxf3 Bxe5 17. Bxe5 Rxe5 18. Rd7 Rb8 19. b3
Rb6 20. h4 Rb4 21. Rd4 Rb7 22. Rc6 Ra5 23. Ra4 Rxa4 24. bxa4 Rb6 (24... Rb4 {
was a better practical option. The text is OK though.}) 25. Rxb6 axb6 26. Ke4
h6 27. Kd5 Kg7 28. Kc6 b5 $2 {Losing} ({Correct is} 28... h5 29. f4 f6 30. e4
g5 31. fxg5 fxg5 32. e5 gxh4 33. e6 $15) 29. axb5 axb5 30. Kxb5 h5 31. a4 g5
32. a5 gxh4 33. a6 {Dick lost the second game.} 1-0

