Qc2 Qe8 14. Be5 {Fritz doesn't like this.} Nxe5 15. dxe5 Ne4 16. f4 Rd8 17. Nf3
e6 18. Nd4 Bf8 19. b4 Rg7 20. Bd3 g5 21. Bxe4 (21. Rad1 $142) 21... fxe4 22.
Kh2 (22. f5 $142 exf5 23. Nxf5 Rgd7 24. Qc3) 22... gxf4 23. exf4 Qg6 24. Qf2
Be7 25. Rae1 $2 (25. f5 $142) 25... Rf8 $2 (25... Bh4 {Wins the exchange.}) 26.
g3 h5 27. Rg1 Bg5 28. Qe2 Bh6 29. h4 Qf7 30. Rb1 Rg4 31. Kh3 $2 Qe7 32. Rbf1 $2
Bxf4 {After 25' thought and the best chance in practical play.} 33. Nc2 $1 (33.
Rxf4 {Offers White no practical chances.}) 33... Bxe5 {Black simply decides to
win a second Pawn, whils retaining the pressure.} (33... Bxg3 $142) 34. Rxf8+
Qxf8 35. Ne3 Rg7 (35... Rg6 $142) 36. Qxh5 Bd4 37. Rf1 Qe7 $2 38. Ng4 Rh7 39.
Qg6+ Bg7 $4 (39... Rg7) 40. Nf6+ 1-0

