convinced that I was lost here and had gone into "desperation mode"} Bc4 23.
Qf5 {With 23........Bxe2 & 23......Bd4 threatened I could resign or go for a
last attack, even though it wouldn't work.} (23. Ng3 {is slow death}) 23...
Bxe2 24. Nf6+ gxf6 25. Rg3+ Kf8 26. Qxf6 Ke8 27. Qf5 Qd6 28. Qxh7 Qf6 0-1

