{90' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 a6 5. Be3 Nf6 6. Bd3 b5
7. O-O Bb7 8. Nd2 Nc6 9. g4 $5 {A bit gung-ho. Better 9.a4 which I considered.}
d6 (9... h5 $142) 10. c4 Ne5 11. Be2 Nxe4 (11... h5) 12. Nxe4 Bxe4 13. cxb5
axb5 14. Bxb5+ Nd7 15. a4 Be7 16. Rc1 Rc8 17. Qd2 Rxc1 18. Rxc1 O-O 19. Nc6 (
19. Qe2 $145) 19... Bxc6 20. Bxc6 Ne5 21. Qe2 Nxc6 22. Rxc6 Qa5 23. Qc2 h6 {(=)
} 24. Bb6 Qe1+ 25. Kg2 d5 26. a5 Ra8 $2 (26... Qb4 $142) 27. a6 g6 ({Not} 27...
Rxa6 $2 28. Rc8+ Bf8 29. Rxf8+ Kxf8 30. Qc8+ Ke7 31. Qxa6) 28. a7 Kg7 29. Rc8
Rxc8 30. Qxc8 Qe4+ 31. f3 Qe2+ 32. Bf2 Bh4 33. Qc5 (33. Qc3+ $142 Kh7 34. Qe3)
33... Bxf2 34. Qxf2 Qa6 35. Qd4+ Kh7 36. Kg3 $2 (36. Kf2 $142) 36... e5 37.
Qxd5 (37. Qc5 $142) 37... Qxa7 38. Kg2 Qc7 39. Qd2 Kg7 40. b4 f5 41. gxf5 gxf5
42. Qd3 Qf7 {(=)} 43. b5 {It's a dead draw, but time was getting on and I
hoped for an error.} Qa2+ 44. Kg3 f4+ 45. Kh3 Qe6+ 46. Kg2 Qa2+ 47. Kg1 Qa1+ {
(=)} 48. Qf1 Qd4+ 49. Kg2 Qb2+ 50. Kh3 Qb3 51. Qe2 Qe6+ 52. Kg2 Kf6 53. Qf2
Qg8+ 54. Kf1 Qc4+ 55. Qe2 Qc1+ 56. Kf2 Qc5+ 57. Kg2 Kg5 $2 {The mistake comes.
This closes the g-file, leaves the e-Pawn weak and lets me put the Queen
behind the b-Pawn.} 58. Qb2 Kf6 $2 {This second mistake loses it.} ({Correct is
} 58... Kg6 {then} 59. Qb3 e4 {etc.}) 59. b6 Qd6 60. b7 Qb8 61. Qb6+ Kg5 62.
h4+ Kh5 63. Qe6 Qxb7 64. Qg4# 1-0

