{90' each/game} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 exd5 4. Bd3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. c3 Qf6
{He would be happy with a draw, but I have to win, so I try to create
something.} 7. Nbd2 Bd6 8. O-O Nge7 9. h3 Bh5 (9... Bf5 $142) 10. Be2 O-O 11.
Nh2 Qf4 {Waste of time.} 12. Ndf3 Qf6 13. Bg5 Bxh2+ 14. Kxh2 Qd6+ 15. Kg1 f6
16. Bh4 Rae8 17. Bg3 Qd7 18. Ne5 $5 {I hadn't expected this.} Nxe5 ({I was
wary of} 18... fxe5 {but} 19. Bxh5 g6 20. Bg4 Nf5 21. Qb3 exd4 {-0.07/0 is})
19. Bxh5 Nf7 20. Qd3 g6 21. Bf3 Ng5 22. Rae1 Nxf3+ 23. Qxf3 Nf5 24. Bh2 c6 25.
g4 Nh4 {I knew this was risky.} 26. Qg3 g5 27. f4 Rxe1 (27... h6 $142) 28. Rxe1
Re8 29. Re3 Re7 (29... Rxe3 $142 30. Qxe3 f5) 30. f5 Qe8 31. Kf2 h5 (31... Re4
$142) 32. Rxe7 Qxe7 33. Qe3 Qd7 34. Bg3 hxg4 35. hxg4 Kg7 ({I spent a while
considering} 35... Nxf5) 36. Bxh4 gxh4 37. Kg2 Qd6 38. Kh3 a6 39. Qf2 $2 (39.
g5 $142) 39... Qe7 40. Kxh4 Qe4 41. Kg3 Qd3+ 42. Kg2 Qe4+ 43. Kg3 Qd3+ 44. Qf3
Qd2 45. Qf2 Qd3+ 46. Kh2 Qe4 47. Qg2 Qf4+ 48. Kh3 Qh6+ 49. Kg3 Qe3+ 50. Kh2
Qh6+ 51. Kg1 Qc1+ 52. Kh2 1/2-1/2

