{90' each/game} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 Bf5 4. Bd3 Bg6 5. Bxg6 {Giving me the
open h-file} hxg6 6. Nf3 e6 7. a3 {Seems unecessary.} Nd7 8. c3 Ne7 9. Nbd2 Nf5
10. Nf1 {White makes a lot of moves just to exchange this Knight.} Be7 11. Ng3
c5 12. Nxf5 gxf5 13. Bd2 (13. O-O {.Fritz}) 13... g5 14. Ng1 Qb6 15. Bc1 {
White is hopelessly behind in development.} O-O-O 16. Ne2 Rh7 17. h3 Rdh8 18.
Ng1 {The Knight just goes backwards and forewards.} Rg8 19. g3 f6 20. f4 $2 {
No doubt he is lost. Opening up the d8-h4 diagonal.} (20. exf6 $142) 20... gxf4
21. gxf4 $2 (21. exf6 $142) 21... fxe5 22. fxe5 (22. Nf3 $142) 22... cxd4 23.
cxd4 Bh4+ 24. Ke2 (24. Kf1) 24... Nxe5 25. Nf3 Rg2+ 26. Kf1 (26. Ke3 f4+ 27.
Kxf4 Rf7+ 28. Ke3 Qb3+ 29. Qxb3 Rxf3#) 26... Rf2+ 0-1

