{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Bd3 Nc6 5. c3 Nf6 6.
Bf4 e6 7. Nd2 Bd6 8. Bg3 a6 9. Ngf3 Bxg3 {I had doubts about this, better is 9.
......0-0} 10. hxg3 g6 (10... h6 $142) 11. Qe2 Bd7 12. Nf1 Ne7 13. Ne3 Bc6 14.
g4 Qc7 (14... Ne4 $142) 15. Rc1 Kf8 16. Ne5 Kg7 (16... Nd7 $142) 17. Qf3 h6 18.
Rh3 Nc8 $2 (18... Raf8 $142) 19. g5 Ng8 20. Kd2 (20. N3g4 $142) 20... Nd6 21.
gxh6+ Rxh6 22. Rch1 Qe7 (22... Bb5 $142) (22... Nc4+ $142) 23. Qf4 Rxh3 24.
Rxh3 Qf6 25. Qh2 Qxf2+ 26. Kd1 Qxb2 $2 (26... Nf6 $142) 27. Rh7+ Kf8 28. Nxg6+
Ke8 29. Qxd6 {Surprisingly I now hang on for about 60 moves.} Ba4+ 30. Bc2
Bxc2+ 31. Nxc2 Qxc3 32. Ne5 Rd8 33. Qb6 Rc8 34. Qb3 Qa5 35. Qxb7 Qc7 36. Qxc7
Rxc7 37. Kd2 Nf6 38. Rh8+ Ke7 39. Ra8 Ne4+ 40. Kc1 f6 41. Nf3 Rc6 42. Rb8 Nc3
43. Kb2 Nd1+ 44. Kc1 Ne3 45. Nfe1 e5 46. dxe5 fxe5 47. Rh8 Kf7 48. Kd2 Nc4+ 49.
Ke2 Kg6 50. Nb4 Rd6 51. Rf8 d4 52. Kd3 Kg7 53. Rf2 Ne3 54. Ke4 Rb6 55. Nd5 Rb1
56. Re2 Nc4 57. Nd3 Rd1 58. Nxe5 d3 59. Nxd3 Nd6+ 60. Kd4 Nf5+ {We were now
both desperately short of time. In the time scramble I won both of his
Knights! but ran out of time on move 90 when he had Rook and passed Pawn and I
had Rook and Knight. Given time I could have sacrificed the Rook for the Pawn
leaving him with Rook v Knight. At the end he had 33'' left.} 1-0

