{40 in 1hr 40' + 20'} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. c4 d6 4. Nc3 Nd7 5. f4 e6 6. Nf3
Ne7 7. Be2 b6 8. O-O Bb7 9. Qc2 O-O 10. Be3 Nf6 11. Rad1 d5 12. cxd5 exd5 13.
e5 Ne8 {Played after a long think 13.......Ng4 is better} 14. g4 f5 15. g5 c6
16. b4 {I suddenly realised that Black, who was playing for a draw, would want
to block this position.} b5 17. Nd2 Nc7 18. Nb3 Ne6 {I was already thinking
that I may have to sacrifice on b5.} 19. Rc1 Rc8 20. Nc5 Nxc5 21. bxc5 a5 22.
Rb1 Qc7 23. h4 {To open the h-file.} Ra8 24. h5 Rfb8 25. hxg6 hxg6 26. Bd3 Ba6
27. Kf2 a4 28. Qe2 {Threatening 29.Nxa4} Bc8 29. a3 Bd7 30. Kf3 Kf7 31. Rh1 Rh8
32. Bd2 Ke6 33. Na2 Rxh1 34. Rxh1 Rh8 35. Rxh8 Bxh8 36. Qe1 Bg7 37. Nb4 Qc8 38.
Qc1 Qh8 39. Qg1 Qh3+ 40. Ke2 Qh5+ {He only just made the time control} 41. Ke1
Bc8 42. Qg2 Bb7 43. Be2 Qh8 44. Kd1 Bf8 45. Qf1 {With thoughts of Bxb5} Bg7 46.
Be1 Qe8 {Although playing "nothing" moves he was taking a long time and would
soon be running out of time.} 47. Nd3 Nc8 48. Ba5 Qh8 49. Bc7 Bf8 50. Kc2 Be7
51. Nb4 Bd8 52. Bxd8 Qxd8 53. Qh3 Qg8 54. Qh1 Ne7 (54... Z0 {with thoughts of}
55. Bxb5 cxb5 56. c6 Ba8 57. Qxd5+) 55. Qh6 Kd7 56. Nd3 Ke6 {He was having to
rush now. I had over an hour left.} 57. Ne1 Bc8 58. Ng2 Kd7 59. Bd3 Kc7 60. Kc3
Kb7 61. Kb4 Ka6 62. Nh4 Be6 63. Nf3 Qd8 {Threatening mate!} 64. Kc3 Kb7 65. Qg7
Qa5+ $4 {Desperately short of time he goes for a check but puts his Queen
offside and it can't get back to defend the g-Pawn.} 66. Kc2 Qd8 67. Qf6 Qd7
68. Nh4 Ka6 69. Nxg6 {Black lost on time.} 1-0

