{35 in 75' + 15'} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 d5 4. Bg2 Nc6 5. Nf3 Be7 6. O-O O-O
7. c5 (7. Ne5 $142) 7... b6 8. cxb6 cxb6 9. Nc3 Bb7 10. Bf4 Rc8 11. Rc1 Bd6 12.
a3 Bxf4 13. gxf4 Ne7 14. Bh3 Nh5 15. e3 f5 (15... Nf6 $142) 16. Ng5 Qe8 17. Kh1
{Over cautious} (17. Nxe6 Qg6+ 18. Kh1 Qxe6 19. Qxh5) 17... Rf6 18. Qd3 h6 19.
Nf3 Rg6 $2 {ointless.} 20. Ne5 Rf6 21. Bg2 Rf8 22. Qb5 (22. Nb5 {Fp}) (22. Rg1
{Fp}) 22... Qxb5 23. Nxb5 Ba6 24. a4 Nf6 25. Rfe1 Bxb5 26. axb5 Rxc1 27. Rxc1
Rc8 28. Nc6 (28. Ra1 $142) (28. Rxc8+ $142) (28. Rc3 $142) 28... Nxc6 29. Rxc6
Rxc6 30. bxc6 Ne8 31. f3 Kf7 32. b4 $2 {I suddenly felt that I was lost. 32.e4
or 32.Kg1 are -1.31 but 32.b4 is -2.7. I had started playing quickly.} a6 (
32... a5 $142) 33. Kg1 {Playing too quickly. Better is 33.Bf1} Ke7 34. e4 (34.
Bf1) 34... Kd6 35. Bf1 Nc7 36. Bd3 g6 37. h4 Kxc6 38. h5 {My only hope, apart
from his time shortage.} gxh5 39. exf5 exf5 40. Bxf5 Nb5 (40... a5 $142) 41.
Bd3 Nxd4 (41... a5) 42. Bxa6 b5 43. Bc8 Nxf3+ 44. Kf2 Nd4 45. f5 Kd6 46. Ke3
Ke5 $2 (46... Kc7 $142) 47. f6 Ne6 48. Bd7 {We were both playing fast.} Kxf6
49. Bxb5 h4 50. Bf1 Ng5 $2 (50... Ke5 $142) 51. b5 $2 ({Correct is} 51. Kd4)
51... Nf7 $2 ({Correct is} 51... Ke5) 52. Kd4 Nd6 53. b6 Ke6 54. Bh3+ Ke7 55.
Kxd5 Nb7 56. Kc6 Nd8+ {He offered a draw here.} 57. Kc7 Ne6+ $4 (57... Ke8 58.
Bf5 Ke7 59. Bd7 {but this is a draw as he can play} Nb7 60. Kxb7 Kxd7 61. Ka7
h3 62. b7 h2 63. b8=Q h1=Q) 58. Bxe6 1-0

