is the alternative [RAC]}) 5. Nc3 Qd8 {Varying from my Game with Nigel Short 
[15/10/83], where I played 5.......Qa5} 6. d4 Nf6 7. Nf3 g6 8. Bc4 Bg7 9. O-O (
9. Qa4+ Nbd7 $4 (9... Bd7 10. Qb3 O-O (10... Nc6 11. Bxf7+ Kf8 12. Bc4) 11. Ne5
