{35 in 75' + 15'} 1. e4 b6 2. d4 Bb7 3. Nc3 e6 4. Bd3 Bb4 5. Nge2 Nf6 6. O-O c5
7. Be3 (7. e5 $142 Ng4 8. a3) 7... Nc6 8. dxc5 (8. Nb5 $142 {I considered this.
}) 8... Ng4 9. Qc1 (9. Bf4 $142) 9... Nxe3 10. Qxe3 Bxc5 11. Qg3 Qe7 12. e5 (
12. a3 {Fritz}) 12... f5 (12... f6 {F}) 13. Rfe1 {Fritz prefers 13.Na4 or 13.a3
} g5 14. Nb5 {I was not happy here} f4 15. Qf3 {Fritz prefers 15.Qh3 but 15.f3
offers better practical chances} O-O-O 16. Be4 Kb8 17. a3 {I wanted to play 17.
Qc3 but needed to prevent 17.......Bb4} Nxe5 18. Qc3 Ng4 $2 {Better 18.......
d6 The Knight is vulnerable on g4 due to a later Qf3+} 19. Bxb7 Nxf2 $4 {
Now short of time he blunders. The Knight is now lost.} ({He didn't like} 19...
Bxf2+ {as I would be threatening mate on c7.}) 20. Ned4 Kxb7 21. b4 a6 {
He was having to play very fast now.} 22. bxc5 axb5 {He had no time to think.}
(22... Qxc5 23. Qxc5 bxc5 24. Nd6+ Kc7 25. Nf7 {is not much better.}) 23. cxb6
({I considered} 23. c6+) 23... Rc8 {He was now down to "zero time" and all his
moves were now instantaneous.} 24. Qf3+ d5 25. Rxe6 Qc5 26. Qxf2 Rhe8 27. Rxe8
Rxe8 28. Rd1 Re4 29. Qd2 Qxa3 30. Nxb5 Qe3+ 31. Qxe3 Rxe3 32. Rxd5 Re2 33. c3
Kxb6 34. Rxg5 {Black lost on time.} 1-0

