}) 22. g3 Nh8 (22... Na5 {F}) 23. h4 g6 24. Nf4 Kg7 {is 1.99 but it doesn't
seem that bad.} 25. g4 Qd6 26. gxf5 (26. O-O-O {F}) 26... exf5 27. Rg1 Kf7 28.
