Getting short of time he tries to take advantage of my d & f-Pawns being
pinned. However, it simply loses.} (40. Bc2 $142) 40... Rxc5 41. dxc5 Qxb3 42.
Kc1 dxe4 43. Rxg4 {Else I play .......Ne5 - d3} hxg4 44. Qh6 Qb5 45. Rd1 Qxc5
46. Qh7+ Ke6 47. Rd4 g3 48. Qh6 Nd5 49. Qg7 Ke5 50. h5 g2 51. Rxd5+ Qxd5 52.
Qe7+ Kf4 53. Qc7+ Qe5 54. Qa7 e3 0-1

