{30' each/game} 1. e4 g6 2. d4 Bg7 3. Nf3 d6 4. h3 b6 5. Nc3 Bb7 6. Bd3 e6 7.
O-O Ne7 8. Re1 Nd7 9. Be3 a6 10. a4 h6 11. Qd2 Rc8 12. Qe2 a5 13. Qd2 c5 $2 {
Not very good as d6 is left loose.} 14. Rad1 (14. Nb5 $142) 14... c4 15. Bf1
Nf6 16. Bf4 g5 17. Bh2 Ng6 18. d5 (18. Nb5 $142 Bf8 19. d5 e5) 18... e5 19. g3
O-O 20. Kg2 Qd7 21. Ng1 Nh7 22. Qe3 Rc5 23. f3 Ne7 24. g4 Ng6 25. Bg3 Nf4+ 26.
Bxf4 gxf4 27. Qf2 Qe7 28. Kh2 Bf6 29. Qg2 Bh4 30. Re2 Bc8 31. Red2 Kh8 32. Nce2
Rg8 33. c3 Qd7 34. Rc2 {Simply overlooking the a-Pawn} Qxa4 35. Rdd2 $2 {
Losing the exchange} Be1 36. Rd1 Qxc2 37. Rxe1 Qxb2 38. Qf2 Kg7 39. h4 Qb5 40.
h5 Ng5 41. Ra1 Ba6 42. Qe1 Qd7 43. Qd1 Kh7 44. Qb1 Rb5 45. Qc2 Nxf3+ {I didn't
have time to think this through but he was almost out of time so I felt that
it was the right move.} 46. Nxf3 Qxg4 47. Neg1 Qxh5+ 48. Bh3 Bc8 49. Qf2 Bxh3 {
Moving quickly I miss the best line....} ({........} 49... Rg3) 50. Nxh3 Rg3
51. Nfg1 Qh4 (51... Rxc3 {is easiest.}) 52. Rc1 Qg4 {White lost on time.} 0-1

