{90' each/game} 1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 Bf5 4. g4 Bc8 (4... Bd7) 5. h4 e6 6. f4
c5 (6... Nh6 {Fritz}) 7. c3 cxd4 (7... Nh6) 8. cxd4 {8 Pawn moves to start
with!} Bb4+ (8... Nh6) 9. Bd2 Qa5 10. Nc3 Nc6 11. Nf3 a6 12. h5 Bd7 13. a3 Bxc3
(13... Be7 {F}) 14. Bxc3 Qb6 15. b4 Nge7 16. Bd3 f5 {Better is 16......h6 but
I felt I had to do something positive.} 17. gxf5 (17. g5 $142) 17... Nxf5 18.
Bxf5 exf5 19. Rg1 Nd8 (19... O-O {is slightly better but looks scary.}) 20. Kf2
(20. Rxg7 $142 Qh6 21. Rg3 Qxf4 22. Kf2) 20... Qh6 21. Qb3 Bc6 (21... Rc8 {
Fritz}) 22. Bd2 Ne6 23. a4 Nc7 $2 {After mucg thought. This should lose.} (
23... O-O $142 24. b5 Be8 25. Qxd5 Rd8 26. Qxb7 Nxd4) 24. Rg5 $2 ({Missing} 24.
b5 Bd7 25. Rac1 Rc8 26. bxa6 Qxa6 27. Rxg7) 24... g6 (24... O-O $142) 25. hxg6
hxg6 26. Rag1 Kf7 {Getting short of time now. This should lose.} (26... O-O-O
$142) 27. Rxg6 (27. e6+ $142) 27... Qxg6 28. Rxg6 Kxg6 29. Qc2 (29. Qa3 $142)
29... Ne6 {(=)} 30. Kg3 Rag8 31. Kf2 Rc8 32. Qb3 Nc7 $2 (32... b5 $142) 33.
Nh4+ $4 {I was down to 3' and playing fast. He had 20' but also started
playing fast.} Rxh4 34. Qg3+ ({He saw} 34. Qg3+ Kh5 35. Qg5#) 34... Rg4 35. Qb3
Rh8 36. b5 Rh2+ 37. Kf1 axb5 38. Qb4 bxa4 39. Qd6+ Kh5 40. Be3 Bb5+ 41. Ke1
Re2+ ({Playing fast I miss} 41... Rgg2 42. Bf2 Rxf2 {and mate}) 42. Kd1 Rxe3
43. Qxc7 ({If} 43. Qf6 Rg1+ 44. Kd2 Rd3+ 45. Kc2 Rg2+ 46. Kc1 Rc3+ 47. Kd1 a3
48. Qxf5+ Kh4 49. Qf6+ Kg3 {etc.}) 43... Rg1+ 0-1

