{30' each/game} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 d6 4. O-O Nf6 5. Re1 Bd7 6. c3 Be7
7. d4 exd4 8. cxd4 O-O 9. Nc3 a6 10. Bd3 Bg4 11. Be3 Nb4 12. Bb1 b5 (12... Nd7
$142) (12... Nc6) 13. h3 Bh5 14. d5 {Now the Knight on b4 is under threat.} a5
15. Nxb5 Rb8 16. Nbd4 Qd7 17. Qd2 c5 18. dxc6 Nxc6 19. Nxc6 Qxc6 20. Nd4 Qb7
21. f3 {Not really necessary. However, in these quick games one plays it safe.}
({if say} 21. b3 Nxe4 $2 22. Bxe4 Qxe4 23. Bh6 $18) 21... h6 ({He avoids} 21...
Qxb2 22. Nc6 Qxa1 23. Nxe7+ Kh8 24. Bd4) ({Correct is} 21... d5) 22. b3 Bd8 (
22... d5) 23. Nf5 d5 {Too late} 24. Bxh6 Re8 25. Be3 {with little time I play
it safe.} (25. Nd6 $2 {is answered by} Qb6+) (25. Nxg7 {5.42/0 is}) 25... Bc7
26. Bd4 Be5 {This loses the exchange} 27. Bxe5 Rxe5 28. Qg5 Bg6 29. Nh6+ gxh6
30. Qxe5 Qb6+ 31. Kh1 Re8 32. Qg3 dxe4 33. Bxe4 Nxe4 34. Rxe4 Rxe4 35. fxe4 Qd4
36. Re1 Kh7 37. Qe3 Qe5 38. a3 Bh5 39. b4 axb4 40. axb4 Bg6 41. g4 Qe7 42. Qd4
{Black lost on time, intending 42.......Qb7} 1-0

