Nc3 a6 43. Ra3 Nb8 44. Kd3 b5 (44... Nc6) 45. Rb3 Nd7 46. Ne2 Rc4 47. h4 Nf6
48. Nc3 Kc6 49. a3 {fHe can't play e4} Kd6 50. Rb1 Nd7 (50... Ke6 $142) 51. a4
Kc6 {A bit of a panic. I had not expected 51.a4. Now I saw 51......b4 etc
After 51.......Ka6 it is lost.} (51... b4 52. Nxd5 Kxd5 ({However, I missed} 
52... Ne5+ $1 53. dxe5+ Kxd5 54. e6 Rc3+) 53. e4+) 52. axb5+ axb5 53. Nxb5 Ra4
54. Nc3 Ra3 55. Rb2 Nb6 56. Ra2 Rb3 57. Kc2 Rb4 58. Ra5 Nc4 59. Rc5+ Kb7 60.
Nxd5 Na3+ 61. Kc3 Rb1 62. Rc7+ Kb8 63. Rxh7 Nb5+ 64. Kc4 Nd6+ 65. Kd3 Rb3+ 66.
Ke2 Rb5 67. Ne7 Nc4 68. Nc6+ Ka8 69. Ra7# 1-0

