dxc4 $142 30. bxc4 Ng6) 30. Re2 (30. exd5 $142 cxd5 31. cxd5 Nh4 32. Bh1) 30...
f6 $2 {he had only seconds left (to the TC). I had a couple of minutes but
rushed it. As soon as I played the move I knew it was wrong.} ({Correct is} 
