Bg3 Bxg4 {It is lost but 34.......g5 is a little better.} 35. hxg4 Qxg4 36.
Rce1 Red8 37. Re4 Qg6 38. d5 cxd5 39. cxd5 f5 {Giving up} 40. Rxh4 1-0

