{30' each/game} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. f3 e5 6. Nb3 d5
7. exd5 Nxd5 8. Bc4 $4 {We both started playing much too quickly. This loses a
piece.} Be6 $4 {He replied instantaneously.} ({Missing} 8... Qh4+) 9. Qe2 {
I had now seen it.} Bb4+ 10. c3 Be7 11. O-O O-O 12. N1d2 Nf4 13. Qe4 Bxc4 14.
Nxc4 Ng6 (14... f5 $142) 15. Be3 Qc7 16. Bf2 Rad8 17. Rad1 Rxd1 18. Rxd1 Rd8
19. Rxd8+ Qxd8 20. Qc2 f6 21. Ne3 Nf4 22. Nc1 Kh8 23. g3 Nh3+ 24. Kg2 Nxf2 25.
Qxf2 Bc5 26. Qe2 (26. Nb3 $142) 26... Qd7 27. Nd3 Bxe3 28. Qxe3 Qd5 29. a3 g6
30. Nb4 Nxb4 31. axb4 b6 32. Qe2 Kg8 33. Kf2 Kf7 34. Ke3 f5 35. Qd3 (35. Qa6)
35... Ke6 36. c4 {Best. I just didn't have time to properly assess the endgame
the endgame chances if the Queens came off. However after 3 draws I felt that
I had to do something to try to get a result.} Qxd3+ 37. Kxd3 Kd6 38. g4 {
Trying too hard.} (38. Ke3 $142) 38... e4+ 39. fxe4 fxg4 40. Ke3 Ke5 41. c5
bxc5 42. bxc5 a5 43. b3 h5 44. Kf2 (44. c6 $142 {followed by Kf4-f5}) 44... g5
45. Kg2 h4 46. Kf2 Ke6 47. Kg2 Kd7 48. e5 Ke6 49. c6 Ke7 50. Kf2 Ke6 51. Kg2
Ke7 {We now decided to toss a coin and I lost.} 1/2-1/2

