Bd3 O-O 8. O-O Bb7 9. a3 a6 10. Be3 Nbd7 11. Qe2 $2 {Not good the Bishop's
retreat is blocked.} c5 {Now I am in trouble 12.......c5 is threatened.} 12. b3
({If} 12. Qd2 c4 13. Be2 {The e-Pawn is lost.}) 12... Rc8 13. Bd2 {This to
defend the e-Pawn with the Queen.} (13. dxc5 {may be better.}) 13... cxd4 14.
Nxd4 Qb6 ({Best is} 14... d5 15. exd5 Nxd5 16. Nxd5 Bxd5 17. c4 Bxd4) (14...
Nxe4 {Doesn't work.}) 15. Nf3 Nc5 ({Best is} 15... Nh5 16. Nd5 Bxd5 17. exd5
Bxa1 18. Rxa1) 16. Rab1 Rfd8 17. b4 {I felt happier now} Ne6 18. Rfe1 Nh5 {
Too late.} 19. Nd5 Bxd5 20. exd5 Nd4 21. Nxd4 Qxd4 22. Qxe7 Qxd5 23. Qe4 Nf6
24. Qxd5 {(=)} 1/2-1/2

