incredible amount of time.}) ({He considered} 7. Bf4 {but didn't like} g5) 7...
Ngxe7 8. g3 Ng6 9. Bg2 O-O 10. O-O Ngxe5 11. Nxe5 Nxe5 12. Nd2 Qe7 13. Qc2 c5 {
Here I had 1hr 34' left, he had 35'} 14. Nf3 Nc6 15. h3 Be6 16. Rfe1 Qd7 17.
Kh2 Bf5 18. Qd2 Rfe8 19. Nh4 Be6 20. Bxc6 {After another long think.} Qxc6 21.
Rac1 Qd7 22. Qg5 b6 23. g4 {White's KS is beginning to look vulnerable.} f6 24.
Qd2 Rad8 25. Ng2 Qf7 26. Qc2 (26. Qd3) 26... h5 27. f3 {He was now being kept
alove by the 30'' increments.} (27. Kg3 {is better but a human player wouldn't
play this in a ime scramble.}) 27... Qc7+ 28. f4 (28. Kg1 Qg3) 28... hxg4 29.
hxg4 Bxg4 30. Kg3 f5 (30... Qc6 31. Qd2 Rxe2 32. Rxe2 Qf3+ 33. Kh2 Qxe2) 31.
