into a drawish line.} (14. Qd2 {Fritz}) 14... Bxf4 15. Bxf4 exf4 16. Rxf4 Qg5
17. Rf2 Rad8 18. Qc1 Ne5 19. Rg2 Qxc1+ (19... Qh4 $142) 20. Rxc1 Ng5 21. Rg3
Ng6 22. Rd1 Nf4 23. Bf1 Rd7 24. Ne3 f6 25. Nf5 Rfd8 26. Kf2 Nf7 27. Nd4 g5 28.
h3 Ne5 29. Nd5 Bxd5 30. exd5 Kf8 31. Bg2 Rc7 32. a4 Ke7 $2 {As time was
getting on we both started to play more quickly} (32... Kf7 $142) 33. Nf5+ Kf7
34. Nxh6+ Kg6 35. Nf5 Kf7 (35... b5 36. axb5 axb5 37. cxb5 Rc2+ 38. Kf1 Nxg2
39. Nd4 Rcc8 40. Kxg2 Rc5) 36. Re3 (36. Be4 {Fritz}) 36... Rc5 37. Nd4 Rc7 38.
Bf1 (38. Be4) 38... Re7 39. Rde1 Rde8 40. Kg3 Nd7 $2 (40... Nc6 $142) 41. Rxe7+
Rxe7 42. Rxe7+ Kxe7 43. Nf5+ {After Nf5 for the fourth time he gives up} 1-0

