Rc8 18. Qe2 Qe6 (18... Bxd3 {Fritz}) 19. Qe3 Nd7 20. f4 (20. Nxc4 {F}) 20... f6
(20... exf4) 21. f5 Qf7 22. Nxc4 bxc4 23. Be2 Nb8 24. Rcd1 Qc7 25. c3 {Worried
about 26.......c3} (25. a4 $142) 25... Nf7 26. Bc1 Rfd8 27. Bh5 Nc6 28. Kh1 Ne7
29. Qg3 Kf8 {Playing it safe} (29... d5 {F}) 30. h4 d5 31. Bxf7 Kxf7 32. exd5
Nxf5 (32... Rxd5 {F}) 33. Qf3 Ne7 (33... Qd7 {F}) 34. h5 (34. Be3 $142) 34...
Rd6 $4 {Starting to play faster I blunder. I realised as I let go of the piece.
} 35. Re4 {He spent ages with me expecting 35.......Rxe5. He than picked the
Rook up and put it on e4.} Rdd8 ({Better was} 35... Rxd5 {but after my mistake
I was in "careful" mode.}) 36. Be3 Rxd5 37. Rxd5 Nxd5 38. Bc5 Nf4 $2 {Just
careless.} 39. Rxc4 {His 38th move was played to allow 39.Rxc4 and he played
it after a few seconds.} (39. Rxf4 exf4 40. Qd5+ Ke8 41. Qe6+ Kd8 42. Bb6 {
Resigns}) 39... Qd7 40. Re4 Kg8 41. Be3 $2 {He was playing fast now.} Rxc3 42.
Qf1 Qf5 43. Rc4 Rxe3 44. Qd1 Qxh5+ 45. Qxh5 Nxh5 0-1

