7. Na3 Nf6 8. Be2 Be7 9. Bg5 Nd7 {Slightly odd} 10. Bxe7 Nxe7 $2 {Simply
playing too quickly} 11. Qxd6 O-O 12. Nc4 Nc6 13. O-O-O (13. Rd1 $142) 13...
Qf6 14. Bg4 $2 {Too casual. Correct is 14.Bf3} Qf4+ 15. Ne3 Nf6 16. Bf3 Be6 17.
Kb1 (17. Qd2 {Fritz}) 17... Ne8 {Another backward Knight move.} 18. Qd2 Nd4 19.
Ned5 ({Fritz comes up with the remarkable} 19. Ncd5 {then if} Nxf3 20. Qb4 a5
21. Qxb7 Nd2+ 22. Ka1 Nd6 23. Nxf4 Nxb7 24. Nxe6 fxe6 25. Rxd2) 19... Qxd2 (
19... Qh4 {Fritz}) 20. Rxd2 Nxf3 (20... Nd6 $142) 21. gxf3 f6 22. Nb6 Rb8 23.
Nd7 Bxd7 24. Rxd7 Rf7 (24... f5 $142) 25. Rhd1 Kf8 (25... f5) 26. Kc1 Re7 27.
R1d3 Nc7 28. Rxe7 Kxe7 29. Nd5+ Nxd5 30. Rxd5 h5 31. Kd2 Rd8 {It has to be
better to keep the Rook on.} 32. Rxd8 Kxd8 33. Ke3 g5 34. Kd3 Kc7 35. Kc4 Kc6
36. a4 b6 37. Kb4 Kd6 38. a5 b5 39. c4 bxc4 40. Kxc4 Kc6 41. b4 g4 42. fxg4
hxg4 43. Kc3 (43. b5+ {Wins more easily.}) 43... Kd6 44. Kb3 Kc7 45. Kc3 Kd6
46. Kd3 Kc7 47. f3 gxf3 48. h4 Kd6 49. h5 Ke6 50. h6 Kf7 51. b5 axb5 52. a6 b4
53. a7 f2 54. Ke2 b3 55. a8=Q 1-0

