Nc6 8. Be2 Bd6 9. Bxd6 Qxd6 10. O-O Nge7 11. Nbd2 O-O 12. b3 b5 13. Nh4 Bg6 14.
Nxg6 Nxg6 15. Bh5 Nge7 16. e4 Qf4 17. Bf3 b4 18. cxb4 Nxd4 {Too casual,
playing thr movers in the wrong order. Correct is 18.......c3} 19. exd5 ({
Correct is} 19. bxc4) 19... c3 20. Ne4 Nxf3+ 21. Qxf3 Qxf3 22. gxf3 Nxd5 23.
Rfc1 Rfc8 24. a3 Nf4 (24... Rc6 $142) 25. Kh2 Ne2 26. Re1 $2 {Played quickly
not seeming to realise there is a problem. Better is 26.Rc2} Nd4 27. Rec1 {
There is no move} Nxb3 28. Rab1 Nxc1 29. Rxc1 c2 {I can't save the c-Pawn.} 30.
Nc5 Kf7 31. Rxc2 Rab8 32. f4 a5 33. Rc4 axb4 34. axb4 Rb5 35. Kg3 Rcb8 36. Nd3
R8b7 37. Kf3 Kg6 38. h4 Kh5 39. Kg3 Rd5 40. Nc5 Rb5 (40... Rb6 $142) 41. f3 Kg6
{There was no real reason to give away the e-Pawn.} 42. Nxe6 Rb7 43. Nc5 Rb8
44. Kg4 Rbd8 (44... f5+ $142) 45. Rc2 Rd1 46. Kg3 Rb1 47. Na6 Rd6 48. Rc4 $2 {
"Tired"?} ({The only move was.} 48. Ra2) 48... Rxa6 0-1

