I wanted to play} 11... Nbd7 {but he replies} 12. Ng5) 12. Rc2 Nbd7 13. Bc1 Bd6
14. Re1 Qe7 15. e3 Ne4 16. Bb2 Ndf6 17. Bf1 Bxf1 18. Kxf1 Rac8 19. h3 Qd7 20.
