7. Nxe5 Qc7 (7... Qe7 $142) 8. Nc4 b5 {Not good. I played the whole game too
casualyy. 8.......0-0 is better} 9. Ne3 (9. e5 $142) 9... Bxc3+ 10. bxc3 Qxc3+
11. Bd2 Qe5 12. f3 O-O 13. Bd3 d5 14. O-O (14. exd5 $142) 14... dxe4 15. fxe4
Nxe4 16. Bb4 (16. a4 {Fritz}) 16... Nc5 {16.......Re8 is better but I was
worried about Qf3 however ........Ra7 is OK} 17. Qf3 Bb7 18. Qh3 Nxd3 19. Bxf8
{He took the Rook almost immediately but 19.cxd3 is better.} Nf4 20. Qg4 (20.
Rxf4 $142) 20... Qxe3+ 21. Rf2 Kxf8 22. Qxf4 Qxf4 23. Rxf4 Bd5 {but again too
casual making it difficult for myself.} (23... Bc6 $142) 24. Rd4 Bc6 25. Rd8+
Ke7 26. Rh8 (26. Rc8 $142) 26... h6 27. Re1+ Kd6 28. Rf8 (28. Rc8) 28... Bd5 (
28... Nd7 {Fritz}) 29. Rd8+ {Making it easy for me.} (29. Ree8 Kc7 30. Re7+ Nd7
) 29... Nd7 30. Rxa8 Bxa8 31. g3 Bd5 32. a3 Ne5 33. Rd1 Nc4 0-1

